msgid "Cast out of the Necromancers' Guild for pursuing forms of knowledge too dark for even their corrupt tastes, Karanya Memoria now pursues greater power without the guild's help…or hindrance."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:13
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Maylander "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:13
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "After making a reputation for himself in Erathia, Maylander, a cleric of the Sun Temple, came to Jadame on a sabbatical rest. The tug of the open road pulled too strongly at him however, and now he is in your services."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:14
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Leane Stormlance"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:14
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "As a daughter of Blazen Stormlance, Leane's whole childhood was spent playing with swords as other girls play with dolls. Now a warrior of great repute, her sword is yours to command."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:15
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Volog Sandwind"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:15
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "A warrior of Rust village, Volog Sandwind earned the nickname, \"One Eye Slayer,\" while championing the village's defense against raiding cyclopes. Now that you've found his village a new homeland, he has joined your cause."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:16
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Thanys"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:16
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Grateful to you for rescuing his herd at Balthazar Lair, Thanys has pledged his loyal service to you. Skilled in warcraft he is a worthy companion."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:17
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Jasp Thelbourne"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:17
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though at least slightly too full of his own self importance, Jasp Thelbourne is not entirely without bragging rights. An adventurer before you met him, he travels with you now seeking to enlarge his glory and reputation."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:18
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Gethric Mercutura"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:18
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though a rebellious nature is not uncommon among vampires, Gethric Mercutura joined your party in direct violation of his orders from the Necromancers' Guild guildmaster, Thant. Though this meant his immediate expulsion from the guild, he has never regretted the decision."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:19
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Flamdring"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:19
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "A rebel among rebels, Flamdring joined you by leaving the pack of Ithilgore--himself a renegade dragon. A dragon of medium size, he has agreed to adventure with you for as long as it holds his flighty attention."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:20
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Hevatia Deverbero"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:20
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "When you allied with the Necromancers' Guild, certain guild members were instructed to place themselves available to your mission. Some did so reluctantly, but not Hevatia Deverbero. A seeker of knowledge she saw an opportunity to explore the world. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:21
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Verish "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:21
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Impressed by your defeat of the Necromancers' Guild Verish, a priest of the Sun Temple, offered to join you, seeing your mission as one serving the greater Path of Light."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:22
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Nelix Uriel"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:22
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Charles Quixote saw in the alliance a chance to season some of his followers with a bit of adventuring. Quixote felt that Nelix Uriel was too much the dragon hunting specialist. With this in mind, he gave the knight leave to follow you on your great quest."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:23
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Sethrc Thistlebone"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:23
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Known in the village of Rust for his great sense of civic responsibility, Sethrc Thistlebone chose to join you for the greater good of his people. Now in your service he single-mindedly pursues an end to the elemental cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:24
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Rionel"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:24
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "A great hero of the Minotaurs' campaign against the Vori Frost Giants, Rionel saw joining your quest as an opportunity to know further glory. An expert with both axe and bow, his skill at the arts of war make him a good companion in battle."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:25
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Adric Stellare"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:25
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "With humble beginnings as a caravan guard, Adric Stellare has risen to the heights of Alvarian society. Having had the opportunity to play many roles, he is skilled in magic and combat. As a member of the merchant guild, he is also an master trader."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:26
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Infaustus "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:26
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though an elder vampire, Infaustus has had little cause to leave her native Shadowspire. When she realized this, she immediately began preparations to leave. Traveling with you is an opportunity for her to know more of Jadame."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:27
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Brimstone"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:27
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "When he rebelled against the Garrote Gorge dragons, Yaardrake was fortunate to convince the mighty Brimstone to join his cause. That you were able to slay so many of Yaardrake's compatriots however, left Brimstone less impressed with Yaardrake and more impressed with you."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:28
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Vetrinus Taleshire"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:28
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Next in line to lead the Necromancers' Guild of Shadowspire, Vetrinus has nothing in his heart for the Temple of the Sun but contempt.  You are lucky to have such a powerful student of the dark magics traveling with you."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:29
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Dervish Chevron"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:29
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Holder of the title of Keeper of the Light, Dervish will soon lead the Temple of the Sun in Jadame.  You are lucky to have such stronger follower of the Path of Light with your party."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:30
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Tempus "
msgstr "템퍼스"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:30
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Among dragon hunters, Tempus is a legend. While most hunting parties consist of at least twenty seasoned knights, Tempus prefers to hunt his prey solo. You are fortunate to have in your service a knight of his great ability."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:31
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Thorne Understone"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:31
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "It is uncommon to hear songs of Trollish heroes in the Ravenshore taverns, but when they are sung, chances are their subject is Thorne Understone."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:32
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Ulbrecht"
msgstr "Ubrecht"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:32
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Many Minotaur heroes made their name in the war against the Vori Frost Giants, but some names stand out more than others. \"Ulbrecht,\" is such a name. Impressed by your great deeds he has raised his axe in your service."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:33
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Cauri Blackthorne"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:33
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Guardmaster of the Merchants of Alvar, Cauri is one of the finest warrior of the Dark Elf people.  She runs errands for the Merchant Council, which they feel require a \"special\" touch.  Her skills will be of great use, if she is in your service."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:34
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Artorius Veritas"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:34
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Grievous wounds forced the ancient vampire, Artorius Veritas into a healing slumber which lasted thirty-four years. Recently awaken he chooses to travel with you to see the changes time has wrought on Jadame."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:35
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Duroth the Eternal"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:35
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Few Dragons live to become as old as Duroth. Disgusted with the society built by the younger generation at Garrote Gorge, he left with his friend, Loeb to form a new nest built around the old ideals. Since that nest's fall he travels with you seeking a clearer truth."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:36
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Nathaniel Roberts"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:36
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though not an official member of the Necromancers' Guild, Nathanial Roberts has gained considerable skill in the dark arts. Tolerated by guild members for his willingness to perform certain favors, Roberts picks up his knowledge where he can get it."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:37
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:37
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Dyson Leyland"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:37
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:37
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though a cleric schooled in the ways of the Sun Temple, his time in the Necromancers' Guild as a secret agent has left him with a dark nature. Though still on the Path of Light, he feels betrayed by his former order."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:38
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:38
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Blazen Stormlance"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:38
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:38
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Finest knight ever trained by Charles Quixote.  Blazen has a personal crusade against the Necromancers of Shadowspire and their attempts to creating skeletal dragons.  His skill will prove very useful, if you allow him to travel with you."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:39
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:47
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "troll"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:40
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:48
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "minotaur"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:41
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:41
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:49
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "darkelf"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:42
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:50
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:50
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "vampire"
msgstr "뱀파이어"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:43
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:51
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:52
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:53
