#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:42
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Protection from Magic"
msgstr "마법의 방어"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Pro V. Magic"
msgstr "마법의 방어"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Protection from Magic affects the entire party at once, granting immunity to certain spells and monster abilities that cause debilitation conditions.  These are:  Poison, Disease, Stone, Paralyze, and Weak.  Every time this spell saves a character from an effect, it weakens.  The spell can survive 1 attack per point of skill in body magic--after that, Protection from Magic is broken."
msgstr "마법의 방어(Protection from Magic); 한 번에 일행 전체에 작용합니다. 중독, 질병, 석화, 마비, 허약을 유발하는 공격으로부터 일행이 면역을 갖게 합니다. 이 방어주문은 캐릭터가 그런 공격을 받을 때마다 약해지며, (기술 레벨) 만큼의 공격을 막아줍니다. "

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Grants immunity to death and eradication effects"
msgstr "사멸이나 목숨을 잃게 하는 공격에 대해서도 면역을 갖게 합니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:84
