msgstr "방어의 날"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:94
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Simultaneously casts Protection from Fire, Air, Water, Earth, Mind, and Body, plus Feather Fall and Wizard Eye on all your characters at four times your skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "방어의 날(Day of protection); 바람,육체,대지,불,정신,물의 저항력 주문;'패더 폴'와 '위저드 아이' 의 주문을 동시에 걸어줍니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:95
