msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:69
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A slight improvement over the common club, maces are better balanced, more durable, and deliver greater damage."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:70
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Flail"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:70
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though evolved from the farm implement which shares its name, the flail's great reach and striking power make it a fearsome weapon."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:71
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Temple Mace"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:71
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The sunray corona circling the head of this well made mace serves as a devotional declaration for Temple of the Sun clerics; it also greatly increases the damage of its blows. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:72
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Reverend Sceptre"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:72
msgctxt "items"
msgid "As much a symbol of office as weapon, these finely crafted maces are carried by inner circle Sun Temple priests. Its highly decorated shaft belies the effectiveness of the gilded erudine-steel head."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Trollish War Mace"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid "While most races have concentrated on developing bladed weapons, the Trolls have always been content to refine the simple bludgeon. This brutal weapon forged as a single piece of stalt alloy is the finest example of their craft."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:74
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sledgehammer"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:72
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:73
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:74
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:75
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:76
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:858
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:859
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:860
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1658
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1659
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1660
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:78
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:57
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:58
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:58
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "망치"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:74
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This hammer is more a construction tool than a weapon. Still, it could deliver a telling, if clumsy, blow."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:75
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Field Hammer"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:75
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This hammer was designed as secondary infantry arm designed to finish off armored opponents who have fallen to the ground."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warhammer"
msgstr "전투 망치"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An improved version of the field hammer, this weapon is heavier, better balanced and more durable. While it requires strength to wield, it is a terrible sight to armored and unarmored foes alike."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sun Hammer"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Clerics of the Sun are prohibited from using bladed weapons. That they carry such fine warhammers is the natural result of this restriction. As an added measure of devotion, a reverse image of their sun symbol is embossed on the striking face."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:78
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Trollish Maul"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:78
msgctxt "items"
msgid "It is necessary to handle this weapon to appreciate its perfect grip and balance. The hammer's head is carved from a single mineral crystal. Trollish weaponsmiths spend a lifetime mastering the shaping technique to produce a head that retains incredible hardness without being shatter prone."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Barbed Club"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:77
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:78
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:79
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:861
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:862
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:863
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1661
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1662
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1663
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:513
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:60
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Club"
msgstr "곤봉"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:79
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A wooden head and handle studded with short iron spikes, the simple club's best attribute is that it can be constructed from found materials."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:80
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Thornbark Club"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:80
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Trolls of the Ironsand Desert make these clubs by fire-hardening the fantastically tough root wood of the thornbark tree."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:81
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Overlord's Club"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:81
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Troll tribal chieftains must win their position through trial by combat. The winner keeps his club as a symbol of office. The losers' clubs often find their way into the weapon marketplace."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:82
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Journey Staff"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:80
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:81
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:82
