msgctxt "items"
msgid "Barrow Key"
msgstr "고분의 열쇠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1461
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:660
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Contestant's Shield"
msgstr "참가자의 방패"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1461
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:660
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  Blood stains the back side of this battered shield.  The owner must certainly have been killed while using it."
msgstr "임무와 관련된 아이템:  이 닳아 너덜대는 방패의 뒤쪽에는 피로 얼룩져 있습니다.  방패를 쓰던 주인이 살해당한 것이 분명합니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1462
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:661
msgctxt "items"
msgid "William's Tower Key"
msgstr "윌리암의 탑 열쇠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1463
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:662
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Catherine's Key"
msgstr "캐서린의 열쇠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1464
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:663
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Colony Zod Key"
msgstr "조디악 영지의 열쇠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1465
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:664
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Faerie Key"
msgstr "요정의 열쇠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1466
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2199
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:665
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:581
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sewer Key"
msgstr "하수도의 열쇠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1466
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:665
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Been looking for this?  No wonder it wasn't in the sewers… it was hiding out in Erathia the whole time."
msgstr "이 걸 찾고 있었나?  하수도에 없었던 것을 이상하게 생각하지 말라구. 쭉 에라시아에 숨겨져 있었으니까."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1467
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1468
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1469
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1470
