#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good luck in the contest!"
msgstr "콘테스트에서 행운을 빕니다!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish Brent knew how to make a red potion."
msgstr "브렌트가 빨강 물약 만드는 방법을 알고 있으면 좋겠는데."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:56
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You'd better watch out."
msgstr "몸 조심하는게 좋을거야."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:57
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't cause any trouble."
msgstr "문제를 일으키지 마시오."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:58
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "축하드립니다!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:59
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for trading with us!"
msgstr "우리와 거래를 해줘서 고맙소!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Group 7"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Group 8"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Group 9"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:63
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:64
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:12
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you are the new Lords of Harmondale?  How may I serve you?"
msgstr "그럼 당신들이 하몬데일의 새 군주님인가요?  몇 분을 섬겨야 합니까?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:65
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Come to study with us under the Masters?"
msgstr "대장 아래로 들어와서 우리와 함께 배우지 않겠소?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:66
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to the capitol of Steadwick! 'Ware the griffins!"
msgstr "스태드윅 수도에 오신것을 환영합니다!  그리핀들을 조심하세요!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:67
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are welcome in Pierpont, the Elven capitol."
msgstr "엘프의 수도, 피어폰트에 오신 걸 환영한답니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings!  Head up the stairs to Pierpont and enjoy!"
msgstr "반갑수다!  피어폰트로 올라가서 즐기시구려!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:69
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware the Walking Dead in the region!"
msgstr "근처에 있는 워킹 대드를 조심하시오!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:70
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yer welcome here I think…then again…"
msgstr "여기 온걸 환영하오 내 생각엔.아니 그게 아니라."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:71
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Come to learn from the best Wizards in Erathia?"
msgstr "에라시아에 있는 최고의 마법사들에게서 배우려고 왔나요?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:72
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings.  Lots of golems around these days!"
msgstr "반가워요.  요즘은 주위에 골렘이 아주 많아요!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:73
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Study with the best and visit all the buildings here!"
msgstr "최고의 사람들에게 배우려면 여기 있는 모든 건물에 한 번씩 들어가 보세요!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:74
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tranquility and rest await you here in Celeste."
msgstr "평온과 안식이, 바로 이곳 셀레스테에서 여러분을 기다리고 있습니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome!  Be sure you don’t have a \"falling out\" while you here!"
msgstr "환영합니다!  여기 있는 동안 \"떨어져 버리지\" 않도록 조심하세요!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to the Pit!  Who says being dead is bad?"
msgstr "핏에 오신걸 환영하오!  누가 죽는 것이 나쁘다고 그러나요?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:77
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Pit is the only place I know of that lets us live in peace!"
msgstr "핏은 우리가 평화롭게 지낼 수 있는, 내가 아는 유일한 곳이지!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:78
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings! Necromancy is evil?  It’s a relative, don’t you think?"
msgstr "반가워!  주술사가 사악해?  그건 상대적이야, 그렇게 생각하지 않나?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:79
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to Mulder!  Enjoy your time with us."
msgstr "니곤에 오신 것을 환영합니다!  우리와 함께하며 좋은 시간 보내세요."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:80
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you journeyed far?  "
msgstr "멀리~ 여행한 적이 있나요?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:81
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello!  Did you come through the tunnels from Stone City?"
msgstr "안녕!  스톤 시티에서 터널을 지나서 왔나요?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:82
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello there?  Checked your purse lately? Let me check it for you…"
msgstr "안녕하세요?  지갑을 확인해 봤나요?  제가 확인해 드리고 싶은데."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some Wacko around here has the boat schedule, I'm sure!"
msgstr "주변에 있는 몇몇 별난 사람(와코)들은 배의 시간표를 가지고 있습니다, 장담하죠!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:84
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As a citizen of the city of Tidewater, I welcome you."
msgstr "연안 도시의 한 시민으로서, 여러분을 환영합니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:85
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings, heard any word of Regnan Pirates?"
msgstr "반갑수.  레그나 해적들에 대해 무슨 말이라도 들어 봤수?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:86
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I heard there was a gate built to the Ancients!  I wonder what they look like."
msgstr "태고 문명의 문이 다 완성되었다는 이야기를 들었어요!  어떻게 생겼는지 궁금하네요."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:87
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard rumors of goblins and undead armed with ancient weapons threatening to conquer Erathia!  How dreadful!"
msgstr "고블린과 언대드들이 태고의 무기를 써서 에라시아를 정복할 것이라는 소문을 들었어요!  너무 끔찍해요!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:88
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations on completing the gate!  Erathia is in your debt!"
msgstr "문이 완성된 걸 축하합니다!  에라시아 전체가 당신들의 은혜를 입었습니다!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:89
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations on completing the forge!  Victory will surely be ours!"
msgstr "대장간을 완성한 걸 축하드립니다!  승리는 분명 우리의 것입니다!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:90
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:91
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:92
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:93
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:94
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:95
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:96
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:97
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:98
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:99
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:100
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:101
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:102
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:103
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:39
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:40
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:41
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:42
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:43
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:44
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:45
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:46
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:47
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:48
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:49
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:50
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:51
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr "안녕하세요!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:104
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard that the abandoned keep on the hill is now home to a pack of goblins.  The keep was built to keep the goblins away, so how could this possibly happen?"
msgstr "내가 듣기론 언덕 위의 성은 고블린들로 꽉 차있다더군. 그 성은 고블린들을 �m아내기위해 만들었다던데 어떻게 그런일이 생길수 있지? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:105
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A day's travel west of here is a new Temple dedicated to Baa.  I've heard that bad things happen to rich people that travel near there."
msgstr "여기서 서쪽으로 하루 걸리는 곳에는 바아의 신전에 헌납된 새 신전이 있다더군. 그리고 난 이 근처를 여행하는 부자들의 나쁜 소식들을 들었다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:106
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The passes through the hills to the west are filled with bandits, travelling on foot through there can be dangerous."
msgstr "이 언덕을 통해 서쪽으로 가는 길은 도적들로 꽉 차있다네. 이 길로 가는것은 위험하다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ocean travel around here can be dangerous because of the sea serpents and water elementals that roam the oceans."
msgstr "이 근처의 바다를 여행하는 것은 위험하다네. 왜냐하면 바다 괴물들과 물의 정령들이 바다를 돌아다니고 있기 때문이지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:108
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The High Council in Free Haven should really consult the Oracle to find out why the Ironfists have lost the Mandate of Heaven."
msgstr "프리헤이븐의 의회는 아이언피스트가 왜 천상의 명령를 읽어버렸는지를 오라클에게 물어봐야 하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:109
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Prince Nicolai isn't even in charge anymore– Regent Humphrey makes all of the decisions.  It's not fair to blame Nicolai for all the problems."
msgstr "니콜라이왕자는 더 이상 책임자가 아니네. - 리젠 헴프레이가 모든 결정을 하지. 그러니 모든 잘못된 일에 니콜라이의 책임을 묻는건 도리가 아니네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:110
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The two solstices are days of considerable magical importance.  The summer solstice is on June 21st, and the winter solstice is on December 21st."
msgstr "두번의 태양의 지, 최고점은 아주 중요한 의미를 지니네. 여름의 태양 최고점은 6월 21일, 겨울은 12월 21일이네 "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:111
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The stables at Castle Ironfist can take you to the Arena, an ancient place where warriors can test their prowess."
msgstr "아이언피스트성의 마구간에서는 당신을 아레나로 데려다 줄 수 있네, 바로 전사들이 그들의 용기를 시험할 수 있는 고대의 장소이지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:112
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Goblins are weak creatures, but they tend to attack in large numbers."
msgstr "고블린들은 약하지만 항상 패거리로 공격을 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:113
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though their physical attacks are weak, these mages can cast various elemental attack spells."
msgstr "그들의 공격은 약하지만 그들 마법사들은 원소마법으로 공격할 수 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:114
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A powerful artifact, Mordred is a dagger that possesses the ability to steal the health of its victim and transfer that vitality to its wielder."
msgstr "강한 무기지. 모드레드는 상대방의 체력을 빼았을 수 있고 그것을 사용하게도 해주는 단검이라네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:115
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Albert Newton in Mist handles the promotion of Sorcerers to Wizards."
msgstr "미스트의 알버트 뉴튼은 마도사들 마법사로 임명하는 책임자이지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:116
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The abandoned temple northwest of town used to be occupied by the Temple of Baa, but they moved out in a hurry one day last year.  Now there's nothing but snakes, bats, and huge spiders."
msgstr "마을 북서쪽의 버림받은 신전은 예전에 바아의 신전이었다더군. 그러나 그들은 작년엔가 갑자기 도망쳤다더군. 이제 그곳에는 뱀, 박쥐 그리고 큰 거미들밖에 없다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:117
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When the Temple of Baa moved out of that old temple outside of town, all of the little problems we've been having just…went away.  I tell you, there's something unwholesome about those people.  I'm glad they're gone."
msgstr "바아의 신전이 마을 바깥쪽에 있는 신전에서 나갔을 때 우리의 잡다한 문제들도 사라졌지. 내가 말하지만, 그 사람들은 불운을 끌고 다니는것 같아. 난 그들이 사라져 기쁘다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:118
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A wizard friend of mine told me the Temple of Baa was laying curses on our town from the abandoned temple just outside town.  One day they tried to lay the Curse of Endless Vermin on us, only they did something wrong and it backfired, infesting their own temple instead.  They moved righty-o quick once that happened."
msgstr "내 마법사 친구 중 하나가 말하길 바아의 신전은 마을 밖에 있는 버려진 신전에서 우리 마을에 저주를 걸려고 했다더군. 언젠가 그들이 우리에게 해충의 저주를 걸려고 할 때, 뭔가가 잘못돼 그들 자신한테 피해가 갔다더군. 그 일이 생기자마자 그들은 바로 사라졌다더군."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:119
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I heard the Temple of Baa abandoned that old temple so quickly they didn't have time to take all their stuff.  It should all still be down there, if you're brave enough to go look for it.  There's a lot of nasty monsters in the way, though, so be careful if you go."
msgstr "내가 듣기론 바아의 신전이 버려진 오래된 신전에서 도망칠 때 그들은 급하게 도망치느라 그들의 물건들을 다 못 챙겼다더군. 아마 아직도 그곳에 있을꺼야. 그곳에는 아주 많은 괴물들도 있다고 하니 만일 찾으러 갈 생각이라면 조심하게나. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:120
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's been quite a while since New Sorpigal was raided by goblins, but with goblins living in the very place meant to protect us from them, it can't be too long before we're attacked again, can it? "
msgstr "뉴소르피갈이 고블린들에게 점령된 지는 꽤 됐지. 그러나 그들이 우리를 보호하려 하지 않는 이상 우리는 곧 공격당할 걸세.그렇지 않나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:121
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An evil guild of mages has been searching the southeast end of our peninsula for signs of the fabled Fountain of Magic.  They attack anyone who comes near to scare off potential rivals.  Be very careful if you travel in that direction!"
msgstr "악마 길드의 마법사들은 우리 영토의 남동쪽에 있는 마법의 샘을 찾기위해 조사를 하더군. 그들은 그들 근처에 오는 모든 자들을 공격한다더군. 만일 그 쪽으로 갈 일이 있으면 조심하게나!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:122
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The three fountains we have here in town are said to draw their water from a spring touched by the gods.  Each one is magical and beneficial to drink from."
msgstr "우리 마을의 3개의 샘물은 다 신의 손길이 다 있다더군. 각 샘물들을 마실 경우에는 마법적 효과가 있다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:123
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A raiding party of goblins has staked out the west bridge, hoping to rob and kill travelers.  They aren't very subtle– you can see them from a mile away– but they ARE dangerous.  Watch your step!"
msgstr "고블린 무리들은 서쪽의 다리를 점령하고 여행자들을 죽이고 강탈한다더군. 그들은 영리하진 않지만- 아마 당신은 1마일만 가도 볼 수 있을꺼네. -그러나 그들은 위험하다네. 갈 길을 조심하게나! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:124
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our town was founded centuries ago as the last major town in Enroth.  We have historically been a point from which colony ships left for the rest of the world."
msgstr "우리 마을은 몇 세기 전에 발견되었고 엔로스의 마지막 중심 시가지이지. 이곳은 많은 배들이 쉬었다가는 곳이지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:125
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The fruit on the trees in the orchards of our fair town is quite tasty, and free for all to take.  You should try it sometime!"
msgstr "우리 마을에 있는 과수원의 과일들은 아주 맛있고 공짜라네. 한번 먹어 볼 만하지!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:126
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware of travelling to the islands just off our north shore.  The waters sometime have dangerous monsters, and the islands are none too hospitable, either.  "
msgstr "북쪽 해안에 있는 섬을 여행할 때는 조심하게나. 물 속에는 위험한 괴물들이 있고 그 섬도 마찬가지라네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:127
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's been decades since we were last attacked by pirates from the islands of Regna, and I guess it's about time for us to be attacked again, what with the king missing and all."
msgstr "우리가 레그난섬의 해적들로부터 공격당한 지는 10년이 됐지. 아마 이제 그들은 다시 우릴 공격할꺼야. 왕이 사라졌으니까. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:128
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:153
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Buccaneers' Lair in New Sorpigal and Mist can teach you dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap."
msgstr "뉴소르피갈과 미스티에 있는 버캔니이스 라이어는 당신들한테 단검쓰는 법과 매매법 등 여러가지를 가리켜준다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:129
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can learn dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap at protection services in Silver Cove and White Cap."
msgstr "당신은 실버코브와 화이트캡에서 단검, 상품, 확인, 지각, 그리고 함정과 보호서비스를 배울 수 있다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:130
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:155
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Blackshire and Free Haven are homes to the Smugglers' Guild, where you can learn dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap."
msgstr "블랙샤이어와 프리헤이븐은 스뮤글러스 길드의 고향이나 마찬가지지, 바로 당신이  단검, 상품, 확인, 지각, 그리고 함정을 배울 수 있는 곳이네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:131
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:156
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sword, axe, spear, staff, and leather are all taught in Blades' End in both White Cap and New Sorpigal."
msgstr "검, 도끼, 창, 지팡이, 그리고 가죽 등은 뉴소르피갈과 화이트캡에 있는 블레이즈 엔드에서 배울 수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:132
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Duelists' Edge in Mist teaches mace, bow, chain, shield, and body building."
msgstr "미스트에 있는 듀리스 에지에선 철퇴, 활, 체인, 방패, 그리고 보디빌딩을 가르친다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:133
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Berserker's Fury in Castle Ironfist can teach you bow, shield, chain, plate, and repair item."
msgstr "아이언피스트성에 있는 버서커 퓨리에서는 활, 방패, 체인, 철판, 그리고 수리함을 가르친다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:134
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Fraternal Order of Silver has recently built a keep just south of Mist.  They used to be such nice people, but now they're so intent on killing evil they destroy anything that isn't perfect, and that's just about everything."
msgstr "실버의 프레이터널 오도는 최근에 미스트 남쪽에다 성을 만들었다네. 그들은 예전에 꽤 멋진 사람들이었으나, 지금은 뭐든지 완벽하지 않은 건 다 죽여버리거나 파괴한다더군. 아무거나 다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:135
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I love living down here!  Lord Newton never remembers to raise taxes."
msgstr "난 여기서 사는게 좋네!  뉴톤군주는 세금을 올리는 적이 없지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:136
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The islands of Bootleg Bay are home to a few cannibal tribes.  People that visit those islands don't return. "
msgstr "부트레그만 섬은 몇개의 카니발 부족의 집이라더군. 그곳으로 간 사람들은 돌아오질 않더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:137
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Fountain of Magic is supposed to be south of Bootleg Bay, but not many people have ever found it."
msgstr "마법의 샘물은  부트레그만의 남쪽에 있을 걸세, 그러나 찾아낸 사람들은 별로 안되지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:138
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In the islands south of Mist is the forge of Gharik, one of Archibald's fellow mages.  The place is crawling with elementals– no one ever goes there now."
msgstr "미스티 남쪽의 섬은 가릭의 대장간이지. 아치발드의 친구 마법사이기도 하지. 그곳은 이제 마법들로 가득 차 있다더군. 아무도 더 이상 그곳에 가질 않지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:139
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "On an island north of Mist is Castle Alamos, one of the centers of magical study in Enroth.  All sorts of summoning and alchemy occurs in that castle– it's a dangerous place for the casual visitor."
msgstr "미스티 북쪽에 있는 섬에는 알라모스성이 있지. 엔로스에서는 마법연구의 중심지이지. 많은 연금술사들이 매일매일 실험도 하지만, 그냥 평범한 사람들이 가기에는 위험한 곳이지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:140
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A couple of old temples are said to still stand in the jungle islands of Bootleg Bay.  I wonder if anyone still worships in them?"
msgstr "부트레그만의 정글섬에는 아직도 몇 개의 오래된 신전들이 남아있다더군. 누군가가 거기서 아직도 예배를 보나? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:141
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Water elementals prowl the waters near Mist.  As if their powerful physical attacks aren't enough, they can also fire Ice Bolts from a distance."
msgstr "미스트 근처에는 많은 물의 정령들이 돌아다니지. 그들은 그들의 물리적 공격 등이 효과를 보지 못 할 때는 멀리서 얼음번개도 사용한다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:142
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This axe is a hero's dream.  It's enchanted to slay dragons and devils, and does so quite well.  Unfortunately, owners of the axe tend to find such creatures more often then they'd like to."
msgstr "이 도끼는 영웅들의 꿈이지. 이 도끼는 드라곤이나 악마들을 충분히 압도할수있는 마법의 주문이 걸려있다네. 그러나 불행하게도 이 도끼의 소유자들은 그들이 원하지 않는 많은 문제들을 달고 다닌다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:143
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not many people make it to wizard, and even fewer are promoted to arch mages.  Albert Newton must ask the impossible of those looking to be promoted."
msgstr "많은 사람들이 마법사가 되지는 못하지, 극소수만이 일등 마도사가 될 뿐이야. 제대로 임명을 받으려면 알버트 뉴튼을 만나봐야 한다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:144
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mist was originally intended to be a customs and trading port for dealings with the Eastern islands and countries.  Piracy has severely cut into that trade, so we're not as prosperous as we should be."
msgstr "미스트는 원래 동쪽에 있는 섬들이나 나라하고 무역 상거래를 하던 항구였다네. 그러나 해적들이 중간에 개입하는 바람에 예전처럼 돈벌지는 못하지만 말일세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:145
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "About 200 miles to the east of us lie the Regnan Islands.  They are inhabited with pirates ruled by an 'emperor' who 'taxes' passing ships that pass near their territory.  The Regnans produce almost nothing on their own, with the exception of weapons and mercenaries."
msgstr "여기서 동쪽으로 200마일을 가면 레그나섬이 있다네. 그곳에는 해적들의 왕이 있어 그 지역을 통과하는 모든 배들에게 세금을 받지. 그들은 자신이 하는 일은 아무것도 없고 단지 무기들만 손질한다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:146
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear you can make a potion of supreme protection by mixing an orange potion with a green potion."
msgstr "내가 듣기론 당신은 오랜지 포션과 녹색 포션을 섞어 최고의 방어력을 만들수 있다더군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:147
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Melody Silver was recently imprisoned by the Silver Helms in their new outpost south of Mist.  They've been acting awfully strange lately, and it's terrible that they seized such a nice young woman.  Someone's got to do something about those people!"
msgstr "멜로디 실버는 최근에 실버헬멧에 의해 그들의 미스트 남쪽의 새기지에 감금되있다더군. 그들이 그렇게 위대한 여자를 가두었다는건 말도 안되는 일이지. 누군가가 뭔가를 해야할텐데. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:148
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Silver Helms, founded by John Silver, were originally organized to fight brigands and murderers, but they've been harassing citizens for even the most petty crimes recently. "
msgstr "실버 헬멧. 존 실버가 만들었지. 원래 그들은 정의를 위해 싸웠었으나 최근에는 오히려 주민들을 괴롭히고 범죄를 조장한다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:149
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most of the international trade on our island is with the Kingdom of Erathia, homeland of our good Queen Catherine.  Erathia is the source of most of our precious metals and stone."
msgstr "우리 섬의 국제무역은 거의 엘라시아왕국과 이루어진다네. 바로 캐서린 여왕의 고향이지. 그 곳에서는 품질 좋은 금속과 돌들이 많다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:150
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Years of practicing high sorcery can erode the memory of the sorcerer severely, and there is no cure for it.  Even if there was, it's unlikely the victim would remember to use it! "
msgstr "고작 수년간 연습하는  마법들은 위대한 마도사들의 명성을 좀먹게 하지. 막을 방법도 없다네. 만일 있더라도 범죄에 사용된다는데!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:151
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Albert Newton was promoted to his current position because of his strong support for Roland during the Succession War, even though Archibald offered him much sorcerous knowledge.  Lord Newton must surely be a good man to have refused to support the wicked Archibald, even though it looked like Archibald was going to win."
msgstr "알버트 뉴튼은 상속 전쟁 때 로날드왕을 도와서 지금 그의 위치를 얻어냈지. 아치발드가 많은 능력을 전수했는데도 말이야. 그가 아치발드를 도와주지 않은 건 정말 잘한 일일세, 설사 아치발드가 이긴다 했더라도 말이야. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:152
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although Lord Newton seems weak and forgetful these days, it's good to remember that he was once one of the greatest sorcerers in the land, perhaps the greatest sorcerer ever!  They say that Lord Newton has forgotten more sorcerous knowledge than Archibald ever knew, excepting the school of dark magic."
msgstr "요즘에는 뉴톤 군주가 약하고 사람들한테서 많이 잊혀진것 같지만, 그는 한때 이땅 최고의 마도사였다네. 정말 최고였지! 사람들은 그가 아치발드보다 많은 마법을 알고 있다고 했지. 단 어둠마법만 빼고.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:154
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can learn dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap at Protection Services in Silver Cove and White Cap."
msgstr "당신은 단검, 상품, 확인, 지각, 그리고 함정을 실버코브와 화이트캡에 있는 보호서비스에서 배울 수 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:157
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Duelists' Edge in Free Haven teaches mace, bow, chain, shield, and repair item."
msgstr "프리헤이븐에 있는 듀리스 에지에서는 철퇴, 활, 체인, 방패, 그리고 수리함 등을 가르친다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:158
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Berserker's Fury in Silver Cove can teach you sword, bow, shield, plate, and body building."
msgstr "실버코브에 있는 버서커 퓨리에서는 당신한테 검, 활, 방패, 철판, 그리고 보디빌딩을 가르친다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:159
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're skilled enough, Calvin Black can teach you ways to improve your staff skill.  He lives in a house right near the Imp Slapper."
msgstr "만일 당신이 어느 정도 실력이 있다면, 캘빈블랙이 당신의 지팡이기술을 더 상승 시켜줄 수 있네. 그는 님프 스레이퍼 근처의 집에서 살고 있다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:160
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When Gonzalo isn't spending time in the Imp Slapper, he teaches spear expertise."
msgstr "곤잘로가 님프 스레이퍼에서 시간을 보내지 않을 때는 그는 창 다루는 법들을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:161
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're looking to gain expertise in leather armor, Arthur teaches right near the Buccaneers' Lair."
msgstr "만일 당신이 가죽장비를 좀 더 능숙하게 다루는 법을 배우고 싶다면 어캔니스 라이어 근처에 있다는 아서를 찾아가 보게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:162
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bernard teaches expert repair skill just south of the Duelists' Edge."
msgstr "베르나드는 듀리스 에지 남쪽에서 베테랑 수리기술을 가르친다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:163
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The weird creatures that have been summoned around here make people forget that Alamos was the home of some of the best alchemists in the world.  Powerful items must be kept in that castle."
msgstr "이 근처에 있는 불가사의한 생물들 때문에 사람들은 이 곳이 최고의 연금술사 알라모스의 집이였다는걸 잊어버렸다네. 분명 대단히 강한 아이템이 이 성 근처에 있을걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:164
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One of the islands to the west has a strange circle of stones.  I think that's used for the Ceremony of the Sun, one of the requirements in Druid promotions."
msgstr "서쪽에 있는 섬 중 하나는 이상한 원형태의 돌들을 가지고 있다더군. 아마 내 생각에는 그것들은 태양에게 제사를 지낼 때 쓰였던것 같네. 그리고 두루이드가 되기 위한 것 중 하나였지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:165
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The waters around Castle Alamos teem with sea serpents that attack ships with their icy breath."
msgstr "알라모스성 근처의 물에서는 바다 괴물들이 있어 배들을 공격한다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:166
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Percival is the ultimate ranged attack weapon.  With its rapid fire and dangerous explosive attack, it can wipe out large numbers of enemies at a safe distance."
msgstr "퍼시발는 대단한 공격형 무기이지. 빠르고 위험한 폭발력은 평야에서 수많은 적들을 죽일수 있지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:167
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "These annoying creatures are immune to magic, but not immune to a good sword blow."
msgstr "이 귀찮은 생물들은 마법에 면역성이 있으나 좋은 검에는 면역성이 없지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:168
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The old Dwarf King is in exile now, but I'll bet he wants his throne back pretty badly."
msgstr "오래된 드워프 왕은 지금 추방돼 있지만 아마 그는 왕좌로 복귀하는걸 간절히 원하고 있을걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:169
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Snergle hid the key to the innermost chambers of his caverns in the iron mines to the west."
msgstr "스너글은 숨겨진 챔버로 가는 키를 철광산 서쪽에 있는 동굴에 감추어 놓았다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:170
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wilbur Humphrey is so scared that something will happen to Nicolai, the Prince has not been allowed to leave the castle in months."
msgstr "윌버 헴프레이는 니콜라이한테 무슨 일이 생길까봐 걱정을 많이 했지. 왕자는 그 때문에 성 밖으로 한달동안 나가지 못했네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:171
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "After Corlagon's defeat in the Succession Wars, he retired to his Estate in the Mire of the Damned to study sorcery.  Rumor has it that he became a lich hoping to survive until Archibald could return."
msgstr "콜라곤은 상속 전쟁에서 성공한 다음에 그는 그의 마이어 오브 댐드의 재산을 마법을 연구하기 위해 처분했네. 소문에 의하면 그는 아치발드가 돌아오기 전에 숨으려 했다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:172
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Shadow Guild, an upstart Thieves' Guild, supposedly has a hideout near Castle Ironfist.  I'm sure Anthony Stone would love to see that hideout destroyed."
msgstr "쉐도우길드와 , 건방진 도둑 길드는 아이언피스트성 근처에 숨어있다네. 난 확신하건데, 안소니 스톤은 정말 그것들이 파괴되는 걸 보고 싶어할걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:173
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm surprised that Nicolai hasn't asked the Oracle for advice; I doubt Regent Humphrey has all the answers."
msgstr "난 니콜라이가 오라클에게 조언을 구하지 않았다는 것에 놀랐네. 내 생각에는 리젠 헴프레이가 모든 답을 가지고 있을걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:174
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's still no news on when Catherine will be back from her trip to Erathia."
msgstr "아직까진 엘라시아로 간 여왕 캐서린이 언제 돌아올건지에 대한 소식이 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:175
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "King Roland's Yacht, the Queen Catherine, hasn't left port in years.  Is it even still seaworthy?"
msgstr "로날드왕의 요트 여왕 캐서린은 1년 동안 부두를 떠나지 않았네. 항해에 부적합한가? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:176
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lizardmen prowl around the swampy areas south of Castle Ironfist.  They use bows, but the most powerful are wizards that will cast Lightning Bolts when threatened."
msgstr "도마뱀 인간들은 아이언피스트성 남쪽에 돌아다니고 있다더군. 그들은 활을 사용하나 제일 좋은 방법은 마법사들이 전뇌를 사용하는 것이지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:177
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Arena of Enroth can be reached through the stables in Ironfist.  You can fight almost any kind of monster there, if you have the taste for that sort of thing.  Lots of people would go every day, but the Arena is only open on Sundays."
msgstr "엔로스의 아레나는 아이언피스트에서 마구간으로 가면 그 곳에서 갈 수 있다네. 그 곳에는 어떤 종류의 몬스터하고 싸울 수 있으며, 많은 사람들이 매일 가는 모양이지만 아레나는 일요일에만 연다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:178
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A useful shield that unerringly blocks missile attacks and makes its user more likely to land blows in battle."
msgstr "좋은 방패는 미사일 공격들을 잘 막아주고 전투할 때도 편하게 해준다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:179
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wilbur Humphrey, in Roland's absence, handles the promotions of all paladins to crusaders."
msgstr "윌버 헴프레이는 로날드가 없을 때 무인들을 십자군으로 진급시키는 임무를 맡았지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:180
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lord Corlagon was Archibald's greatest lieutenant during the Succession War, and after his side lost, he retired to his mansion in the swamps somewhere.  It is said that he performed the Ritual of the Endless Night and became a lich a couple of years ago."
msgstr "콜라곤 군주는 아치발드의 유명한 장교 중에 하나였지에서, 전쟁이 끝난 후 그들이 졌을때 그는 어딘가로 사라져버렸지. 소문에 의하면 그는 무한한 밤에 대한 의식을 어디서 지내고 있다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:181
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:80
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wilbur Humphrey is Foremost Paladin of the land.  Though many say he is too naïve and unfit to rule while King Roland is gone, people say he is utterly fearless and honest.  I personally think we couldn't possibly find a better man for the job!"
msgstr "윌버 헴프레이는 이땅의 가장 유명한 무인이네. 많은 사람들은 그가 로날드왕의 자리를 메꾸기에는 부족하고 경험이 없다고 하지만 그는 용기있고 정직하다네. 내 개인적인 생각으로는 그보다 나은 사람은 없을 것 같네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:182
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:81
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The fabulous Circus of the Sun usually sets up a few day's travel down the trade road leading north from Castle Ironfist.  They are always there in December of each year."
msgstr "놀라운 태양의 원은 아이언피스트성에서 북쪽으로 무역항로를 따라 며칠가면 볼 수 있네. 그들은 매년 12월에 항상 그곳에 있지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:183
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:82
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are highwaymen plying the trade road brazenly near the castle.  The Regent must be mightily distracted to permit these ruffians to rob innocent travelers right beneath his nose!"
msgstr "성주변의 무역항로에는 노상강도들이 설치고 있지. 리젠은 순진한 무역상인들을 보호하기 위해 뭔가 조치를 취해야 할걸세!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:184
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:83
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Seer lives in a hut on a mountain near the source of the Silver River that runs from the Steel Mountains, past Castle Ironfist, and into the ocean.  It is said that he helps those who are lost."
msgstr "예언자는 스틸마운틴에서 아이언피스트성을 통과하는 실버 리버산의 오두막에 살고 있으며 길 잃은 사람들을 도와준다고 하더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:185
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:84
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rocklin, former King of the Dwarves, has been deposed by a dwarf named Snergle.  Snergle renamed the mines and caverns formerly operated by Rocklin to, predictably, Snergle's Mine and Snergle's Caverns.  You can find both of those places west of the mountains near Castle Ironfist called the Steel Mountains."
msgstr "록클린, 옛날 드워프들의 왕, 그는 스너글한테 쫏겨났지. 스너글은 록클린이 이름 붙였던 광산과 동굴들의 이름을 다 바꾸었으며 그 광산과 동굴들은 아이언피스트나 스틸마운틴에서 찾을 수 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:186
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:85
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The swamps of Enroth are home to all manner of unwholesome monsters, many of them undead.  Carry fire and tread lightly if you should ever have to venture there!"
msgstr "엔로스의 늪지대는 거의 좀비들의 집이라네. 만일 그런 곳으로 갈 일이 있으면 불과 빛의 마법을 가지고 가게나!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:187
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:86
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The road between Castle Ironfist and New Sorpigal has become quite unsafe.  Ordinarily, we only have one group of bandits preying upon travelers…but these days we have not one, not two, but THREE groups of bandits!  First, there is that hideous Temple of Baa, then we have the Dragoon hideout near the south shore somewhere, and finally we have an unauthorized Thieves' Guild open for business near the Castle!  "
msgstr "아이언피스트성에서 뉴소르피갈로 가는 길은 더 이상 안전하지 않네. 그곳에는 이제 도적때들만 남아 여행자들을 습격하고 있지. 그것도 한 두개가 아니라 세 무리씩이나! 먼저 그 곳에는 바아 신전이 숨어 있었고 또 남쪽 어딘가에는 기병대들, 마지막으로 도적 길드가 있다네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:188
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:87
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Newt teaches expert leather skill south of Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "뉴트는 아이언피스트성 남쪽에서 베테랑 가죽기술을 가르친다. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:189
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:88
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can learn expert chain skill from Rich just south of Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "당신은 아이언피스트 남쪽에서 리치한테 베테랑 체인 기술을 배울 수 있다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:190
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:89
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A little south of Castle Ironfist are four small houses.  Benito teaches expert plate skill in the northmost one."
msgstr "아이언피스트성에서 남쪽으로 조금만 가면 네개의 작은 집이 나오지. 베니토는 거기서 베테랑 철판기술을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:191
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:90
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Edgar will teach sufficiently skilled shield users expert techniques."
msgstr "에드거는 방패를 쓰는 테크닉을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:192
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:91
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Aaron teaches expert sword wielding right next to the weapon shop in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "아이언피스트성의 무기상점 옆에서 아론은 베테랑 검술을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:193
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:92
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Expert axe is taught by Stephan in the training grounds."
msgstr "훈련장에서 스테판에게 베테랑 도끼기술을 배울 수 있지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:194
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:93
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Helen lives with her friend Tracy right between the King's Crown and the Eagle's Eye."
msgstr "왕의 왕관과 독수리의 눈 사이에서 헬렌은 그녀 친구 트레이시와 살고 있지.."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:195
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:94
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tyler teaches expert disarm right across the street from the training grounds in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "아이언피스트 성의 훈련장에서 길을 건너면 테일러가 베테랑 함정을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:196
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:95
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Leon teaches expert identify right across the street from the training grounds in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "아이언피스트 성의 훈련장에서 길을 건너면 레옹이 베테랑 확인기술를 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:197
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:96
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Olaf lives in a small house behind Castle Ironfist, and teaches expert body building from there."
msgstr "오라프는 아이언피스트 성 뒷편에 있는 조그만 집에서 살고 있지, 그리고 거기서 보디빌딩을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:198
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:97
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Elton teaches expert learning in one of the towers of Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "엘튼은 아이언피스트 성의 타워 중 한군데서 베테랑 배우기 기술을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:199
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:98
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Walter teaches expert diplomacy in one of the towers of Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "월터는 아이언피스트 성의 타워 중 한군데서 베테랑 정치력을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:200
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:99
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Behind the King's Crown you can find Terrance Smith.  He'll teach skilled dagger users a few new tricks."
msgstr "왕의 왕관 뒷편에서 당신은 테란스 스미스를 찾을 수 있네. 그가 새로운 단검기술을 가르켜 줄걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:201
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:100
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear there's a reward out for the ones who can put down the Dragoon highwaymen plying the road near the south shore.  Some merchant's offering a LOT of money for the return of his stolen merchandise!"
msgstr "내가 듣기론 남쪽에 있는 노상강도들을 처치하면 보상금이 있다더군. 그리고 어떤 상인은 그가 빼았긴 물건을 찾아주면 많은 돈을 준다더군!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:202
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:101
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A small order of monks has grown just south of Bootleg Bay, called the Order of the Fist."
msgstr "부트레이만 남쪽에서 승려들이 모이가 있다더군. 그들을 오더 오브 더 피스트라고 한다더군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:203
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:102
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The islands of Bootleg Bay hide a pile of pirate treasure.  That is, if you can get past the cannibals and actually find it…"
msgstr "부트레이만의 섬은 많은 해적들의 보물을 감추고 있지. 만일 카니발의 과거를 안다면 찾을 수 있을지도…  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:204
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:103
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The location of the Fountain of Magic is still a mystery.  For some reason, the people that find it never reveal its location."
msgstr "마법의 샘물의 위치는 아직 미스테리이네. 어떤 이유에선지 모르지만 그 곳을 찾아낸 사람들도 절대 말을 안한다는군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:205
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:104
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Church of the Sun used to have a temple on an island in Bootleg Bay."
msgstr "태양의 교회은 부트레이만에 신전이 있었다더군.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:206
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:105
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A powerful crown, Arthur not only boosts all its wearer's physical characteristics, but also their spell points."
msgstr "강한 왕관이지, 아서는 착용자의 물리적 샌스까지 올려주고 또 마법 포인트까지 올려준다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:207
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:106
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard that you need to slay an elder dragon to be promoted from Crusader to Hero.  No wonder there are so few Heroes around!"
msgstr "내가 듣기로 당신들은 십자군에서 영웅이 되려면 오래된 용을 죽여야 한다던데, 왜 영웅이 많지 않은지 이제 알겠군!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:208
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:107
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The temple of Tsantsa can be found on one of the large islands south of Silver Cove.  The people that live on that island like to sacrifice captives to their beastly god Tsantsa, and then shrink their heads in the pools of disgusting chemicals they keep in their temple.  The islanders are quite hostile, so be sure to kiss your loved ones goodbye if you have plans to visit the island."
msgstr "실버코브 남쪽의 큰 섬에서 트샌트사의 신전을 찾을수 있다네. 그 곳에 사는 사람들은 항상 그들만의 신 트샌트사에게 예배를 하고 신전 안에 있는 징그러운 화학품에게 머리를 조아린다네. 만일 당신이 그 섬을 여행한다면 유서를 써넣고 가는게 좋을걸세.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:209
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:108
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Long abandoned by the Church of the Sun, their temple still stands on a large island east of Free Haven.  A small order of confused monks, misapprehending the true nature of the temple, have somehow made peace with the islanders and moved into the temple– bringing a stolen holy artifact with them.  Now the old temple's insidious magic has affected their minds, making them believe they must defend the temple to the death.  The monks are very unfriendly these days, and attack all who trespass."
msgstr "오래전에 버려진 태양의 교회, 그러나 아직 그들은 프리헤이븐 동쪽의 섬에서 건재한다더군. 어떻게 했는지 모르지민 섬사람들하고 좋은 관계를 유지해 그곳으로 옮겼고 훔친 고대 물건들도 같이 가지고 같다더군. 그들은 죽음으로부터 신전을 지켜야한다고 믿고 있으며 승려들은 예전처럼 친절하지도 않고 그곳에 무단출입하는 자들을 모두 공격한다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:210
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:109
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Preston teaches expert chain skill just east of the Goblin's Tooth."
msgstr "프레스톤은 고블린 투스 동쪽에서 베테랑 체인기술을 가르친다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:211
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:110
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shoshi can teach you new perception tricks from his house just east of the Goblin's Tooth."
msgstr "소시는 고블린 투스 동쪽에서 새로운 지각능력을 가르친다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:212
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:111
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Winston used to be a member of that new clerical order down here, but he quit.  Apparently he left something behind because he's looking for someone to go back to the Temple of the Fist for him.  He's lives in one of the antechambers of the House of Healing now."
msgstr "윈스톤은 이곳의 새로운 성직자 계급의 멤버였으나 그만 뒀지. 그는 누군가가 자기를 위해 피스트 신전에 가기 원했다네. 그는 지금 치료의 집의 곁방에 살고 있다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:213
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:112
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Cedric Druthers' splinter group of druids perform ceremonies in a cave west of Silver Cove."
msgstr "세드릭 브루더한테서 쪼개져 나온 그룹들이 실버코브 서쪽 동굴에서 예배를 보고 있다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:214
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:113
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The stronghold of the Fraternal Order of Silver is located near Silver Cove.  The Silver Helms seem more violent lately, I wonder why that is?"
msgstr "프레테널 오더 오브 실버의 요새는 실버코브에 위치하고 있다네. 실버 헴즈은 더 난폭해 진것 같고, 난 그들이 왜 그렇게 변했는지 궁금하다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:215
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:114
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Warlord's Fortress is to the northwest of Silver Cove.  Only the strongest warriors are enlisted into his army."
msgstr "워로드의 요새는 실버코브의 북서쪽에 있다네. 아주 강한 전사들만 그곳의 군대에 들어갈  수 있지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:216
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:115
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Shadow Guild supposedly has a large guild right near Castle Stone.  I'm surprised Anthony Stone hasn’t discovered its location yet."
msgstr "쉐도우 길드는 스톤성 주위에 커다란 길드를 갖고 있다던데, 난  안소니 스톤이 아직도 위치를 못 찾아낸 것에 놀랄 뿐이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:217
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:116
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not many ships travel to Castle Alamos.  Most captains are afraid of the strange creatures that prowl around the northern seas."
msgstr "알라모스성으로는 많은 배들이 여행을 가지 않는다네. 대부분의 선장들이 북쪽 바다에 있는 이상한 생물들을 무서워하기 때문이지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:218
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:117
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Guilds of Light can be found in Silver Cove and Blackshire and Guilds of Dark can be found in Winter Cap and Blackshire."
msgstr "빛의 길드은 실버코브와 블랙샤이어에서 찾을 수 있고 어둠의 길드는  회이트캡과 블랙샤이어에서 찾을 수 있다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:219
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:118
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Diamond Gargoyles are the toughest gargoyles around.  They're impossible to kill with physical attacks, so you should use magic to kill them."
msgstr "금강석 석루조는 이 주위 석루조 중 가장 강한 것일세. 그것들은 물리적인 공격으로는 죽일 수 없고 단지 마법으로만 죽일 수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:220
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:119
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Druids can cast a variety of elemental spells when angered, and are often slightly shielded from magical attacks."
msgstr "드루이드는 화가 나면 원소마법도 쓸 수 있고, 마법공격에도 보호를 할 수 있다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:221
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:120
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "These legendary boots enable their wearer to move faster and react quicker."
msgstr "이 전설의 부츠는 신은 자에게 빠르게 움직일 수 있게 해준다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:222
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:121
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To be promoted to Arch Druid, a Greater Druid needs to perform the Ceremony of the Moon in the Temple of the Moon near Free Haven."
msgstr "극 드루이드로 승진하기 위해서는, 프리헤이븐 근처의 달의 사원의 의식을 통과해야하네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:223
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:122
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The fortress of the Warlord watches over the source of the Calimar river as it winds its way past Silver Cove and empties into Bootleg Bay.  Originally established to protect a town planned for that region, the fortress became a magnet for mercenaries and criminals after the town failed and all the settlers moved south to greener pastures."
msgstr "워로드의 숲은 캘리머 강물의 원천이고 바람은 실버코브를 지나 부트레이만까지 분다네. 원래는 이 마을을 지키기 위한 목적으로 생겼으나 숲이 범죄와 추악한 것으로 더렵혀지자 모두들 그곳을 떠나 남쪽으로 갔다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:224
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:123
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Monolith overlooks the Silver road that leads from Silver Cove to Free Haven.  It's been an object of fascination and occasional worship for ages.  A long time ago, some group of druids carved a home out of the giant rock, and it has been inhabited by various groups since then.  The druids who currently live there were experimenting with some kind of new magic, and I think something may have gone wrong.  They've been avoiding contact with the outside world for some time now, and refuse to allow visitors to enter the Monolith."
msgstr "실버코브에서 프리헤이븐으로 가는 실버로드에는 비석이 하나 있다네. 그것은 아주 매력적이고 수년동안 그것에 예배를 지냈지. 아주 오래전에 드루이드들이 거대한 그 돌에다 조각을 했다더군, 그리고 드루이드들은 그 돌에다 새로운 마법을 연습했는데 내 생각에는 뭐가 잘못 된 것 같아. 그들은 다른 사람들하고 일체 연락을 끊고 아무도  모노니스로 들어오지도 못하게 한다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:225
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:124
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The town of Silver Cove got its start as a fishing and trading village a few hundred years ago.  With time, our little village grew up to be a full-fledged town.  We have ample room to expand the town, and the land around us is fertile and easy to farm.  We are just a little distant from the rest of the Kingdom, though."
msgstr "실버코브 타운은 수 백년 전에 낚시와 무역을 겸하는 조그만 마을이었네. 시간이 지난 후에 우리 마을은 발전했지. 우리는 더 발전시킬만한 더 많은 능력이 있고 주위 여건도 상당히 좋은 편이네. 단지 왕국에서 조금 멀리 있을 뿐이지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:226
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:125
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Lady of Silver Cove often seems more interested in amassing her fortune than governing well, but I don't think it's so simple.  She often spends a lot of wealth on town improvements and security, so I guess she can't be all bad."
msgstr "실버코브의 책임자인 그녀는 적어도 정치하는것 보다는 자신의 부를 쌓는 것에 관심이 더 많은것 같네. 그러나 그녀는 또한 치안에도 많은 시간을 쏟아부으니 뭐, 특히 나쁘다고 할건 없다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:227
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:126
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Silver Helm vigilantes have occupied a fortress just north of Silver Cove.  Accusing Lady Fleise of the sin of greed, the Silver Helms have begun to attack her caravans travelling between Silver Cove and Free Haven.  I'm sure she's none too happy about it..."
msgstr "실버 헴의 정찰대는 실버코브의 북쪽에 있는 숲에 위치하고 그들은 레이디 플레이즈의 무역상인들, 실버코브에서 프리헤이븐으로 가는 사람들을 습격하기 시작했네. 분명히 그녀는 그 일에 대해 많이 화가 나 있을걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:228
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:127
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Be careful of travelling the waters north and east of Silver Cove– they're inhabited by giant, man-eating sea serpents!"
msgstr "실버코브의 북쪽과 동쪽을 여행할 때는 조심하게나. 그 곳에는 자이언트와 사람을 잡아 먹는 바다 괴물들이 있다네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:229
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:128
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Spring Equinox is on March 20th, and the Autumn Equinox is on September 23rd.  It's said that these dates are important magical events."
msgstr "봄의 일식은 3월 20일, 그리고 가을 일식은 9월 23일. 사람들은 이날 뭔가 대단한 마법이 일어날거라 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:230
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:129
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The White Rock Islands north of Silver Cove have long been abandoned by civilized humans, and are now home to the monsters and madmen.  Druids occasionally risk their lives and journey to those islands looking for the fabled Circle of Stones so they can perform the Ceremony of the Sun."
msgstr "실버코브, 북쪽에 있는 화이트락 섬은 사람들이 버린지 오래 됐지, 그리고 미친 사람들과 괴물들만이 살고 있지. 그러나 드루이드들이 그 곳에있는 서클 오브 스톤을 의식에 사용하기 위해 그곳에 모이고 있다더군.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:231
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:130
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Silver Helms have been attacking everyone they see as less than 100% behind their fight against evil.  I don't know about you, but I think such an extreme position can't be a good thing– what's Sir John Silver thinking?"
msgstr "실버헴은 그들눈에 보이는 모든 것들을 다 공격한다더군. 난 당신에 대해 잘 모르지만 과격해봤자 좋을 일도 없는데, 대체 존 실버경은 무슨 생각을 하고 있지?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:232
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:131
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The druids of the Monolith have made a pact with the Netherworld– I know, because I met a druid who escaped from there one night.  He says unspeakable things are happening inside the Monolith, and if something isn't done soon, the outside world may soon learn more than it ever wanted to know about the secrets of the ancient place."
msgstr "모노니스의 드루이드들은 명부와 협정을 맺었네- 난 알지 왜냐면 난 그들 중에서 도망쳐나온 드루이드를 한명 알거든. 그가 말하길 모노니스에서는 말 못 할 일이 생기고 있다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:233
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:132
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tina lives with her daughter just east of Town Hall.  She teaches light expertise to skilled apprentices."
msgstr "티나는 타운 홀 동쪽에서 그녀의 딸과 살고 있고 그녀는 빛의 숙련된 기술을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:234
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:133
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can learn expert repair just west of the Mercenary Guild from Cyrus Montebleu."
msgstr "당신은 상인 길드 서쪽에 있는 키루스 몬테블루한테서 베테랑 수리기술을 배울 수 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:235
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:134
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Clyde teaches expert meditation skill right across the street from the Self Guild."
msgstr "클라이드는 셀프 길드 길 건너편에서 베테랑 명상기술을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:236
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:135
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sigriv can teach you expert techniques with the spear just south of the training grounds."
msgstr "시그리브는 훈련장의 남쪽에서 베테랑 창기술을 가르친다네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:237
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:136
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I heard that Eleanor wants the evil druids kicked out of the Monolith to the west, and she's willing to offer a reward to the people that do it.  She's on the east side of town if you want to know more."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는 엘레나는 악마 드루이드들을 모노니스에서 서쪽으로 �m아내고 싶어한다더군, 그리고 그녀는 그것에 대해 보상금을 준다네. 그녀는 타운동쪽에 있으니 관심있으면 만나보게나. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:238
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:137
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The home of the Necromancers; no one travels to Castle Darkmoor anymore unless they're looking for undead.  I can't imagine the village of Darkmoor surviving much longer without any trade from the rest of Enroth."
msgstr "네크로맨서들의 고향이지; 아무도 더 이상 다크모아성으로 여행을 가지 않네, 단 좀비들을 찾으려 할 때만 빼놓고. 난 그들이 엔로스와 아무 거래 없이도 살 수 있다는걸 믿을 수가 없다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:239
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:138
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The mountains to the west keep all the horrible creatures of Dragonsand from rampaging across the rest of Enroth."
msgstr "서쪽의 산에는 드라곤샌드의 모든 살벌한 괴물들이 모여 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:240
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:139
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Snergle isn't a good leader, but none of the dwarves dare to stand up to him."
msgstr "스너글은 좋은 리더가 아니지. 그러나 어떤 드워프도 그와 맞설 생각을 못하네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:241
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:140
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Terrax never left Darkmoor after he became a lich.  He could very well still be inside researching new magical spells."
msgstr "테렉스는 그가 시체가 되기 전에는 한번도 다크모아를 떠난 적이 없네. 그는 마법 연구에 한 몸을 바쳤었지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:242
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:141
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The ghosts that haunt the Mire of the Damned can age you past your years with a single touch."
msgstr "유령들이 많이 출몰하는 마이어 오브 댐드에서 그들은 한번 토치로 당신을 젊게 할 수 있다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:243
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:142
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Harpies will curse their unlucky victims.  Fortunately, they're pretty easy to kill."
msgstr "성난 여자는 그들의 적에게 저주를 걸으나 다행히도 그들은 죽이기 쉽다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:244
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:143
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Even though skeletons are the weakest undead monster, some of them can curse you or fill your hearts with unnatural fear."
msgstr "해골들이 가장 죽이기 쉽다고 하나 어떤것들은 당신의 용기를 없애버리는 저주를 걸 수 있다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:245
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:144
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A ring useful for either a cleric or paladin, Igraine boosts the effect of their spells."
msgstr "성직자이나 무인양 쪽에 다 사용가능한 반지로서 , 이글라인은 마법효과를 극대화 해준다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:246
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:145
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Osric requires a test of skill for promotion to champion.  Few ever succeed in that test."
msgstr "오스릭은 챔피언으로 임명하기 전에 테스트를 보고 극소수만 그 테스트를 통과했다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:247
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:146
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Connie teaches expert axe skill just outside Darkmoor village."
msgstr "코니는  다크모아 빌라지 밖에서 베테랑 도끼 기술을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:248
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:147
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Casey teaches expert merchant skill upstairs in the south of Darkmoor village."
msgstr "케시는 다크모아 빌라지 남쪽에서 베테랑 매매술을 가르친다네 . "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:249
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:148
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jack teaches expert mace skill across the street from Smoke and Mirrors."
msgstr "잭은 스모크 앤 밀러 건너편길에서 베테랑 철퇴기술을 가르친다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:250
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:149
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Avinril was an important dwarf until the new king Snergle kicked him out.  He's looking for revenge now, and needs help.  I know you can find him in the Haunt out by one of the dwarf mines."
msgstr "애빈릴은 새 왕 스너글이 그를 �i아내기 전까지 매우 중요한 드워프 중 하나였네. 그는 이제 복수를 하려하고 도움이 필요하다네. 난 당신이 그를 드워프 광산들 중에서 찾을 걸 알고 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:251
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:150
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Church of the Moon had a temple to the west.  Now, Cedric Druthers' druids use the temple for their ceremonies."
msgstr "달의 교회은 서쪽에 신전이 있었지만 이제는 세드릭 드루터스의 드루이드들이 의식집행을 위해 사용한다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:252
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:151
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The sewers under Free Haven are crawling with thieves and pests.  I can't imagine anyone WANTING to live in a sewer."
msgstr "프리헤이븐 지하의 하수도는 도적들과 해충으로 득실되지. 난 거기서 산다는 것을 상상도 할 수가 없다네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:253
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:152
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard that a strange ship sails in the middle of Temper's lake."
msgstr "내가 듣기론 사원의 호수 중앙에는 이상한 배가 항해를 한다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:254
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:153
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Cedric Druthers' druids now occupy an old temple of the Church of the Moon to the west of Free Haven."
msgstr "세드릭 드루터스의 드루이드들은 이제 프리헤이븐 서쪽의  오래된 달의 교회의 신전을 차지했다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:255
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:154
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The High Council has not once visited the Oracle since these disasters have started happening.  The wisdom of the Oracle could certainly be used now."
msgstr "의회는 이런 재앙들이 닥치는데도 한번도 오라클을 방문한 적이 없네. 이제 오라클의 도움을 받을 때도 된것 같은데. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:256
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:155
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The pass to White Cap and Castle Stromgard is now patrolled by renegade ogres and greedy humans."
msgstr "화이트캡과 스트롬가드 성을 지나는 길은 오그레들과 흉학한 인간들의 순찰을 받아야 할 걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:257
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:156
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No surprise, archers will fire arrows at you.  However, some archers prefer to use flaming arrows, and the best of them can actually cast Fireball."
msgstr "놀랠 것도 아니네, 궁수들이 당신한테 활을 쏴도. 최고의 궁수는 화이어 볼도 사용할 수 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:258
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:157
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A sorcerer or archer's best friend, this amulet boosts the effect of elemental magic."
msgstr "마도사나  궁수들이 제일 좋아하는 것이지, 이것은 원소마법의 효과를 극대화를 해준다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:259
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:158
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Osric Temper handles all the promotions of knights in Enroth."
msgstr "오스릭 사원은 엔로스의 기사들의 임명권을 가진다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:260
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:159
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The High Council meets in Free Haven to represent the Lords of Enroth and handle the important business of the Realm.  With trouble brewing in the west, you would think they'd meet more frequently, but they still limit their hours as though nothing were happening!"
msgstr "프리헤이븐에서의 의회는 엔로스의 새 군주와 왕가의 중요한 비즈니스를 어떻게 할건지에 대해 모이는 것일세. 보통 생각으로 서쪽의 여러가지 문제 때문에 더 많이 회의 하는게 정석이지만 겉으론 여전히 아무일도 없던 것처럼 조금 밖에 회의를 하질 않는다네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:261
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:160
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Of all the Lords of Enroth, Osric Temper is the most concerned with handling the devils that have been attacking the western towns and villages.  I personally believe he is the only Lord with his head screwed on straight these days!"
msgstr "엔로스의 군주는, 오스릭 기질이 되야하네, 그만이 지금 서쪽지방을 위협하는 악마들과 제대로 싸울 수 있고 마을을 지킬 수 있네. 난 그가 최고 적임자라고 믿어의심치 않는다네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:262
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:161
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear there's a Thieves' Guild in the city with a trap door leading into the Free Haven city sewer.  They must use it to distribute all their stolen loot around town."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는 도시 안에 있는 도둑 길드는 프리헤이븐에 있는 하수구로 들어가는 입구에 함정들을 설치해 놓았다는군. 분명 그것은 그들이 훔친 여러 물건들을 감추기 위해 그럴꺼야.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:263
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:162
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Circus of the Sun usually sets up a few days south of Castle Temper on the west side of the Crescent River.  They stay there during August of every year."
msgstr "태양의 원은 보통 크리샌트 강물의 서쪽, 템퍼성에서 남쪽으로 며칠 안 걸리는 곳에 자리를 잡는다네. 그들은 매년 8월, 항상 그 곳에 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:264
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:163
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though small, the village of Rockham serves as a trading post and rest stop for people travelling around the Kingdom.  'Though all roads may lead to Free Haven, nearly every traveler has to pass through Rockham to get there."
msgstr "비록 작긴 하나, 록크헴 마을은 왕국으로 여행하는 사람들의 휴식처이며 거래 장소이지. 모든 프리헤이븐으로 가는 사람들은 록크헴을 지나치게 돼지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:265
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:164
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When Ethric the Necromancer…died, he left instructions for his body to be placed in a tomb he had built next to the mountains south of the Pearblossom river.  It's said that he rose from the dead a few days later in a sort of infernal miracle.  Since then, the tomb has become a spiritual sink where all manner of lost souls drift to after death.  There they languish, mindlessly attacking the living in defense of their new master Ethric the Mad."
msgstr "네크로맨서 에스릭이 죽었을때… 그는 그의 육신을 피어블로즌 강물 남쪽의 산에 비석을 세우고 묻히려 했지. 소문에는 그는 죽은지 며칠 후에 어떤 기적으로 인해 다시 일어났다는군. 그 때부터 비석은 초자연적으로 변하고 모든 길 읽어버린 영혼들이 모이게 됐지. 그 영혼들은 그 곳에서 그들의 새 주인인  미친 에스릭를 보호한다는군."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:266
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:165
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An unsavory company of mercenaries has moved into a fortification built by Roland during the Succession War, near Crescent Lake.  Far as I know, the mercenaries haven't done anything wrong yet, but their presence is ominous, don't you think?"
msgstr "불쾌한 그 용병들의 요새는 롤랜드왕이 상속 전쟁 때 만든 크리샌트 강물 근처에 있는 요새로 옮겨 갔다네.  내가 알기로는 그 용병들은 뭐 나쁜 짓을 하지는 않았지만 그들의 모임은 불길한 느낌이라네. 그렇지 않나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:267
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:166
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Free Haven is the oldest and most prosperous city in the Kingdom.  With a natural harbor and the Oracle, it was only common sense for people to gather here since the Silence."
msgstr "프리헤이븐은 왕국에서 가장 오래되고 번창한 도시라네. 자연적 항구와 오라클이 있고 사람들이 이 도시로 모이는 것은 자연적인 일이 되었지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:268
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:167
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Glimmervale Lake has been the source of many supernatural sightings lately.  People say the sightings are caused by the tampering of the Necromancer's Guild, disbanded now for ten years.  Who knows what damage they caused before King Roland put a stop to their evil?"
msgstr "그리머밸리 호수는 초자연적인이고 보이지 않는 모든 것들의 원천이 되었다네. 사람들은 그런 일들이 다 네크로맨서 길드가 저주를 해서 그런거라지만, 그들은 해체된지 10년이 되었다네. 그러나 누가 알겠는가, 그들이 얼마만큼 저주를 퍼부었는지를, 롤랜드 왕이 악마들을 막기전에. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:269
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:168
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Temple Stone in Free Haven was recently burnt to the ground by a group of monks trying to steal the sacred chalice from the temple.  They fled east by boat, and nobody's seen them since."
msgstr "프리헤이븐에 있는 스톤 신전은 최근 신성한 제단을 훔치려는 승려들에게 불타버렸다네. 그들은 보트를 타고 동쪽으로 도망갔고, 그 후에는 아무도 그들을 본적이 없다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:270
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:169
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't know if you've noticed, but those creepy followers of Baa keep popping in and out of buildings around town in the strangest manner.  Could be that they've located one of their temples in the city sewer system."
msgstr "혹시 당신이 들어봤는지는 모르지만 바아 신전의 추종자들은 빌딩들을 벗어나 이상한 곳에 숨어있다는군. 아마 도시의 하수구 등에 있을꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:271
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:170
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Maybe there really is something to the notion that evil is down, while good is up.  Both the followers of Baa and members of the Shadow Guild can be found in the city sewers.  Would that we have a big flood one day to wash all that trash out to sea!"
msgstr "어쩌면 악마는 내려가고 좋은 것들은 올라간다는 것이 맞을지도 모르네. 어쨌든 바아 신전의 추종자들과  쉐도우길드 멤버들은 도시 하수구에서 찾을 수 있다네. 아마 그 쓰레기들을 치우려면 큰 홍수가 한번 나야 될거야!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:272
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:171
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware bandits on the road to Blackshire!  Ever since the King went off to who knows where, criminals have been plying the roads between all the major cities."
msgstr "블랙샤이어로 가는 길의 도적들을 조심하게! 왕이 사라진 후부터 도적들은 모든 중심지에 나타나 장악하고 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:273
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:172
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Liches are the only form of the living dead that actually chooses to be living dead.  A lich is the rotting skeleton of a powerful cleric or sorcerer, held together by necromantic rites performed during life.  A relatively new monster, it is said that Ethric the Mad was the first sorcerer to discover and perform the Ritual of the Endless Night, simultaneously becoming the world's first lich and necromancer. <Shuddering> Creepy, huh?"
msgstr "좀비들은 시체들 중에서도 특별히 선택된 것들이지. 그들은 강한 성직자이나 마도사가 조종하고 어떤 사악한 의식에 사용되기도 하지. 비교적 새로운 괴물들은 말하길 미친 에스릭가 처음으로 발견하고 무한한 밤의 의식을 치룬 첫번째 마도사라고도 하지. 그리고 세계 첫번째좀비라고도. <떨면서> 오싹하지 않나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:274
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:173
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The mercenaries living in that stronghold near Castle Temper seem to have a lot of money, because they keep ordering up weapons and supplies.  Someone must be paying them for some reason, but who?"
msgstr "용병들은 템퍼성 근처의 요새에 살면서도 돈이 많은 것 같더군. 왜냐면 그들은 쉴새없이 무기들을 주문하더군. 아마 누군가가 어떤 이유로 뒷 돈을 데주는 것 같아. 누굴까? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:275
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:174
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear the former King of the Dwarves is hiding out in some local tavern, drowning his sorrows after being deposed by Snergle.  A sorry fate for Roland's most steadfast ally during the War!  I'll bet if King Roland were around he would help him out."
msgstr "내가 듣기론 옛날 드워프의 왕이 어떤 동굴에 숨어있다더군, 스너글에 대한 증오를 품으며 말일세. 만일 롤랜드왕이 살아있으면 분명 도와줬을텐데."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:276
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:175
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Timothy teaches expert body magic southwest of the four elemental guilds."
msgstr "티모시는 4대원소 길드의 남서쪽에서 베테랑 보디 마법을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:277
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:176
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Michael teaches expert sword skill just northeast of the body guild."
msgstr "마이클은 보디길드 북동쪽에서 베테랑 검술을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:278
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:177
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sylvester can show you new diplomacy tricks south of Town Square."
msgstr "실버스타는 마을 광장 남쪽에서 새 정치기술을 가르쳐준다더군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:279
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:178
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Livia will teach promising merchants a few expert techniques south of Town Square."
msgstr "리비아는 마을 광장 남쪽에서 상품에 대한 새로운 기술을 가르친다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:280
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:179
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Takao teaches expert shield just west of the Sharpening Stone."
msgstr "타카오는 샤핑 스톤 서쪽에서 베테랑 방패기술을 가르친다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:281
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:180
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mynasia teaches expert mind magic southwest of the four elemental guilds."
msgstr "마이네시아는 4대원소 길드의 남서쪽에서 베테랑 정신마법을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:282
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:181
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Michele teaches expert spirit magic southwest of the four elemental guilds."
msgstr "마이클는 4대원소 길드의 남서쪽에서 베테랑 영혼마법을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:283
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:182
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can find expert disarm training from Ivan right near the Smugglers' Guild."
msgstr "스뮤글러스 길드 근처에서 당신은 이반이라는 사람한테서 베테랑 함정기술을 배울 수 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:284
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:183
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Logan lives just northeast of the body guild, and he teaches expert dagger skill."
msgstr "보디 길드 북동쪽에 살고 로간은 베테랑 단검기술을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:285
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:184
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jack teaches expert fire magic just south of Temple Stone."
msgstr "잭은 스톤신전 남쪽에서 베테랑  불마법을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:286
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:185
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Woodrow lives just southwest of the mind guild, and he teaches expert plate skill."
msgstr "우드로우는 정신 길드 남서쪽에 살고 그는 베테랑 철판 기술을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:287
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:186
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hitomi teaches expert water magic just south of Temple Stone."
msgstr "히토미는 스톤신전 남쪽에 살고 베테랑 물마법을 가르친다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:288
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:187
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Li teaches expert earth magic just south of Temple Stone."
msgstr "리는 스톤 신전 남쪽에 살고 베테랑 땅마법을 가르친다네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:289
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:188
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Zodahn teaches expert air magic just south of Temple Stone."
msgstr "조단은 스톤신전 남쪽에서 베테랑 공기마법을 가르친다네.     "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:290
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:189
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Zoltan was complaining recently that a new artifact for his collection was stolen by the Dragoons to the south of here.  He's put up a bounty for its return, go to his house just south of Town Square for more information."
msgstr "졸탄은 그의 새 고대 유적을 여기 남쪽에 있는 기병대들이 훔쳐같다고 불평을 하다군. 그는 다시 찾아주는데 보상금을 걸었네. 좀더 알려면 여기 남쪽에 있는 그의 집으로 가보게나.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:291
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:190
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gabriel said he was working on a way to reverse some weird undead ritual.  I don't know much about rituals, but I do know that Gabriel lives just south of Temple Stone if you want to ask him about it."
msgstr "가브리엘이 말하길 그는 언데드에 관한 의식을 하고 있었다더군. 난 의식에 대해서 잘 모르지만 가브리엘이 스톤신전 남쪽에 사는건 알고 있으니 가서 물어보게나. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:292
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:191
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Carlo's good friend Sherell is lost in Bootleg Bay; he's looking for people to help him out near the docks."
msgstr "카를로의 좋은 친구인 세넬은 부트레이만에서 사라졌다네 그는 지금 그 때문에 자기를 도와줄 사람들을 부두 근처에서 찾고 있지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:293
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:192
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rumor has it that the main Shadow Guild guildhall is located very close to Castle Stone.  "
msgstr "소문에 의하면 쉐도우 길드의 중심지는 스톤성 근처에 위치하고 있다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:294
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:193
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The pass to the Frozen Highlands is unsafe to travel now because of the ogres and humans that took over Icewind Keep."
msgstr "프로즌 하이랜드로 지금 가는 것은 별로 좋지 않다네. 왜냐면 오그레들과 사악한 인간들이 아이스윈드성을 점령했거든.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:295
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:194
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Magyars are straightforward fighters, but the magyar matrons can attack with a deadly electrical blast."
msgstr "마자르는 전형적인 싸움꾼이지, 그리고 그는 엄청난 전기 일격을 구사할 수 있다네.."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:296
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:195
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This seemingly simple mace bursts into flames when used, simultaneously dealing a vicious flame attack on its victim and also protecting its wielder from fire."
msgstr "이 간단해 보이는 철퇴는 사용할 때 불꽃을 내지, 특히 적을 제대로 가격하면 말일세, 그리고 불에 대한 방어력도 갖추어 준다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:297
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:196
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Anthony Stone, among other things, promotes deserving Clerics to Priests."
msgstr "안소니 스톤은 성직자를 사제로 진급시킬 수 있지. ."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:298
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:197
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Erik Von Stromgard is the finest archer in the lands, and as such is given the task of training and promoting archers."
msgstr "에릭 본 스트롬가드는 이땅의 최고의 궁사라네. 그는 제자들을 훈련시키고 또 궁수로 임명하기도 한다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:299
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:198
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lord Stromgard is without a doubt the greatest archer in the land.  He always competes in the major competitions, and I've never seen him lose.  "
msgstr "스트롬가드 군주는 이땅 최고의 궁수라네. 그는 항상 정확히 적을 맞추네. 난 그가 실패하는 것을 본 적이 없다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:300
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:199
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lord Stone has the dual role of being the High Priest of the Realm and the overseer of underworld activity.  A very strange combination, I suppose, but he certainly does seem to keep the peace.  Long may he live!"
msgstr "스톤군주는 황실 최교주의 임무를 띄고 그리고 지하세계를 관리하는 임무도 맡고있지. 약간 이상한 역활이지만, 그는 평화를 지키기 위해 열심히 일하지. 그에게 영광이 있기를!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:301
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:200
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Icewind Keep was once Lord Stromgard's first castle, but he lost it to an attack of ogres and evil humans about a year ago.  He's moved to his second castle east of White Cap, but they say he's rather bitter about the loss and thinks only of revenge these days."
msgstr "아이스윈드 성채는 한때는 스트롬가드 군주의 첫번째 성이었지, 그러나 그는 수년전에 오그레와 사악한 인간의 공격에 그 성을 빼았겼었지. 그는 화이트캡 동쪽에 있는 두번째 성으로 옮겼으나  사람들은 그가 다시 그 성을 찾으려 한다더군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:302
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:201
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Shadow Guild is a new Thieves' Guild created to challenge Lord Stone's authority over the underworld.  They have two hideouts– one near Castle Ironfist and the other within spitting distance of Castle Stone.  It looks to me like they're spoiling for a fight!"
msgstr "쉐도우 길드는 도둑 길드가 스톤군주에 맞서기 위해 만든 새로운 길드이네. 두개가 있는데 - 하나는 아이언피스트 성 근처에, 또 하나는 스톤 성 근처에 있다네. 내가 보기에 그들은 전쟁준비를 하는것 같더군!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:303
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:202
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "White Cap is the third largest town in Enroth, and it's been suffering ever since Lord Stromgard lost Icewind Keep to the ogres last year.  The ogres keep raiding caravans trying to go through the pass.  If the caravans ever stop, it'll be the end for the town."
msgstr "화이트캡은 엔로스에서 세번째로 큰 도시이네. 그리고  스트롬가드 군주가 아이스윈드 키프를 작년에 오그레 한테 뺐겼을때 이곳으로 옮기면서 활성화 됐지. 오그레들은 여전히 이 곳을 지나가는 무역상인들을 공격한다네. 만일 무역 상인들이 이 타운에 오지 않는다면 이 타운은 끝장이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:304
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:203
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sure has been a long time since last summer, I think.  MUCH too long.  Something is wrong with the weather, and I'm beginning to think the gods are punishing us for supporting the Ironfist dynasty!"
msgstr "내 생각에는 마지막 여름을 본게 꽤 오래 전 일인것 같네. 아주 길었지. 날씨가 무슨 문제가 있는것 같고 이제는 내 생각인데 신이 아이언 피스트 왕가를 밀어주는 것을 징벌하려는것 같다니까.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:305
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:204
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If tales told be true, the Shadow Guild and the Temple of Baa are in cahoots to ruin the Kingdom.  I hear the Temple has been magically extending winter in these parts, and the ritual materials they need are being supplied by the Shadow Guild."
msgstr "만일 소문이 맞는다면 쉐도우 길드와 마아의 신전은 같이 이 왕국을 무너뜨리려는것 같네. 내가 듣기론 신전이 마법적으로 겨울을 길게 하고 그 의식에 필요한 것들을 쉐도우 길드로부터 얻는다는군.."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:306
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:205
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you've ever seen a sorcerer try to fly near a town, you may have been treated to the sight of the Dragon Towers shooting him down.  Dragon Towers shoot at anything that flies near a town, because they have trouble telling the difference between a man and a dragon.  Be careful!"
msgstr "만일 당신이 마을 근처에서 날라다니려는 마도사를 본적이 있다면 조심하라고 얘기해주게. 드라곤 타워에서 쏘아 떨어뜨릴테니까. 그들은 마을 근처에 날아다니는 것은 모두 쏘아 떨어뜨린다네. 그들이 하는 말은 용과 사람을 구별하지 못해서라더군. 조심하게나!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:307
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:206
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It sure is a bad thing that those ogres have control over Icewind keep!  Some of their human allies are archers, and they like to shoot at people going through the pass.  They've been real bad for business at White Cap, believe me."
msgstr "정말 그 오그레들이 아이스윈드 키프을 차지 했다는건 안 좋은 일일세. 궁수들중 몇 사람들이지만 그들 역시 그 곳을 지나는 사람들을 맞추는 걸 좋아한다네. 분명 그들은 화이트캡의 무역에 정말 안 좋은 영향을 끼친다네. 정말이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:308
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:207
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are a few important passes in the kingdom, and more and more they're controlled by monsters rather than the king's men.  If things go the way they're going much longer, we'll have to pay taxes to the devils instead of the king!"
msgstr "왕국으로 가는 몇 개의 중요한 길이 있는데 가면 갈수록 악마들이 점령하고 있다네. 만일 계속 그렇다면 우리는 통행세를 악마들한테 내야 될지도 모른다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:309
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:208
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A master of air I spoke with some time ago claims that someone is tinkering with the weather using ritual magic.  He says he traced the magic back to one of those temples of Baa that've been springing up all over the place recently.  "
msgstr "공기의 마스터와 몇번 누군가가 날씨를 가지고 장난치는 것같더고 얘기한적이 있다네. 그가 말하길 그가 추적해보니 바아의 신전에서 그랬다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:310
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:209
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The mountains around here have some mighty strange hermits living in them here and there.  Most are crazy, but a few go there to meditate on truths not meant for mortal man to know."
msgstr "이 산 여기저기에는 대단한 은둔자들이 살고 있다더군, 대부분이 미쳤지만 개중에는 정말 대단한 사람들도 있다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:311
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:210
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you look carefully in the mountains of this Kingdom, you might come across a pass that can cut days off your travel."
msgstr "만일 당신이 이 왕국의 산의 지형을 잘 살펴본다면 지름길을 발견해 더 빨리 목적지에 갈수 있을꺼네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:312
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:211
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Both Lord Stromgard and Lord Stone were key supporters of King Roland during the Succession Wars.  They owe their current positions to that support, and I think they have been amongst the most conscientious of the Lords of the Realm."
msgstr "스트롬가드군주와 스톤군주는 상속 전쟁때 정말 로날드왕한테 큰 도움을 주었다네. 아마 그들은 진실로 황실을 따르는 것 같네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:313
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:212
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dickson teaches expert mace just west of Castle Stromgard."
msgstr "딕슨은 스트롬가드성의 서쪽에서 베테랑 철퇴 기술를 가르친다네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:314
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:213
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jed teaches expert bow just west of Castle Stromgard."
msgstr "제드는 스트롬가드성 서쪽에서 베테랑 궁술을 가르친다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:315
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:214
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Morton teaches expert dark magic in the southwest of White Cap."
msgstr "모르튼은 화이트캡 남서쪽에서 베테랑 어둠의 마법을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:316
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:215
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard that Abdul has his resort in the south of Dragonsand.  Some resort!  It's probably filled with dragons."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는  압둘은 그의 리조트를 드라곤샌드 남쪽에 가지고 있다더군. 리조트 말이야! 아마 분명 용으로 꽉 차있을꺼야.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:317
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:216
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's a strange pyramid in the middle of Dragonsand.  No one has any idea who built it, though."
msgstr "드라곤샌드 중앙에는 이상한 피라미드가 있지. 아무도 누가 만들었는지 모른다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:318
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:217
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wyrms move very quickly on the ground, but cannot fly.  They attack with a poisonous breath attack."
msgstr "윔은 땅위에서는 재빠르게 움직이나 날지는 못한다네. 그들은 독성을 가지고 공격을 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:319
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:218
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fire Lizards are just one of a variety of draconian creatures found in Dragonsand."
msgstr "불의 도마뱀는 드라곤샌드에서 발견된 특이한 생물 중 하나이지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:320
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:219
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wielders of Cronos gain an incredible boost to their vitality.  They'll need anything they can get, because troubles and misfortune constantly follow this axe."
msgstr "크로노스의 마법사는 엄청난 힘을 가졌다네. 그들은 그들이 원하는 것들을 가질 수는 없었다네, 왜냐하면 이 도끼에는 항상 불운과 문제들이 따라다니니까.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:321
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:220
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A cave near Blackshire opened about the same time that people in the town started disappearing."
msgstr "블랙샤이어 근처의 동굴은 마을의 사람들이 사라짐과 동시에 생겨났네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:322
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:221
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The people of Blackshire have fallen under a terrible curse– they turn into werewolves at night!"
msgstr "블랙샤이어의 사람들은 엄청난 저주에 걸려있네- 그들은 밤에 늑대인간으로 변한다네! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:323
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:222
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An old temple sits in the center of Star Island.  Strangely enough, the number of statues on the island has slowly increased over time."
msgstr "별의 섬 중앙에 오래된 신전이 하나 있다네. 시간이 지날수록 그 섬의 조각들도 늘어난다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:324
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:223
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Werewolves are simply people that turn into a half-man, half-beast creature at night.  They are especially powerful under a full moon."
msgstr "늑대인간들은 반은 사람, 반은 괴물이고 그들은 보름달이 뜰때 더 강한 힘을 발휘한다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:325
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:224
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Air elementals flitter about in the valley between the Frozen Highlands and Dragonsand.  Though the weakest elementals, they're fast and have a nasty electrical attack."
msgstr "공기의 정령들은 프로즌 하이랜드와 드라곤샌드의 계곡에 살고 있다네. 제일 약하지만 그들은 빠르고 잔인한 전기 공격을 할 수 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:326
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:225
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The sword of a mighty warrior, Hercules confers a huge boost to might and endurance, but at the cost of the wielder's intellect."
msgstr "제일 강한 전사의 검, 허클리스는 강한 힘과 인내력을 주지만 지성이 감소된다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:327
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:226
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No one has been promoted to high priest in ages.  I wonder what Anthony Stone requires from Priests for that promotion?"
msgstr "수년동안 아무도 최고 주교로 임명받지는 못했지. 난 안소니 스톤이 주교들한테 어떤 임무를 주길래 그러는지 궁굼하다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:328
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:227
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The island at the center of Star Lake is home to some monsters straight from the heart of hell!  I heard about someone who rowed out there one night with some friends and these huge snake creatures came boiling up out of the ground.  They had to but look you in the eye to turn you right to stone!  Anyway, this guy was the only one to make it back alive, he says, and he did it by running and not looking back! "
msgstr "별의 호수 중심에 있는 섬은 지옥의 심장에서 나온 괴물들의 집이라네! 내가 듣기론 누군가가 친구와 거기서 하룻밤을 보낼려하는데 거대한 뱀이 땅에서 나와서 그들을 쳐다보자마자 그들은 돌이 되었다는군! 그들 중 한명만 살아나왔는데 그는 뒤도 안보고 도망쳐서 그랬다는군!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:329
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:228
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A terrible curse has befallen the people in this area, and everyone thinks they know the source– it's that new cave that opened itself up in the side of the mountain south of town.  Someone needs to go in there and end the curse, but bravery's at a premium in Blackshire, these days."
msgstr "이 지방에 사는 사람들한테는 끔찍한 저주가 걸려있다네. 그리고 모두들 원천이 어딘지 알고 있는것 같네. 바로 마을 남쪽에 있는 새로생긴 동굴이라네. 누군가가 그곳에 가서 저주를 풀어야만 하네. 그러나 그런 영웅이 이곳에는 없네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:330
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:229
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dragonsand is the home and breeding ground of the dragons of Enroth.  Never will you find a more fierce or terrible monster than a dragon, and never will you find one that is gentle or kind.  "
msgstr "드라곤샌드는 엔로스의 살아있는 용들의 고향이지. 아마 당신은 용보다 강하고 무서운 괴물은 만나지 못할 걸세. 그리고 그만큼 친절한 것도.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:331
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:230
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Circus of the Sun likes to set up alongside the road between Blackshire and Star Lake.  They're around here every year during April.  It's a good show– well worth the money to go see it!"
msgstr "태양의 원은  블랙샤이어와 별의 호수의 사이 길에 세워지지. 그들은 매년 4월이면 이곳에 온다네. 매우 재미있는 쇼지- 가서 돈내는게 아깝지 않다니까! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:332
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:231
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The road leading west from Blackshire has gone from the safest road in the Kingdom to the most dangerous.  West of here lies Pleasant Valley, and the name has long since become a joke.  Now that valley is a barren and ruined land, crawling with those hideous new monsters– the devils."
msgstr "블랙샤이어에서 서쪽의 안전한 왕국으로 가는 길은 없어지고 이젠 위험한 길만 남았네.  여기서 서쪽으로는 프리젠트 발리가 있지만 그 이름은 이미 조크가 되버렸네.  이제 그 계곡은 황무지가 되버렸고 새로운 괴물들이 자리잡고 있다네. - 악마들말일세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:333
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:232
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just go west down the road from Blackshire a few days and you're sure to see some devils.  You better be able to run pretty fast, though!"
msgstr "블랙샤이어에서 서쪽으로 며칠만 내려간다면 당신은 분명 악마들을 만나게 될걸세. 아마 당신은 빨리 도망가는게 좋을거야!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:334
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:233
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lord Kilburn disappeared while patrolling the road leading from Blackshire to Pleasant Valley.  At least, that's what people are saying.  If you're looking for him, you might want to start looking around there."
msgstr "킬번군주는 블랙샤이어와 프리젠트 발리를 순찰하다가 사라졌다네. 최소한 사람들은 그렇게 말하더군. 만일 당신이 그를 찾으려 한다면 그곳부터 시작하는게 좋을 걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:335
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:234
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We all saw the king fleeing from the devils toward Castle Kriegspire a while back.  Haven't heard from him since.  Sad.  I think the devils will take us all, before long."
msgstr "우리는 모두 왕이 악마에게 도망치다 크리그스파이어성 앞에서 사라지는 걸 보았네. 그때부터 들은 소식이 없지. 슬프다네. 내 생각엔 곧 악마들이 우리도 덮칠걸세. 곧.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:336
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:235
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ambrose teaches expert dark magic in the town of Blackshire."
msgstr "암브로스는 블랙샤이어에서 베테랑 어둠의 마법을 가르친다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:337
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:236
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Castle Kriegspire, at one time, was the center of magical experimentation in creating creatures.  Now, it's abandoned and the creatures run rampant inside.  The volcano it rests in was created to keep all the monsters in."
msgstr "크리그스파이어성은 한때,  모든 마법생물들의 중심지였지. 지금은 버려졌고 괴물들만 살지만 화산은 여전히 휴식을 취하며 괴물들을 불러들이고 있다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:338
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:237
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Agar, one of Archibald's sorcerers, was the most skilled of the experimenters in Kriegspire.  His monsters are the ones crawling around the castle now.  He left with the rest of the mages, but no one knows where he went to."
msgstr "아가르, 아치발드의 마도사 중 한명, 크리그스파이어의 최고의 마도사. 그의 괴물들이 성을 돌아다니고 있지. 그는 그의 부하들과 사라졌고 아무도 그가 어디있는지 모른다네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:339
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:238
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though weaker than dragons, drakes are nothing to sneer at.  These flying reptiles have powerful elemental attacks."
msgstr "용보다 약해보이지만 이 드라크스를 비웃을께 아니라네. 이 날아다니는 것들은 강한 원소 공격을 한다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:340
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:239
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some of the minotaurs escaped from Kriegspire and now roam in and around the volcano surrounding the old castle."
msgstr "몇 마리의 미노타우루스는 크리그스파이어에서 더망쳐 나와 오래된 성 주변의 화산을 황무지로 만들고 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:341
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:240
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Earth elementals prowl around the area of Kriegspire.  Free from the mages that summoned them, theses elementals look to destroy whatever they come across."
msgstr "땅의 정령은 크리그스파이어 주변을 맴돌고 있지. 그들을 소환한 마법사로부터 해방된채. 그들은 그들 앞을 막는 모든 것을 다 파괴시킬려고 한다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:342
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:241
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No armor in the world can match Apollo for protection against elemental spells.  Unfortunately, the armor gains its power from sapping the endurance of its wearer."
msgstr "이 세상의 어떤 갑옷도 정령들의 원소마법공격에 대한 방어로선 아폴로와 견줄수 없다네. 그러나 이 갑옷은 착용자의 인내략을 감소시킨다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:343
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:242
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Superior Temple of Baa was constructed about a year ago against the mountains east of Castle Kriegspire.  Unlike most of their temples, it's closed to the public.  You'll have to join them if you ever want to be let in."
msgstr "크리그스파이어성의 동쪽의 산에서 바아 신전이 만들어졌다네. 그들의 신전은 거의 공용이고 만일 당신이 그 신전들을 구경하고 싶으면 그들과 한 패가 되야만 한다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:344
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:243
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The village of Edenbrook wouldn't be around these days if it weren't for King Roland and his men.  They saved it from a horde of devils a little while back."
msgstr "에덴브룩의 마을은 만일 롤랜드 왕과 부하들이 없더라면 존재하지 않았을 꺼네. 그들이 악마들의 공격에서 이 마을을 구해냈지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:345
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:244
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When the king fled to Castle Kriegspire he was followed by an enormous army of devils.  A couple of days later a few dozen devils were seen leaving the old volcano the castle occupies, but the King himself hasn't been seen since."
msgstr "왕이 크리그스파이어성으로 도망쳤을때 악마의 군대들이 뒤따르고 있었지. 며칠 후에 성에서 몇 무리의 악마들이 도망쳐나왔고 그때부터 왕은 본 적이 없다네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:346
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:245
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rarely do humans and dragons get along, but the death knights have formed some sort of pact with a group of dragons in a keep on the north side of the mountains near Kriegspire."
msgstr "좀처럼 사람과 용은 같이다니지는 않지만 죽음의 기사들은 크리그스파이어 근처의 산에서 용들과 같이 지낸다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:347
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:246
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nicholas can show you expert techniques with the magic of light in the village of Kriegspire."
msgstr "니콜라스는 크리그스파이어의 마을에서 베테랑 빛의 마법을 가르친다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:348
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:247
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Titans are second in power only to the mighty dragons.  Not only do titans possess an incredible electric attack, they are skilled in mind magic and favor the Psychic Shock spell."
msgstr "타이탄은 용 다음으로 강력한 적이네. 그들은 전기공격만 하는 것이 아니고 그들은 정신마법도 쓸 수 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:349
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:248
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fire elementals seem to like Hermit's Isle, though who would summon them there is a mystery."
msgstr "불의 원소는 꼭 은둔자의 섬같네, 누가 그들을 소환했는지는 미스테리이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:350
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:249
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although this crown reduces the reaction time of its wearer, it also makes the wearer incredibly resistant to elemental magic."
msgstr "이 왕관은 사용자의 반사신경을 감소시키는듯 하나 원소마법에 강한 저항력을 가지고 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:351
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:250
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hermit's Island has recently become home to the Supreme Temple of Baa.  They have found an ancient installation to put their temple in, and are no doubt performing dark experiments as we speak."
msgstr "은둔자의 섬은 최근 바아신전의 고향이 되버렸지. 그들은 고대의 주문으로 신전을 보호하는것을 발견했고 그들이 나쁘다는것은 말할 필요도 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:352
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:251
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dragonsand, the great desert of Enroth, is home to all the worst monsters in the world.  Dragons, titans, and other oversized killer monsters roam the sands freely on whatever errands such creatures find important.  Humans foolish enough to travel the desert learn to run and hide very quickly, or they don't last long."
msgstr "드라곤샌드, 엔로스 최고의 사막, 그곳은 모든 최악의 괴물들의 고향이지. 드라곤, 타이탄 그리고 많은 괴물들이 사막을 돌아다니지. 아주 멍청하거나 죽고 싶어하는 사람들만 그곳으로 여행을 떠나지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:353
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:252
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Once the greenest and most fertile of lands in Enroth, Pleasant Valley has fallen under a curse that has caused the plants to wither, the animals to sicken, and the people to leave.  It is a barren land now, and no one wants to live there."
msgstr "한때는 엔로스에서 가장 푸르고 아름다운 땅이었으나 어떤 고약한 저주에 의해 식물들은 마르고 동물들은 병들고 사람들은 떠났네. 이제 황폐해졌고 아무도 그곳에 살지 않는다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:354
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:253
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shortly after the Night of Shooting Stars, the blight began to eat away at Pleasant Valley.  In a few short years, nearly all the plants and animals had sickened and died, and the villagers and farmers living in the valley had to move east to find food.  The blight has shown no signs of abating– rather, it has accelerated, and will one day cover the entire continent unless something is done to stop it."
msgstr "슛팅 스타의 밤이 있은 다음에, 충해들이 프리젠트 발리를 좀 먹어들어 갔다네. 몇 년이 지난 후에, 식물들과 동물들이 죽어가기 시작했네.  그리고 사람들은 음식을 찾기위해 그 곳을 떠나갔고  만일 충해를 누군가가 멈추지 않는다면 그것은 계속퍼져 나중에 전 세계를 망쳐버릴걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:355
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:254
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most of the devils you see in Pleasant Valley are in fact worker or soldier devils.  They are organized like ants, only they have intelligent leaders.  The leaders can fly, and their best leaders can use human speech and writing."
msgstr "당신이 프리젠트 발리에서 보는 대부분의 악마들은 군인이거나 노동자이네. 그들은 개미처럼 움직이며 그들은 지성을 갖춘 리더도 있네. 리더는 날수 있으며 인간의 말과 글을 쓸줄안다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:356
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:255
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though powerful, the devils are far from invincible.  King Roland fought and won a battle at Sweet Water Pass by outmaneuvering them and outthinking them.  They're tough, but they die like anything else does when you put a sword through it!"
msgstr "강해보이지만, 악마들은 그렇지만도 안네. 롤랜드왕이 스윗 워터 패스에서 싸워 이길때 그들은 칼로 찌르면 그냥 보통 생물처럼 죽어가더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:357
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:256
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "These legendary boots make the wearer a blur, able to react instantly to any situation."
msgstr "이 전설의 부츠는 사용자를 빠르게 해주며 어떤 상황에서도 빨리 움직일수 있게 해준다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:358
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:257
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The devils seem to swarm around a strange building near the remains of Sweet Water."
msgstr "스윗 워터 주위에 이상한 빌딩에는 악마들이 떼지어 다니는 것 같다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:359
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:258
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although the ruins of the buildings are still there, the town is completely destroyed.  No one lives there anymore."
msgstr "파괴의 빌딩이 아직 거기 있는 이상 , 타운은 완전히 파괴될걸세. 아무도 그곳에 살지도 않지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:360
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:259
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The forest of Blackwoode has been wiped out completely since the night of Shooting Stars."
msgstr "블랙우드의 나이트 오브 슛팅 스타 후에 완전히 재가 되버렸네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:361
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:260
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The devils seem to prefer fire attacks and enjoy attacking in large groups.  Some of the most powerful can cast spells from the fire school."
msgstr "악마들은 불 공격을 준비하고 수십명을 공격하는 걸 좋아하지. 제일 강한 마법들은 불의 마법 학교에서 배울 수도 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:362
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:261
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This odd amulet will grant its wearer extra vitality, spell points, and luck."
msgstr "이 이상한 부적은 사용자에게 엑스트라 생명력, 마법 포인트, 그리고 운을 준다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:363
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:262
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sweet Water used to be the most beautiful town in the kingdom, but no news has come from it since the Night of Shooting Stars.  I think the shooting star landed right on top of the town, leaving no survivors to tell the tale."
msgstr "스윗 워터는 옛날에 왕국에서 가장 아름다운 마을이 었다네. 그러나 나이트 오브 슛팅 스타 다음에는 아무 소식도 들리지 않더군. 내 생각에는 그날 이후로 그곳에서 살아 남은 자가 없는 것 같다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:364
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:263
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Oracle had warned of the coming of devils from the sky in writings long ago.  I don't think anyone remembers, and of those who do, no one thinks the Night of Shooting Stars and the devils are connected.  "
msgstr "오라클은 옛날에 악마에 대해 경고를 했었다네. 내 생각에는 아무도 기억을 못하는것 같더군, 그리고 기억한다해도 아무도 나이트 오브 슛팅 스타와 악마가 연결됐다고는 생각하지 않을걸세.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:365
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:264
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I met a man who went to discover the fate of the town of Sweet Water, and he says that the place was burnt to the ground by the devils.  The devils have built a strange tower near the old town, and eerie noises come from it every twenty minutes.  He would have explored further, but there were so many devils near the tower he didn't dare."
msgstr "난 스윗 워터 마을이 파멸한 이유를 찾아내려는 자를 만났다네. 그가 말하길 마을은 악마들 때문에 완전히 재가 되버렸다더군. 그들은 이상한 마을을 만들었으며 20분마다 오싹해지는 비명소리가 들려온다더군. 그는 더 멀리 여행을 한다더군, 악마들도 개의치 않고 말일세.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:366
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:265
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you noticed how Temples of Baa have been sprouting up throughout the kingdom?  They're everywhere, and I for one think it's an ominous development.  Although they offer free healing, they don't seem to be doing it out of kindness– there must be a method to their madness!"
msgstr "어떻게 바아신전이 왕국에 자리잡게 됐는지 알고 있는가? 그들은 모든 곳에 있다네. 그들은 공짜 치료을 해주지만 정말 친절함에 하는 것은 아닌것 같네. 분명 뭔가가 있을꺼야!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:367
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:266
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The queen left quite a while ago for her home country of Erathia.  People are getting worried– what if something happened to her during her trip?"
msgstr "여왕 캐서린이 그녀 고향  엘라시아로 간지도 꽤 됐다네. 사람들이 걱정하기 시작했지. - 만일 그녀한테 무슨 일이라도 생기면 어떻하지?    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:368
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:267
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most of the shipping in Enroth follows a set schedule.  If you're in the right place at the right time, the shipping companies can take you great distances quickly and cheaply."
msgstr "엔로스의 대부분의 해운업은 스케줄에 따라 움직이지. 만일 당신이 제대로 스케줄에 맞춘다면 해운회사들이 당신을 빨리 싼 값에 먼곳까지 데려다 줄걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:369
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:268
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The legends say that the great ship used in the Crossing lies buried under a giant stone tomb in the middle of Dragonsand.  There must have been a lake or ocean long ago where the desert is now, for the ship to end up in the middle of the desert!"
msgstr "전설에 의하면 위대한 배가 거대한 돌비석 아래 묻혀있다더군, 드라곤샌드 중앙에서 말일세. 아마 이 사막자리가 옛날에는 바다나 호수였을꺼네. 그러니 그런 전설이 있겠지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:370
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:269
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you touch one of the obelisks scattered around the kingdom, you'll get a part of a riddle no one's yet unraveled.  People say that a great treasure lies buried somewhere in Enroth, and the one who finds the answer to the riddle will find the treasure."
msgstr "만일 당신이 왕국에 있는 몇 개의 오벨리스크를 만지면 당신은 아무도 모르는 몇 개의 암호를 발견할걸세 . 사람들은 엔로스 어딘가에 위대한 보물이 감춰줘있다고 하고 그 암호를 푸는 자는 보물을 가질 수 있다고 하지 "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:371
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:270
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware the Dragon Towers you'll find near every major settlement.  They will shoot a fireball at anyone flying.  I guess they're meant to protect the towns from dragons and other flying monsters, but they can't tell the difference between a man and a monster."
msgstr "타운에 있는 드라곤타워를 조심하게나. 그들은 날아다니는 모든 것을 공격한다네. 그들은 물론 날아다니는 용이나 괴물들로부터 타운을 보호키위해 그런다지만 사람과 괴물을 구별 못하는 것 같네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:372
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:271
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some people are saying the Temple of Baa and the devils are in league!  It makes sense– the temple first appeared a few months after the Night of Shooting Stars, and we all know the devils and that night are related!"
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 바아 신전과 악마들이 결탁했다고 하더군. 그건 맞는 것 같네.- 신전은 나이트 오브 슛팅 스타 다음에 처음으로 생겨났지, 그리고 사람들은 이제 그 말이 사실이라는 것을 알게 됐다네!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:373
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:272
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's a rumor going 'round that Slicker Silvertongue, Wilbur Humphrey's representative on the High Council, is a traitor.  People are saying he's been seen in several Temples of Baa, and everyone knows the temple is against the king!"
msgstr "소문에 의하면 스리커 실버톤그, 윌버 헴프레이의 의회 대변인이 배신자라더군. 사람들은 그가 바신전과 결탁되있다고 하고 모두들 신전이 왕을 적대시 한다는 것을 알고 있다네!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:374
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:273
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Weather sure has turned sour since the Night of Shooting Stars.  Every summer seems colder than the last.  Why, I'd venture to say last summer was the coldest winter I've ever experienced!  'Course, that's an exaggeration, but you know what I mean.  Something's wrong!"
msgstr "날씨는 나이트 오브 슛팅 스타 다음에 심술 궂어졌네. 여름은 지난 번보다 더 추워졌다네. 지난 여름이 어떤 겨울보다 추웠다네! 말도 안되는 일이지. 뭔가 잘못된게 틀림없네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:375
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:274
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Doesn't it seem there's been more floods and earthquakes since the king disappeared?  It's as though the gods are angry with the king and his dynasty.  Perhaps they have lost the Mandate of Heaven."
msgstr "왕이 사라진 후부터 홍수나 지진이 더 많이 일어난다고 생각하지 않나? 신이 꼭 왕과 황실때문에 노여워하는 것 같네.  어쩌면 하늘의 계시을 잃어버려서 그런지도 모르지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:376
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:275
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though the Temple of Baa may offer free healing, it seems to me that more things go wrong, and more people get hurt, when one of their temples is nearby.  Could it be they are cursing the people near them, and then healing them for some bizarre reason?"
msgstr "바아 신전이 공짜로 치료를 해 주지만 내 생각에 뭔가가 잘못된 것 같네. 신전 주위에 있는 사람들은 이상하게도 많이 다치지. 바아 신전이 모두 꾸민 일인가?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:377
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:276
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you ever seen Archibald's statue in the library behind Castle Ironfist?  It is amazingly lifelike… almost as though he was turned to stone rather than sculpted."
msgstr "아이언피스트 성 뒤에 있는 도서관에서 아치발드의 동상을 본적이 있나? 대단히 신기하지… 난 그가 그냥 돌로 변할 줄 알았을 정도니까. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:378
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:277
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The western province of Pleasant Valley has undergone a shocking transformation in the last few years.  Once it was a rich, fertile farming region.  Now all the plants have died from a terrible blight, and the water has dried up.  All the animals sickened or died, and all the people had to move away to find food to eat."
msgstr "프리젠트 발리의 서쪽에 있는 땅은 몇 년전의 일때문에 완전 페허가 되어버렸지. 식물들은 죽어가고 물은 말라버렸네. 사람들은 음식을 찾아 다들 떠나고 말일세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:379
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:278
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ancient legends say that all the greatest artifacts from before the Silence came with the ship our distant ancestors used to get here from their homeland.  They say the voyage was so long that three generations of people were born, lived, and died while aboard the ship!  How's that for a whopper of a tale?!"
msgstr "고대전설에 의하면 모든 고대의 유물들은 우리의 조상들이 고향에서 이곳에 올때 타고 온 배에 있다더군. 그 배는 3대동안 항해해 왔고 많은 사람들이 그 배에서 태어나고 죽고 했다더군. 믿을 수 있나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:380
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:279
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Erathia is the second major continent to be settled in the world.  It is a lot wilder and more unsafe than Enroth, and all the little kingdoms there are always bickering and fighting."
msgstr "엘라시아는 이 세계에서 2번째로 만들어진 큰 나라이지. 그곳은 엔로스보다 안전하진 않네. 그리고 그곳 황실은 매일 싸운다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:381
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:280
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The islands east of Enroth are all part of the 'Kingdom' of Regna.  They were settled by the most nasty and violent of people hundreds of years ago, and they haven't changed their ways.  They are pirates and mercenaries to a man, and have no regard for the sorrow they cause by siding with petty tyrants and usurpers like Archibald was."
msgstr "엔로스 동쪽의 섬은 모두 레그나 왕국 소속이지. 그곳은 수 백년전에 징그럽고 잔인한 사람들에 의해 만들어 졌지. 그리고 그들은 그 방식을 버리질 않았네. 남자들은 해적이나 용병이 되고 그들은 어떤일을 해도 죄책감을 느끼질 않는다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:382
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:281
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If the old tales are true, the dwarves were once just like the rest of us, but before the Crossing, the dwarves lived in a place where they and everything around them weighed a lot more.  The stories say this made them very short and very strong, and they haven't changed since."
msgstr "만일 전설이 사실이라면, 드워프들은 한때 우리랑 똑 같았었다더군, 그러나 갈라지기 전에 그들은 모든 것이 그들보다 엄청 무거운 곳에서 살았었고 그 때문에 그들이 키기 작아지고 힘이 세어졌다하더군. 그리고 그때부터 아무 변동이 없고.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:383
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't like Mondays."
msgstr "난 월요일이 싫어."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:384
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best armor shop in all of Enroth is the Enchanted Hauberk.  The proprietor's name is Teddy, but he hates to be called that.  Safer to refer to him as Theodore."
msgstr "엔로스 최고의 무기상점은 엔첸티드 휴버크이다. 소유자의 이름은 테디, 그러나 그는 그렇게 불리우는 것을 싫어하네. 티오돌라고 하는게 안전할꺼네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:385
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best magic shop in the kingdom is Mighty Magicks.  It is possible to find there the most unusual and powerful enchanted items for sale anywhere."
msgstr "왕국에 있는 최고의 마법 상점은  마이티 매직스라네. 그곳에서는 무지 강하고 진귀한 마법 아이템들을 취급한다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:386
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Be careful with even ordinary objects.  If something is magical, get an expert like me to identify it before you sell it for pennies on the gold piece of its true worth.  You can be surprised by what there is to find out there, and you might sell off something very useful."
msgstr "평범한 물건에도 조심하게. 만일 그게 마법적인 것이라면 먼저 무었인지 알아보는게 좋네. 당신은 많이 놀랄것이며 필요한 물건들을 많이 찻을 수 있네 "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:387
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The lands to the far west of the continent used to be green and fertile, but have wasted to an unhappy land of cracked earth, bad smells, and barren landscapes."
msgstr "서쪽에 있는 먼땅은 녹색이고 풍요로왔으나 지금은 나쁜 냄새와 세상에서 최고로 더러운 지역이 됐다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:388
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most civilized areas you'll find are in the east.  While there are some small towns and villages located to the west, don't count on finding many."
msgstr "당신이 만날 대분분의 문명은 동쪽에 있다. 서쪽에는 조그만 타운과 빌라지만 있을뿐.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:389
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This ghastly place is named for all of the undead that prowl it.  Rumor has it that people killed in the mire return as undead guardians of the place.  "
msgstr "이 소름끼치는 장소는 언데드들의 장소이다. 소문엔 습지에서 죽은 사람들이 언데드가 된다는 얘기가 있다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:390
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are some places you can't get to by boat, during different times of the year.  You should plan your trips carefully to avoid inconvenience."
msgstr "보트로 갈수 없는 곳도 있다. 여행을 할때 계획을 잘 세워야할걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:391
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many areas of the oceans are home to giant sea serpents.  Though not much danger to ships, they can be lethal to people, water walking or even bystanders on the coast."
msgstr "바다의 많은 부분은 거대한 사탄들의 집이다. 배로 가면 괜찮지만, 물위를 걸을때나 해안에 서 있는것만으로 치명적인 공격을 줄수 있다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:392
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you are wounded enough, you will fall unconscious.  Taking a wound while unconscious almost always leads to death."
msgstr "만일 상처를 얻었다면 무의식 상태로도 간다. 무의식 상태서 공격당하면 거의 죽음으로 간다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:393
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mixing poppysnaps, phirna root, or widoweeps berries with water in an empty potion bottle will make a simple potion.  These simple potions have limited beneficial effects, but are stronger than the herbs by themselves."
msgstr "포피스넵스, 피라냐 룻 그리고 위도윕스베리를 물과 함께 빈 포션 병에 섞으면 간단한 포션이 나온다네. 물론 한계가 있지만 허브보다는 강하다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:394
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Let me tell you the effects of the simple potions.  Red potions are minor healing, blue potions are minor spell point gain, and yellow potions are a boost to all seven statistics."
msgstr "내가 심플 포션의 결과를 가리켜 주지. 붉은 포션은 약간의 힐링, 파란 포션은 약간의 마법포인트 를 올려주고 노란 포션는 모든 7개 능력를 올려준다.."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:395
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Because skills get so difficult to learn once you've achieved a high level in them, it is much more efficient to learn many skills to a moderate level, rather than a couple of skills to a high level."
msgstr "높은 레벨이 되면 기술들이 배우기 어려워 진다.  보통의 레벨에서 배우는게 더 유용하지, 오히려 높은 기술때 보단 났지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:396
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Kriegspire, one of the centers of magical experimentation, has been swallowed by an enormous volcano.  Surely one of their experiments must have gone completely awry."
msgstr "크리그스파이어, 마법 연습지 중의 하나. 거대한 화산에 묻혀 있다. 그들의 실험은 분명히 잘못된것 같네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:397
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The three most important things to remember in a battle are:  Don't get surrounded, concentrate on killing a single enemy before moving on to another, and don't be afraid to run.  No shame in living another day!"
msgstr "전투에서 가장 중요한 3개는: 포위되지 마라. 도망갈때는 도망가라. 그리고 한번에 하나의 적만 죽이는데 신경써라!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:398
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A finely crafted weapon is a rare find, but a magic weapon is a treasure indeed.  Magic weapons are often more damaging, faster, and sometimes even have spells imbedded into them.  Your skill is important, but having a great weapon certainly doesn't hurt either."
msgstr "좋고 특수한 무기는 희귀하게 발견되네. 그러나 마법무기는 보물들 안에 있네. 마법무기가 대미지를 많이 입히고 빠르네. 그리고 어떤 것은 마법을 가지고 있기도 하지. 당신의 기술이 중요하네. 그냥 좋은 무기만 있으면 되는게 아니네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:399
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When fighting in a place that is very hot or cold, try using the opposite kind of spell on your enemies.  Often they are resistant or immune to the element they're used to living in."
msgstr "싸우는 장소가 매우 덥거나 추울때는 그거와 상반된 마법을 적에게 사용해보게. 그들은 환경에 적응해 있기에 같은 원소마법은 별로 통하지 않을걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:400
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some sorcerers have cheated death itself in their attempts to gain power.  These sorcerers trade their lives for eternal life as an undead.   I can't imagine the lust for power that would cause someone to trade their soul.  Liches are powerful and determined; you should be careful fighting them. "
msgstr "어떤 마도사들은 그들의 죽음으로 마법을 더 얻기위해 속임수를 쓰지. 이런 마도사들은 그들의 인생을 언데드 라이프와 교환하지. 난 힘을 얻기 위해 영혼과 바꾼다는것을 상상할수 없네.  그들은 강하고 힘세니 그들과 싸울때는 조심해야 하네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:401
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Light magic makes up one half of the Mirrored Path.  Light cannot exist without dark, nor dark without light.  The spells in the school of light are what most people would call 'holy.'  It is difficult to find training in this path, but the rewards are certainly worth the effort."
msgstr "빛의 마법은 일과 2분의 일의 길을 반사하네. 빛이 없으면 어둠이 없고 어둠이 없으면 빛도 없다네.  빛의 마법 의 주문은 사람들이 '홀리.'라고 한다네. 이걸 훈련하는 곳은 상당히 어려우나 결과는 많은 가치를 준다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:402
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Merchants respond to a customer's skill in bargaining.  It's important to only use your best negotiator when you buy or sell anything with a  merchant. "
msgstr "상인 고객들과의 거래에 책임을 지네. 최고의 협상가를 구해 물건을 파고 살때 거래하는 건 상당히 중요하다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:403
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A group of bandits called the Dragoons are now preying on merchants travelling between Free Haven and New Sorpigal."
msgstr "산적무리들을 용기병이라 부르지. 그들은 프리헤이븐과 뉴 소르피갈로 가는 무역상인들을 약탈하고 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:404
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A while back I was exploring the Star Lake area, and saw a bunch of statues on the island at the center of the lake.  They were marvelously carved– the most lifelike statues I've ever seen.  I wonder who put them there?"
msgstr "내가 별 호수 근방를 여행할때, 섬 호수 중앙에서 많은 상들을 봤네. 그것들은 환상으로 조각됐지- 내가 본것중에 최고 였네. 누거 거기다 놓았는지 궁금하군? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:405
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The law of the land is simple:  Do not murder, do not threaten, do not bribe.  Begging is frowned upon, as is keeping company with known criminals.  Reputation is everything."
msgstr "이 땅의 법은 간단하네: 살인 금지. 협박 금지, 뇌물 금지. 구걸은 범죄자들이나 하는 것이다. 명성이 최고임. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:406
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Enroth is ruled by a king, and the council of five lords.  These six people handle the laws, rules, and matters of state for all of Enroth."
msgstr "엔로스는 왕과 의회의 다섯 군주로 움직이네. 이 여섯명이 법을 만들고 진행하며 엔로스의 문제들을 해결하네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:407
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When someone has a chest or other lock they don't want you to get into, they'll usually trap it rather than lock it.  Everyone knows that a determined thief will eventually get through a lock, but not every determined thief will survive the trap once he opens the chest."
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 상자나 감긴것들을 갖고 있네, 그들이 열고 싶어하지 않는. 보통 그들은 잠구는 것보다 함정을 만드는걸 좋아하지. 모두가 다 알다시피 도적들은 그런 것을 잘 열지만 대부분은 �C에 걸려 죽는 다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:408
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some locks are bound by magical enchantments.  You won't be able to open them, no matter how fine a locksmith you are, unless you have the magical key necessary."
msgstr "어떤 자물쇠는 마법적으로 잠겨있네. 당신이 꽤 유명한 자물쇠 제조공라도 그걸 열수는 없네. 마법 키를 가지기 전에는.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:409
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:434
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you heard of the Temple of Baa?  They're wonderful!  My family was hungry and they fed us when no one else would.  All we had to do was promise to come back!"
msgstr "바아 신전에 대해 들어봤나? 그들은 대단하다네! 우리들이 배가 고플때 그들이 공짜로 도와주었네. 우리가 한일은 다시 돌아오겠다고 약속한 거였지!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:410
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "People often remark at how lucky I am.  It's not so much that I'm lucky, it's that I look on the bright side of everything.  You'd be amazed at how trivial some of your worst problems are if you look at them from the right angle."
msgstr "사람들은 내가 운이 좋다고 생각하지. 그러나 대단한건 아니네. 모든 걸 밝게 보는 거지. 만일 안되는 일들을 좋게 생각하며 보면 세상이 달라질걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:411
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Every now and then there's someone who needs to go to a strange place, like Castle Kriegspire.  Like this one fellow the other day, he paid me well to help him and his servants carry stuff over the lip of Kriegspire Mountain and into its center.  His servants didn't look too healthy, either, but they never got tired.  Smelled bad, too."
msgstr "모든 순간에도 어떤 사람들은 이상한 장소에 가야하지, 크리그스파이어 성처럼. 이 사람은 어떤 날 내게 와 그가 크리그스파이어 산의 센터에 올라가는 걸 도와준다면 돈을 주겠다고 했지. 그의 부하들은 튼튼해 보이지 않았지, 그러나 지치지도 않았지만 나쁜 냄새가 났지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:412
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Paradise Valley is no more.  All that's left from the Night of the Shooting Stars is a barren wasteland.  I've seen it, but I didn't have the courage to venture into it.  I'm not sure what sort of acts the people of Paradise Valley did to justify that sort of Heavenly retribution, but they must have been foul indeed."
msgstr "파라다이스 밸리는 없네. 슈팅스타의 밤, 뒤에는 쓰레기만 남았지. 난 봤네. 그러나 그 안을 돌아볼 용기는 없었지. 그 곳에 있는 사람들이 무슨 짓을 했는지 모르겠지만 잘못한 것은 확실하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:413
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah!  There's nothing like sitting next to the fire at home with a glass of wine, my dog at my feet, and a good balance sheet to work on.  That's the life!"
msgstr "아! 집에 편이 쉬는것 만한 것은 없다네. 모든게 편안한 것, 그게 인생이라네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:414
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's no two ways about it– you always need gold.  Everything has a price; hopefully you can pay it."
msgstr "그것에 다른 길은 없네.-항상 골드가 필요하고, 모든 것은 돈이 있어야 하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:415
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Terrible things have been happening lately.  I heard about a village that was washed away in the recent heavy rains when their local creek overflowed its banks, and the news from Sweet Water is so bad there's been no news– people are saying the entire town was wiped out!"
msgstr "너무 안 좋은일이 일어났네. 내가 듣기로는 큰 비로 빌라지가 씻겨 내려같다더군, 그리고  스윗 워터에서 소식도 안좋더군. 사람들이 그러는데 타운이 아예 없어졌다는군!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:416
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard the tales of the supper served to Roland's expedition the night before they left.  I wonder if any of them expected to return based on the accounts I've heard of that feast.  The luxury afforded to those men certainly sounded to me like some sort of last meal."
msgstr "난 롤랜드가 떠나기 전에 그가 마지막으로 먹었던 저녁때 내가 서브하며 얘기를 들었네. 그들은 모두 돌아온다고 했지만 내가 보기에는 마지막 저녁처럼 보였네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:417
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our horses around here are thankfully very tame, but there are some centaurs– half man, half horse– roaming the countryside of Erathia.  The centaurs like to gather in tribes and make war on the humans and elves living near them."
msgstr "다행히 여기 주변의 우리말들은 매우 순하지만, 어떤 것들은 반신반마이지.  이라시아 구석에 많이 돌아다니지. 그들은 그들끼리 모여 살며 사람이나 엘프와 전쟁을 하려들지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:418
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The sewers under Free Haven house all sorts of interesting things.  I've heard stories of hideouts, temples, treasure, and well, sewage.  I don’t know which to believe, but it certainly seems like an interesting place."
msgstr "프리 헤이븐집들 밑의 하수관은 재미있게 배치�榮募超�,  내가 듣기로는 신전, 보물, 하수등이 그곳에 있다더군. 어떤걸 믿어야 할진 모르겠지만 재미있는 곳 같네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:419
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware taking long trips for a few days– three planets are in retrograde, and one is actually on its third epicycle stage this month, all while Leo is ascending against Pisces' lateral movement.  Don't say I didn’t warn you!"
msgstr "장거리 여행을 할때는 조심하게. - 3개의 별이 역행하고 하나는 사실 이달에는 3번째 주전원이 있네. 레오 자리가 물고기 자리위로 올라갈때, 내가 경고 했다고 발설하지 말게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:420
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are some places you can't get to during different parts of the year by boat.  You should plan your trips carefully to avoid inconvenience."
msgstr "계절이 바뀌면 보트로도 못갈수 있는 곳이 생기지. 여행계획을 짤때 심사숙고 하는 게 좋네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:421
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Magical flying is constrained to a certain altitude, so certain high mountains will block magical flight.  Given all the advantages of flight, that's really a very minor drawback."
msgstr "마법의 힘으로 나는것은 어느 정도의 높이를 제한한다네. 어느정도 높은 산은  못 넘지. 그러나 그건 별로 중요한 문제는 아니네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:422
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The water in the lakes and seas around Enroth is very cold, and even the best swimmers can drown in it.  If you fall in the water, get out as fast as you can!  You can't survive long there, no matter how tough you think you are."
msgstr "엔로스의 바다나 호수는 매우 차다네. 최고의 수영선수도 힘들어 할 정도지. 만일 물에 빠지면 빨리 나와야 하네! 오랬동안 거기서 버틸순 없네. 당신이 누구더라도. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:423
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An excellent spell, but unfortunately most towns are in the east, so you won't get very far exploring with this spell.  Of course, if you need to run back to town, this is the easiest way to go."
msgstr "대단한 마법이나, 불행하게도 웬만한 타운은 다 동쪽에 있기에 이 마법으론 멀리가진 못할걸세. 물론이지, 만일 타운으로 급히 갈 일이 있다면 이 마법이 가장 빠르네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:424
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although they were a heretical religion, their heart was in the right place.  The Church helped the poor, healed the sick, and comforted the distraught.  But they grew rich, powerful, and prideful, and pride indeed goeth before a fall.  When they attacked their rival, the Church of the Moon, they brought both their enemy and themselves down."
msgstr "그들은 비록 이교도였지만 그들의 생각은 올바랐네. 그들은 불쌍한 자들을 도왔고 아픈자들을 치료했으며 불편한 자들을 편하게 해주었네. 그러나 그들은 부자가 됐고 힘이 막강해졌으며 자존심이 강해졌지. 자존심은 하늘을 찔렀고 그들이 그들의 라이벌 달의 신전을 공격했을때, 그들은 둘다 망하고 말았지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:425
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's hard to make a living these days playing music in the taverns.  I've been travelling between the towns for years, but people are really scared these days.  Everyone is afraid to spend money."
msgstr "술집에서 음악을 하며 사는건 쉬운일 이 아니네. 사람들은 요즘 돈 쓰기를 무서워하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:426
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Boats don't always travel on the schedules or to the destinations you want.  If you want personal control over your water travel, the water walk spell is the way to go."
msgstr "보트는 항상 당신이 원하던 곳이나 시간에 맞추어 가진 않지. 만일 조종하고 싶으면 물의 마법이 필요하다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:427
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The cutlass is a better weapon than the broadsword for many reasons, but the best is the way it's swept backward to deceive your opponent about the length of your weapon's reach.  The smithies of Regna turn out the best cutlasses in the world, you can bet on that, matey!"
msgstr "단도는 동검보다 여러가지 이유로 좋다네. 최고 좋은 것은 뒤면으로 적을 후려쳐 적을 기만하는 것이지. 레그나의 대장장이들은 최고의 단도를 만든다네, 정말 믿어도 되네! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:428
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Chadwick, a veteran of the Succession Wars, lives in Free Haven.  He's the most decorated living cavalier in Enroth, and one of Osric's favorite knights."
msgstr "채드윅, 상속 전쟁의 베테랑, 프리 헤이븐에 살고 있지. 그는 엔로스의 제일 유명한 사람 중 하나고, 오스릭이 제일 총애하는 기사이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:429
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most games of chance are made to separate fools from their money.  Unless you're a psychic or phenomenally lucky, don't waste your hard earned gold on them."
msgstr "모든 게임의 찬스들은 바보들의 돈을 가지고 결정이 되지. 만일 당신이 운이 무지하게 좋지 않으면 어렵게 번 돈을 쉽게 날리지 말게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:430
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With the death of Roland and rumors of a collapse of the Ironfist Rule, the roads are almost unsafe to travel anymore.  Brigands and bandits of all sorts now prey on anyone travelling too far from the protection of the castles."
msgstr "롤랜드가 죽은 후에 아이언피스트의 룰이 무너진다는 소문이 돌았지, 더 이상 길도 여행하기에는 안전하지 못하다네. 도적과 강도들이 성 밖으로 나서는 자들을 모두 포획한다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:431
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you must resort to 'special' measures to get someone to talk to you, remember that begging is almost free of consequences.  Some types, however, just won't listen to a beggar, forcing you to try another tack.  Thieves and merchants never tolerate begging."
msgstr "만일 어떤 특별한 사람하고 얘기하고 싶다면 가서 구걸하는 것도 중요하다네. 어떤 자는 구걸하는 자들을 쳐다도 안 보지. 그럴땐 또 한번 해보게나. 도적이나 상인들은 절대 구걸을 용서하지 않네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:432
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nicolai Ironfist is my twin brother.  I'll bet you didn't know that, did you?  We were separated a long time ago by our father, Roland.  They've used magic to keep Nicolai looking so young, but he's really my age."
msgstr "아이언피스트의 니콜라이는 나와 쌍둥이 형제네. 전혀 몰랐지? 우리는 어렸을때 아버지에 의해 어렸을때 떨어져 살게 됐지. 그들은 마법으로 니콜라이를 젊게 만들었지만 그는 정말 내나이 라네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:433
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most people like to talk about the sewers of Free Haven as a home for all sorts of thieves.  I doubt it though.  I'd certainly live in a nice house with plenty of butlers and maids if I had my druthers.  Why would I choose to live in a sewer?"
msgstr "많은 사람들은 프리 헤이븐의 하수관이 도적들의 소굴이라 하지.난 그렇게 생각하지 않네. 난 만일 내가 부하가 있다면 멋진 집에서 하인들과 하녀들을 두고 살겠네. 왜 그런 곳에서 살겠나?   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:435
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We need a real king, not a child.  How can Nicolai be a good ruler when he's still a child?"
msgstr "우리는 진짜 왕이 필요해, 애가 아닌. 어떻게 니콜라이가 좋은 왕이 되지? 아직 애인데.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:436
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's not much difference in cloak styles, except a general color or fabric choice.  There is one that stands out,  however, as quite unusual.  That's the Doomsday Cloak, fabricated 80 years ago by the Church of the Moon.  You can recognize it buy it's black interior lining and silver hem.  These cloaks are invariably highly enchanted."
msgstr "망토 모양은 크게 다르지는 않네. 좀 특별한게 하나 있지만 거의 희귀하지. 그건 최후의 날의 망토라네. 80년 전에 달의 신전에 의해 만들어 졌네. 그것은 까만색으로 선처리가 되있고 가장자리는 은으로 되있다네. 물론 높은 마법력이 깃들어 있고. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:437
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Someone has to do all the grunt labor around here.  Too bad that someone is me."
msgstr "누군가가 여기 투덜대는 노동자들 위해 뭔가 해야하지. 그 누군가가 나라는게 참 안좋군.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:438
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All this cold weather's really got me worried.  It's really unusual, and I'm concerned for the health of my crop."
msgstr "이 추운 날씨가 나를 걱정스럽게 만드는군. 평범한 일이 아니야. 내 건강도 생각해야 하가든.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:439
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If I had a Heavenly Forge, I could make hundreds of barrels a day and not break a sweat.  I guess those forges were one good thing about the Time of Wonders."
msgstr "만일 내가 천상의 용철로가 있다면 난 하루에 수 백개의 통들을 만들겠네. 내 생각에는 그런 용철로가 고대시대때의 좋은 점 중 하나지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:440
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To make strong, excellent pottery, you really need a hot fire.  If it weren't so dangerous, I'd make a trip to Castle Kriegspire to try out the fires they're supposed to have under the castle.  "
msgstr "강하고 대단한 도기를 만들기 위해서는 당신은 무지 뜨거운 불이 필요하다네. 만일 위험하지만 안았다면  크리그스파이어로 여행을 떠나 성 지하에 있는 불을 가지고 오겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:441
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When the storms hit in July, I was completely unprepared for the demand for winter clothes.  Now that I'm ready for the winter demand, it hasn't been all that cold.  I must have done something to anger the Heavens!"
msgstr "7월에 폭풍이 몰아쳤을때 난 겨울옷을 하나도 준비안한 상태였네. 지금은 준비가 됐지만 이렇게 추운적은 없었네. 분명 하늘이 나때문에 노여워서 그런걸꺼야.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:442
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are a few different kinds of magical boots that alchemists have been making.  Most of the metallic ones have some sort of enchantment on them."
msgstr "연금술사가 만든 부츠중에는 다른 종류들이 있지. 쇠로된것은 거의 마법이 깃들어 있지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:443
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Why isn't anyone doing anything about all the bad things happening?  Isn't that what the council is there for?"
msgstr "왜 아무도 이렇게 나쁜일이 일어나는 것에 대해 아무일도 안 하지? 의회는 뭐하라고 있는 거야?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:444
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There must be something wrong with this year's grain crops.  I can't seem to find enough sellers of raw wheat and corn to make my business run properly.  I don't know how much longer this can go on before I'm broke."
msgstr "분명 이번 곡식 수확에 뭔가 문제가 있네. 난 내게 밀이나 옥수수를 파는 사람을 못 만나봤네. 이러다 사업이 망할 지경이야. 이 상태가 얼마나 갈지도 모르겠네, 이러다 파산할꺼야.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:445
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The metal weapons aren't the only things to be enchanted.  Wooden weapons, like bows, sometimes have powerful spells placed in them as well."
msgstr "강철 무기만 마법적으로 변하는 건 아니네. 가끔은 나무무기도, 활같은. 아주 강한 마법이 들어가 있을때도 있지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:446
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Marble is the finest building material money can buy.  Most of it comes from the hills near Blackshire...   which is too bad, since people are saying there's some sort of terrible curse on the people of that area. Not much work is getting done around there these days."
msgstr "대리석은  뭘 짓는 재료로서는 돈주고 살수 있는 것 중에 최고라네. 블랙샤이어 부분은 주위의 언덕에서 나오지… 언젠가부터 사람들이 그곳에 사는 사람들이 저주가 걸렸다고 말하면서부터 요즘은 일이 안돌아가네. 아주 안 좋지..    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:447
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How can you recognize a goblin pirate? He is the one with the patch over both eyes!"
msgstr "어떻게 고블린 해적을 알아보지? \n\n양쪽눈을 헝겊으로 다 가린자! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:448
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Monsters been eating the good game animals, lately.  Lots more monsters than usual."
msgstr "몬스터들은 좋은가축들을 최근 잡아먹기 시작했지. 최근. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:449
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't believe how few people will actually part with a little money for a wretch like me.  Is everyone so selfish?"
msgstr "난 믿을수 없네. 어떻게 사람들이 적은 돈을두고 내게 등을 돌리지? 모두 다 이기주의자만 모였나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:450
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't tell no one, but I have a cleric friend who heals the brand marks right off the cattle we, ah, borrow from all the ranchers.  Works like a charm!"
msgstr "아무한테도 말하지 말게. 우리가 목동한테 빌리는 가축들의 낙인을 치유, 없애버리는 슬레릭 이란친구가 있네. 아주 황홀할 정도지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:451
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The destruction of Paradise Valley wiped out the grandest forest in Enroth, Blackwoode Forest.  A peaceful place, Blackwoode Forest was full of game.  I made a good living there among the trees.  Now I'm not sure where to hunt."
msgstr "파라다이스 벨리가 파괴되면서 엔로스의 거대한 숲이 사라져버렸네. 블랙우드 숲. 평화로운 곳이었지.사냥하기도 좋았었고, 난 그곳에서 나무들과 함께 잘 살았었는데. 난 이제 어디서 사냥을 해야할지 모르겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:452
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can't even begin to understand how unpleasant working for the nobility is.  They may have money, but no other client is so pushy, demanding, or uncaring about the way they use your time."
msgstr "당신은 귀족들을 위해 일한다는게 얼마나 기분나쁜지 모를걸세. 그들은 돈이 있을진 모르지만 항상 강요하고 부담주네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:453
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Island Empire of Regna hasn't converted to Baa yet.  I'm hoping to travel there to spread the word of Baa."
msgstr "섬의 레그나 제국은 아직 바아를 변화시키지 않았네. 난 그곳으로 여행가 바아의 뜻을 발산시켰으면 하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:454
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We get all of our important shipments in on Tuesdays."
msgstr "우리는 모든 중요한 장비들을 화요일 날 얻지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:455
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fortunately, most violent people take their aggressions out in the Arena, and not in the towns."
msgstr "다행히도, 위험한 사람들은 아레나를 떠났네. 이 타운에도 없고.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:456
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The High Council hasn't consulted the Oracle for years.  The last person to try was Archibald, and the Oracle didn't help him out at all."
msgstr "의회는 1년동안 오라클의 의견을 듣지 않았네. 마지막으로 노력한 사람은 알치발드였네. 그러나 오라클은 그를 도와주지 않았지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:457
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is nothing worse than new religions promising the world to the underprivileged.  They are upsetting the applecart and fomenting rebellion.  This Temple of Baa that everyone is talking about– now, they're no good.  I do wish the regent would mobilize against them."
msgstr "새 종교가 이 세계는 은혜받지 못했다고 말하는 것보다 가치없는 건 없네. 그들은 반역을 준비하고 있지. 이 바 신전은 모든사람들이 지금 그들이 안 좋다고 하네. 난 리젠트가 그들과 맞서 싸웠으면 좋겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:458
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Baa, friend…oh.  Uh, I thought you were a member of my temple.  Sorry, my mistake.  "
msgstr "바아,친구….오. 음, 난 당신이 내 신전의 일원인줄 알았네. 미안, 나의 실수네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:459
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hate school.  My father says I need to work hard so that I can get a good job, maybe even learn to study magic.  Who cares about that?  I just want to play!"
msgstr "난 학교가 싫어. 우리 아버지는 공부 열심히 해여 좋은 직장을 얻는다고 하지. 어쩌면 음악을 배우는 것도 . 누가 그런걸 신경쓰지? 난 단지 놀고 싶은데! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:460
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:461
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:3
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not to ruin my business, but to be honest, if you think about it, it really pays to only hire us smiths when you need us, rather than carrying us around wherever you go."
msgstr "내 사업을 망치지 말게. 그러나 정직하게, 당신도 생각하고 있다면 , 돈을 내고 우리를 고용하게, 어디를 가든 도움이 될테니까."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:462
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you ever find an item containing the Lloyd's Beacon spell, remember that the locations you are able to transport to are based per person.  That means that even a non-spell using person could have a location that they can transport to with the use of a Lloyd's Beacon item."
msgstr "만일 당신이 로이드의 등대의 주문을 발견한다면, 기억하게. 당신이 이동 할수 있는 장소는 사람에 따라 달려있네. 그 뜻은 마법을 쓸줄 모르는 사람도  로이드의 등대 주문을 사용해 공간이동 할 수 있다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:463
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are three plants that can be used to make the three basic potions.  They are poppysnaps, phirna root, and widoweeps berries.  Just mix the crushed flowers, roots, or berries respectively with water to get the potion."
msgstr "3 개의 기본적인 포션을 만들수 있는 3개의 식물이 있다. 그것들은 포피스넵,피라냐 뿌리 , 그리고 위도우윕 베리. 단지 꽃과 뿌리 열매를 물과 섞으면 된다.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:464
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Castle Kriegspire was originally built to study the extinct volcano in which it rests, but recent activity from that mountain has chased all humans from the castle.  It hasn't been destroyed yet, but monsters are the only ones that dare live inside it."
msgstr "크리그스파이어 는 절멸한 화산이 쉬고 있는 곳에서 만들어졌다. 그러나 최근 활동함에 따라 사람들은 도망쳐 나오고 있다. 아직 완전히 파괴된게 아니고 오로지 괴물들만 그 안에 살고 있다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:465
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The dragons from Dragonsand have taken advantage of the devils' attacks and have spread out from the desert into the nearby wastelands. They are even rumored to be as north as Kriegspire."
msgstr "드라곤샌드에 드라곤들은 악마의 공격에 이득을 보고 불모의 땅근처로 진열했다. 소문에 그들은 크리그스파이어 북쪽에도 있다더군.."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:466
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some monsters can be reasoned with.   If you know the charm spell, for instance, you can make even the most ferocious of beasts temporarily friendly.  Remember– you don't have to kill everything you meet.  Sometimes just getting past them is enough."
msgstr "어떤 괴물은 이유가 있다. 만일 당신이  매력의 마법이 있다면, 당신은 적을 임시적으로 친구로 만들수 있다. 잊지말게- 만일 꼭 다 죽일 필요가 없다면 , 그냥 적들을 이렇게 해 지나치는 것도 괜찬네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:467
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:497
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lady Fleise is the Queen of the Merchants, and she has built a huge fortune by controlling shipping prices."
msgstr "플레이스 여사는 상인들의 여왕이지. 그녀는 해상운임을 움직여 거대한 돈을 움켜쥐었지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:468
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Occasionally some coastal towns or slow ships are attacked by pirates.  Fortunately, pirates are rare, but their attacks can affect prices in the towns they plunder."
msgstr "때때로, 해안 근처 타운이나 느린 배는 해적들에게 습격을 받는다. 다행히도, 해적은 많지 않으나 약탈당하면 피해가 크다. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:469
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Certain monsters and spells can reduce your body to ashes, making efforts to raise the dead difficult.  We healers call this eradication.  Only special temples and spells can cure eradication."
msgstr "적들이나 마법은 마법은 당신의 몸을 재로 만들지. 죽음에서 살아나오기 어렵게 말이네. 힐러들은 이걸 이라디케이션이라 부르네. 특별한 신전이나 마법만 이라디케이션을 고칠수 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:470
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't need a powerful spell caster with you for healing.  All the towns and castles have temples with healers.  You can make healing potions, find items with healing spells in them, or even magical fountains or shrines that can heal you."
msgstr "힐링하는데 강한 마법사는 필요없네. 모든 타운과 신전에는 힐러가 있네. 거기서 힐링 포션을 만들수 있고 아이템도 마찬가지네. 아니면 마법의 샘등도 당신을 회복시킬수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:471
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The largest Guild of the Self was founded in Silver Cove."
msgstr "제일 큰 셀프 길드는 실버 코브에서 발견됐다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:472
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Whenever you have the opportunity, it pays to become an expert or master in any given skill you've been practicing.  Experts and masters enjoy benefits and effects out of the reach of people who just learn the basic skill."
msgstr "만일 기회가 있으면 베테랑이나 마스터가 되기 위해 계속 연습을 하게. 베테랑이나 마스터는 이제 막 시작하는 초보들에게 기술을 가르치는 걸 좋아하니까. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:473
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's important to fight creatures challenging to you.  If you fight weak creatures, you don't learn much experience, and if you fight hard creatures, you run the risk of dying.  The creatures at your skill level are the most rewarding to learn from."
msgstr "당신에게 덤비는 생물과 싸우는 건 중요하다네. 만일 약한 것하고  싸우면 많은 경험치를 얻지 못하지. 강한것 하고 싸우다간 자칫 죽을수도 있지. 적들의 기술 레벨이 당신이 얻는 경험치를 결정하지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:474
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Always wear armor if you can!  Always!  And spend a little effort to learn to use it or you'll wallow like a pregnant yak in a fight!"
msgstr "항상 갑옷을 착용해라, 항상! 그리고 그걸 배우는데 시간을 투자해라. 아니면 임신한 소처럼 뒹굴게 될테니!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:475
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A man had wandered through not too long ago proclaiming to have knowledge of ancient weapons, the likes of which have not been seen since the Time of Wonders.  We laughed him and his insane ramblings right out of town."
msgstr "방랑하지 얼마되지 않은 남자가 보지도 못한 고대 무기, 고대 시대때의 무기를 알고 있다면 우린 웃어버리지. 그런 정신 나간자는 바로 �i아버리지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:476
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This spell is my personal favorite.  It works best on the strongest and toughest monsters by making them heavier, and smashes lots of important internal organs.  It seems to cut their health in half, and with the strong ones, that can be quite a bit."
msgstr "이 마법은 내가 개인적으로 좋아하는 거지. 이 마법은 강하고 터프한 적에게 제일 잘듣지. 그들을 무겁게 만들고 중요한 감각기간을 파괴시키지. 그들을 체력을 반으로 나눌정도라네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:477
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The greatest magical researcher since the Silence, Twillen's age has finally caught up with him.  The last I heard, he was searching for a way to find his youth again.  I don't think even he can counter the forces of nature."
msgstr "침묵의 시대,이후의 최고 마법연구가를 트윌렌은 그와 똑같은 위치에 섣네. 마지막으로 내가 듣기에는 그는 그가 젊어질 방법을 연구 하고 있다더군, 그러나 난 그가 자연의 힘을 거역할수 있을것 같지 않네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:478
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dark magic makes up one half of the Mirrored Path.  Dark cannot exist without light, nor light without dark.  'Evil' is the word most commonly associated with the school of dark, but that's not true.  A school, like a weapon, isn't good or evil by itself–  it's morality is determined by its use."
msgstr "어둠의 마법은 1과 2분1을 반사한다네. 어둠이 없으면 빛이 없고 빛이 없으면 어둠도 없네.  암흑의 학교에는 악마란 말이 가장 잘 어울리지만 그건 사실이 아니네. 학교, 무기들은 좋지만 사용시 도덕성이 무너진다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:479
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although banks in Enroth don't pay interest, they protect your money from theft and loss.  You should consider putting your money in a bank before embarking on any long or dangerous trips."
msgstr "엔로스의 은행이 이자를 계산하진 않지만  그들은 당신의 돈을 도둑과 읽어버림에 방어하고 있는거네. 당신은 아마 돈을 읽어버리기 전에 은행에 넣는게 좋을걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:480
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ahhh, the point of being a merchant!  Gold makes the world move.  Economies bustle with exchange of gold, from markets to farms, to towns, to kingdoms– everywhere!  Even kings spend the lives of their men more readily than they will their gold.  Being a merchant is the way to accumulate wealth, and that wealth gives me a status that most people will never have."
msgstr "아, 상인이 되는 방법! 골드는 세상을 움직인다. 경제는 골드에 의해 움직이고  마켓, 농장, 타운, 왕국까지- 모든 곳이다! 왕들도 골드를 모으기 위해 힘을 쓰는데 상인이 되는 것은 내게 부를 가져다 주지. 부는 다른 사람들이 못하는 걸 내가 하게 해주지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:481
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is a small village around Abdul's Desert Resort that sells some of the finest magic equipment I've ever seen.  Heaven knows where they get it, but it sure is nice to know that stuff is available there."
msgstr "압둘의 사막 리조트 옆에 조그만 타운이 있네. 그곳은 내가 보기에는 최고의 마법 장비를 파는 곳이네. 하늘만이 그것들이 어디서 왔는지 알꺼네, 그곳에는 확실히 좋은 지팡이들이 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:482
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware of highwaymen plying the roads between towns.  Wise travelers will take advantage of Enroth's many high quality banking establishments to avoid being completely robbed by these parasites."
msgstr "타운의 길에 있는 노상강도를 조심하게. 현명한 여행자는 은행을 사용해 노상강도를 피하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:483
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A whole culture of underworld people exists, though it is sometimes difficult to find.  Thieves and criminals have their own organizations and codes, and are surprisingly good at spreading information.  Though you can't always trust them, it's wise to use them as best you can."
msgstr "지하세계 사람들의 문화는 존재하네. 가끔은 찾기 힘들지만. 도적과 범죄자들은  그들만의 조직과 코드를 가지고있고 정보력은 놀라울 정도이네. 그들은 믿을수 없지만 그들을 이용하는게 현명한 방법이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:484
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've build a few secret doors in my day, and I think I can safely say that some of them are virtually indistinguishable from a plain old wall.  If you have the Wizard Eye spell, you can use it to look at the map it makes for you and logically work out whether or not a section of wall is part of a secret door."
msgstr "난 여태까지 몇 개의 비밀문을 만들어 왔네, 그리고 대부분은 구별할수 없는 오래된 벽과 모양이 같네. 만일 당신이 마법의 눈의 주문이 있다면, 당신은 지도를 볼때 그걸 사용해 비밀 문을 찻을수 있을꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:485
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hey!  I'm a legitimate locksmith, not some shady burglar or thief.  I help protect peoples' belongings, not steal them."
msgstr "이봐! 난 유명한 자물쇠 제조공이네. 뒤가 구린 강도나 도적이 아니고. 난 사람들이 방어하는걸 돕네. 훔치는게 아니고.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:486
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A pipe gives a wise man something to think about and a fool something to stick in his mouth."
msgstr "파이프는 현명한 사람한테는 뭔가를 생각하게 만들고 바보들은 그것을 그의 입에 집어넣을려고 하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:487
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Speaking of dooming yourself, poor Roland should never have bitten off as much as he did.  I'm sure he met his end courageously, but it was far too early in his life."
msgstr "당신의 운명에 대해 얘기하는 건, 불쌍한 롤랜드가 당한 잔인한 짓과 버금가는 것이네. 난 그가 그의 용기의 끝을 봤다고 생각하네, 그러나 너무 빠른 감이 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:488
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't be careless with the way you pack your goods in your backpack!  A little organization can save a lot of space, and let you carry more.  No one's going to do it for you, you know!"
msgstr "당신이 짐싸는 것에 대해 너무 신중하게 하지 말게. 조금만 구성을 잘 하면 많은 자리를 찾을 수 있지. 그리고 더 실을수도 있고. 그러나 아무도 그런 일을 당신을 위해 해주진 않네. 잘 알잖아!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:489
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some places it is simply too dangerous to rest.  Never assume you can rest in a difficult area.  Try and save enough strength to be able to retreat to a safer area."
msgstr "어떤곳은 휴식하기에는 너무 위험하지.  어려운 곳에서는 쉬지 말게. 안전한 곳에서 쉬며 체력을 비축하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:490
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You know, it really makes me uncomfortable to have to do business with or hear accounts from criminals.  I know they've stolen money, but what am I to do about that?  Jail is reserved for only the most violent or persistent of criminals.  Bring back Archibald and the good old fashioned execution, that's what I say!  King Roland's too soft, and so is his regent."
msgstr "아시다시피, 거래를 한 자가 범죄자라는 것을 알았을때는 상당히 불편하지. 그들이 돈을 훔쳤다는것을 아네. 그러나 내가 뭐라고 하겠나? 감옥은 큰 범죄를 진자가 많이 가는 곳이지. 아치발드를 데려오고 예전처럼 사는게 내 소원이라네. 롤랜드 왕와 기사들은 너무 부드럽다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:491
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One of the best ways to make money is to curb your expenses.  Find the cheapest places to get supplies, healing, and training.  Don't hire people you don't need, don't pay for travel unless you need to, and don't buy items you don't intend to use.  Saving money is as important as making it."
msgstr "돈을 버는 제일 좋은 방법은 절약을 하는 걸세. 물가가 싼 곳을 골라 살고 필요없는 사람을 고용하지 않는 거네. 그리고 필요없는 아이템은 사지말고. 절약하는 것은 버는 것만큼 중요하다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:492
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's a way to make a powerful potion by mixing common herbs into water and the simple potions that process makes into more complex potions.  I know that if you mix an orange potion with a green potion you'll end up with a white potion of extreme protection.  There's a lot of other combinations you could try, but experimenting is dangerous!"
msgstr "물에다 보통의 허브를 섞어 강한 포션을 만드는 방법이 있네. 내가 아는건 오랜지 포션과 녹색포션을 섞으면 하얀색의 막강한 방어 포션이 나오지. 섞는 방법은 아주 많네. 그러나 위험하기도 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:493
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I love a well prepared steak, seasoned with a few herbs, and served with onions and mushrooms.  Add some steamed vegetables, maybe a potato, and some good ale… now that's a meal!"
msgstr "난 잘 준비된 스테이크를 좋아하지, 그리고 허브와 양파, 버섯. 약간의 야채들, 그게 바로 식사야! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:494
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now, not a lot of people like to go to the Mire of the Damned, and I'm one of them.  Horses don't belong there, either, and I don't think you'll soon find a stagecoach company willing to take you there.  My advice is to stay away from that place.  "
msgstr "지금은 많은 사람들이 마이어 오브 댐드에 가려하지 않지, 나도 그들 중 하나고. 그곳에는 말들도 없고 당신을 그곳으로 데려다 줄 회사도 없네, 내 충고는 그곳에서 떨어져 있게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:495
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In my last visit to Castle Ironfist, Nicolai raved over how much he wanted to visit the circus.  I played a few songs from the circus for him, and he seemed to appreciate the gesture a great deal."
msgstr "내가 마지막으로 아이언피스트를 방문 했을때, 니콜라이가 그가 얼마나 서커스를 가고 싶어하는 지 열변을 토하더군. 난 그를 위해 서커스 노래를 들려주었고 그는 만족한것 같았네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:496
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It isn't wise to laugh off prophecies, even if, admittedly, most don't come true.  The most important one of our age is the one by Apius Silanus made on his deathbed 800 years ago when he said the dark brother would rise again in the shadow of the light brother's sunset.  That sounds an awful lot like our King Roland and his wicked brother Archibald, doesn't it?"
msgstr "예언 앞에서 웃는 건 현명한 일이 아니네. 만일 그게 엉뚱한거라도, 우리 시대 때 중요했던 것은 아피우스 실라누스가 88년 전에 죽으며 했던말, 어둠의 형제가 태양의 빛 형의 그림자에서 일어난다는 거였지. 그 얘기는 롤랜드와 아치발드를 얘기하는 것 같네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:498
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Alamos is the home of many researching sorcerers and their magyar guards.  Rumor has it the sorcerers there study summoning spells, but no one is brave enough to go there and ask."
msgstr "알라모스는 많은 마도사들과 마자르 가드들의 고향이지. 소문에는 마도사들은 소환마법을 연구한다고 하나 아무도 그곳에 가서 물어볼 용기가 없네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:499
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're ever facing a horde of small monsters, try using the Ice Blast spell on them.  It explodes into dozens of tiny shards of ice that bounce around and slice your enemies to ribbons.  Because it will bounce off the walls, it works even better indoors.  Make sure you cast it far away from yourself, or it will hit you, too."
msgstr "만일 당신이 유목하는 조그만 적들과 마주하고 있다면 그들한테 얼음 일격 주문을 한번 사용해보게. 그러면 한 다스의 작은 얼음 파편들이 나가 튀어다니다 적들과 부딪히면 폭팔할걸세. 왜냐면 그것들은 벽과 부딪혀도 폭파하지 않으니 실내에서는 더 좋다네. 그리고 꼭 멀리 떨어져 사용하게. 아니면 당신도 피해를 볼수 있으니.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:500
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're going to be teleporting around everywhere, it's important to keep good maps to avoid getting lost."
msgstr "만일 당신이 아무곳으로 순간이동 할려면 좋은 지도를 가지고 있게. 길 읽어버리지 않으려면. I "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:501
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Light magic is the strongest magic in the world that doesn't bite you for trying to use it.  Dark magic can work offensive miracles, but often as not there's a price to pay for using it.  Also, many of the most destructive dark magics hurt the caster at the same time it hurts the enemy."
msgstr "빛의마법은 세계에서 가장 강한 마법이고 사용자는 다치지도 않는다네.어둠의 마법은 강하긴 하나 사용시 그 대가를 치루어야 하네.어떤 경우에는 사용자에게 적과 똑같은 대미지를 입히기도 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:502
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Pipe music seems to have a strange effect on rats and children.  At least it does when I use my best pipe.  They follow you everywhere!  "
msgstr "파이프 뮤직 은 쥐와 애들에게 이상한 힘을 발휘하는 것 같네. 그들은 아무데나 따라오니. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:503
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've never made it to Star Island, but I've seen the statues outside.  No one has ever come back from a trip to the island, and I suspect the statues are the transformed people that have made it to the island and discovered some terrible secret there."
msgstr "난 한번도 스타 섬에 가본적이 없네, 그러나 난 바깥쪽의 상들은 봤네. 아무도 그섬에 가서는 돌아오지 않았네.  난 상을 조사해봤고 그곳에 무시무시한 비밀이 있다는 것을 알게 됐네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:504
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For sea battles, there's nothing like a trident for dealing with enemies.  The trident works underwater, or from the surface into the water.  Most weapons can't cut through the water well, but a trident stabs right through it."
msgstr "해전에서는 적과 싸울때는 작살이 최고네. 작살은 물밑에서도 통하지. 대부분의 무기들은 물을 잘 뚫진 못하지만 작살은 가능하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:505
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rumors abound that the council actually guards a cache of equipment from before the Silence.  I don't believe it, though.  Wouldn't the council have used this equipment against the devils, or even in the Succession War if it were true?"
msgstr "의회에 도는 소문은 침묵의 시대전의 장비들을 은닉하고 있다더군. 난 믿지 않지만. 만일 그렇다면 왜 의회는 악마와의 전쟁때 안 쓰고 왕위계승전쟁때  사용을 안 했겠나? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:506
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here, let me see your palm…<pointing at a line on your hand> Ah.  Well, just as I suspected.  You're going to die.  Soon, I'll warrant."
msgstr "내가 점을 봐주지…<손금을 가르치며>오, 내가 예상했던 대로군. 당신은 곧 죽을꺼야, 내가 확신하지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:507
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A dagger or knife is the most useful weapon in the world.  You can use it for a variety of tasks, from cooking to carving to lock picking (in a pinch).  Plus, as you become more and more skilled, you can use one in either hand and even strike vital locations on enemies with precise attacks."
msgstr "단검과 나이프는 아주 유용한 물건이지. 당신은 그걸 여러가지 임무에 사용할수 있고 요리부터 짐싸는데까지 사용할수 있지. 만일 당신이 그것들을 아주 잘 다루게 된다면 양손사용기능하고 던질수도 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:508
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If ever there was a snake's nest of politics and religion, it was Karigor.  Karigor is a small island southeast of the 'bootleg' that New Sorpigal is situated on.  The twin rival Churches of the Sun and the Moon were founded there, and fought the longest war the world has ever seen until they managed to destroy one another about 200 years ago.  Their artifacts of power are scattered around the world."
msgstr "뱀들의 종교와 정치상의 보금자리가 있다면 카리고이네. 카리고는 뉴소르피갈에 있는 부트레그만 남동쪽에 있는 작은 섬이네. 두개의 라이벌인 태양의 신전 과 달의 신전도 그곳서 발견됐고 그들은 200년동안 싸웠다네. 세계에는 많은 인공물의 힘이 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:509
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Temple of Baa is full of insane cultists bent on world domination!  Their evil is everywhere, and they're out to get you and me!  Our only chance of escape is to kill their leader, Wilbur Humphrey, before he poisons the ear of the prince any longer!"
msgstr "바아 신전은 세계를 구한다는 정신나간 예배를 하지. 악마들이 널려있고 그들은 당신과 나를 잡기위해 돌아다니지! 우리가 피할수 있는 법은 그들의 리더를 죽이는 것 뿐이야, 윌버 험프리 그가 왕자를 죽이기 전에!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:510
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A bandit that prowls up north, he is notorious for collecting 'protection' from merchants.  He has a good racket, but I'm not sure how long it'll last before someone does him in."
msgstr "북쪽에 돌아다니는 도적들은 상인들 한테서 '방어'를 뺐기로 유명하지. 그는 협박을 잘하나 난 그가 얼마나 그렇게 살지 모르겠네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:511
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't tell anyone I said this, but people are saying the Ironfists have lost the Mandate of Heaven.  What else could cause all the storms and floods and disasters?  These are signs of heavenly wrath, mark my words!"
msgstr "아무한테도 내가 이얘길 했다고 말하지 말게. 사람들은 아이언피스트가 하늘의 계시를 잃어 버렸다고 하지. 아니면 왜 홍수나 태풍같은 재앙이 일어나겠나? 그곳에는 신의 노여움의 증거가 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:512
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With all of the troubles that are going on, I'm certainly glad to be protected by my lord!  Other people might have to worry about their well-being, but all I have to focus on is the work that must be done."
msgstr "모든 안좋은 일이 돌아가는 도중에도 난 나를 방어해주는 나의 군주에 감사하고 있네! 다른 사람들은 도움받기를 바라지만  내가 하는 일은 단지 주어진 일은 끝내야 된다는 것이네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:513
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gauntlets are more an armorer's specialty than a tailor's, but I can tell you that the best stuff is available in the armorsmith shops of the far north.  The finest of these magical gauntlets are almost as easy to wear as a soft glove, yet protect every bit as well as the hardest plate gauntlets."
msgstr "손 보호대는 양복장이들이 만든 것보단 갑옷의 의미가 많네. 그리고 최고의 지팡이는 멀리 북쪽에 있는 갑옷 장신구에서 찾을수 있을 꺼네. 제일 좋은 긴 장갑은 입기도 쉽고 판금 보호대보다 방어력이 좋네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:514
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As much as I hate being a lowly laborer, I'd much rather be me than any of the Ironfists.  Troubles seem to follow them like ants at a picnic.  I lead a simple but happy life… better that than to be a miserable noble."
msgstr "난 아이언피스트의 싸구려 노동자가 돼기 싫으네. 문제들은 항상 그들을 개미와 소풍처럼 따라다니지. 난 평범하고 행복한 삶을 살고 싶네.... 위대한 귀족들보다 더 좋은.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:515
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's been a lot of troop movement, these days.  All these soldiers keep walking over my fields!  Now you tell me– what do you think happens when an entire army walks over your crops?  Yes, that's right!  Financial ruin!"
msgstr "요즘, 많은 군대들이 이동이 있다네. 많은 군인들이 나의 필드를 걸어다닌다네! 이제 내게 말해보게- 만일 군인들이 당신의 수확물위를 걸어다닌다면? 그래 맞네! 파산이야!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:516
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fortunately there are a lot of taverns and inns around; they keep me busy making casks for them.  You can find an inn almost anywhere."
msgstr "다행히도 근처에는 많은 선술집과 여관이 있네. 난 그들을 위해 통들을 만드느라 항상 바쁘지. 당신은 여관을 아무데서도 찾을수 있을꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:517
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's tough being a potter these days– there's no reason making it harder on yourself.  Always go to market knowing what prices should be, and make sure you come armed with your wits!  Someone without any merchant skill is likely to get bad bargains."
msgstr "요즘은 포터가 된다는 것은- 당신 자신을 구태여 힘들게 할 필요가 없다는 것이네. 항상 마켓에 가격이 얼만지 알아보고 그리고 항상 무장하고 다니게! 만일 상인 기술이 없다면 바가지를 쓰게되지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:518
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're planning on staying up north for very long, make sure you pack warm clothes.  It never seems to stop snowing up there."
msgstr "만일 당신이 북쪽에 에 오래 있으려고 한다면 꼭 따듯한 옷을 가져가게. 그곳에는 눈이 멈추지 않는것 같으니.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:519
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dragonhide is the best material to use when making any shoe, belt, or boot.  It is supple, yet tough and resistant to the elements."
msgstr "드라곤하이드는 신발을 만들때 최고의 재료이네. 벨트나 부츠도. 유연하고 원소마법에 방어력도 있다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:520
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With all the practice I have digging, I should go to the islands in the bay and dig for pirate treasure."
msgstr "내가 배운건 단지 발굴하는 기술이네. 난 이제 부트레그만에 있는 섬으로 가 해적의 보물이나 발굴해 봐야 겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:521
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, with all this bad weather going on, at least the wind is good for me.  I have two windmills, and a little wind goes a long way to saving me a lot of money on labor costs!"
msgstr "이렇게 나쁜 날씨가 지속되면, 최소한 나한테는 좋지. 나한테는 두개의 윈드밀이 있지 그리고 작은 것은 나의 노동비를 절약하게 해주지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:522
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Perhaps I should move to Regna.  They have the largest navy in the world.  I could easily adapt to shipbuilding.  I mean, wood is wood, right?"
msgstr "어쩌면 난 레그나로 이사가야 할지 모르네. 그들은 제일 큰 해군을 가지고 있지. 난 배만드는 걸 잘하네. 아니, 내 말은 나무는 나무라는 거네. 그렇치 않나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:523
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gems can be worth quite a bit of money, so don't get rid of them or sell them cheap!"
msgstr "보석은 돈보다 가치가 있는 것 같군, 그러니 그것들을 팔거나 하진 말게! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:524
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Why didn't the skeleton cross the road? He didn't have the guts!"
msgstr "왜 해골이 길을 건너지 못했을까? \n그는 창자가 없거든!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:525
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tanning is a disgusting job.  That's why I trap instead of tan.  "
msgstr "태닝은 지겨운 직업이지. 내가 바로 시커멓게 타있는 이유지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:526
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hate to be begging like this, but the injuries I sustained in the Succession War prevent me from doing most labor. "
msgstr "난 이렇게 구걸하고 싶진 않지만 상속 전쟁때 얻은 이 상처로 인해 난 일자리를 못구했지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:527
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't laugh, but I heard that giant flying bloodsuckers are responsible for killing the cows in the New Sorpigal area.  Gods preserve us!"
msgstr "웃지 말게. 뉴 소르피갈에는 거대한 흡혈귀라는 것이 소들을 죽이고 있다더군, 하늘이 도와야 할텐데!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:528
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Scattered about the lands are shrines.  I wonder what they're dedicated to and who worships at them?"
msgstr "땅위의 여러곳은 성지이지. 난 누가 헌정하고 누가 예배를 하는지 궁금하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:529
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've scribed some spell books for a number of sorcerers, including Albert Newton.  He's my best customer, as a matter of fact.  He sells the most complex spells to the Guilds of Light and Dark based somewhere in the west, probably near Blackshire."
msgstr "난 몇 명의 마도사, 알버트 뉴튼을 포함한 그들의 마법책을 대서했네. 그는 복잡한 마법들을 서쪽 어딘가에 있는 빛의 길드와 어둠의 길드에게 판다네. 아마  블랙샤이어에 근처에 있는."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:530
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This Church focused on worshipping the heavens.  The conflict between the Churches of the Sun and Moon was pointless and wasteful.  We're all fortunate they're both gone."
msgstr "이 교회는 천상을 위해 예배하는 것에 대해 집중하고 있지. 태양의 신전과과 달의 신전의 전쟁은 전혀 필요없는 것이지. 그들이 사라졌다는 건 우리에게 보면 행운일수도있지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:531
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Better than digging ditches.  Besides, someone has to keep the machinery of state moving!"
msgstr "도랑을 파는 것보단 났지. 그리고 누군가는 기계를 계속 돌려야하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:532
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do I look bored to you?  I'm not, of course.  Acting like you're asleep is an old guard's trick. "
msgstr "내가 지겨워 보이나? 난 아니네, 당신은 꼭 오래된 가드의 함정에 걸려서 자둔 것처럼 보이는 군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:533
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can tell that Archibald's an Ironfist– he has the trademark bad luck.  Not only did his bid for power fail, now he's a statue in the royal library.  At least he gets to spend the rest of his days in the castle."
msgstr "아이론피스트에 있는  알치발드에게 이렇게 말하게-그는 악운의 징표이네. 그의 힘이 실패헤서가 아니네. 지금그는 왕궁 도서관에 상 으로 있지. 그는 최소한 앞으로 그 상태로 있어야 하니까.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:534
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This Mandate of Heaven nonsense really has the potential to start up some serious trouble.  If someone doesn't figure out what is going on with these disasters soon, the kingdom is going to fall apart!"
msgstr "이 하늘의 계시는 뭔가 심각한 문제를 일으키진 않을걸세. 만일 누가 왜 이런 재앙이 자꾸 생기는지 밝혀내지 않으면 이 왕궁은 끝장날걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:535
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're ever in need of healing and you don't have enough money to pay those sharks at the regular temples, why not visit a Temple of Baa?  They're healing people for free!"
msgstr "만일 치료는 해야하는데 신전에 가서 치료할 돈이 없다면 왜 바아 신전에 가지 않지?  그들은 공짜로 치료해주는데!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:536
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I was Nicolai!  He's still a kid, but I bet no one tells him what to do!  He can do whatever he wants because he's the king.  Not like me, everyone tells me what to do."
msgstr "난 내가 니콜라이�岵만� 좋겠네! 그는 아직 어린 애고, 그리고 아무도 그에게 뭐라 하질 않을 걸세. 왜냐면 그는 왕이기 때문이지. 나는 모두가 뭐라고 간섭해서 미칠지경이야."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:537
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sometimes you can tell that a weapon is heavily enchanted just by looking at it.  If it's heavy and glitters a lot, it's expensive, and probably very powerful."
msgstr "가끔 어떤 무기들은 쳐다보기만 해도 강한 마법에 걸려있다는 것을 알수있네. 만일 무겁고 빛이 많이 나면, 그것은 비싸네. 그리고 아마도 엄청 강할걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:538
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't overlook the defensive value of a good shield.  Yeah, I know a two-handed weapon hits a lot harder, but what do you do if you miss, or if that monster just doesn't go down on the first swing?  That's when a good shield comes into play.  It'll save your life one day, mark my words!"
msgstr "좋은 방어용 방패에 너무 관심을 두지 말게. 양손으로 쓰는 무기가 더 많은 대미지를 입힌다네. 그러나 실수하거나, 아니면 적이 첫번째 공격으로 죽지 않는다면 어떻게 할건가? 그때가 바로 좋은 방패가 필요할때니. 언젠가는 그것이 당신의 목숨을 구할꺼네. 명심하게!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:539
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Statistics show that most items are broken when the wielder or wearer falls unconscious from damage, or where a monster has a particularly bruising blow to deliver.  The single best way to prevent broken items is to just not be knocked unconscious.  Get healed before it's too late."
msgstr "스태틱스는 아이템들이 적들이 공격했을때나 높은 곳에서 떨어졌을때 대미지 상태를 나타내네. 하나의 최고 방법은 무의식중에 사용하지 않는 걸세.너무 늦기 전에 고치게나."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:540
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most items you find will boost or enhance some basic characteristic about you, but a few will have a more complex effect.  It is these that are truly valuable, and their names are usually in the form of 'item of ' as in wand of lightning bolts."
msgstr "당신이 찾는 아에템들은 거의 증진시키거나 능력을 높힐수 있다. 그러나 몇 개는 더 높은 능력이 있다. 그것들은 정말 쓸만하고 그것들은 보통 '아에템들 '라고 불리고 지팡이의 라이트닝 볼트."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:541
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is an island southwest of Enroth where people say is the headquarters of the Temple of Baa.  Why they would pick such a remote location for such a popular religion is beyond me, though."
msgstr "엔로스 남서쪽의 섬에 바아 신전의 본거지가 있다고 사람들은 말하지. 왜 그들은 그렇게 먼곳에 자리를 잡았을까, 그렇게 종교를.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:542
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rumor has it the westernmost parts of the Frozen Highlands are overrun with powerful creatures.  Maybe even dragons!"
msgstr "소문에 의하면 프로즌 하이랜드의 서부지역은 엄청 강한 생물에 공격을 받았다더군. 어쩌면 용일지도!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:543
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not anymore it isn't!  Since the devils came, Paradise Valley is a barren wasteland infested with hundreds of devils.  No one goes in there and survives!"
msgstr "이제 더 이상 없다. 악마들이 온 후로 파라다이스 밸리는 수 백명의 악마들로 매꾸어졌다. 아무도 그곳에 가서 살아남지 않는다. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:544
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:574
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "King Roland keeps his own personal royal yacht, the Queen Catherine, in a lake just west of Castle Ironfist.  She is a mighty ship, capable of going nearly anywhere quickly, but only the king or the regent can give permission for someone to use her."
msgstr "롤랜드 왕은 그만의 로얄 요트가 있다.  여왕 캐서린, 아이론피스트 서쪽의 호수에. 그 배는 대단하고 어디든 빨리간다. 그러나 왕과 그의 기사들만이 사용할수 있다 "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:545
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many small islands fill Bootleg Bay.  I've heard rumors of temples on the islands, and even pirate hideouts!  I've never seen either, but I can imagine the amount of treasure a pirate would have accumulated."
msgstr "부트레그 만은 많은 작은 섬으로 이루어졌지. 난 그 섬에 있는 신전에 대한 소문을 들었네. 해적들도 쉬쉬하는! 난 본적은 없지만, 상상이 가네. 해적들이 숨겨놓은 엄청난 양의 보물이.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:546
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is important to raise someone from the dead as soon as possible, if you intend to do it.  If you take too long, death may require more than one spell to fix.  This can get expensive!"
msgstr "죽은 사람을 빨리 되살리는 건 중요한 일이네. 만일 오래 걸린다면 죽음이 마법보다 더 강할지 모르네. 그렇게 되면 되살리기가 힘들어질걸세!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:547
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's possible to create more complicated potions by mixing the simple potions together to create compound potions.  Compound potions are stronger than simple potions and have slightly different effects."
msgstr "간단한 포션과 복잡한 포션을 섞어 합성 포션 만드는 것도 가능하네. 합성 포션은 간단한 포션보다 강하고 다른 결과를 가져온다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:548
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Simple potions combine to create compound potions.  Orange potions temporarily boost your armor class, green potions temporarily boost your resistances, and purple potions serve as antidotes to any poison."
msgstr "심플 포션을 섞어 강력한  포션을 만들수 있다. 오랜지 포션은 임시적으로 당신의 갑옷 클래스를 올려주고, 녹색 포션은 방어력을 올려주고, 보라색 포션 은 모든 사람을 회복시킨다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:549
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone has a spell book, but many lack the ability to fill it with even the simplest of spells.  If you can somehow get a spell into your spell book, you can cast it as long as you have enough spell power."
msgstr "모두 다 마법책을 가지고 있다. 그러나 대부분이 사용할 능력이 없다. 만일 당신이 주문 책이 있다면 주문의 힘이 떨어질때까지 계속 사용할수 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:550
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A cunning woman– it's easy to forget how intelligent she is when dealing with her.  Aside from gaining vast amounts of wealth, she's mastered several skills, and is associated with a few of the druidic orders of the north."
msgstr "교활한 여자? 그녀랑 거래할때는 그녀가 얼마나 똑똑한지도 모르게 된다네. 그녀는 몇 가지 기술의 마스터이고 그녀는 북쪽의 드루이드와 같이 다니기도 한다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:551
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Pay attention to the advantages of small, quick weapons.  If you're good enough with them, you can attack twice as often as you could with a larger, heavier weapon."
msgstr "작고 빠른 무기들에 관심을 가져라. 만일 잘만 사용한다면 한번에 두번 공격할수 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:552
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some warriors prefer to specialize in one weapon above all others.  This training makes them incredible fighters, but it has a few weaknesses.  They may not be able to find an awesome weapon of the type they've specialized in, or they may be fighting against an opponent that is more resistant to their type of attacks.  Specialists are very good, but they shouldn't travel alone."
msgstr "전사들은 한 무기에만 전무가지. 훈련은 그들을 엄청난 전사로 만드나 약점도 있지. 그들의 전문분야의 무기가 아닌 경우에는 당하기가 쉽지. 전문가는 좋으나 혼자 다녀선 안되지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:553
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Be sure to use spells of protection when you have them.  They can really reduce the heartache of being reduced to ash by dragon fire or electrocuted by enemy sorcerer lightning attacks."
msgstr "방어 주문 은 꼭 사용하게. 그것은 용의 불꽃이나 적의 전기공격, 마도사의 빛 공격을 방어한다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:554
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A powerful sorcerer, Agar tried in vain to create powerful creatures as his slaves so that he could conquer Enroth.  His minions were either too stupid to be of use, or too smart to be controlled."
msgstr "강한 마도사, 아가르는 그의 노예로 아주 강한 생물을 만들려고 했네. 그래서 그가 엔로스를 장악할수 있도록. 그의 미노타우로는 사용하기에는 너무 바보였거나 아니면 콘트롤하기에는 너무 똑똑 했네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:555
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Corlagon took Terrax's Crystal to his estate for studying when he began learning the Necromantic arts.  I imagine the crystal is still there."
msgstr "콜라곤 은 테락스 크리스탈을 그의 토지로 그가 네크로만틱 을 배우기 시작했을때 연구하기 위해 가져같다네. 내 생각에 크리스탈은 아직 거기있는것 같다. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:556
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Diplomacy is the skill that makes people feel more favorable towards you.  If you must speak with someone who doesn't seem to like you, make sure that you use your most diplomatic person to do the talking."
msgstr "외교는 사람들을 당신편으로 만들게 하는 기술이지. 만일 당신과 반대의견인 사람과 얘기 한다면  이 기술이 큰 도움이 될걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:557
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I knew who Abdul is.  His shops consistently offer low prices– he must be a bandit trying to launder money.  I can't see any other reason to have the low prices he does."
msgstr "난 누가 압둘인지 알았으면 좋겠네. 그의 가게는 상당히 싸다던데-그는 분명히 도적과 돈세탁을 하는것 같네. 그렇게쌀 이유가 없거든.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:558
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm certain the devils destroyed the town of Sweet Water!  It was the most northwestern town in Enroth, and certainly one of the most beautiful.  Not many people made it out that way to visit, but now you don't hear anything about the place.  "
msgstr "난 스윗 워터의 모든 악마들이 사라졌다고 확신하네! 그곳은 엔로스의 북서쪽의 아름다운 타운이지. 많은 사람들이 방문하진 않았지만 지금은 그곳에 대한 아무소식도 들을수 없네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:559
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are two major thief guilds in the land.  One, the 'sanctioned' one, can be found in some of the major towns in the kingdom.  The other, guild is called the Shadow Guild.  They are much more violent and cruel than the sanctioned guilds, and I'm sure the king would put them down if he had the time."
msgstr "이 땅에는 큰 두개의 도적 길드가 있네. 하나는 '인정받은' 것이고 왕국의 큰 타운에서 찾을수 있고 다른 하나는 쉐도우 길드라고 하지. 그들은 다른  길드보다 훨씬 험악하고 위험하네. 만일 왕이 시간있으면 그들을 다 잡아들일거라고 확신하네,  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:560
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The lords themselves are too busy to handle most affairs of state, so they have council members that attend the High Council in Free Haven for them.  Each lord has one council member, and these six people make most of the laws of the state, in the names of their respective lords."
msgstr "군주들 자체는 그들의 땅을 돌보느라 너무 바쁘기 때문에 그들은 그들의 심복들을 프리헤이븐의 의회로 보내네. 그들의 그들 군주의 이름으로 행동을 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:561
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Plate armor is, of course, the strongest kind of armor available.  There is a legendary suit of armor called Zeus, and it can imbue its wearer with extraordinary strength, but it doesn’t do much for the personality.  "
msgstr "판금 갑옷는, 물론 제일 강한 갑옷이네. 그리고 제우스라고 불리는 전설적인 갑옷이 있다네. 그리고 입으자에게 강한 체력을 주나 개성에는 별 상관이 없다네..  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:562
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard rumors that Zoltan Phelps lost a valuable possession to a group of bandits.  If he had taken proper precautions and had used my services, that wouldn't have happened."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는 졸탄 펠스가 도적들 사이에서 그의 지위를 읽어버렸다더군. 만일 그가 나의 적합한 예방조치를 듣고 내 서비스를 받았다면 그런 일은 없었을 꺼네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:563
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know I charge a lot to travel with, but I'm worth it!  If you keep me around, I'll tell you words of wisdom you'll not soon hear from anyone else.  For instance, did you know that a fool and his money are soon parted?"
msgstr "난 함께 여행갈때 많은 돈을 요구하지, 그러나 그 만큼 가치가 있네! 만일 나를 데리고 간다면 난 당신에게 아무도 모르는 현명한 지혜를 알려주겠네. 예로, 바보와 돈은 같이 못있는 다는 것을 아나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:564
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's a pity the Temple in Free Haven was destroyed in the fire.  That temple had the most magnificent altar.  The clerics there could raise people from the dead, even from just ashes!"
msgstr "프리 헤이븐에 있는 신전이 불에 타버린건 정말 안타까운 일이네. 그 신전에 아주 휼룡한 제단이 있었는데. 그 곳에 있는 슬레릭은 죽은 사람도 살릴수 있었는데!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:565
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The people who hire me often ask me to carry all kinds of junk I know they can do without.  Sorcerers have got to be the worst.  Pipes, tubes, glassware, junk– the works.  Just keep the best stuff with you and sell all that old junk!  But remember that selling to a general store will always get the worst prices."
msgstr "나를 고용한 사람들은 그들을 위해 그들의 모든 쓰레기들을 들어달라고 했네. 마도사는 아주 심했네. 파이프, 튜브, 유리제품, 쓰레기-등등, 단지 최고의 것만 싸고 나머지 오래된 쓰레기는 팔아버리게. 그러나 좋은 가게를 알아보는것을 잊지말고.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:566
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Resting while poisoned or diseased is not advisable.  You stand a good chance of never waking from a rest while under these conditions.  You should get yourself healed of the poison or disease before resting."
msgstr "독이나 병에 걸렸을때 쉬는 건 별로 추천할 방법이 아니네. 쉬어봤자 별로 효과가 없거든. 쉬기전에 먼저 그런 병을 치료하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:567
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The 'Imperial Regnan Navy' has been on a taxation spree recently, and this has raised the cost of sea travel and transportation tremendously.  Many businessmen simply cannot afford to pay insurance on their goods any longer.  Somebody has to do something about the troublesome Regnans."
msgstr "레그나 제국 해군는 최근에 과세로 흥청망청 논다더군, 그때문에 바다 여행과 운송이 무서워 졌다네. 많은 사업가들은 더 이상 보험에도 가입하지 않는다네. 누군가 뭔 조취를 취해야 할것 같네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:568
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Due to the recent problems, people aren't spending as much money as they used to.  I'm afraid the economy is going to suffer quite a bit from this, and everyone will soon feel it."
msgstr "요즘일로 인해 사람들은 예전같이 돈을 안 쓰지. 난 경제가 무너질 까봐 걱정되네. 곧 모두가 느낄꺼네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:569
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wise men are saying they think the Temple of Baa is behind all the disasters that have been happening recently.  I think they're probably right.  The temple offers free healing, but you should think twice before using it– people are suspicious of the temple, and you'll get a bad reputation for having anything to do with them."
msgstr "현명한 사람들은 바아 신전이 생긴이후로 많은 재앙이 일어났다고 말하지. 나도 그들이 맞는 것 같네. 그 들은 공짜로 힐링해주나 받기전에 한번 더 생각해보게. 사람들은 그들을 믿지않고 그들하고 어떻게든 연관되면 명성이 깍인다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:570
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard of fountains with magical waters that are supposed to exist in the lands.  I wish I could find one of these fountains; I'd love to prepare a meal with some magical water."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는 마법의 샘물이 존재한다더군, 난 그런 샘물을 찾아봤으면 좋겠네. 난 식사를 마법의물과 하고 싶거든.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:571
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't need to worry about this as much if you travel using the stagecoaches, but if you walk, be sure to rest on grass.  It's a lot more comfortable, and your travelling resources won't get used up as fast as if you try to sleep in the middle of the road."
msgstr "만일 당신이 마차를 이용한다면 걱정안해도 되나 만일 걷는다면 꼭 잔디위에서 쉬게. 훨씬 편하고 길 위에서 자면 여독이 잘 풀리지 않을걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:572
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't understand why there aren't any major Temples of Baa in or around any of the major cities or castles.  For some reason they all seem to be built in more remote places."
msgstr "큰 도시나 성에는 왜 큰 바아 신전가 없는지 모르겠네. 어떤 이유인지 그들은 항상 먼 곳에다 짓는 것 같네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:573
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most people don't know about it, but the Dragon Towers posted near each of the towns are quite dangerous to students of air.  They're meant to shoot down flying monsters, but they'll also shoot at flying sorcerers.  They shot at me, once, and I'm lucky to be alive to tell this tale!"
msgstr "많은 사람들이 잘 모르지만 드라곤 타워는 공기 마법 하는 사람들한테는 위험하다네. 그들은 날아다니는 적들을 쏴야하지만 날아다니는 마도사들도 쏜다네. 나한테도 한번 �i지만 난 운이 좋았지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:575
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Terrax was Enroth's first arch mage, and a sorcerer of incredible power.  He developed the foundations for elemental magic, and made the first basic discoveries into light and dark magic.  His crystal is said to hold some of the highest magical secrets."
msgstr "테락스는 엔로스의 첫번째 궁수 마법사였네, 그리고 엄청난 힘을가진 마도사 였네. 그는 원소 마법을 발견해냈고 그리고  빛과 어둠의마법을 발견해 냈네. 그의 크리스탈은 엄청난 마법의 비밀을 가지고 있다고 하지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:576
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Town Portal spell is the single best spell for travelling huge distances in Enroth.  Masters of water have firm control over where they go and when they can cast this spell.  It's expensive to learn, but well worth your while!"
msgstr "마을 이동 마법은 엔로스의 먼 거리를 여행할때는 최고이네. 물의 마스터는 그들이 어디 가고 싶을땐 이 마법을 사용해 가지. 배우기는 힘드나 가치가 있지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:577
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you can't learn to retreat, Guardian Angel at least provides a means of escape from certain death.  Anytime you explore a dangerous area, it's best to have this spell cast, just in case."
msgstr "만일 철수하는 것을 배운다면 최소한 가디안 엔젤이 죽음에서 탈출하는 것을 가르쳐줄걸세. 어떤 위험한 곳에 가도 이 마법이 있으면 든든하다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:578
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Temple of Baa has been giving a bad name to all religion.  People are beginning to think they're behind these disasters, and I'm beginning to agree.  The gods must surely be angry with their disgusting heresies!"
msgstr "바아 신전은 모든 종교들한테서 미움을 받고 있네. 사람들은 이제 모든 재앙 뒤에 그들이 있다고 생각하네. 그리고 나역시 그렇고. 신이 분명히 그들의 행위에 노여워할걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:579
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Can't count on savage beasts to be soothed by music.  That whole story about controlling beasts with music is just a myth.  I have scars to prove it!"
msgstr "미개한 적들은 음악으로 컨트롤 할수 없네. 그런 얘기는 이제 전설일 뿐이네. 난 그걸 증명할수 있는 상처가 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:580
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Castle Darkmoor, in the deepest part of the Mire of the Damned, houses the most powerful undead anywhere in the world.  That's how the rumor goes, anyway.  I've never actually seen the place, much less been inside of it.  I've made it out of the mire alive, though.  Not many people can say that."
msgstr "다크 모아는, 마이어 오브 댐드의 가장 깊은 곳에 있네, 가장 강한 언데드들의 집이지. 소문은 그렇게 도네. 난 가본적은 없지만 그곳 진창에서는 빠져나온적이 있네. 많은 사람들은 나 같은 경험이 없지만.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:581
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know it sounds bad, but the best job I ever had was Imperial Tax Collector for his Highness, Hareck IX.  We collected tax on a lot of ships, and good old Hareck always let us keep some of the booty– er, I mean proceeds.  <sighs> Yep.  Those were the days!"
msgstr "나쁘게 들리겠지만 내가 가진 최고의 직업은 하렉 9세를 위한 황실 세금 징수자였네. 우린 배마다 많은 세금을 받았고 하렉은 우리가 뒷돈을 가지게 해 주었네. 아니, 내 뜻은  생겼다는 거네. <웃으며> 그런 이미 옛날 일 이지!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:582
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The knight's Lord!  Osric's mastered everything there is in combat, from individual fighting to the logistics of siege warfare.  No one is a match for him in a battle!"
msgstr "기사들의 군주! 오스릭은 전쟁에 관한 모든 것을 마스터 했지. 기본 전투부터 물건 고치는 것까지. 아무도 그의 적수는 안 돼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:583
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can see the mark of doom about your face!  It is like a cloud that hangs just above your head, clouding your features and casting a shadow over your future.  Great and terrible adventures await you, my friend!"
msgstr "난 당신 얼굴에서 종말의 표시를 읽을 수 있네. 그것은 바로 당신 머리위에 있는 구름과 같네! 아주 큰 그림자를 가진, 위험한 모험이 당신을 기다리고 있다네. 친구여!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:584
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The priests of Baa are nice, even to gypsies.  You can tell a priest of Baa from the decorative cloaks they wear."
msgstr "바아의 주교들은 착하네,  집시들까지도. 당신은 바아의 주교들을 그들이 입고 있는 화려한 망토를 보면 알수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:585
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If someone won't talk to you, and begging doesn’t seem to be working, try a good, hefty bribe.  Gold loosens a tongue faster than charity."
msgstr "만일 누가 당신과 얘기를 안하고 구걸도 통하지 않는다면 뇌물을 한번 줘보게. 골드는 만사형통이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:586
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone wonders what secrets the ancient pyramid in Dragonsand holds.  Well, I know.  I went there under the protection of the King of the Dragons, and entered the pyramid.  It's the storehouse for all of the dragons' treasure!  It's packed to the brim with gold and artifacts.  Ahh, just the memory of the beauty brings a tear to my eye."
msgstr "모두들 다 드라곤 샌드의 고대 피라미드가 무슨 비밀을 감추고 있는지 궁금해 하네. 난 한번 드라곤왕의 보호아래 그 파라미드에 가본적이 있네. 그곳은 모든 드라곤들의 보물 창고였네! 그곳은 인공물과 골드로 가득 차 있네. 아, 그때 기억들이 내게 눈물을 가져오게 하는군."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:587
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gah!  Nothing has ruined my livelihood more than the banks.  Because it's nearly impossible to break into them, everyone stores all of their valuables there.  I can't find anything decent to take anymore."
msgstr "가!  은행처럼 내 생계를 파괴 시킨 것도 없다네. 모든 사람들은 그곳에 귀중품을 맡기고 그들을 뚫고 물건을 훔칠방법은 없다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:588
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's a shame about the king, what with his disappearance and all.  He must have done something to offend heaven to be so unlucky.  I guess he's getting what he deserves."
msgstr "왕이 저지른 모든 실수는 부끄러운 것이지. 그는 분명히 이런 상태에 대해 뭔가를 했어야만 하네. 그는 그가 한 행동에 보상받는것 같네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:589
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I was a hero with a sword and shield, instead of a peasant with a plow."
msgstr "난 네가 방패와 칼의 영웅이었으면 하네. 쟁기쟁이가 아닌. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:590
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Erik Applegate is the tailor most famous for working with alchemists to enchant belts.  Applegate has been working at this task for a few decades, now, and you can expect they've turned out some amazing stuff.  "
msgstr "에릭 아플리게이트는 연금술사들의 마법 벨트를 만드는 유명한 제단사네.  아플게이트는 이 일을 수십년간 해왔지만 이젠 신비의 지팡이를 만들고 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:591
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I ate some poppysnaps once.  They made me so sick I missed a day's work."
msgstr "난 약간의 포피스넵을 먹어본적이 있네. 그것은 나를 아프게 했고 난 그 날 일을 못했네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:592
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear there's a terrible blight infecting crops and plants in the west.  If it spreads here, I'll be ruined!"
msgstr "내가 듣기론 서쪽에 심한 전염병이 돌아 수확물과 식물들이 말라 죽었다더군. 만일 여기까지 퍼지면 난 파산이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:593
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With the destruction of Blackwoode and the stand-off in the Timber War, where am I going to get wood to keep making barrels?"
msgstr "블랙 숲가 파괴되고 팀버 전쟁 때문에 고립되면 난 어디서 통을 만들 나무를 얻지? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:594
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can find the shells of all these little animals along the beach and in the rivers when you're looking for good clay.  They must be very old.  There's a lot of shellfish in the Free Haven Harbor.  Oysters, I think.  So many of them, they clutter up all my good clay!"
msgstr "당신은 이 조그만 동물의 껍질을 강가에서 당신이 좋은 점토를 찻으려할때 발견할수 있을꺼네. 되게 오래된것들이고 프리 헤이븐 부두에 많이 있다네. 굴의 껍질이지. 그것들은 나의 점토를 흐트러뜨리지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:595
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fancy hats and pretty shirts are nice, but if you're going to be in combat you're better off with armor and a helmet."
msgstr "멋진 모자와 이쁜 옷은 멋있지. 그러나 전투할때는 헬멧과 갑옷이 최고지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:596
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you ever heard of the legendary pair of boots called Hermes?  It's said that the boots can boost their wearer's speed to godlike levels.  I'd love to see that someday!"
msgstr "혹시 헤르메스라고 부르는 전설의 부츠를 들오봤나? 소문에는 그 부츠는 입은자의 스피드를 신처럼 만들수 있다더군. 난 언젠가 꼭 한번 보고싶네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:597
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm not nearly as skilled as some of the people around here.  If I could cast spells, or heal, or fix things, more people would want to hire me.  Who needs ditches dug anymore?"
msgstr "이 근처에는 실력있는 자들이 없네. 만일 내가 마법을 쓸수 있으면, 많은 사람들이 나를 고용할텐데. 누가 더 이상 도랑파는 자들이 필요하겠나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:598
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "While the storms have been a big help with the windmills, the water mills are suffering from all the cold weather.  Every time the streams freeze up, no work gets done at the water mills."
msgstr "폭풍이 풍차들을 도왔을때 워터 밀은 차가운 물때문에 피해를 입었다네. 항상 추위가 닥치면 워터밀은 소용이 없다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:599
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The last Heavenly Forge stopped working about 130 years after the Silence.  No one has ever been able to repair the Forges."
msgstr "마지막으로 천상의 대장간은 침묵의 시대후에 130년뒤에 멈추었네. 아무도 대장간을 수리할수 없었지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:600
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "They say that the streets of Kalimar, the capitol city of Karigor, are made of fine jade, and the buildings all use it too.  Sounds beautiful, doesn't it?"
msgstr "사람들이 말하길 칼리말, 카리고의 수도, 좋은 비취로 만들어 졌다. 모든 건물들도. 멋있지 않나? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:601
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you hear about the orc ventriloquist whose dummy quit to find a new partner?"
msgstr "혹시 복화술을 쓰는 바보 오그레가 새 파트너를 찻고 있다는 얘기 들어봤나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:602
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's lots of ways of laying a trap that's sure to go off when someone opens a box or steps on a certain spot on the ground.  You'd do well to have a little skill in disarming traps if you're going to go adventuring.  Could save your life one day, you know."
msgstr "만일 누가 상자를 열때나 땅위의 어떤 장소를 밞았을 때를 위해 덫을 설치하는 건 여러가지 방법이 있네. 당신은 모험을 떠난다면 그런 기술을 갖추어야 하네. 언젠가는 당신의 생명을 구할수 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:603
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have pity on a poor soul and spare a few coins!  The gods will favor you if you do."
msgstr "불쌍한 영혼을 위해 코인을 좀 주게나!  신이 당신과 함께 할꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:604
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ever try sneaking up on a cow in the middle of the night?  They sleep standing up.  You can knock them over by just pushing hard.  Boy, that is one surprised cow when it wakes up!"
msgstr "밤에 소를 훔쳐본적이 있나? 소들은 서서 자기에 그냥 세게 밀면 기절시킨다네. 만일 일어난다면 그건 대단한 소라네!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:605
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who's Ivan Seling?  Only the greatest bow craftsman ever!  I wish I had a bow he made.  No one could be a better hunter than I!  Unfortunately, his bows have become very rare since the Timber Wars."
msgstr "이반 셀링이 누구냐고? 활의 대가이지! 난 그가 만든 활을 구했으면 좋겠네. 아무도 나보단 사냥을 못하지! 불행히도 그의 활은 팀버 전쟁후에는 매우 구하기 힘들어졌네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:606
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Given the lousy selling price of spell scrolls, I would just hold on to them and use them in emergencies.  Often they are scribed at a very high skill level, so you may find their use worthwhile."
msgstr "마법 스크롤에 비열한 가격을 준다면 난 위급할때를 위해 그걸 팔진 않겠네. 어쩔땐 매우 높은 마법을 구사할 수 있으니 가지고 있는게 더 가치가 있을걸세.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:607
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Roland's death is proof that the Ironfist line has lost the Mandate of Heaven.  It's time Enroth had new rulers!"
msgstr "롤랜드의 죽음은 아이언피스트가 하늘의 계시를 잃어버렸다는 걸 증명하지. 이젠 엔로스가 새왕이 필요할때야!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:608
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rubber for my stamps comes from southern Erathia's more tropical climate.  There's a plant that grows there that saves clerks 'round the world a lot of repetitive writing!"
msgstr "내 도장 고무는 남쪽 이라시아의 열대 기후에서 왔지. 그곳에는 나는 식물들이 많은 종이를 쓰는 사무원들을 살렸다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:609
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I had the opportunity to go on Roland's expedition.  Better to take action and fight bravely against the enemy than to stand around and wait for trouble."
msgstr "난 내가 롤랜드의 원정에 갈 기회가 있다면 좋겠네. 여기 않아서 문제를 기다리는 것보다 가서 적들과 싸우는게 훨씬 났네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:610
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't believe the strange weather we've been having lately.  I think I might just start betting on the weather.  I could probably make a killing!"
msgstr "난 이 이상한 날씨를 믿을수 없네. 난 그냥 날씨에 도박을 거는게 나을 것 같네. 난 아마 곧 죽을테니!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:611
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The king's disappearance is a disaster.  I know that it is hard to feel sympathy for the nobility, but an orderly kingdom is in everyone's best interests.  Losing the king doesn't create order, and there is no one who could possibly replace him without so much bloodshed it would make the Succession Wars look like a schoolgirl slap fight!"
msgstr "왕의 소멸은 재앙이네. 귀족들은 믿지 못하겠지만. 왕국은 모두의 관심사네. 왕을 읽어버린건 명령이 없다는 거고 아무도 상속 전쟁때처럼 피를 흘려가며 그 자리를 차지하려하진 않을걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:612
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Once you join the Temple of Baa, you'll be issued temple cloaks and be allowed to visit the Superior Temple of Baa located just east of Castle Kriegspire.  Everyone's going to join us sooner or later, so why wait?  The Superior Temple is quite a sight!"
msgstr "바아의 신전에 가입하면 망토를 받고 크리그스파이어에 있는 바아 신전를 방문할수 있네. 모두들 다 어차피 가입할텐데 뭘 기다리지? 바아 신전은 아주 멋있네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:613
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My mother told me that if I do bad things, the devils will come and get me!"
msgstr " 우리 엄마가 그러는데 내가 나쁜 짓을 하면 악마가 잡아간다대요."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:614
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't let the name fool you:  Abdul's discount stores offer really great quality for low, low prices.  He also didn't pay me to say that on Thursdays.  Honest."
msgstr "이름에 속지 말게 압둘의 디스카운트 가게는 좋은 품질을 대단히 싸게 판다네. 그는 이런얘기하는 것에도 계산을 안했네. 정말로."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:615
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Always have your best merchant do the talking when you buy and sell stuff through merchants.  If they can make a few more gold pieces off an unwary customer, not a one of them will hesitate, believe you me!"
msgstr "항상 최고의 상인을 보고 물건을 팔때나 살때 흥정을 시키게. 만일 그들이 조금이라도 더 싸게 방심한 고객들에게 팔면 한명도 망설이지 않을 꺼네. 믿게나."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:616
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many unusual magical effects occur during annual astrological events, such as the two solstices and equinoxes.  Eclipses, midnight, noon, comets; all these things can be magically significant.  The significant dates this year are:  March 20th, June 21st, September 23rd, and December 21st."
msgstr "많은 진귀한 마법은 점성술의 예언 이벤트에서 나타나네.  솔스티스 와 이퀴녹스 처럼.  월식새벽 정오, 혜성모든 이런 것들은 마법적으로 중요함을 시사하네.  올해의 중요한 날들은:  3월 20, 6월 21, 9월  23, 그리고 12 월 21."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:617
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In the land of Enroth, the shades of black and white have special magical significance.  If an item or a potion is colored white, it usually means that it provides a powerful beneficial effect without any sort of negative side effect.  If it is black, it provides the most powerful of effects, but with some sort of unpleasant side effect.  Be careful!"
msgstr "엔로스에는 그늘의 어두운 곳과 밝은 곳에 따라 특별한 마법이 있다. 아이템이나 포션이 하얀색이면 그건 보통 강한 파워를 나타내고 어두은 힘이아닌. 까만색이면 역시 강한 힘을 나타내나, 안 좋은 결과를 초래한다. 조심하게!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:618
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone has heard of Abdul's chain of discount stores.  Well, he also has an island resort where the old and tired can be rejuvenated for a hefty fee.  They say that Abdul himself lives on his resort Island and rarely visits the mainland."
msgstr "모두들 다   압둘의 디스카운트에 들어봤을 꺼네. 그는 또 늙고 지친사람들을 위해 섬 리조트를 가지고 있다. 사람들은 압둘이 그의 리조트에 살고 가끔 본토를 방문한다고 한다.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:619
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Druidic orders flourish in the grasslands near Silver Cove.  These druids will often arrange stone circles to perform ceremonies or worship nature."
msgstr "드루이드의 명령은 실버 코브 근처에 있는 글라스랜드에서 번영했다. 이 드루이들은 자주 스톤 서클을 만들어 그들의 장례식이나 예배를 가졌다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:620
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The mountains that make up the gap that leads to Paradise Valley are called the Sentinels.  Folk tales suggest they protected the valley from evil; now they serve as a warning to anyone foolish enough to want to enter."
msgstr "산에 갈라진 틈은 파라다이스 밸리로 이끌어주고 파수꾼이라고 부른다. 그 곳이 악마들로부터 계곡을 방어해준다; 이제 그들은 그곳에 함부로 들어가는 바보들에게 경고를 한다.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:621
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:651
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are many islands that can only be reached with a combination of boat travel and the Walk on Water spell.  Many of them are inhabited by the most horrible of monsters, but often the finest treasures can be found on them."
msgstr " 많은 섬들은 보트나 물위로 걷는 마법으로만 갈수 있다. 그런 곳에는 무시무시한 적들이 있으나 많은 보물들도 찾을수 있다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:622
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Travel by boat isn't instantaneous; it takes time.  Don't forget to factor in your travel times if you're running on a deadline."
msgstr "보트로 여행하는건 시간이 걸리지. 만일 데드라인이 있으면 시간 계산을 잘 해야하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:623
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There once was a temple built by Lord Stone in the city of Free Haven, but it was burned down by vandals a few years ago.  The quality of the altar there was so good that it permitted the priests to raise anyone from the dead, even eradicated bodies."
msgstr "프리 헤이븐에는 스톤 군주가 만든 신전이 하나있네, 그러나 몇년전에 야만인들이 다 태워버렸네.  제단의 품질은 너무 좋고 그것은 어떤 죽음에서도 되살릴수 있다네. 이라디케이티드 바디도 괜찮다네.."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:624
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A low level body spell, First Aid is very efficient in terms of its casting cost, but slow.  If you have plenty of time, it's the best way to heal damage."
msgstr "바디 주문의 낮은 레벨, 응급처치는 유능하지만 느리네. 만일 시간이 있으면 그게 대미지를 회복하는데 가장 좋다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:625
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The pinnacle of light spells, Divine Intervention does just that– calls for Eyla, goddess of healing, to intercede on your behalf and heal your group to full life.  Her price, a part of your life-force causing you to age a few years, is sometimes well worth her attention."
msgstr "빛의 주문의 작은 탑, 신성한 중제는 힐링의 신 이야라를 부른다. 당신의 부름을 받아 당신 파티들의 생명을 꽉 차게 해준다. 그 대가로는 당신의 나이를 늙게 한다. 그러나 가끔은 필요하다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:626
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Training centers are the best way to increase your level, but they can get awfully expensive later on.  Personally, I recommend Abdul's Discount Training centers to avoid excessive training costs."
msgstr "훈련장는 당신 실력을 올리기 가장 좋은 곳이네. 그러나 그들은 나중에 꼭 대가를 요구하지.  개인적으로 난 압둘 디스카운트 훈련장를 추천하겠네. 나중에 바가지 쓰지 않기 위해.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:627
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No teacher in the world can equal the Oracle in Free Haven.  The only catch is that to visit the Oracle, you need to have the unanimous approval of the High Council."
msgstr "어떤 선생도 프리 헤이븐에 오라클과 비교할수 없네. 오라클을 방문하기 위해선 의회의 승인이 필요하다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:628
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One advantage of the sword and the dagger is that skilled users can wield a blade in their left hands instead of using a shield.  Even a fluff head like yourself should understand why that could help."
msgstr "검과 단검을 사용하는데 이점은 다른 한손에는 방패를 들수 있다는 거지. 당신같은 돌머리도 그ㅔ 왜 도움이 되는지 이해가 갈꺼야. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:629
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know how easy it is for us warriors to scoff at the weak mages out there, but they can make themselves useful at times.  Many of their spells can increase your fighting ability by making you faster, or hit better, or more resistant to damage.  As long as they can pull their own weight, mages make excellent travelling companions."
msgstr "나도 아네, 전사들이 약한 철퇴를 쓰는걸 비웃는 다는걸.  그러나 그들도 제대로 쓰진 못하네. 많은 마법이 당신의 속력를 올려주지. 아니면 더 강하게 때리게 해주거나. 그런 걸 합쳐서 재대로 쓸수만 있다면 철퇴는 모험의 훌룡한 동반자가 될 걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:630
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Travelling spells represent the most important class of spells for all magic-using people.  Not only do they let you get to places you couldn't get to without  magic, but they let you visit things like health and magic-boosting fountains in remote areas, and use those abilities in dangerous dungeons and castles where you need them."
msgstr "여행 주문은 모든 사람들한테 다 중요한 마법이지. 그냥 당신이 마법없이 갈수없는 곳만 데려다 주는게 아니네. 그리고 당신을 마법의 샘, 체력의 샘등에도 데려다 주네. 아주 멀리있는. 그런 능력을 당신이 위험한 던전에 있거나 성에 있을때 필요할때 사용하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:631
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Agar's 'finest' creations, these floating heads have surprising intelligence and great power at their command.  Their gaze is enough to put you to sleep.  Rumors abound of even more powerful eyes that can cause panic or even complete insanity."
msgstr "아가르의 '최고의' 생명체, 이 부동적인 머리는 놀라운 지성과 강한 힘을 가지고 있네. 그들의 응시는 당신을 잠재울 정도지. 소문에는 더 강한 눈은 사람을 공포에 빠뜨리거나 정신이상 까지 만들어 버리네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:632
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few Guilds of the Self exist in the lands.  Combining knowledge of mind, spirit, and body, these guilds offer a more generalized study than any of the individual guilds can offer.  Their knowledge of the individual schools isn't nearly as complete, however."
msgstr "몇개의 셀프 길드 만 이 땅에 존재하네.  마인드. 스피릿 그리고 바디,의 지식을 섞어놓은 이 길드는 다른 길드보다 더 연구해왔네. 그들의 지식은 끝이 없다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:633
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't let the name fool you:  Abdul's Discount stores offer really great quality for low, low prices.  He also didn't pay me to say that on Thursdays.  Honest."
msgstr "이름에 속지 말게:  압둘의 디스카운트 상점은 정말로 싼, 아주 싼 가격에 물건을 내 놓네. 그는 목요일 날 얘기해주는 이 얘기를 해주는 것도 돈을 안 주었네. 정말로.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:634
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In the north, businesses are controlled by a few monopolies that prevent competition by any means necessary, even by extortion.  The Shadow Guild and the Thieves' Guild have already started to clash over rights in areas like Silver Cove and Free Haven."
msgstr "북쪽에 사업은 몇 명의 사람에 의해 독점되고 있다더군. 엄청난 에누리를 착취하는 것 같네. 쉐도우 길드와 도적 길드는 벌써 실버 코브 와 프리 헤이븐처럼 충돌하고 있다더군."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:635
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Take my word for it when I say the Mire is a bad place to find yourself at night.  The Necromancer's Guild 'retired' to the swamp after Archibald's defeat in the Succession War, and evidence of their handiwork is walking around the swamp freely."
msgstr "나의 충고를 새겨듣게. 마이어는 밤에 는 위험한 곳이네. 네크로맨서 길드는 상속 전쟁에서 아치발드가 패한후  '사라졌다' 였네. 그러나 습지를 걸어다니면 증거를 찾을수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:636
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can avoid a lengthy jail sentence for any crimes you've been committing by receiving forgiveness at the temples.  If you run into a guard before receiving forgiveness for significant crimes, you could be looking at a year in jail, or even longer.  "
msgstr "당신이 감옥에 가기전에 범죄를 저지른 전력을 신전에서 용서를 받으면 다 없앨 수 있지. 만일 당신이 용서를 받기전에 가드에게 붙잡히면 아마 감옥에서 일년 아니면 더 오래 있어야 할걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:637
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many monsters won't reason with you, no matter how eloquently you phrase your requests.  You need to recognize hopelessly aggressive monsters and be rid of them as fast as possible."
msgstr "많은 몬스터들은 당신한테 원한이 없네. 당신이 어떻게 임무를 완수하든. 어쨌든 이 세계를 구하기 위해서는 많은 적들을 죽여야 하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:638
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many people don't really care for tinkers because we wander and do odd jobs that guilds would like to charge a lot for.  But you like me, don't you?"
msgstr "많은 사람들은 땜장이들한테 별 신경을 안 쓰지. 왜냐면 우리는 방랑하고 길드가 돈 많이 주는 일만 하기 때문이지. 당시도 나 같지 않나? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:639
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With all the troubles that have been going on, business has been great for me.  People have found the need to lock up their possessions to try and protect them from marauders or looters.  It's good to know I can give people at least a small sense of security in these dark times."
msgstr "문제가 생길때마다 니힌테는 좋은 사업이 되지. 사람들은 문을 꼭 닫고 강도들이나 범죄자들 한테서 자기들을 보호하려고 하지.  난 사람들에게 그럴때마다 이 어두은 시간에 대한 안전에 대한 센스를 주지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:640
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I bought a treasure map from this treasure map salesman I met awhile ago and it says the dread pirate captain Silveka buried his treasure under a tree on one of the  islands east of Free Haven."
msgstr "난 보물지도 장사에게 보물지도를 샀네. 그 말로는 무서운 해적선장 실베카가 프리헤이븐의 동쪽의 섬에 있는 나무 밑에 보물을 묻었다는군.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:641
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Loretta is my kind of person.  She makes her own luck, and it's almost always good.  She's got confidence, and that's something you can't just buy.  I'm sure that's the reason she's so successful: a confident, positive outlook."
msgstr "로레타는 친절한 사람이네. 그녀는 그녀만의 운을 만들고 항상 좋지. 그녀는 신용이 있고 그건 그냥 살수 없는 거라네. 아마 그래서 그녀는 성공한것 같네. 항상 밝지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:642
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm sure you've seen the obelisks scattered around the Kingdom.  They say there's a riddle in them just waiting to be solved that shows where to find a great horde of buried treasure.  No one's ever done it, though.  At least, no one I've ever heard of."
msgstr "난 당신이 분산된 방첨탑을 왕국근처에서 봤다는 것을 확신하네. 그들은 그곳에 이상한 수수께끼가 풀리길 기다리며 풀면 엄청난 보물이 묻힌 곳을 알려준다고 하지. 아무도 하지 못했네. 내가 듣기로는. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:643
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Aye, I've worked in Osric's army before, tending camp and preparing food and cataloguing supplies.  He's a fair man, and an excellent leader.  He knows how to keep his troops motivated, let me tell you."
msgstr "예, 난 전에오스릭의 군대에 있었지. 캠프를 치고 음식을 구하고 여러가지를 준비했었지. 그는 공정한 사람이었네. 그는 어떻게 여행하는지를 잘 알고 있었지. 내가 말해주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:644
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are only three certainties in life:  The first is death.  The second is taxes.  And the third is the fact that you'll hear that joke sooner or later."
msgstr "삶에는 세가지 확실해야 할께 있네: 첫째는 죽음, 둘째는 세금. 셋째는 농담따먹기지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:645
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Banks are a safe place to store money.  Unless you personally own a secure, guarded vault, your best bet is to put your money in a bank.  You don't collect interest on your money, but because the banks don't lend out money, you don't have to worry about losing it."
msgstr "은행은 돈 맡기기엔 제일 좋은 장소이네. 당신이 당신만의 금고를 가지고 있기 전에. 이자는 받지 못하지만, 읽어버릴 염려는 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:646
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One of the few exports the Islands of Regna have going for them, besides piracy, is sugar, cocoa, and cinnamon.  If it weren't for those, I'd say we should ship the Temple of Baa over to Regna and let them sink all those islands!"
msgstr "수입상 중 하나가 레그나섬에 갔었지. 설탕과 코코아 그리고 향료를 가지고. 그들이 아니었으면 아마 우리는 바아의 신전로 갔었을 꺼네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:647
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Different inns charge different amounts for the food they sell, but don't be fooled.  The more expensive food will generally last longer than the cheaper stuff.  It's important to have food that will last when you plan to be out for long periods of time."
msgstr "여관마다 음식에 대해 다다르게 청구하네. 그러나 속지말게. 비싼게 싼것보다 오래가네. 어디 갈때 음식물을 챙기는것은 중요한 거네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:648
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't say I know much about travel over water, but from what I've heard, you can either take a ship to the islands, or Walk on Water to get there.  Ships all have complicated itineraries– be sure to ask the shipping company before you book passage when they do return voyages!"
msgstr "난 물위로 하는 여행은 잘 모르지만 섬에는 배나 물위를 것는 마법을 이용해 갈수 있다는 군. 배를 이용할때는 확실히 부킹하게! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:649
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's a shame that Catherine was pulled away to her father's funeral so soon after Roland's death.  That poor woman has suffered too many tragedies too soon.  It's even sadder that she's leaving Nicolai here while she's gone.  He's too young to have to deal with all of this on top of the crises affecting the kingdom."
msgstr "캐서린이 아버지 장례식에 롤랜드의 죽음도 모르고 간 것은 부끄러운 일이지. 이 불쌍한 여자에겐 너무 많은 비극이 한번에 일어났네. 그리고 니콜라이를 두고 간것도 안 좋지, 그는 너무어려 왕국의 권모술수에 대처하기 어려울텐데.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:650
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Necromancer's Guild first appeared publicly during Archibald's brief reign 10 years ago.  They were around before that, but they kept themselves secret, knowing people wouldn't appreciate them.  When Roland became king, he outlawed the guild and ordered the leaders arrested.  None of them stayed around long enough for that, though, and now they're nowhere to be found."
msgstr "네크로맨서 길드는 처음으로 공식화된게 10년전 아치발드가 잠깐 통치했을 때네. 그전에도 있었지만 비밀이였지. 그러나  롤랜드가 왕이 �瑛뻑� 그는 불법단체라 하고 리더를 체포했네. 그때부터 그들은 없어지기 시작했고 이젠 찾을수 없네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:652
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dragons are not only adept combatants, they are wily spell casters.  Few people appreciate the dragons' grasp of magic, and many cocky warriors find themselves unprepared for the dragons' true power."
msgstr "드라곤들은 그냥 싸우기만 하는것이 아니네. 그들은 마법도 부린다네. 몇몇만 보았을뿐이고 많은 전사들은 용과 싸울때 용의 진정한 힘을 알게 되지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:653
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Erathia is out of even Town Portal's long range.  That continent is a full six week's worth of sea travel away.  There are a lot of islands and sub-continents between here and there, all of them filled with petty kingdoms and tribes looking to rob travelers of their valuables, their freedom, or their lives."
msgstr "이라시아는 멀고 타운 포탈을 할수도 없네. 그곳은 바다로 6주나 가야하지.  가는길에는 많은 섬들을 지나쳐야 하고 그 섬들마다 조그만 왕국이나 도적들이 있어 여행자들을 호시탐탐 노린다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:654
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've seen a few devils in my travels, and they are fierce to behold.  I've had to rescue a few people from devil attacks, and I  was amazed at their coordination and prowess in combat.  They must have excellent training to be that proficient."
msgstr "난 여행도중 몇 명의 악마들을 보았네. 그들은 잔인해 보였지.  난 몇 명을 악마의 공격으로부터 구해냈지. 그들은 상당한 기술을 가지고 있더군, 그들은 숙련되기까지 상당한 노력을 했을꺼야.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:655
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I fear the Night of Shooting Stars was an omen of the worst kind.  It didn't take long for our good king to disappear after that night, and for the Temple of Baa to arrive, did it?  And all this talk about devils in the west…these are evil omens indeed!"
msgstr "내가 느끼기엔 슈팅스타의 밤에 이 최악의 상태의 징조였던것 같네. 그런 일후에 우리의 좋은 왕이 사라졌고 바아 신전가 생겨낳지, 아닌가? 그리고 모두들 서쪽의 악마에 대해 얘기하지… 아마 악마의 징조였던것 ��네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:656
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Once I was hired by a noble to entertain him and his wife on Star Lake, playing music while they picnicked in a boat. When we approached the south end of the island at the center of the lake, we saw the most hideous beast– a woman with snakes for hair– on the shore of the island.  She took one look at my noble benefactors and they turned to stone before my eyes.  It was all I could do to row away before I joined them."
msgstr "내가 한번 스타 호수의 귀족들에게 고용되 그의부인과 그를 위해 보트를 타고  음악을 연주하다가 호수 중앙의 섬끝에 도착했을때 우리는 엄청난 괴물을 보았지. 머리카락이 뱀인 여자를. 그녀는 내 눈앞에서 나의 주인과 눈이 마주쳤고 내 주인은 바로 돌이 되버렸네. 내가 할수 있었던건 그냥 도망가는 일뿐이었네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:657
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Flight spells provide a way to get past mountains and walls and other such obstacles.  There is a limit on how high you can fly with the Fly spell, though.  Some peaks rise too high to pass with magical flying."
msgstr "날아다니는 마법은 산이나 벽, 또 어떤 장애물도 상관 없이 빨리 이동시켜주네.  그러나 날수 있는 지역이 있다네. 어떤 산은 너무 높아 통과 할수도 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:658
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hareck IX has got to be the best leader in the world.  Not only is he the only Emperor in the world, he's the only leader I've ever heard of that does common work like the rest of his people.  Like when there's taxes to be collected on shipping, Hareck's right there with the rest of us.  Boarding, fighting, cursing, drinking, whatever.  Hareck's a real down to earth kind of Emperor."
msgstr "하렉 9세 는 세상의 최고의 리더 였다네. 그가 단지 황제여서가 아니라, 그는 그의 사람들을 행복하게 해준 유일한 왕이었다더군, 예로 해운을 위한 세금을 걷을때도 그는 우리편에 서서 같이 싸우고 마시고 놀아주었다네. 그는 정말 위대한 왕이 였다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:659
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Every squire knows that a weapon is of no use broken.  Every warrior should know how to repair his own equipment, or be at the whim of the smiths' schedules.  Knowing how to repair your weapon is part of mastering your weapon."
msgstr "모든 기사들은 무기들이 쉽게 망가진다는걸 알지. 모든 전사들은 망가진 무기를 고칠 줄 알거나 아니면 대장장이의 스케줄에 맞춰 수리를 부탁해야 하네. 무기를 고치는 것도 당신의 무기를 마스터하는데 일부분이라네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:660
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Of all the malicious mischief makers in the world, Necromancers are by far the worst.  Their 'science' is very new, and they know just enough to get themselves and the rest of the world in trouble."
msgstr "모든 악의있는 피해를 입히는 자들중에서는 네크로맨서가 최악이라네. 그들의 과학은 신비롭지만 그들은 어떻게 그들과 세상사람들을 재앙에 빠뜨리는지 알고 있다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:661
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Resting revives your body and mind.  Camping gives you a chance to relax, talk, celebrate– to just unwind a little and rest off some of the stress and worry of the remainder of the day.  "
msgstr "휴식은 당신의 마음과 몸을 회복시키네. 캠핑은 당신에게 쉴 찬스와 이야기하고 즐길게 해주네-스트레스를 날려버리고 지난날의 걱정을 뿌리칠수 있지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:662
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A wise negotiator once said, 'On whether 'tis better to be loved or to be feared, choose both.  But if a choice between the two must be made, choose fear.'– Words to live by, my friend.  Words to live by."
msgstr "현명한 자가 한번은 말하길, '사랑과 용기에 서 하나를 택하라면 용기를 고르라 했네' - 말은 틀린게 없네, 정말이지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:663
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Up north, it's not uncommon for wealthy businessmen to preserve their position in the market by hiring thugs to trim their competition.  Trade wars can become quite literally wars.  It's best to not get involved in any merchant disputes."
msgstr "북쪽위에는 유망한 사업가들이 그들의 라이벌들을 사람들을 고용해 제거하고 하는게 흔하지 않네. 무역전쟁은 말그대로 진짜 전쟁이 될수도 있네. 제일 좋은건 그런일에 끼지 않는 걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:664
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some of the best perception and lock-picking teachers hang out in Thieves' Guilds."
msgstr "어떤 자물쇠 마스터들은  도적 길드에 있다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:665
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Even if King Roland did something bad to cause heaven to abandon him, I don't suppose that his son Nicolai deserves it.  After all, he's only ten years old.  Maybe heaven will smile upon him and give him heaven's mandate to rule wisely.  That would be nice."
msgstr "만일 왕 롤랜드가 뭔가 잘못된짓을 해 하늘이 그를 포기할 짓을 했더라도 난 아들인 니콜라이가 책임 질 필요가 없다고 생각하네. 그는단지 열살이고 어쩌면 하늘이 그에게 미소를 지으며 현명하게 나라를 다스리라고  계시를 줄지 모르지. 그러면 좋을텐데.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:666
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't leave the towns and castles without some bandit taking away what little money I actually manage to save.  Why can't the guards do something about all the brigands?"
msgstr "난 타운과 성을 강도들에게 돈을 뜯기진 않고는 떠날수 없네. 왜 가드들은 아무 조취도 안 취하는 거지?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:667
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Indigo from Regna was cut off a decade ago when the king outlawed trade with that pirate kingdom.  I can understand why he did that, but I sure am tired of the indigo shortage.  I can't dye anything blue or purple!"
msgstr "레그나의 남색은 수십년 전에 왕이 해적왕국과의 무역을 금지시켰을때 떨어져 나갔네. 난 그가 왜 그랬는지 이해가 안가고 아마 그는 남색의 부족함에 질려버렸던것 같네. 난 남색이나 보라색없이는 어떤것도 염색을 할수가 없네!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:668
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What do you want from me?  I'm just a worker; I'm not here to amuse you."
msgstr "내개서 뭘 원하지? 난 그냥 노동자일뿐이야.; 난 당신을 위해 여기있는게 아니야.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:669
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It sure has been raining a lot, lately.  It would be terrible if the clouds ran out of rain and the rivers ran dry because all the water had been used up during these storms.  If the rivers all ran dry, I'd be ruined!"
msgstr "비가 많이 와야만 하네. 만일 구름이 비를 못 뿌려 강물이 말라버린다면 정말 끔찍할걸세. 만일 강물이 말라버린다면 난 파산이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:670
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Chests and boxes aren't the only things that can hold treasure.  Barrels can also hold valuables, so don't forget to search them, too."
msgstr "상자나 박스만이 보물들을 가지고 있지. 통은 오래된 물건들을. 그러니 항상 조사하는 것을 잊지말게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:671
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shipping has slowed from Erathia, which is where I get all the paints I need for my work.  That's the land the queen comes from.  I wonder if there's a problem over there?"
msgstr "해운업은 이라시아에서 부터 늦어지고 있네. 내가 나의 일을 위해 페인트를 고급받고 여왕님도 그곳 출신이시지. 혹시 그곳에 무슨 문제가 있나?   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:672
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't know who makes them, but every Baa priest has a cloak with the symbol of Baa on it.  I wish I had the job of making all those cloaks, I'd be rich!"
msgstr "난 바아의 심볼이 들어가 있는 망토를 누가 만드는지는 모르네. 그러나 내가 만들었으면 좋겠네. 그럼 난 부자가 될텐데!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:673
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "History is the sound of soft-soled slippers going down the stairs while hobnail boots climb up the stairs."
msgstr "역사는 아주 부드러운 슬리퍼로 계단을 내려가는 것과 큰 못을 박은 부츠로 계단을 올라가는 소리를 합쳐 논거네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:674
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I sure wish I could learn to do something other than dig ditches, but I'm just not bright enough."
msgstr "난 구덩이 파는 것말고 다른 기술을 배워야 하지만 난 그만큼 똑똑하지가 않네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:675
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Flour's been going bad early this year, even though it's properly stored in sealed containers.  I wonder what's going on?"
msgstr "밀가루 상태가 올해는 빨리 안좋아지고 있네. 콘테이너에 꽉 봉해놓아도. 대체 무슨일이 일어나는지 궁금하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:676
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't forget that you can store things in cabinets.  Chests aren't the only places to keep your treasure."
msgstr "캐비닛에도 물건을 저장할수 있다는 걸 잊지말게. 상자만이 보물을 담을수 있는게 아니지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:677
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The roads of Enroth are made of flagstones from the hills near Kriegspire.  They were placed long ago by the people who first settled Enroth, and those first roads have never eroded or decayed in any way.  Very odd."
msgstr "엔로스의 길은 크리그스파이어 주변의 언덕의 반석으로 만들어졌다네. 그것들은 엔로스를 처음 만든자들에 의해 만들어졌네. 그리고 그 길들은 절대 부식하거나 하는 법이 없네. 대단하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:678
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What do you call a jittery sorceress? A twitch!"
msgstr "신경과민의 마도사를 뭐라고 하지?\n\n신경경련의 마도사!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:679
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dark days are upon us, mark my words!  Never have I seen so many monsters and so little game."
msgstr "암흑의 날은 거의 다가왔네. 명심하게. 난 이렇게 많은 괴물들과 이런 작은 게임은 본족이 없네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:680
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nothing is worse than trying to beg near Silver Cove.  All the people there are so greedy!"
msgstr "실버 코브에서는 구걸하는 것먼큼 가치없는 일이 없네. 그곳 사람들은 모두 탐욕스럽거든!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:681
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Shadow Guild is the best place to find a buyer willing to take stolen cattle.  There's nothing they won't do!  They're great, AND they charge less than the regular Thieves' Guild.  You gotta try them out!"
msgstr "쉐도우 길드는 훔친 동물을 사기에는 최고의 장소라네. 그들이 못하는건 아무것도 없다네. 그들은 대단하고 또 가격도 보통 도적 길드보다 싸게 판다네. 한번 사용해보게! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:682
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With the lack of animals and all the problems lately, I should probably just become a bounty hunter.  I could probably make a fortune tracking down all the lawbreakers."
msgstr "동물들이 부족하고 많은 문제들이 생긴만큼, 난 그냥 현상금 사냥꾼이나 해야겠네. 아마 난 법을 어긴 자들을 잡아 부자가 될수 있을꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:683
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The most demanding master to have to work for is Osric Temper.  No one else shouts as much, or talks as quickly during a dictation.  I will say this though– of all the Lords, he is the only that seems to be on top of the devil situation we all know is so serious.  Unpleasant to work for to be sure, but he has the interests of the kingdom at heart."
msgstr "가장 많은것을 요구하는 마스터는 오스릭 템퍼일걸세. 아무도 그렇게 고함치거나 받아쓰기 하는데 그렇게 빨리 말하지는 않을걸세. 아마 다른 군주하고 비교했을때 그만이 악마들의 생각을 알고 진지하게 받아들이는것 같네. 일하는건 기분 나쁘지만 그는 진심으로 왕국을 걱정하고 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:684
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you spoken with Baa today?  Let me help you come to grips with your problems and show you a better way; it will only take a little of your time."
msgstr "오늘 바랑 얘기한적이 있나? 내가 당신 문제를 도와주고 더 좋은 길을 가르쳐주지; 금방 끝나네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:685
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A lot of people complain about taxes, but I just want to say I like them.  How could clerk's offices function without tax money?  How would people get permits and licenses without us?"
msgstr "많은 사람들이 세금에 대해 불평을 하지, 그러나 난 그것이 좋다네. 그렇게 안 받으면 어떻게 세금걷는 사무원들이 살아가겠나? 어떻게 사람들이 우리들없이 신분증을 받겠나?   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:686
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The towers outside the towns shoot at flying creatures that we'd normally have a difficult time handling."
msgstr "타운 바깥쪽의 타워는 우리가 잡기 어려운 날으는 생물들을 쏜다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:687
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most people don't have confidence in Nicolai.  I'll bet you 3 to 1 odds that he gets thrown out before his next birthday.  What'd ya say?"
msgstr "니콜라이는 사람들의 신임을 얻지 못했네. 내가 3과1의 홀수로 그가 다음 생일전까지 왕좌에서 쫓겨나리라고 도박을 걸겠네. 자, 어떤가? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:688
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I do hope that the queen returns from her trip to her homeland soon.  Even if she is a foreign queen she will supply some semblance of order to our besieged kingdom."
msgstr "난 여왕이 그녀의 고향에서 빨리 돌아왔으면 좋겠네. 그녀가 타지 사람이라도 여왕이니 뭔가를 할수 있지 않을까.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:689
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No one knows where the Supreme Temple of Baa is, but I've heard only full-fledged priests and high temple officials are allowed to visit."
msgstr "아무도   바아 신전 가 어디 있는지 모르네. 내가 알기론 단 높은 주교와 높은 사무원들 많이 갈수 있다더군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:690
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do goblins have names?  Or families?  Why are they evil?"
msgstr "고블린들은 이름이 있나? 가족은? 왜 그들은 악마지? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:691
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best all around weapon shop in Enroth is the Knight's Paradise, run by Eric Regent.  You can't buy better weapons anywhere else in the kingdom. "
msgstr "엔로스의 최고 무기상점은 기사들의 천국이고, 주인은 에릭 리젠트이네. 여기 말고는 더 좋은 무기를 파는데는 없네. 왕국 안에서는. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:692
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You know, metal for arms and armor used to be a lot cheaper before Snergle wrested the dwarven throne away from Rocklin, the old King of the Dwarves.  Sure would be nice if someone fixed Snergle's wagon."
msgstr "알다시피, 갑옷과 무기들을 만드는 메탈은 스너글이 락크린의 드워프 왕좌를 버리기 전에는 무지하게 싸네, 드워프들의 오래된 왕. 누군가가 스너글의 무기를 고치면 멋있을 꺼네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:693
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Once you are a member of a particular type of magic guild, you won't need to keep buying membership into different branches of the same guild.  A member of the Guild of Fire, for instance, need not buy membership in another Fire Guild in order to take advantage of their services."
msgstr "당신이 만일 마법 길드의 멤버라면, 같은 길드의 브랜치 멤버십을 계속 살 필요가 없네.  예를 들어 불의 길드멤버라면 ,다른 불의 길드의 멤버쉽을 살 필요가 없다는 거네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:694
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Albert Newton is the Lord of Mist, and he is truly the patron of all who hold dear the mystical arts.  If you have a question about magic, Mist is where you should look for an answer."
msgstr "알버트 뉴튼은 미스트 군주이네. 그가 바로 신비적인 마법의 최고자이네. 만일 마법에 대해 궁금증이 있다면 미스트에서 답을 찾게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:695
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware travel in the swamps south of Castle Temper.  The undead are said to roam about freely, unafraid of the living or the sun."
msgstr "템퍼성의 남쪽을 여행할때는 습지대를 조심하게. 태양도 무서워하지 않는 언데드가 살고있으니. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:696
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I never seen one, but I've heard stories of magical portals– doorways– that lead instantly from one part of Enroth to another.  That would take all the fun out of travelling, wouldn't it?"
msgstr "난 본적이 없지만 - 소문은 들었네. 마법적인 것, 엔로스에서 다른 곳으로 순간이동 할수 있는것. 그것은 아마 여행의 즐거움을 뺐어가는 것이네. 그렇지 않나? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:697
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Aptly named, Dragonsand is full of both dragons and sand.  I think the most powerful dragons are more than a match for the devils, or the devils would have long ago taken over the desert."
msgstr "이름답게, 드라곤 샌드는 드라곤과 모래 로 가득차 있다. 내 생각에는 강한 드래곤은 악마들 보다 훨씬 강한것 같다. 그렇지 않았으면 악마들이 그 사막을 뺐었을테니까.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:698
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:728
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is said that one of the islands east of Free Haven hides the buried treasure of Silveka the pirate.  Now, I know these stories are a dime dozen, but I swear this one is true!  If only the map could be found…"
msgstr "프리 헤이븐 동쪽의 섬에는 해적 실베카의 보물을 감추고 있다고 한다. 이런 얘기는 많으나 이 얘기는 진짜라고 확신한다. 만일 지도만 찾을수 있으면…  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:699
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Isle of the Hermit is a fairly large volcanic isle in the southwest of Enroth. No one goes there and it's more barren than even the wastelands.  It was named when Lord Terrance made a joke about a hermit living there to get away from it all."
msgstr "은둔자의 섬은 엔로스 남서쪽의 거대한 활화산 섬이네. 아무도 그곳에 가려고 하지않지. 그 섬의 이름은 테란스 군주가 은둔자보고 그곳에 살라고 농담하다 붙혀졌지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:700
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All of the Necromancers in the Kingdom have been banished, happily, except the ones who took their black art too far and became liches.     The worst of those liches, Archibald's former general Lord Corlagon, has taken up residence in the south eastern portion of the Mire of the Damned."
msgstr "왕국안의 모든 네크로맨서들은 사라졌네. 행복하게도, 그들의 어둠의마법을 뺐어간 자만 빼고. 그 자는  알치발드의 옜 장군, 콜라고 군주 는 마이어 오브 댐드의 남동쪽을 차지했네.."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:701
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It IS possible to combine compound potions with simple or compound potions to try and make complex potions.  Though complex potions are the strongest you can make, the process is dangerous.  Mixing the wrong potions can cause violent reactions and set off dangerous explosions."
msgstr "합성 포션과 심플한, 아니면 합성포션을 섞어 복잡한 포션을 만들수 있네. 이 복잡한 포션은 당신이 만들수 있는것 중에 가장 강하다네. 위험하지. 잘못 섞으면 폭파되 대미지를 입힐수도 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:702
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know only one formula for a complex potion– the combination of a compound potion with either a simple or compound potion.  Mix a potion of resistance with a potion of cure poison, then take that potion and mix it with a potion of protection, and you end up with a potion of divine cure."
msgstr "난 단지 복잡한 포션을 섞는 공식만 알고 있네.- 난 복잡한 포션의 한 공식만 하네.- 콤비네이션 의 복합한 포션과 간단한  복합한 포션이지. 저항의 포션을 해독 포션과  섞게. 그리고 그 포션을 ,프로텍션 포션과  섞은면  포션 오브 디바인 큐어가 되네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:703
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thief and Mercenary Guilds are the places you go to learn all kinds of skills.  Different guilds teach different skills, so if one doesn't have what you're looking for, try the guilds in a different town."
msgstr "도적과 용병길드 에서는 거기서 모든 기술을 배울수 있네. 다른 길드는 다른 기술을 가르치지. 그러니 만일 찾는게 이 길드에 없으면 다른 길드에 있을수도 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:704
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Quests aren't anything magical, they're simply opportunities...  Opportunities to learn a great deal or to make a great deal of money.  Try not to pass up the chances you get."
msgstr "모험은 마법적이고 신비하지 않네. 단 기회일 뿐이지…. 좋은 경험을 하거나 많은 돈을 벌수 있지. 그러니 주어진 기회를 놓치지 말게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:705
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Try to equip everyone in your group with a bow, crossbow, or some other ranged weapon.  You can do a lot of damage to an opponent as they approach you, and ranged weapons let you attack flying creatures that otherwise couldn't be hurt."
msgstr "당신 파티들을 보우, 크로스 보우, 아니면 다른 무기로 무장시키도록 하게. 적들에게 상당한 대미지를 입힐수 있고 날아다니는 적들도 맞출수 있네. 다른것은 못하지만.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:706
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most warriors like to train in a variety of weapons.  Usually, one weapon is trained higher than the others, but few are ignored.  This provides great flexibility in combat, because you can use the weapon that is most effective against the enemy you face."
msgstr "많은 전사들은 많은 무기를 연습하고 싶어하지. 보통 한 무기를 잘 쓰면 다른 무기는 그렇지 못하지. 이 것은 전쟁에서 융통성을 발휘하게 하지.  왜냐면 전쟁중에는 적한테 제일 잘 드는 무기들을 쓰면 되니까. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:707
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some monsters are resistant to nearly all magic spells.  If you run into one of these monsters, don't despair– use your magic to heal your warriors and strengthen their blows."
msgstr "어떤 괴물은 모든 마법에 저항력이 있다. 이런 적들을 만났을때 피하지 말게. 마법으로 체력을 올려 힘으로 닐려버리게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:708
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Albert Newton is a brilliant magical researcher, but his research always seems to take a long time to complete.  He certainly knows quite a bit about sorcerers and their magics, however.  If you have any questions about that, he's the person to talk to."
msgstr "알버트 뉴튼은 유명한 마법 연구가이지. 그러나 그의 연구는 하나 끝날때마다 많은 시간을 소요하는 것 같네. 그는 마도사들의 마법에 대해서도 잘 알고, 어쨌든 그런 부분에 대해 문제가 있으면 그를 찾으면 돼네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:709
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard tales of a powerful magical staff that boosts your magical reserves and can strike as swiftly as the wind itself. "
msgstr "난 당신의 마법을 증가시키고 재빨리 바람을 일으킬수 있는 마법 지팡이에 관한 얘기를 들었네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:710
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "General stores will buy  nearly anything, but give terrible prices.  If a general store is the only store around and you need to sell something fast, go ahead and use it.  But if it can wait, you'll do better selling something to a more specific store."
msgstr "보통가게는 아무거나 산다. 그러나 말도 안되는 가격을 주지. 만일 보통가게가 하나밖에 없고 뭔가를 빨리 팔아야 할때는 그렇게 하지만 만일 시간이 있을때는 다른 가게로 가 알아보게나.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:711
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not all shops are the same!  Some stores offer lowly goods, while shops in other towns have excellent wares for sale.  You'll need to look around and find the good shops for yourself, but keep in mind:  You get what you pay for.  Great equipment never comes cheap."
msgstr "모든 가게가 같진 않네! 어떤 가게는 질 안 좋은 가게를 다른 가게들이  좋은 것들 세일 할때 내놓기도 하지.  당신 자신이 좋은 가게를 찾아야 하네. 그러나 잊지말게 당신이 산 것에 대해서는 책임을 져야하네. 좋은 것은 싸지 않다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:712
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This foul place is the center of the most serious crimes against nature the Necromancer's Guild has been committing.  My firm scout's advice is to avoid, avoid, avoid!"
msgstr "이 안좋은 장소는 네크로맨서와 대항하는 범죄가 많이 일어나는 곳이지, 나의 정찰병이 말하길 피하라고 하더군. 피하라고, 피하라고!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:713
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "City councils are always looking for people to take care of local jobs for them.  If you need a little extra cash, try dropping by and asking about work.  There's a good chance they'll have something for you."
msgstr "의회는 항상 그들의 자질구례한 일을 처리해줄 사람을 구하네. 만일 용돈이 필요하다면 그곳에 가 일을 물어보게. 좋은 기회가 많고 보상도 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:714
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your reputation affects how people deal with you.  Most people aren't going to trust you or confide in you if your reputation isn't good.  You'll only find friends from thieves and the like, and do you really want them as friends?  You'll need to help others and follow the laws to bolster your reputation."
msgstr "당신의 명성에 따라 사람들이 당신을 대하냐가 달려있네. 만일 당신의 명성이 좋지 않다면 사람들은 당신을 믿지 않을걸세. 아마 친구들도 도적들 밖에 안 생길걸세. 그들을 정말 친구로 원하나? 당신의 명성을 올리기 위해 법을 따르고 다른 사람을 도와야 하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:715
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Try to stay close to chimney sweeps– they're good luck!"
msgstr "굴뚝청소부 옆에 있으려고 노력하게.? 그들은 운이 좋다네! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:716
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Apparently there's a new Thieves' Guild called the Shadow Guild that's competing with the established guilds across the lands."
msgstr "명백히 이제 새로운 길드 쉐도우 길드가 생겼네. 그들은 이땅에 있는 모든 길드와 경쟁하려고 하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:717
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I just bought the deed to a bridge spanning the White Forest River.  It's a toll bridge!  Soon I'll be rich as my professional bridge managers make money from the tolls they charge and put it in my bank account!"
msgstr "난 지금 하얀 숲의 다리 한뼘의 증서를 샀네. 사용료를 받는 다리지! 곧 난 부자가 될걸세. 나의 매니저가 돈을 받으면 내 은행 구좌에 넣어줄것이거든! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:718
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can never get work in Castle Ironfist.  I don't understand why.  It's almost as though they don't want people crawling around the castle.  Are they hiding something?"
msgstr "아이언피스트성에서 난 일자리를 찻을수 없네. 난 이해를 못하겠네 왜그런지.그들은 성주위를 돌아다니는 사람들을 원하지 않는 것 같네. 그들이 뭘 감추고 있나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:719
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I travel with all kinds of people, carrying heavy loads from one place to the other.  I tell you though, unless you're powerful, your load will be lightened for you by all the bandits on the roads.  Stay off the roads between cities if you know what's good for you."
msgstr "난 많은 종류의 사람들과 여행을 해봤네, 무거운 짐들도 들어봤지. 내가 하네 말해주지, 당신이 힘이 아주 쎄지않는이상 당신의 길은 도적들로 꽉 차있을꺼야, 그러니 길을 피해 다니게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:720
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many inns are scattered across Enroth, and I believe there are even a few that eke out a meager existence in the western reaches.  These provide the easiest way to get food and the safest rest."
msgstr "엔로스 주변에는 많은 여관이 있지. 내가 알기론 서쪽에는 생활방식이 결핍한 곳도 있다더군. 그게 안전한 곳에서 쉬라는 걸 증명해주지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:721
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ever notice how the cost of Resurrection at a temple is exactly equal to all the gold you had with you when you died?"
msgstr "당신이 죽었을때 신전에서 되살리려면 얼마가 드는지 아나? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:722
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you find a great piece of equipment for a low price, by all means buy it.  You'll be able to sell it later for a profit, and maybe even get some use out of it until then.  "
msgstr "만일 좋은 물건을 싼 값에 찻는다면 많이 사 두게. 나중에 이득을 봐 팔수 있네. 나중에 쓸데가 있을지도 모르니.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:723
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've cooked a lot of fish in my day, but never have I cooked one of the deadly eels that infest the waters north of Silver Cove.  I'd love a chance to do it, but not many people tangle with the eels and live.  But, oh, for a taste!  They say the eels are the best delicacy the world has to offer!"
msgstr "난 예전에 많은 생선을 요리했었지. 그러나 나는 실버 코브 북쪽 물에 있는 죽은 뱀장어를 요리한적이 없었네. 난 기회가 온다면 한번 해보고 싶네. 그러나 많은 사람들이 뱀장어를 산채로 잡아온적이 없네. 그러나 맛은! 그들은 뱀장어가 세상에서 가장 맛이 좋다고 하지!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:724
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Never run out of food!  You don't gain any benefit from rest when you have no food, and it's very easy to starve to death in the wilderness if you have no food."
msgstr "만일 음식이 없으면 당신은 휴식을 취하나 마나네. 그리고 배가 고플때 전투하다간 죽기 쉽상이지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:725
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Somewhere out there is a set of horseshoes that protect your horses' hooves perfectly, and never lets them get tired!  The places you could go if you had horses with those qualities!  Oh, well.  It's just a legend, most likely."
msgstr "바깥 어딘가에는 말의 편자를 파는데가 있어 당신말의 발을 완벽하게 지켜준다네. 그런 걸 얻으면 어디든 갈수있지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:726
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Soon after Archibald's defeat, I was able to peek into the Royal Library after one of my many performances at Castle Ironfist.  Inside, I saw a statue of Archibald in magnificent detail.  He must have had the statue made when he thought he was going to win his insurrection, and Roland's kept it as some sort of memento."
msgstr "아치발드가 당했을때 난 왕실도서관을 슬쩍 들여다 보았네. 난 그곳에서 장대한 아치발드의 조각을 봤네. 아마 그 조각은 그가 제일 강했을때 만들어 진걸꺼야. 롤랜드는 유품으로 갖고 있더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:727
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Every spell caster knows, or should know, that certain spells and magical effects occur around dawn and dusk.  For instance, no Divine Intervention is possible at any other time."
msgstr "모든 마법사들은 알다시피 마법은 새벽이나 땅거미가 질때 많이 사용되네. 예로 신성한 중제는 아무때나 가능하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:729
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The old Dragon Towers were built to protect the towns from flying creatures, but they'll shoot down anything within their range that's flying."
msgstr "오래된 드래곤 타워는 날아다니는 적에게서 방어하기 위해 만들어졌지. 그러나 그들은 날아다니는 모든 것을 공격한다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:730
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though the Church of the Moon celebrated the darker side of human nature, it is not to say that good could not come of their evil, just as evil came of the Church of the Sun's good.  During their heyday, the Church managed to create artifacts of great power– the Doomsday Cloaks.  If you ever find one, don't throw it away!  They're all very powerful and valuable."
msgstr "달의 신전은 인간의 자연적으로 어두운 부분을 칭송한다네. 악마의 좋은 부분니 아니라 좋은 면에서 악마적인걸 찻아내는 거지. 그들이 잘 나갈때 그들은 인공물을 하나 만들었네. 엄청난 힘을 가진 - 최후의 날의 망토.  만일 찾는다면 버리지 말게. 아주 강하고 유용하다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:731
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A great spell when running errands, Lloyd's Beacon allows you to set up beacons that you can teleport back to.  Though the beacons don't last forever, with proper planning they last long enough to get the job done."
msgstr "볼일이 있어사용할때 좋은 마법이지. 로이드 비콘은 당신이 돌아가고 싶은 곳에 beacon을 설정해 돌아가게 해주지. 그러나 비콘은 영원히 지속되진 않으나 용무를 처리할때까지는 가능할걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:732
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Making a healing potion is a simple matter, if you have ingredients.  All you need are widoweeps berries and a flask with water.  Just mix the berries with the water, and…Voila!  Instant healing potion!  If you don't have any water handy, you can just eat the berries directly, but the effect isn't as strong."
msgstr "힐링 포션을 만드는것은 간단한 일이네. 당신이 합성 할줄만 안다면. 당신이 필요한 것은 위도우입 베리와 휴대용 술병 그리고 물이네. 그냥 물과 베리를 섞기만 하게.  그리고 쨘! 인스턴트 힐링 포션!  만약 물을 가지고 있지 않다면, 그냥 베리를 먹어도 되네. 그러나 효과는 크지 않다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:733
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sweet Water was an excellent venue for my music before the Night of Shooting Stars.  Now the road to that town is infested with devils, and they say the town is no more."
msgstr "스윗 워터는 내 음악을 연주하는데 최고지이네 슈팅스타의 밤 전에는. 지금은 그곳으로 가는 길은 악마로 꽉차있다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:734
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Isle of the Hermit, named by Lord Terrance for its remoteness, is difficult to travel to because of the turbulent waters south of Enroth."
msgstr "운둔자의 섬은 군주 테란스가 지었네. 그리고 여행하기가 어렵네. 왜냐면 엔로스 남쪽에는 사나운 물이 흐르기 때문이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:735
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lots of people would like to invade Regna and take her spices, her metal, and her treasures.  The only thing that's kept Regna free all these years is her attention to metal smithing science and her arms sales to all the countries of the world.  Everyone criticizes Regna for that, but everyone buys Regnan weapons.  Talkin' outta both sides of their mouth, that's what those hypocrites do!"
msgstr "많은 사람들은 레그나로 침입해 그녀의 향신료와 금속 , 보물등을 가지고 싶어하네. 그러나 아직까지 레그나가 건재한건 금속연구하는 기술과 그녀가 만든 갑옷은 전세계로 팔리고 있기 때문이지. 모두들 그런 생각도 하지만 한편으로는 그녀가 만든 무기만 산다네. 한입으로 두말하지 그게 바로 위선자의 모습이고. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:736
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I could have been part of Roland's expedition!  There's true bravery– how glorious that troop must have looked, armor and weapons gleaming in the sun.  Better to die valiantly in the battlefield with your lord, then to expire in the night, cold and alone."
msgstr "난 내가 롤랜드의 원정대에 있었으면 좋겠네. 그곳에는 진짜 용기가 있네-그들의 군대는 영광적이었으며 갑옷과 무기는 태양아래 빛났네. 전장에서 왕을 위해 죽는건 혼자 외로이 추위에 떠는것보다 났다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:737
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Astrology is often sneered at, but I tell you it's very real and important.  The most significant astrological event recently was that shooting star that fell from the sky out of Sagittarius.  It portends upheaval, disaster, and opportunity for the entire world."
msgstr "점성술을 비웃기도 하지만, 그러나 그것은 중요하다네. 최근 가장 컷던것은 궁수자리에서 떨어진 슈팅 스타였네. 그 징조는 재앙의 시작을 알리는 것이였지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:738
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Merchants in the northeast aren't above hiring people to make sure that their competition isn't too competitive.  We try to avoid those areas and not get involved with any of the local petty struggles."
msgstr "북동쪽에 있는 상인들은 서로 라이벌들을 감시하기 위해 사람들을 고용하지 않네. 우리는 그 쪽하고 거래를 안하고 그들과 사소한 문제라도 일으키지 않으려고 하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:739
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Listen to the way a person greets you to get an idea how to deal with them, should they prove uncooperative.  You'll find that many people that share similar interests and professions will have the same attitude toward your choice of begging, bribing, or threatening them."
msgstr "사람들이 당신에게 인사하는것이나 어떻게 대하는지를 유심히 보게. 많은 도움이 될걸세. 당신은 사람들이 같은 주제에 흥미있어함을 알게될거고  어떤상황에서는 구걸하거나 뇌물을 주거나 협박해야 할때가 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:740
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't tell anyone I told you this, but Roland isn't dead.  He simply needed a vacation from all of the pressures of being king, and he's hiding away on Abdul's Resort Isle under a false name."
msgstr "아무한테도 내가 이런말 했다고 얘기하지 말게. 롤랜드는 죽지 않았네. 그는 단지 왕이 되서 받는 스트레스 때문에 휴가가 필요했던거네. 그는 압둘의 리조트 섬에 숨어있다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:741
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To keep people like me away from their things, people will often trap their chests. "
msgstr "그들은 그들의 물건에서 항상 나 같은 사람을 멀직이 띄워놓지. 왜냐면 난 항상 �C을 설치하거든."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:742
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Weather sure has been strange lately.  Why, last June it snowed!  Snow in June, who'd ever have guessed?  It is an ill omen, snow in summertime."
msgstr "날씨가 확실히 이상해 졌다네. 왜냐면, 6월에 눈이 왔거든! 누가 예상할수 있었겠나? 위험한 징조야. 여름에 눈이 오다니.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:743
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Despite all of my problems, at least the Temple of Baa cares about me and helps me out.  Not like the government we have now."
msgstr "나는 문제가 많지만  바아 신전이 나의 문제들을 해결해주고 도와주네. 지금의 정부하곤 전혀 틀리지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:744
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Boots are the cobbler's domain, and I don't know much about them, but I will say that you shouldn't overlook their usefulness.  They can go a long way to adding to your overall personal protection in battle.  Everyone should wear boots."
msgstr "부츠는 구두수선공의 모든것이지. 난 그것에 대해 별로 알진 못하지만 그러나 그들의 중요성은 대단한거네. 그것들은 전쟁에서 당신을 도와주고 모두들 다 부츠를 신어야 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:745
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I imagine much of my work in the near future will be digging the graves of the people killed by the devils."
msgstr "난 앞으로 내가 악마들한테 죽은 사람의 시체를 매장하는 굴을 팔거라는것이 상상이 되네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:746
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't even begin to tell you how awful produce prices have been in the market, recently.  I think someone's artificially fixing the prices low!  If this goes on much longer I'll be ruined!"
msgstr "난 요즘 상점에서 가격이 얼마나 끔찍한지 얘기할수도 없네. 내 생각에는 누군가가 가격을 낮추어야 하네! 만일 이 상태가 계속되면 난 파산할걸세!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:747
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Be careful drinking liquids left in barrels; you never know how long it's been sitting there.  You could get sick doing something like that."
msgstr "항상 통에 남아있는 물을 마실땐 조심하게. 그 안에 얼마나 있었는지도 모르니, 어쩌면 그물을 마시고 아플수도 있다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:748
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The wheel spins in the most fascinating ways.  Sometimes I think that if everyone would take a little time out and watch the wheel spin, they would calm down, and be less likely to fight with one another.  But no one will listen to me.  I'm just a lowly potter."
msgstr "바퀴들은 매혹적으로 굴러가지. 내 생각에는 가끔 사람들이 일을 멈추고 바퀴를 쳐다보면은 아마 사람들은 차분해 질걸세. 그리고 서로 싸우는 일도 적어질거고. 그러나 아무도 내 말을 듣지 않네. 난 단지 일꾼일 뿐이니까.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:749
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's one thing to make the clothes, but the beauty usually comes from dying the clothes in interesting colors."
msgstr "옷을 만드는 이유는 하나밖에 없지. 옷의 아름다움은 어떻게 옷을 염색하는데에 따라 달려있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:750
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The fact that our king is missing is awful, but it must be the will of the gods.  How could anything happen that isn't the will of the gods?"
msgstr "왕이 사라진것은 끔찍한거지. 아마 분명히 신의 뜻일걸세. 신의 뜻이 아닌이상에는 어떤일도 일어날수 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:751
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lord Temper won't even allow me to become a knight.  He said I wasn't smart enough to follow directions."
msgstr "템퍼 군주는 나를 기사로 인정하지 않는다네. 그는 내가 그의 명령을 따를 정도로 똑똑하지 않다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:752
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mice and rats are a relentless plague upon mankind!  I hear that a keep near New Sorpigal has the biggest rats in the world living in it.  <shuddering>  May I never see such horrors as long as I live!"
msgstr "쥐들은 인간들에게 커다란 역병을 돌게하지. 내가 알기론 뉴 소르피갈근처의 창고에는 거대한 쥐들이 살고 있다더군. <떨면서> 난 내가 사는동안에는 그런것들을 안 봤으면 좋겠네!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:753
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With all of Blackwoode now destroyed, wood is going to be very scarce in Enroth.  We might see another Timber War starting soon."
msgstr "블랙 우드가 파괴된 다음 엔로스에서는 나무 구하기가 힘들어 졌네. 아마 곧 또다 팀버 전쟁이 시작될지 모르네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:754
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Tomb of Ethric the Mad is a wonder of fine stone cutting.  My grandfather helped build it.  He says there are some very cleverly concealed secret doors in the Tomb.  Why Ethric would care if a door was secret or not is beyond me, but hey– he was both rich and mad.  I guess he could do what he liked."
msgstr "미친 에스릭의 묘비석은 돌 자르는 것에 대한 신비라네. 내 할아버지가 그걸 만드는걸 도왔다네. 그가 말하길 그 비석에는 알아볼수 없는 비밀문이 있다더군왜 에스릭은 비밀문을 만들었을까, 이봐, 그는 부자였고 미치광이 였네. 그는 그가 하고 싶은데로 아무거나 할수 있었지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:755
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Why is it goblins have no luck raising chickens? They plant the eggs too deep!"
msgstr "왜 고블린은 닭을 못 기르지?  그들은 달걀을 땅속 깊이 심기때문이지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:756
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The one thing you can say's been good these days is the cold weather.  All the animals have really thick, valuable fur.  Only trouble is finding them.  Monsters been eating most of the good fur animals, I think."
msgstr "당신이 말할수 있는건 하나지. 이 추운날씨를 잘 버티고 있다는 것이지. 모든 동물들은 살��고 부드러운 털을 가지고 있군. 단지 문제는 그들을 찾는 것이지. 아마 괴물들이 부드러운 털을 가지고 있는 것들을 다 먹어치웠을꺼야. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:757
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just between you and me, I saw a werewolf when I was a werewolf in Blackshire!  I believe all the rumors about their curse."
msgstr "당신과 나만 아는 얘기로 난  늑대인간를 봤네. 내가 블랙샤이어에서 늑대인간이였을때! 난 그곳이 저주에 걸렸다는 걸 믿네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:758
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When cattle rustling gets too hard, I usually spend my time hunting on some Lord's land.  Since most people are afraid to hunt there, those forests haven't been over-hunted.  Recently, though, the animals have been getting scarce.  Could have something to do with the western blight."
msgstr "짐승들의 바삭 바삭하는 소리가 커지면 난 내 시간을 군주의 땅에서 사냥하는데 보내네. 많은 사람들이 그곳에서 사냥하는걸 무서워해 그 곳에 있는 숲들의 동물들은 사냥 당하지 않았네.  그러나 요즘은 희귀하다네. 아마 서쪽의 충해하고 무슨 상관이 있을꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:759
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In some places it is difficult to hunt for game.  You need to pack more food when you travel in swamps or deserts or snow, for example."
msgstr "어떤 장소는 사냥하기 힘드니 당신은 음식을 많이 가져가야할 필요가 있네. 예로 늪지대, 사막, 눈속등이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:760
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wilbur Humphrey has hired me several times to take notes on disaster reports filtering in from around the kingdom.  I think there's been a sharp increase in calamities since the disappearance of the king."
msgstr "윌버 험프리는 재앙에 대해 리포트를 쓰기위해 나를 몇번 고용한 적이 있네. 내가 보기에는 왕이 사라진 후로 재앙이 더 많아진것 같네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:761
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The prince is far too young to manage a kingdom.  Wilbur Humphrey should be ruling the kingdom for himself, not in the name of a child."
msgstr "왕자는 왕국을 다스리긴 너무 어리니, 윌버 험프리가 왕국을 다스려야 하네, 왕자의 이름으로 말고. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:762
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you ever find yourself in need of work, just stop by the city council's office in one of the large towns.  There's usually a job that needs doing."
msgstr " 만일 일이 필요하다 싶으면 아무 타운에 가 의회에 들리게. 그들은 항상 일을 준비시켜 놓지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:763
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The rumors of the dynasty collapsing and all the disasters have brought out the worst in humanity.  I need to be even more vigilant than normal to keep the peace."
msgstr "소문에 의하면 왕조가 망가지고 모든 재앙은 인류의 잘못된 행위가 가져왔다고 하지.  난 더 열심히 평화를 지키기 위해 힘써야 겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:764
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Take it from me, if you want a lucky charm, hang around a chimney sweep.  Sure, their banter can be annoying, but they're the luckiest people I know."
msgstr "내게서 가져가게, 만일 당신이 행운의 부적을 원한다면 , 그리고 굴뚝 청소부들과 같이 다니게. 물론 그들의 농담은 귀찮지만, 그들은 내가 아는 최고의 운이 좋은 사람들이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:765
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have heard rumors that the recent 'winter during summer' spectacles have been caused by mischievous sorcerers who have learned to meddle with the weather.  I think it's part of a plot to create mass hysteria and open rebellion against the King."
msgstr "내가 들은 최근 소문에 의하면 '겨울안의 여름'은 날씨에 관해 연구한 어떤 잘못된 마도사가 그렇게 했다는군. 내 생각에 그것은 혼란을 부르기 위한 음모이거나 왕에 대한 번역이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:766
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The devils people are talking about causing havoc in the west are just misunderstood.  Baa says that they are our friends.  You just have to be respectful and run from them if you see them coming.  They need a lot of personal space, and get angry if they don't get it.  But that's only because they are superior beings.  If we were superior, all this would be easier to understand."
msgstr "악한 사람들은 서쪽에 황폐함에 대해 얘기하는데 그건 잘못된 거네.바아가 말하길 그들은 우리 친구라더군, 당신은 그냥 그들을 조심하고 그들을 보면 도망치게나. 그들은 넓은 토지가 필요하고 그것을 못가졌을 때는 화를 내지. 그러나 그들은 상관이니까 그러는 거네. 만일 우리가 상관이었다면 훨씬 이해하기가 쉬웠겠지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:767
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'd love to sail the oceans on a big ship.  I could travel to all the islands and just be free of school and chores and my parents.  That would be wonderful!"
msgstr "난 큰배로 바다를 여행하고 싶어. 섬들을 단지 학교나 부모님의 간섭에서 벗어나기 위해.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:768
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Word is that the goblins are looking to buy weapons for raids on human towns.  I hear the regent has a sizeable bounty on the heads of any who deliver weapons to those evil little toads."
msgstr "소식에 의하면 고블린들이 무기를 살 가게를 타운에서 찾고 있는것 같네. 내가 듣기로는 리젠트가 꽤 큰 현상금을 걸었다는군. 그들에게 물건을 갖다주는 조그만 악마 두꺼비 등에게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:769
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most any dragon that has a lair is absolutely loaded with gold.  They get it from all the paladins who try to kill them to make a name for themselves."
msgstr "거의 모든 용들이 있는 곳은 골드로 차 있네. 그것들은 그들을 죽이러 온 무인들 한테 얻은것이네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:770
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some of the magic items you find around the world are cursed.  Almost none are pure curses, but many have side effects you won't like much.  You should carefully weigh the side effects against the benefits an item offers before using it."
msgstr "당신이 찾는 어떤 마법 아이템은 저주가 걸린거네. 거의 모든게 진짜 저주가 걸리지는 않았지만, 많은 아이템들이 당신을 기분좋게 하지 않을걸세. 사용하기 전에 신중하게 한번 고려해봐야 할걸세."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:771
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Of course you know that spells cast at high noon draw their power directly from the sun.  It is in this way that the mightiest of magicians can afford the power it takes to enchant the magical items you find throughout the land of Enroth."
msgstr "물론 당신도 알겠지만 한낮에 쓰는 마법은 태양에서 직접 힘을 받는다네. 이때가 바로 마법사들의 힘이 제일 강하고 아이템에 마법을 걸기 가장 좋을때이네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:772
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The desert is a land that should be avoided by all but the mightiest sorcerers and knights.  Filled with giants and dragons, nearly all who visit do not return.  Rumor has it that a strange pyramid in the desert holds untold riches and secrets waiting to be unearthed by some brave souls."
msgstr "사막은 모두가 안 좋아하는 곳이지, 기사와 마도사만 빼고. 그 곳은 거인들과 용들로 꽉차있다. 그곳을 방문한 자는 돌아오지 못했지. 소문에 의하면 그 곳에는 신비한 피라마드가 고대의 비밀을 간직한 채 용감한 영혼을 기다린다고 한다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:773
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The pass leading to White Cap and Caste Stromgard has recently been taken by a group of ogres and greedy humans working together."
msgstr "화이트 캡에서 스트롬가드 성으로 가는 길은 오그레와 탐욕스러운 자들로 꽉 차있다.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:774
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard stories of a horrible curse that has possessed the town. Every time I've visited, however, everything seems normal."
msgstr "난 타운에 걸린 무시 무시한 저주에 대해 얘기를 들었다. 내가 방문했을 때마다. 그러나 내가 보긴 모두 정상 같아 보였는데. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:775
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:805
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although no shipping companies are currently offering the service, Erathia, homeland of Queen Catherine Ironfist, can be reached in a voyage of three weeks or so, depending on the season.  Ain't never been there, but they tell me it's nice."
msgstr "이라시아,로 어떤 배도 써비스 하진 않지만 여왕 캐서린의 고향인 그 곳은 가는데 3주정도 걸리고 계절에 따라 다르다. 가본적은 없지만 멋있다고 하더군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:776
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Water walking is nice and all, but it doesn't beat a good ship and a good crew.  Not only are you slower than a ship, you have to worry about the spell wearing off, and you have to worry about sea serpent attacks.  Boats are the best way to travel by water."
msgstr "물위를 걷는다는 멋있다네. 그러나 좋은 배 보다는 못하다네. 속도가 문제가 아니라, 마법이 다 고갈되는 문제도 있지. 그리고 바다뱀의 공격도 생각해야하네. 보트가 물위를 여행하는건 최고이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:777
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Resting only really works well in a comfortable place like an inn.  There you can regain lost strength and magic, and heal from most of your wounds.  If you must rest in the wilderness, be sure to have enough food!  Hungry people gain no benefit from rest."
msgstr "휴식은 정말 편안한 장소에서 취해야 하네. 여관 같은 곳. 그 곳에서 체력과 마법을 보충할수 있고 상처를 치유할수 있네. 만일 야외에서 휴식한다면 확실한 음식이 있는지 확인하게나! 배가 고프면 휴식해도 아무 효과가 없으니.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:778
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though not as effective as other healing spells, Healing Touch is in the school of spirit, which makes it easier for paladins to learn.  Also, body spells don't work in certain areas, so you will need to use Healing Touch instead of spells like First Aid or Power Cure."
msgstr "다른 치료보다 별로 좋지는 않지만 힐링터치는 영혼 학교에서 무인들이 금방 배운다네, 또,바디 주문 마법은 어떤 곳에서 사용할수 없네. 그러니 당신은 치료의 손길를 알아야 하네.  응급처치나 강력 치료말고."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:779
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shared Life is an excellent way to keep weaker party members alive when your party is being assaulted with area affect spells.  This spell combined with Power Cure can keep everyone alive when you get in over your head."
msgstr "나누는 삶는 당신의 약한 파티를 공격당했을때 보호할수 있네. 이 마법은 파워 큐어를 포함하고 당신 머리위에서 쓰면 모두 다 살릴수 있다.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:780
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many teachers do not want to be flooded by students, so they have moved to remote locations.  You might have to look around quite a bit to find them.  Generally, expert teachers know where their master teachers are."
msgstr "많은 선생들은 많은 제자를 원하지 않지. 그래서 그들은 먼곳에 살고 있다네. 아마 당신도 그들을 찻는데 시간이 좀 걸릴걸세. 보통 베테랑 선생들이 그들의 마스터 선생이 어디 있는지 알고 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:781
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fame, in many ways, is an accumulation of the experiences you have and how you've managed to share with others.  Quests and brave deeds against monsters can make you famous."
msgstr "명성,  이것은  얼마나 많은 경험치를 축척하고 그것을 다른 사람과 나누었는가에 결정된다. 모험과 적들과 맞서는 용기가 당신을 유명하게 만들수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:782
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Personally, my favorite weapon is the mace.  When you get good at it, you learn to strike at hard parts on your opponent so that it bounces off instead of sinking in.  Saves time.  Anyway, when someone gets hit with a mace, it can stun them so bad that they stop fighting back.  And that's a fine thing."
msgstr "개인적으로 내가 좋아하는 무기는 철퇴이네. 만일 잘만 사용한다면 한 방에 적들을 보낼수 있지. 시간을 절약할수 있네. 만일 적들이 맞으면 그들을 기절시켜 다시 못 싸우게 되지. 어때, 달콤하지 않은가?   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:783
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Never underestimate the staff!  Most people associate the staff with a mage, but that's not always the case.  Although you cannot use a shield with a staff, as you become more skilled you'll find that staves are the best defensive weapon around.  Not only that, but they have enough weight to stun people that are hit with it.  It's one of the best all around weapons available."
msgstr "절대 지팡이를 포기하지 말게. 많은 사람들을 지팡이와 철퇴를 같이 사용하나 그건 항상 그렇게 하는게 아니네. 방패를 같이 사용할순 없지만 좀 더 잘 쓰게되면 그 지팡이가 최고의 방어를 할수 있다는 것을 알게 될걸세. 그것 뿐이 아니고 충분히 사람을 기절시킬만한 무게도 있네. 모든 무기중에 최고라네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:784
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All of the schools of magic have eleven spells, but only ten can be found in the guilds of darkness.  The missing eleventh spell is called something like Dark Holding or Dark Containment.  No one alive seems to have learned it, and the guilds are very anxious to find it.  "
msgstr "모든 마법 학교는 11개의 마법을 갖추고 있네. 그러나 10개만 어둠의 길드에서 찻을수 있네. 감추어진 11번째는 아마 어둠의 홀딩 이나 어둠의 굴레라고 하네. 아무도 배운적이 없는 것 같고 길드는 찾으려고 혈안이 되있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:785
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Summoned by mages to guard areas or items, elementals are beings composed of one of the four primary elemental forces:  air, earth, fire, or water.  Elementals can freely use magics of their element, so be wary if you should battle them."
msgstr "마법사들에 의해 소환된 가드나 아이템들은 4 개의 기본원소로 이루어져 있네 : 공기, 땅, 불, 물 이들은 그들의 원소 마법에 따라 자유롭게 쓸수 있고 전쟁에서 쓸때는 조심히 쓰게.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:786
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Archibald, Roland's brother, mastered many magical arts and accomplished himself as a powerful sorcerer before his demise.  No one seems to know where he is buried, though.  It's as though he disappeared after Roland's ascension to the throne."
msgstr "아치발드, 롤랜드의 형제, 많은 마법의 마스터, 그리고 그가 소멸하기 전에 유명한 마도사로 이름을 떨쳤던 자. 아무도 그가 어디 묻혔는지 모른다. 롤랜드가 왕위에 오른 후 사라졌다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:787
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Skilled merchants run many of the stores in Enroth.  You must be careful when buying and selling to make sure you are not getting ripped off."
msgstr "능력있는 상인들이 엔로스에 많은 가게들을 운영하고 있지. 당신은 물건을 파고 살때 바가지 쓰지 않도록 조심해야 겠네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:788
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's dangerous to carry a lot of money with you.  Banks provide a safe place to store large amounts of money.  Though they don't credit you with interest, you don't have to worry about pickpockets.  That's good enough for me."
msgstr "많은 돈을 지니고 다니는 것은 위험하다네. 은행이 제일 안전하지. 물론 이자등은 안 붙지만 잃어버릴 염려는 없다네. 그 정도면 충분하진 않은가?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:789
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In the center of Dragonsand you can find a pyramid marking the Tomb of the Ship, or so they say.  I've scoured the desert and found nothing but dragons and titans to run from.  That doesn't mean it's not there– I had to get out of that desert while the getting was good.  A very dangerous place!"
msgstr "드라곤 샌드 중앙에서 배의 비석을 마크하는 피라미드를 찾을수 있네, 아니면 그냥 소문이거나. 난 사막을 가 봤지만 용과 타이탄의 흔적말고 아무것도 못 찾았다네. 그뜻은 그게 거기 없다는게 아니네. 나도 제대로 찾진 않았으니까. 매우 위험한 장소라네! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:790
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I do not like assassins, or men of low character.  And it seems that both types of criminal are spreading through the land like the plague these days."
msgstr "난 암살자를 좋아하지 않네. 품위가 없는 사람도. 아마 그런자들이 이 아름다운 땅에서 문제를 일으키니까.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:791
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some creatures you'll run into can be reasoned with if you have a fear spell available.  You can avoid unnecessary and wasteful injury by scaring off your enemies rather than simply fighting with them."
msgstr "어떤 생물들이 당신에게 공격할때는 당신이 용기의 마법이 있으면 싸우는 것보다 그거 한번으로 적들을 잠잠시킬수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:792
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sometimes bandits and highwaymen will accept you if they don't think you're 'upstanding citizens.'  The weak, however, are always robbed."
msgstr "가끔은 도적과 노상강도들이 당신이 상류층이 아니라고 생각할 경우에는 당신을 받아들일때도 있다네. 어쨌든 약한자는 항상 강도를 당한다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:793
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must be careful when opening some locks.  Many people don't consider a lock enough of a deterrent, so they will trap their doors or chests to try and frighten off or kill a would-be thief."
msgstr "자물쇠를 열땐 항상 조심해야하네. 많은 사람들은 별로 신경을 안 쓰지, 그래서 그들은 �C이나 함정에 걸려 죽거나 다치곤 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:794
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:819
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All of the really bad disasters started happening after the Night of the Shooting Stars two years ago.  Not much has gone right since then, except the Temple of Baa.  They really help people.  They also say that King Roland must have done something awful, 'cause the stars were avenging angels falling from Heaven to punish the wicked."
msgstr "모든 나쁜일은 2년전의 슈팅스타의 밤 뒤에 생겼네. 그때부터 제대로 된일이 없지. 바아 신전 만 빼고. 그들은 정말로 사람들을 도왔네. 그들은 또 롤랜드왕이 뭔가 안 좋은일을 했다고 했지.그래서 하늘에서 벌하려고 별을 떨어뜨렸다 했네,  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:795
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Let me tell you a secret.  There is no such thing as luck.  You make your own luck based on your outlook.  If you expect the worst to happen, it probably will, and you'll have a horrible time.  If, however, you look on the bright side and expect the best, you'll usually find it."
msgstr "내가 비밀을 말해주지. 운 만큼 좋은게 없다네. 당신의 운은 당신의 견해에 따라 달려있네. 만일 당신이 최악을 생각한다면 정말 나쁜일이 생기지. 만일 좋은 일만 생각한다면 좋은일이 생길걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:796
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's hard to travel through the snow.  Good thing you have people like me around!"
msgstr "눈오는데 여행하는 건 상당히 힘드네. 당신은 주위에 나같은 사람이 있다는 건 좋은 일일세! . "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:797
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Resting allows you to approach the new day with vigor and zest.  Resting will heal your wounds and recharge your magic.  Nothing finishes a hard day like a good camp, good dinner, and a good fire."
msgstr "휴식은 당신에게 활기차고 새로운 날을 맞이하게 하주지. 휴식은 당신의 상처를 치료해주고 당신의 마법을 회복시켜주지. 좋은 음식, 캠프, 저녁은 모든걸 회복시킨다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:798
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ever fantasize about discovering a huge horde of treasure?  I do.  They say there are three really big ones:  The first is the knowledge contained in the Royal Library.  The second is the treasure the obelisks lead to.  And the third is in Loretta Fleise's basement!"
msgstr "큰 보물을 찻는것을 꿈구어 본적있나? 난 그랬네. 사람들은 3개의 큼 보물이 있다고 했네. 찻째 왕실 도서관의 지식. 둘째, 방첨탑의 보물. 셋째,  로레타 플레이스의 기지지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:799
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm not sure the towns to the west even exist anymore.  Merchants don't travel to there, and no one has come back from those areas yet.  I believe civilization ends at Blackshire, and even the people there are strange at times."
msgstr "난 서쪽에 있는 타운이 아직 존재하는지는 모르네. 사인들도 그쪽으로는 안가고. 아무도 그곳에서 돌아온 사람도 없네. 내 생각에는 블랙샤이어에서 문명은 끝난것 같네. 그리고 그쪽사람들도 약간 이상하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:800
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It may not seem like a big deal, but I like to supplement my cooking with fresh fruit.  You can find it most places just growing on trees, if you look.  Fruit trees have helped me out when I was hungry and had no money, and they could help you, too."
msgstr "별로 큰 거래같진 않지만 나는 과일과 함께하는 나의 요리를 보완하고 싶네. 당신은 나무가 있는 곳이면 어디서든지 발견할수가 있네. 내가 배고프고 돈이 없을때 과일나무들이 나를 도와주었지. 그것들은 당신도 도와줄수 있을꺼네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:801
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I believe there is a spell that will allow you to create food for yourself out of thin air, but I can't imagine food made from magic tasting very good."
msgstr "내가 알기론 음식을 만들어 낼수있는 마법이 있다는군. 그러나 그런 음식이 과연 얼마나 좋을까. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:802
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't suppose you've got any news of Sweet Water, do you?  No one I know has heard anything about the town for a year!  They're a long ways off from here…but a year?  Something must be wrong."
msgstr "난 당신이 스윗 워터에 대해 아무 얘기도 못들었을 꺼라 확신하네 그렇지? 아무도 1년동안 아무 소식도 못들었으니. 아무리 멀다해도, 1년씩이나! 뭔가 잘못됐어.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:803
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wonder about the council sometimes.  The decisions they've made and some of the laws they've stalled on have really contributed to the chaos around here.  They've stalled any official investigation of Roland's death, and I don't understand why."
msgstr "난 의회에 대해서 가끔 궁금하네. 그들이 만든 법은 혼돈을 부르고 롤랜드의 죽음에 어떤 공식적인 행동을 취하지 않는지 궁금하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:804
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Practicing meditation may not seem like a big deal at first, but it can be a source of tremendous magical energy to the skilled.  Meditation masters can have many times the spell casting power as their less enlightened brethren."
msgstr "치료를 연습하는 건 처음에는 아무것도 아닌것 같지. 그러나 그것은 굉장한 효과를 발휘하지. 마스터 치료자는 마법을 많이 사용할수 있지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:806
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The next best thing to flying, if you fall off of a cliff or similar height; Feather Fall doesn't give you any control but it certainly keeps you alive.  "
msgstr "당신이 만약 날다가 떨어지거나 절벽에서 떨어질 경우  피더 폴은 당신이 컨트롤 할수 있게 하진 않지만 살려준다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:807
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The legend of the Crossing is more than a thousand years old, but that doesn't stop people from repeating it from time to time.  The legend says that we all, and that even includes the elves, the dwarfs, and the goblins, came from the same place on a great ship that carried us across the void between the stars."
msgstr "황단의 전설은 이미 1000면도 더 되었네. 그것은 계속 꾸준히 내려온다네. 전설은 인간, 엘프, 드워프, 고블린도 많은 별들중 한 곳에서 같은 배를 타고 왔다고 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:808
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard portals exist that allow transit between two fixed places in Enroth.  Knowledge of these would provide another excellent and fast way to move around the world."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는 포탈은 엔로스에서  두개의 장소를 왔다갔다 하게 만들어 준다더군. 이 기술을 알면 세상을 좀 더 빨리 돌아갈수 있을꺼야.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:809
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The gods oversee our lives and guide us constantly toward heaven and the light.  All you have to do is listen with your heart and do what it tells you to be admitted to heaven.  Have faith.  The gods will help you get there, if you'll listen to them."
msgstr "신은 우리를 돌보고 우리를 밝은 곳으로 인도하시네. 당신은 단지 마음의 소리를 듣기만 하면 당신은 천국에 갈수있다네. 희망을 가지게. 신이 도와줄걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:810
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "They say the king was last seen fleeing toward Castle Kriegspire with an army of devils following him.  He never returned.  I think we may have to face up to the possibility that our good king was killed by those monsters."
msgstr "사람들이 말하길 왕의 마지막 모습은 크리그스파이어에서 악마군대에게 �m기는 모습이였다더군.  그는 돌아오지 않았네. 내 생각엔 우리 좋은 왕이 악마에게 죽었다고도 가정해졸 필요가 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:811
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Teleportation is the way to go to minimize travel times.  Of course, you can move around pretty quickly by boat or by horse if you have a skilled person leading the way."
msgstr "순간이동은 여행을 빨리 할수 있게 해주네. 물론, 능력있는 자가 이끌면 보트나 말로 여행을 해도 빠르다네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:812
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I came to Enroth during the time Regnans were invited by King Archibald to bring over a load of weapons to help in his fight against Roland.  When Archibald lost the war, Roland seized all the arms ships and forbade travel to Regna.  I've been stuck here ever since."
msgstr "난 레그난이 아치발드한테 초대되 그가 롤랜드와의 전쟁을 위해 군주의 무기를 가지고 오라할때 엔로스에 왔지. 아치발드가 지고난 후 롤랜드는 모든 전쟁선을 잡아 레그나에게 넘기며 행동을 금하게 �g네. 난 그때부터 여기에 있었지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:813
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The simplest piece of a knight's equipment, the shield provides excellent defense for low hindrance and weight.  No warrior should be without a good shield in a fight."
msgstr "기사들이 장비해야할 물건들 중 하나지. 방패는 방어를 도와준다네. 좋은 방패가 없이는 전사도 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:814
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Witches' Assembly of 638 was the greatest gathering of sorcerers and alchemists ever.  Since then, the popularity of the magical arts has declined, and persecution of groups like ours…er, theirs– has grown quite a bit.  It really is quite awful."
msgstr "638년에 있었던 마녀의 모임은 마도사와 연금술사들도 모인 최고의 모임이였네. 그때부터 마법을 사용하는 사람들이 줄어들기도 했지만, 우리처럼 박해받는..음, 그.. 지금은 조금 나졌지만, 대단히 무섭다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:815
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Merchants are businessmen first and foremost.  They will always try to buy low and sell high.  Don't be too upset with them; they need to make a living, too.  The way to get the best prices, both when buying and selling, is to try different markets."
msgstr "상인들은 처음이자 마지막으로 남을 사업자들이지. 그들은 항상 싸게 사 비싸게 팔려고 하지. 그들에게 너무 열받지 말게. 그나마 손해보지 않는건 다른 상점들을 사용해 보게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:816
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you've determined that begging and bribing are of no use, and you simply must speak with a person, then the thinly veiled threat must be issued.  But remember to use this option sparingly, since only the best diplomats can stop the damage you'll do to your reputation if threats become your habit."
msgstr "만일 당신이 구걸이나 뇌물주는게 별로 소용이 없다 싶으면 협박을 한번 해보게. 그러나 기억하게, 최고의 외교력를 가진 자만이 당신 명성이 깍이는걸 막을수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:817
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nicolai has commissioned a bridge to be built from New Sorpigal to Mist.  I'm working for him by offering affluent members of society a chance at charter membership of the Nicolai Ironfist Bridge Fellowship.  The basic membership gets your name on a flagstone of the bridge and costs 50,000 gold– a small price to pay for immortality.  Are you interested?"
msgstr "니콜라이는 뉴 소피르갈에서 미스트까지 다리를 지을 임무를 위임했네. 난 그를 위해 부유한 사람들을 니콜라이 아이언피스트 다리 협회에 멤버로 모으고 있지. 멤버쉽은 다리의 깃발에 이름을 새기고 가격은 50,000 골드라네.? 후세에 남을 이름값치고는 싸지 않은가? 흥미있나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:818
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fetzil, the Prince of Thieves lieutenant, is smart; he knows enough to hide out when things get hot.  He's not an easy person to catch."
msgstr "펫질, 도적의 왕자의 중책이지. 똑똑하지. 상황이 안좋을때 숨을줄 안다네. 그는 잡기 쉬운 사람이 아니네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:820
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hate taxes!  Why should we pay taxes anyway?  It's bad enough I have to spend my life working for other people; I need to pay them for the 'honor'?"
msgstr "난 세금이 싫어! 왜 내가 꼭 내야하지? 난 내가 다른 사람을 위해 일한다는 것만으로도 열받는데; 그들의 명예를 위해 내는건가? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:821
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Cotton is found in Karigor, the island home of the Church of the Sun and the Church of the Moon.  It doesn't grow well anywhere else, and it's difficult to pick and seed, but it makes for wonderful soft clothes, if you can afford it."
msgstr "목화는 카리고에서 발견됐네, 태양의 신전과 달의 신전의 고향이지. 그것은 딴 곳에는 잘자라지가 않는다네. 그리고 씨를 뿌리기도 쉽지않지. 그러나 아주 부드러운 옷을 만들수 있지, 만일 구할수만 있다면.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:822
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If I could actually use a weapon, I'd probably be better off joining a bandit group.  I bet they lead an easy life."
msgstr "내가 만일 무기를 다룰줄 안다면 난 도적들과 한패가 될걸세. 그들은 쉬운 삶을 사는것 같더군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:823
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sure's been hard to get help recently.  What is a good farmer to do if he can't find strong workers during harvest times?  Go into bankruptcy and ruin, that's what!  Oh, woe is me!"
msgstr "요즘은 도움받기도 힘드네. 농부가 농사를 잘 지으면 뭐하나? 수확물을 거두어들일 힘센 노동자들이 없는데. 남은건 파산뿐이지. 오호..통재로다..  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:824
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'd love to hear what the Oracle would say about the devils, the Temple of Baa, and Prince Nicolai.  Why won't the council consult the Oracle?"
msgstr "난 오라클이 악마에 대해 뭐라그럴지 듣고 싶네. 니콜라이 왕자도. 왜 의회는 오라클을 사용않지?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:825
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Change is in the air and on the wind.  You can smell it and feel it.  Something big's going to happen soon.  I can always tell."
msgstr "변화는 대기와 바람안에 있지. 당신은 느낄수 있네. 조만간 큰일이 일어날걸세. 난 얘기할수있지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:826
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Warm clothes won't help you resist the chill of Castle Darkmoor.  The undead there steal the warmth from your body with their touch."
msgstr "다크 모아성에서는 따듯한 옷 가지고는 안되네. 언데드들은 그냥 만짐으로 당신의 따듯한 체온을 뺐어간다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:827
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The blight that's afflicting western crops and animals is slowly spreading east.  Cows are affected first, and this is causing a very serious leather shortage.  You can expect the price of boots and belts and other leather goods to be increasing!"
msgstr "서쪽의 수확물, 곡식이 말라가고 동물들은 서서히 동쪽으로 이동하고 있네. 소가 제일 먼저 영향을 받았고 그것은 대단한 가죽 부족 현상을 만들었네. 당신도 벨트와 가죽갑옷, 신발등의 가격이 올라가는것을 느낄수 있을꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:828
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This isn't the best job in the world, but at least the work is steady."
msgstr "이건 좋은 직업이 아니네, 그러나 안정된 일이지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:829
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Taxes have been good under this King.  Archibald was terrible, much worse than his father.  I thought I would be ruined by Archibald's cruel taxes.  May he nor his like never hold the throne again!"
msgstr "이 왕이 통치할때는 세금은 문제가 없었네. 알치발드는 끔찍했네. 그의 아버지보다 더했지. 난 아치발드의 세금때문에 파산할뻔 했네. 그가 다시는 왕좌를 차지하면 안되네!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:830
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Let me tell you, some bookshelves or desks or other furniture can be crafted to conceal a secret passage.  You can walk through a room and never realize there were two or three other hidden exits."
msgstr "내가 말해주지, 어떤 책선반이나 책상, 아니면 다른 가구들은 비밀문서를 가지고 있을지도 모르네. 당신이 방에 들어갔을때 비상구가 몇 개가 있는지 모르는 것처럼.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:831
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you ever take a trip near Star Lake, be sure to check out the beautiful statues on the island in the center of the lake.  They are so life-like they're breathtaking!"
msgstr "만일 스타 호수쪽으로 여행을 갈 생각이면, 섬 중앙에 있는 아름다운 상을 놓치지 말게. 그들은 살아있는것처럼 부드럽다네!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:832
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What is big and red and eats rocks? A big red rock eater!"
msgstr "무엇이 크고 빨간 돌을 먹지?  \n크고 빨간 돌을 먹는 것이! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:833
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Come to think of it, the animals all started to go away when the stories of the devils in the West started cropping up.  Yep.  That's probably it.  Pesky critters!"
msgstr "한번 생각해 보게. 모든 동물들은 악마들이 서쪽에서 일어났다고 했을때 도망가기 시작했다네. 그게 맞을꺼야. 귀찮은 푸념뿐이네!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:834
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm so pitiful, the bandits that prowl the roads even laugh at me!"
msgstr "난 너무 가련하지. 길위를 방황하는 도적마저 나를 비웃는 다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:835
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you think your reputation is getting too bad for people to tolerate you, you should check yourself into a temple and start donating, my friend.  The temple will spread word of your generosity far and wide, and people will think better of you for it."
msgstr "만일 당신 생각에 당신의 명성이 다른사람들과 상대하긴 너무 나쁘다면 신전에 가서 돈을 기부하는게 좋을 걸세. 친구여. 신전은 당신의 명성을 높여 줄거고 사람들은 당신에 대해 좋게 샐각할걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:836
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're going to hunt anything, you'll need a bow.  I don't think you are fast enough to chase a deer down with your sword."
msgstr "만일 무언가를 사냥한다면 당신은 활이 필요할꺼네. 내 생각에 당신은 검으로 사슴을 쫓을만큼 빠르지 않은 것 같네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:837
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When I was much younger, I had a chance to see the ruined library of the Church of the Moon at Karigor.  It was made entirely of jade and marble, and once contained the wisdom of the ages within its hallowed halls. If ever you have a chance to visit, take it!"
msgstr "내가 한참 젊었을때, 난 파괴된 카리고의 태양의 신전의 도서관을 본적이 있네. 그곳은 비취와 대리석으로 만들어 졌고 홀은 시대의 현명함을 갖추고 있었다네. 만일 당신에게도 찬스가 있다면 가서 보게! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:838
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The main Temple of Baa is just northwest of Blackshire.  Only members of Baa are allowed inside."
msgstr "바 신전의 본관은 블랙샤이어의 북서쪽에 있네. 바아의 멤버들만 들어갈수 있지.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:839
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The High Council isn't just an ordinary city council– they are the body that represents the lords of the land.  They vote on important matters of state that need to be taken before the king.  They also control access to the Oracle."
msgstr "상원 의회는 보통 의회와 틀리다네. 그들이 이땅을 주무르지. 또 오라클도 그들이 결정을 하곤하지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:840
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is important for guards to be patient.  We can't go out and look for trouble; we need to wait for trouble to find us."
msgstr "가드는 인내심이 있는게 중요하네. 우리는 자리를 비울수가 없거든. 우린 문제가 우리를 찾으로 올때까지 기다려야 하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:841
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The poor queen has lost both her father and her husband.  Hopefully, nothing will happen to Nicolai. "
msgstr "불쌍한 왕비는 남편과 아버지를 다 잃었지. 니콜라이한테는 아무일도 없길 바라겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:842
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm wondering if something foul indeed fell from the sky that Night two years ago.  I am not, however, of the opinion that it was an avenging angel!  More like a devil, if you ask me!"
msgstr "난 2년전밤 에 떨어진 이상한 것이 궁금하다네. 의견들은 그것이 천사의 복수라 하지. 악마들처럼.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:843
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm fine!  Why do you ask?"
msgstr " 난 괜찮네. 왜 그러지?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:844
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Why do grown-ups always have to fight?  Why can't people just get along?"
msgstr "왜 항상 어른들은 싸우지? 같이 살순없나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:845
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What're ya gallivanting' around here for on a Sunday?  It's a day of rest, kid, REST, I say!"
msgstr "일요일날 여기서 뭐하는 거지? 오늘은 쉬는 날이야 꼬마야, 휴식이라고!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:846
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are two kinds of magic armor– armor that increases your protection, and armor that is lighter and easier to wear.  A few rare kinds of armor have both of those properties."
msgstr "두 종류의    마법 갑옷이 있다.? 당신의 방어력을 올려주는 갑옷, 그리고 가볍고 입기쉬운 갑옷. 몇 개의 이상한 갑옷는 양쪽을 다 갖추고 있다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:847
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When a wand runs out of charges, you've lost the value of the wand.  They can never be recharged, but it's usually possible to find a sucker to buy the wand at full price  just before the charges run out."
msgstr "지팡이가 충전이 떨어졌을때, 당신은 지팡이의 값어치를 읽어 버리네. 다시는 회복할수 없네. 그러나  충전이 떨어지기 직전에 바보들에게 제 값 다 받고 팔수있다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:848
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Combining potions in the right proportions can achieve formulas that do very unusual things.  The Guild of Alchemists closely guards the secrets of which potions have which effects."
msgstr "공식을 이용해 포션을 섞어내면 희귀한 결과들이 발생되지. 알캐미스트 길드가 각 포션의 비밀을 보호하고 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:849
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't have much taste for civilization, but you can rest assured that more goods and services will be available on the east coast of Enroth than anywhere else– particularly Free Haven."
msgstr "난 주민들과 별로 친하진 않지만 그러나 당신은 엔로스 동쪽에서 더 좋은 서비스를 받으며 쉴수 있을꺼네.- 특히 프리 헤이븐에서.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:850
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Horses provide an excellent means of travelling if you can afford the cost.  All of the towns and castles  on the mainland have stables where you can hire horses."
msgstr "말들을 빌릴 돈이 있다면 완벽한 여행을 할수 있을꺼네. 거의 모든 도시나 타운에는 마구간이 있고 거기서 빌릴수 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:851
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mages are so lazy, they've formulated several spells to transport people instantly from place to place.  These spells are good, but there's nothing like a REAL journey."
msgstr "마법사는 게으르네. 그들은 장소에서 순간 이동하는 마법들을 발견해냈지. 그러나 진짜 모험보다는 못하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:852
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:882
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard there are sorcerers for hire who can cast the Walk on Water spell if you can't do it yourself.  They charge a lot, though."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는 물위를 걷는 마법을 사용할수 있는 마도사들을 돈을 주고 고용할수 있다 하더군. 그러나 비싸다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:853
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You need to be careful when planning your boat travels.  Certain areas are too dangerous to sail to during parts of the year."
msgstr "보트로 여행할때는 조심해야할 필요가 있네. 어떤 곳은 여행하기는 너무 위험하다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:854
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is important to get treatment for diseases and poisons.  The longer they go untreated, the harder they are to cure.  Getting poisoned or diseased more than once worsens your situation."
msgstr "병이나 독에 대한 약을 가지고 있는 것은 매우 중요하네. 오래될수록 치유하기도 힘들지. 중독되면 움직이기도 힘들어 진다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:855
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The highest level spell in the school of body, Power Cure is an effective way to heal the entire party quickly.  One Power Cure heals more damage faster than 4 smaller healing spells."
msgstr "바디 학교의 최고 높은 레벨의 마법은 모든 파티들을 한번에 치료한다네. 하나의 강한 치료는 4개의 힐링 주문보다 낫다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:856
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You generally have more hit points than spell points, so it is often faster to heal yourself as best as possible with magic, then rest.  You can cut down on your resting times quite a bit this way."
msgstr "당신은 공격포인트가 마법포인트 보다 많을 걸세. 그러니 마법으로 수시로 치료하는고 쉬는게 낫네. 이렇게 하면 쉬는 시간을 줄일수도 있지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:857
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As your level of experience increases, so does the amount of experience you need to improve.  You'll get more benefit from a magical effect or reward that increases your level directly later in your life because of this rule."
msgstr "경험치 레벨이 올라가면 당신이 필요한  경험치도 올라가네. 당신은 마법에 의한 결과나 보상금으로 당신의 레벨을 다이렉트로 올려준다네. 왜냐면 그게 룰이거든.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:858
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Prince Nicolai shows incredible perception and creativity for his young age, much like his father did.  I don't think people give him enough credit– they're more concerned with his age than his ability."
msgstr "니콜라이 왕자는 그의 나이에 비해 믿기지 않을 정도의 창조력과 독창성을 보인다. 그의 아버지가 그랬던 것처럼. 그러나 사람들은 그를 신용하는것 같지는 않네.- 다들 그의 능력보단 나이에 힘쓰지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:859
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It pays to know how to use two or three different kinds of weapons, kid.  That way you can change tactics in battle if an opponent isn't getting hurt by your favorite fish gutter, if ya know what I mean!"
msgstr "두, 세게의 다른 무기들의 사용법을 아는데는 시간이 걸린다네, 그러니 적들이 당신이 좋아하는 무기에 끄덕도 않는다면 다른 무기로 바꿀 필요가 있네. 내 말이 이해가 가나? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:860
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Osric is not only a master warrior, but an ingenious general.  I'm glad to see that he's not taking the recent attacks by the devils lightly.  He's already working on ways to fight back, but the situation looks pretty grim.  If anyone can come up with a way to fight them, however, it's Osric."
msgstr "오스릭은 마스터 전사 뿐이 아니네. 재간있는 장군이기도 하지. 난 그가 최근의 악마 공격에 당한 것을 얘기 안하는게 좋다네. 그는 이미 복수에 손을 쓰고 있고 그러나 상황은 힘든것 같네. 만일 악마들과 싸울수 있는 자를 꼽으라면 오스릭이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:861
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're facing an opponent that can't be put down with direct damage spells, try a mental attack spell, or something that freezes them in place.  This can often give the warriors in your group time to pound the enemy into the ground while distracted by your spell."
msgstr "만일 당신이 마법으로 한번에 쓰러뜨릴수 없는 적을 마주하고 있다면 심적인 마법공격을 한번 해보게. 아니면 그들을 얼려버리거나. 이 마법은 당신 파티들이 얼어있더나 할때 맹타를 퍼부을수 있게 해주네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:862
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gharik attempted to recreate some of the weapons from the Time of Wonders in his forge.  He was never successful, but a number of his experiments provided useful information for enchanting weapons and summoning creatures."
msgstr "가릭은 고대시대 때의 무기를 그의 대장간에서 다시 만들려고 했었지. 그는 절대 성공하진 못했지만 그의 연구결과로 많은 쓸만한 무기와 마법 무기가 탄생되었네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:863
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few Guilds of the Elements exist.  Though their knowledge of the individual elements isn't as pervasive as the more specialized guilds, they are an excellent resource to broaden your knowledge of all the elements."
msgstr "약간의 원소 길드만 존재한다. 그들의 지식들은 다른 길드에 퍼지지 않지. 그들많이 알고 있고 그 곳에서 당신의 지식을 넒힐수 있다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:864
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The essence of life!  Gold oils the squeaking wheel, silences the witness, or loosens his tongue.  Gold puts food on the table and wood in the fire.  How I love thee, O mighty gold.  Never run out of gold, my friend.  Never!"
msgstr "인생의 실체! 황금기름은 바퀴를 굴러가게 하고 조용한 증인, 골드는 식탁에 밥을 먹게 해주고 나무에 불을 떼게 해주네. 내가 얼마나 사랑하는데. 위대한 골드. 절대 골드없인 다니지 말게. 친구여. 절대! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:865
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The most important part of being a merchant can't be taught.  You need to learn to notice a good buy when you see one, and make the good deals when you can.  If you pick up something for cheap in one town, there's a good chance you can sell it somewhere else for a profit."
msgstr "상인이 되는 가장 중요한 부분은 절대 가르칠수 없네. 좋은걸 고를수 있는 안목이 있어야 하고 좋은 거래를 할 줄 알아야 하네. 만일 물건을 싸게 산다면 딴데 가서 비싸게 팔수도 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:866
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I traveled to the lands west of Blackshire recently, and what I saw chilled my blood.  Devils running about a ruined, blighted landscape, killing any humans they ran across.  Something is terribly wrong.  I just don't know why someone isn't doing something about it!"
msgstr "난 최근에 블랙샤이어 서쪽을 여행했네, 그리고 내가 본것은 내 피를 얼어붙게 했지. 악마들이 그곳을 황폐화 시켰고 땅에 희망이라곤 없고 도망가는 많은 사람들을 죽이고 있었지. 무언가 크게 잘못됐네. 난 왜 아무도 그곳에 대해 뭔가 조취를 취하지 않는지 궁금할 뿐이네! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:867
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Compared to many countries, Enroth is a very tolerant kingdom.  Nonetheless, you can end up in jail if you commit enough crimes and are foolish enough to show your face to a guard.  "
msgstr "다른 나라와 비교하면 엔로스는 꽤 강한 왕국을 가지고 있네. 만일 당신이 계속 범죄를 저지르고 가드에게 얼굴을 보이고 다닌다면 당신은 감옥에서 인생을 마쳐야 될걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:868
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Diplomacy is the key to negotiation, and negotiation is the key to many closed doors in the world.  You must be able to sip champagne with the highest lords and guzzle ale with the lowest scum if you want to succeed."
msgstr "외교 는 협상의 키네. 그리고 협상은 많은 닫힌 문들을 열리게 하네. 만일 성공하고 싶다면 군주들하고는 샴페인을 홀짝홀짝 마시고 낮은 사람들하고는 맥주를 팍팍 마셔야 한다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:869
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Find a penny, pick it up, all the day you'll have good luck!"
msgstr "페니를 줏게. 그러면 그날 좋은일이 있을걸세! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:870
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most of the great treasure you'll find will be locked away in a chest or box.  It only makes sense to protect your valuables."
msgstr "당신이 찾을 많은 보물상자들은 잠겨있을꺼네. 그것들은 당신의 귀중한 것들을 방어 하라는 것 밖에 안되네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:871
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is better to talk and let them think you a fool than to keep silent and prove it!"
msgstr "그들과 얘기해 그들이 당신을 바보가 아니라 조용히 입 다물고 있다는 것을 보여주게! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:872
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Poor Eric's temper matches the weather in his kingdom.  Seeing a smile on his face is about as rare as seeing the sun in White Cap.  He's got the wrong way of looking at things, ol' Eric does."
msgstr "불쌍한 에릭의 기분은 그의 왕국의 날씨와 같다네. 그의 웃음을 보는 건 화이트 캡에서 태양을 보는 것 만큼 어려운 일일세. 그는 세상을 항상 안 좋은 시각으로 보지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:873
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lady Fleise is the most difficult mistress to work for in all Enroth, you can be sure of that!  Penny pinching, heart of stone she has!  "
msgstr "플레이스 여사는 엔로스에서 가장 상대하기 힘든 여주인 이네. 확신하네! 1전에도 그녀는 민감할 정도니!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:874
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Different terrains are easier to forage and hunt in.  You don't need to use quite as much food in grasslands, for example, as you do in the desert.  Keep this in mind when you choose a place to camp."
msgstr "다른 지형에서는 말먹이를 구하고 사냥하기에는 좋지. 초원에서는 많은 식량이 필요하진 않네. 사막에 있으면... 항상 캠프를 칠땐 이거 염두에 두게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:875
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Times are tough, and the banks have stopped giving interest payments on deposits recently.  Don't expect anything but security when you put your money in the bank– interest is a thing of the past!"
msgstr "시간은 터프하다네. 그리고 은행은 이자를 안 주지. 아무것도 기대하지 말고 당신이 은행에 돈을 입금할때는 조용히 하게.-이자는 과거의 얘기지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:876
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Loretta's managed to make money by creating and exploiting her lead position in the shipping industry.  She's able to manipulate shipping prices all over the kingdom which brings in quite a bit of money.  I only wish I handled her accounts."
msgstr "로레타는 해운업에서 큰 돈을 벌었네. 그녀는 관련된 돈을 왕국을 넘어서서 관리 했기에 큰 돈을 벌었네. 내 소원은 내가 그녀의 돈을 관리 하는거네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:877
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Better and fresher food that keeps longer is also more expensive.  People out west have figured out the trick of making food that keeps for a long time."
msgstr "좋고 신선한 음식은 오래가지만 비싸네. 서쪽에 있는 사람들은 음식을 오래가게 하는 것을 알고 있는 것 같네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:878
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Herbs can be used to create magical potions.  I don't know the procedure, but I know it's possible.  I wonder how those taste?"
msgstr "허브는 마법 포션을 만드는데도 쓰이네. 난 어떻게 하는지는 모르지만, 그러나 가능하다는 것은 아네. 맛이 어떨지 궁금하네?   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:879
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although it can be expensive, travel using the stables is faster than most any other way, excepting magic, and not many people can do that!  If you're broke, you'll have to hoof it yourself, but don't forget the food cost of travelling by foot!  "
msgstr "어쩌면 비쌀수도 있네. 마구간을 가는게 여행할때는 무지 도움이 되네, 마법만 빼고. 그러나 많은 사람은 마법을 못 쓰니, 돈이 없을때는 혼자 해결해야 하네. 그러나 음식 값을 해결해야 한다는 것을 잊지 말게! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:880
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I love to perform!  I love to travel!  There is no life like that of a bard.  The best gossip, the best food, and, most importantly, the best drink available… why would I ever want to be anything else?"
msgstr "난 연주를 좋아하고, 여행을 좋아하고, 음유시인 같은 삶은 없네. 최고의 화제, 최고의 음식, 중요한, 최고의 술.. 내가 뭘 원하겠나? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:881
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though you can't hear it, the stars and the planets sing as they travel through the sky.  It is the Music of the Spheres– the grandest symphony in the universe!"
msgstr "당신은 못들을지도 모르지만 별들과 유성은 그들이 하늘을 여행할때 노래를 부르네. 바로 천상의 노래지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:883
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Flying is certainly easier than walking.  Safer, for the most part, too.  The only problem is that the Fly spell continually drains your power, so you need to plan your flight trips carefully so the spell doesn't run out."
msgstr "나는 것은 걷기보다 쉽지. 안전하지. 문제가 있다면 당신의 힘을 없엔 다는 것, 그러니 마법이 떨어지지 않게 하기위해 신경을 쓰도록.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:884
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Water walking– my specialty– permits you to walk across most bodies of water as though you were on dry land.  You have to be careful, though, or the spell will run out while you're still over the water.  "
msgstr "물위를 걷는 것?나의 특별한 기술? 당신은 땅위에 있는 것처럼 물위를 걸을수 있네. 그러나 조심해야  할건, 물위에서 마법이 끝나지 않도록 해야하는 것이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:885
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've had to rescue a number of doomed expeditions, and let me tell you the one thing I've learned.  If you go somewhere that you don't think you can handle, RETREAT.  No one will think less of you for it."
msgstr "난 최후의 원정대를 구해냈지. 그리고 내가 배운 한가지를 얘기해주지. 만일 당신이 할수 없다고 생각하면 물러서게. 아무도 뭐라하지 않으니. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:886
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The magics of mind, body, and spirit are the magics of the soul and the self.  To improve one's understanding of them is to improve one's standing with the gods.  "
msgstr "마인드, 바디, 그리고 스피릿의 마법은 영혼의 마법이라더군. 그걸 사용할수 있는자들은 신과 가까운 자들이라더군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:887
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many people have contempt for the simple music of a travelling minstrel, but it is the work of a lifetime to get good at what I do."
msgstr "많은 사람들은 음유시인의 노래에 모욕을 느끼다군. 그러나 내가 하는 일보다 났네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:888
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many areas with magical powers are scattered around the world.  Most often, they are in out of the way locations.  It's to your best benefit to try and discover and use as many of these as you can."
msgstr "세계의 곳곳에는 마법의 힘이 걸린 장소가 많이 있네. 그곳들은 보통 가는 장소는  군데군데 있네. 그런 곳들을 찻아 무었이 있는지 밝혀보게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:889
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "People say bad things about my homeland of Regna all the time, but they don't know what they're talking about.  Never will you find a more fun loving, happy people than on Regna, nor a more fiercely independent people."
msgstr "사람들은 나의 고향 레그나에 대해 나쁜 얘길하지. 그러나 그들은 그들이 무슨 얘기하는지도 모르지. 아마 레그나만큼 행복하고 좋은 곳도 찻기 힘들꺼네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:890
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best way to learn is to make sure to fight challenging opponents.  You don't grow by picking on things weaker than yourself.  The true path to glory leads through winning tougher and tougher battles."
msgstr "싸움을 걸어온적들을 피하지 말게. 당신보다 약한 자는 싸워봤자 아무 이득이 없네. 강한자와 싸워 이겨야 보람이 있지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:891
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is a mystical deck of tarot cards some claim to have seen.  No person ever sees the deck twice.  To draw from the deck is to draw a new hand in the game of life."
msgstr "어떤 사람은 정말 신비한 타롯 카드를 본적이 있다더군, 그러너 아무도 두번 본적은 없다더군. 덱 을 끌어내는건 인생에 새로운 모험을 하는것 같다더군.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:892
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most of the dangerous areas left in the world are found to the west.  Paradise Valley and Dragonsand are the most notable, though the western parts of the Frozen Highlands and the Mire of the Damned are difficult as well.  As a general rule, the farther west, the more difficult."
msgstr "서쪽에는 아직도 무섭고 위험한 곳이 많네. 파라다이스 밸리 와 드라곤 샌드가 아주 유명하지. 그리고  프로즌 하이랜드 와 마이어 오브 댐드도 상당하다네. 서쪽으로 더 뒷편은 더 어렵다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:893
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't stress the importance of diplomacy enough.  A good diplomat can excuse any action, no matter how foul. "
msgstr "난 나의 외교가 거만 떨기엔 충분치 않다고 생각하네. 좋은 외교는 어떤 행위도 용서되지. 아떻게 하든.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:894
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Devils!  Bah!  They're nothing more than illusions created by mages hiding vast treasure somewhere in Paradise Valley.  I know a few of those sorcerers personally, you see.  This ring I'm wearing was a gift from one of them."
msgstr "악마! 바아! 마법사들이 만들어낸 환상들이 거대한 양의 보물을  파라다이스 밸리에 숨겨놓았다더군. 난 게인적으로 그들 중 몇 명의 마도사들을 아네. 보시다시피 내가 하고 있는 이 반지는 그들이 내게 선물로 준거네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:895
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some people are born to trade, or negotiate, or fight, or study.  I'm born to steal, and I'm pretty good at it.  Times are a lot harder now because of all the calamities; it's hard to find things worth stealing anymore– people are way too careful with what they have."
msgstr "어떤사람은 태어날때부터 무역자, 협상가, 전사, 학자이기도 하지. 난 태어날 때 부터 훔쳤네. 지금은 아주 잘하지. 시간이 흘러 이젠 힘들어졌네; 더 이상 훔칠정도로 가치있는 물건이 없다네.-사람들도 그들의 물건을 꼭꼭 숨겨놓고.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:896
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank God for Sundays!  If I had to work every day I think I would revolt against my noble oppressors and replace them with a capitalist-bourgeoisie run quasi-democratic society where I would still have to work long hours for little pay."
msgstr "오!  신이 축복한 일요일이군! 만일 내가 매일 매일 일했더라면 난 분명히 왕에게 반란을 일으켰을 걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:897
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wonder what life was like before the Silence with a governor in charge of everything?  It couldn't have been very good, or there wouldn't have been a rebellion."
msgstr "난 침묵의 시대전엔 통치자들은 어떤 삶이었는지 궁금하군. 아마 좋았을꺼야. 폭동도 없었을 꺼고.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:898
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are three styles of hats popular these days, ranging from the cloth hat to the fancy, expensive sort made by the highest quality tailors.  Wizards like to enchant quality hats because they're lighter than helms and don't block your vision.  Also, a certain kind of conical hat seems easier to enchant than others."
msgstr "요즈음에는 3가지 모양의 모자가 인기가 있네. 옷과 모자를 맞추어 입고 유명한 재단사 가 만들은 것이 있고 마법사는 마법이 깃든 모자를 좋아하지, 왜냐면 그것들은 헬멧보다 가볍고 당신의 비젼을 막지 않거든. 그리고 원뿔형의 모자는 다른 것보다 마법걸기가 쉽다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:899
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Before the Silence was the Time of Wonders.  Magical creations handled all the hard labor– I wish I had one to do my chores."
msgstr "고대시대전의 침묵의 시대 때. 마법생물은 노동자들이 지휘했다더군, 나도 내 잡일을 위해 하나 있었으면 좋겠네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:900
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All are equal before the majesty of the law:  Rich man as well as poor is prohibited from sleeping under bridges, stealing bread and begging for change.  –Voltaire"
msgstr "법이 생기기 전에는 모든게 동등했었네: 부자들도 가난한 자들처럼 다리밑에서 자고 구걸하고 빵을 훔쳤다더군 - 볼타이어"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:901
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's easier to let a barrel roll down hill than to push it up.  Sometimes it's better to just go with the flow."
msgstr "통을 굴리는게 언덕위로 미는것 보다 쉽네. 가끔은 그냥 가는것도 좋지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:902
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not all clay is created equal.  The best clay can be found in the bed of the rivers and streams flowing past Free Haven."
msgstr "모든 점토는 똑같이 만들어지지 않았지. 최고의 점토는 강가나 프리 헤이븐에 있는 개울속에 있는 것이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:903
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some articles of clothing have been enchanted.  It will benefit you to wear these types of magic clothes."
msgstr "어떤 옷들은 마법이 걸려있네. 이런 옷을 입는건 당신에게 도움이 될걸세.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:904
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone should wear shoes, not just nobles and rich people!  What are you going to do if you hurt your feet?  How are you going to keep working?"
msgstr "모두들 다 신발을 신어야 하지, 귀족이나 부자뿐만이 아니고! 발을 다치면 어떻게 할건가? 어떻게 일을하지?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:905
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If I was smart, do ya think I'd be digging ditches for a living?  Be serious, please."
msgstr "내가 똑똑 했다면 도랑이나 채굴하고 있겠나? 심각하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:906
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grindstones are so hard to make and find, it's a wonder anyone ever becomes a miller.  I hear that Karigor has a great rock quarry that turns things like millstones out by the hundreds.  "
msgstr "그린드 스톤 은 만들기도 힘들고 찾기도 힘드네. 제분업자들의 꿈이지. 내가 듣기론 카리고에는 좋은 맷돌을 만들수 있는 좋은 돌들이 많이 있다는군.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:907
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Can you imagine the Elves starting a war over deforestation?  Where do you get wood if not from trees?  How am I supposed to make a living if I don't have lumber to shape and build with?"
msgstr "엘프들이 삼림 벌채꾼들하고 전쟁을 시작했다는 걸 상상할수있나? 만일 숲이 없다면 어디서 나무를 얻지? 재목이 없다면 무엇으로 집을 짓고 살지?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:908
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Churches and kings seem to spend a lot of time thinking about paving stones and whatnot.  If it weren't for them, I would hardly have any work at all."
msgstr "교회와 왕들은 많은 시간을 돌과 장식 선반을 꾸미는데 쓰는것 같네. 내가 그들이랑 있지 않았다면 난 열심히 일하지 않았을 꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:909
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Why are there only twenty hours in a goblin day? Ever see a goblin with twenty-four fingers and toes?"
msgstr "고블린의 날은 왜 20시간 밖에 없지? \n\n24개의 발과 손을 가진 고블린을 본적이 있나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:910
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Used to be plenty of game out west.  Not so much, these days. Maybe it has something to do with the blight that's been killing the plants in Pleasant Valley."
msgstr "서쪽 바깥에는 재미있는 게임이 있는 것 같더군. 요즘은 많진 않지만. 어쩌면 플리젠트 벨리의 식물들을 죽인 것과 관계가 있을진 모르겠군.."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:911
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most people have too many problems of their own to help out a poor beggar like me, but the priests of the Temple of Baa always seem to have time and money or food for me.  I'm very grateful to them for helping me."
msgstr "많은 사람들은 나 같은 거지를 도와주기에는 자기들의 문제가 너무 많지. 그러나 바아 신전의 주교들은 항상 나를 위해 돈과 음식이 있는 것 같네.  난 그들의 도움에 정말 감사하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:912
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The blight everyone's been talking about has been killing all the cows!  Now tell me.  How's a soul supposed to make a living rustling cattle when there's no cattle to rustle?"
msgstr "말라버린 모든자들은 소를 죽이는 이야기를 하고 있지. 내게 한번 말해보게. 어떻게 살아있는 소들을 그렇게 죽일수 있다는 거지?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:913
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mogreds are extinct in Enroth, and almost extinct in Karigor.  They were over-hunted because of how valuable their horns are for enchanting."
msgstr "모그레드는 엔로스에서 거의 절멸했네. 크리고에서도. 그들은 모두 사냥당했지, 왜냐면 그들의 뿔은 가치가 있고 마법적이었거든.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:914
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's a paper shortage that's come up recently, and I can tell you, my clients do NOT like it.  It's amazing to hear some wealthy noble like Loretta Fleise complain about the cost of paper.  She probably has the largest pile of gold in the kingdom, perhaps even the world, and still she complains."
msgstr "요즘에는 종이들이 부족하고 나의 고객들은 별로 안 좋아하네. 그리고 로레타 플레이스같은 귀족이 종이 값에 대해 불평하는 건 신기할 정도네. 그녀는 왕국에서 제일 많은 엄청난 돈을 가지 고 있을텐데,어쩌면 세계일지도 모르지. 그러나 불평한다네..  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:915
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Based on worshipping nature and the world around us, this church cared less about the people and more about its selfish goals.  "
msgstr "우리 주위 세계의 자연적인 예배의 기본은 벗어나지만 이 교회는 사람들보다 그들의 목적에 더 신경쓰는것 같네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:916
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I could certainly use a holiday.  How many clerks do you know of that work every day of the year?"
msgstr "난 공휴일을 즐길수 있었는데. 당신은 쉬는 날 없이 일년내내 일하는 종업원을 몇 명이나 알지? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:917
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know most people don't feel our job is important.  With the events recently, however, it's extremely important for us to keep order.  We will be as vigilant as ever!"
msgstr "모든 사림들은 우리 직업이 별로 중요하지 않다고 여기지. 최근 일때문에. 어쨌든 우리한테는 명령을 지키는게 대단히 중요한 일이지. 우리는 계속 경계할걸세!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:918
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hope your luck is better than mine.  I've lost a lot of money on sure bets recently.  I think the bad luck of the Ironfists is rubbing off on me."
msgstr "난 당신이 나보다 운이 좋았으면 좋겠네. 난 최근 도박에서 돈을 많이 일었다네. 내 생각에는 아이론피스트의 나쁜 운이 나를 다 털리게 한것 같네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:919
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hate Sundays!  It is ever so hard to get good help to work on Sunday.  Like it's different than any other day!  Humph."
msgstr "난 일요일을 싫어하네! 일요일에는 도움을 받을수도 없거든. 보통날과는 다르니까! 흠.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:920
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Baa changed my life for the better!  Surrender your will to Baa, and you will forever be free of doubt and pain!"
msgstr "바아는 내 삶을 더 좋게 만들어 주었네! 당신도 바아를 믿게, 당신은 고통없이 살게 될꺼야!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:921
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't wait for the Circus of the Sun to get here.  I've been good all year, so hopefully my parents will take me to see it!"
msgstr "난 태양의 서커스가 여기까지 오기를 기다릴수가 없어요!. 난 일년동안 잘했고 드디어 부모님들이 날 데려가기로 했지! "

