#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:151
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:151
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Lost Book of Khel will advance my skills in the dark arts beyond that of even Sandro!\nI am forever in your debt!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:152
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:152
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We need to consult Korbu!\nYou have agreed to bring us his remains and his Sarcophagus!\nDo not bother us until you have these items!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:153
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:153
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Korbu?\nHe was the greatest of our kind, and yet he always seemed troubled.\nThere are some of us that remember the times before he left. He always seemed disturbed to me."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:154
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:154
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Korbu left us after making the \"Arrangement\" with the necromancers here in Shadowspire.\nWe aid them in any research they are working on, and assist with the defense of their guild.\nIn return we are allowed to feed on the local population without hindrance."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:155
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:155
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Guild of Necromancers is very stingy when it comes to parting with Lich Jars.\nYou may be better off seeking out Zanthora, and obtaining one from her."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:156
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:156
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "the Lost Book of Khel is rumored to hold the secrets to the ultimate powers of the dark art of necromancy.\nIt may be good that no one knows where it is!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:157
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bastian Loudrin has been a great friend to the guild. Sadly, I must refuse his request at this time. Even as we speak, my guild is embroiled in a battle for its very survival. For you see, the Temple of the Sun has declared a holy war on us. Most of our members are away in the fields either leading armies or raising zombies to serve in them.I wish I could say otherwise, but the accursed temple holds the upper hand. If only the balance would tilt in our favor."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:158
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If we had the Nightshade Brazier back in our possession, Shadowspire's defense would not be an issue. We could bring this war to the doors of the Sun Temple. We would annihilate them!Knowing its importance, the clerics keep the brazier in a secure chamber deep within their temple. Dyson Leland believes he can gain access to that chamber. Bring him to the temple, recover the brazier and return it to me. You want me in your alliance? Well, do this for me, and I will be in your debt.If you have any questions about the Nightshade Brazier ask Thant. It was he who created the thing."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:159
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:159
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will not join you until the security of the guild is secure. Bring me the Nightshade Brazier from the Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods. We will talk again of alliance after that is done."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:160
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Early on our conflict, the Sun Temple attempted to infiltrate our ranks with a spy. Such foolishness--thinking they could so easily deceive a host of dark magicians!It was child's play to unmask their agent--one \"Dyson Leland.\" Since then we have turned him against his former masters, or so it would seem. Frankly, I don't entirely trust in his loyalty. Still, he has proven useful. As long as he does, we will continue to let him live."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:161
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How can anyone's quest for power bring him to participate in the horrors of the Dark Path? And yet, here is a whole house of them! Oh, they will call themselves \"seekers of knowledge,\" but these magicians of death are abomination! Loathsome corruption incarnate!Only through my own fear can the foul Necromancers' Guild call itself \"my master.\""
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:162
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When I was young, all I wanted to do was to join the Order of Light--to be a selfless servant of the good. As soon as I was of age, I entered the Temple of the Sun with a heart filled with the fire of purity.What a fool I was. If there is goodness in the world, I have not seen it. There is certainly none in the halls of the Sun Temple! Hiding behind the righteousness of sanctity, Order members perform the worst crimes of greed and self-indulgence. If it were not so horrid, it would pass for something like irony."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:163
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few months ago, I was called to a private audience with the Sun Temple head priest, Oskar Tyre. He sent me out on a mission of infiltration against the Necromancers' Guild. \"Become as they are,\" he said. \"Gain their trust. While you bide your time waiting to deliver a killing blow, feed us their secrets.\"A too simple plan from too simple a leader! Oh, I did as he said, bathing myself in evil so I might seem evil. But it was as if the guild could see into my heart. I was unmasked as a spy. Under threat of death, I now follow their orders. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:164
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:164
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join with you? An interesting idea. But what can you offer me? After all I have been through I find myself consumed with a thirst for revenge. I would go with you, but am unwilling to spend my efforts lightly. Give me an opportunity to hurt one of my enemies--the cursed Temple of the Sun or the abominable Necromancers' Guild--and I will travel with you gladly."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:165
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:165
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that the Nightshade Brazier covers Shadowspire in its fortifying darkness. Thant goes to lead his minions."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:166
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Certainly the elemental unrest concerns us greatly. Why one need travel only a short distance north from our temple to see a great maelstrom of unnatural duration and fury. But sadly we have other matters pressing.The sick horror that is the Necromancers' Guild must be blighted from this land! We wage holy war on the evil in Shadowspire. Our entire spirit and power goes into the campaign we wage against Sandro and his minions. Until that is done we cannot entertain participation in your alliance."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:167
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Then again, we could spare some resources for your alliance if the war would turn in our favor. Perhaps you could be our agent of fortune?Inside the Necromancers' Guild is a device known as the \"Skeleton Transformer.\" It converts living creatures into the skeletons which the dark mages use for the bulk of their reinforcements. If it were destroyed, we would quickly have the upper hand.We have an agent, Dyson Leland, placed in their guild. Find him and help him to wreck their skeleton making device. Do this and I will consider your request more favorably."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:168
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:168
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You come here again with talk of alliance? I have told you what you must do. Go to the Necromancers' Guild in Shadowspire, find Dyson Leland and help him to destroy their Skeleton Transformer!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:169
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent work! With the Skeleton Transformer destroyed, I am more than confident that the light of righteousness will cleanse Shadowspire of evil. The Necromancers' Guild is as good as no more.As I agreed, you may now consider the Temple of the Sun an ally against the elemental cataclysm. I myself will sit on your alliance council in Ravenshore. I will make my departure arrangements with all due haste."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:170
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:170
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take the prophecy so lightly that you shirk the role it has cast for you? These are dire times calling for dire actions from all. Go forth across the land and forge the unity represented by the alliance. Go, unless you favor the oblivion that threatens us!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:171
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:171
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Using Arion Hunter's boats we have managed to gather some information. I sent one to Ravage Roaming and another to the Dagger Wound Islands. It is reported that strange portal gateways have appeared in both regions. The gateway in the islands stands on the slopes of the large volcano that rose from the sea southeast of the main island. The Ravage Roaming portal is in the middle of the large lake. It is said that the water which formed the lake flooded out of the gateway."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:172
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Within hours of our first meeting, a most fortuitous development occurred. We were contacted by a great sage, Xanthor, of the Ironfist courts of Enroth!Using his great magic, he projected his image into this very chamber. He and Roland and Catherine Ironfist were at sea off our shores when the cataclysm occurred. They survived the resulting storms and now would like to land in Ravenshore to aid the alliance. Unfortunately, they are blocked by the Regnan pirate fleet. We must help them to land. Xanthor claims much knowledge of what has happened here. We need his council!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:173
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our sources believe the main Regnan fleet is in a hidden port somewhere on Regna Island. If you could sink the fleet in dock you could greatly cripple their ability to patrol the seas off our shore. Unfortunately, we don't have a fleet of our own strong enough to make a landing on Regna.Brekish Onefang has gotten message to us that the Regnans have built an outpost on an atoll off the main Dagger Wound Island. He believes this outpost is resupplied by mysterious means. His scouts never see ships land there, but they are always well stocked. Perhaps you should go there and solve the mystery. Perhaps the answer will convey you to Regna?Regardless of the means, the Regnan fleet must be sunk if the Ironfists are to land in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:174
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your good work sinking the Regnan fleet has already had the desired results. Just yesterday morning, Catherine and Roland Ironfist arrived along with their sage, Xanthor. With them in the alliance, we are made stronger--immeasurably so.I will admit that the time of this crisis has contained some of my darkest moments. Thanks to your efforts I believe that the worst of this is over. I have hopes that we will indeed survive this."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:175
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:175
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must sink that Regnan fleet! It is imperative that the Ironfists be allowed to land safely. Their sage Xanthor has knowledge of the crisis that we cannot do without."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:176
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:176
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For all their claims of empire and their airs of civilization, the Regnans are the worst scum of Jadame. Why I cannot find myself the least bit surprised that they would take advantage of the crisis to expand their pirating operations. What concerns me most is their new outpost on Dagger Wound. I am sure they mean to use it as a base of attack on the continent. Why, it even puts them in striking distance of Ravenshore!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:177
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have only met with him briefly, but I am convinced that Xanthor is remarkably knowledgeable about the workings of the elemental planes. Apparently he learned much from the Ironfists' elemental allies during their recent campaigns against the devils of Erathia.Even now he studies the strange crystal in the town square. You may find him there, or perhaps in the nearby residence we have provided him."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:178
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We of the council have great faith in this Xanthor. He has told me that he is formulating a plan for dealing with the elemental crisis. If anyone can find a solution to our problems, it is he.If you would help us further, be of service to this great sage. Consult with him about the crystal and see what you might do for him."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:179
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:179
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We look to Xanthor to formulate our next actions. Go to him and see how you can help."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:180
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:180
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "That we have been joined by the royal court of Enroth has been nothing but good. I was worried they would be afflicted with the need for pomp which infects many other monarchs. I am gladdened to report that this is not the case with this king and queen. They disembarked and set directly to work on our problem. As key members of our alliance, you will find access to them easy. We have put them up in houses here in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:181
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:181
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "From what Xanthor has told us, I'm sure all of the elemental planes are dangerous. Still, I would advise you to take particular caution when exploring the Plane of Fire. Its denizens, according to reports from the Ironsand Desert, are being particularly belligerent."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:182
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:182
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All I know of the Plane Between Planes is what I learned from the Alvarian loremasters. Still, if the Destroyer's base is there, proceed with the greatest caution! It is said the plane is made of the stuff of chaos from which all the other planes are formed as if from clay. While chaos has a form, it is fluid. Whatever you see there will not be as it seems. And what is there may be subject to continuous change."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:183
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:183
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What the Alvar loremasters told me of the Plane Between Planes applies here. While I am sure the prisons of the elemental lords are prisons in every sense of the word, I am equally sure that they will not appear as one would expect."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:184
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:184
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Merchant Guild of Alvar owes you a great debt. As a small measure of repayment, we have decided to make this merchanthouse permanently available to you. Please take this gift from us as a token of our profound gratitude for your valorous deeds."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:185
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know being part of your alliance is important work. Still, I do miss the hunt! I keep imagining all the good fun my men are having while I'm here pushing around papers.Hurry up with this alliance business! I want to get this mess taken care of with dispatch! Without the thrill of the hunt, my life is missing its usual spark."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:186
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:186
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Judging from the tactics employed by the Regnan pirates, I suspect that Blackwell Cooper is involved. Cooper is an old…shall we say, \"associate,\" of mine. Why, if I were a gambling man, I'd bet gold that he is leading the Regnan expeditionary force on Dagger Wound."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:187
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:187
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know I hold the council's minority opinion on the subject, but really, I don't see why we have to involve some charlatan magician in this matter! Surely this crisis is solvable, like most things, with judicious application of a length of well-forged steel."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:188
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:188
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fah! If you ask me, this idea of Xanthor's is foolhardy! I say if we're facing attack by elemental armies, we should be raising an army to meet them. Frankly, all this talk of prophecy leaves me uneasy. This council is too much under the sway of the Ironfist's pet wizard. I say we take the fight to the elemental planes and introduce the invaders to the sharp edges of our blades!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:189
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:189
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I tell you, this Xanthor is sending you on a wild goose chase. \"Plane Between Planes,\" indeed! What hogwash! The worst of it is that we make no preparations for war in the event the crazy scheme fails, which I expect it will. This mad following of prophecy flies in the face of good military sense!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:190
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:190
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have had more of my share of doubts about this Xanthor, but it is the mark of a man how readily he admits his errors. It is clear to me now that he has given nothing but good and effective advise. If he tells you to rescue the elemental lords, then that is what you must do. Go! And good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:191
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good to see you again, Heroes of Jadame. A good job there, saving the world, and all. You certainly have my thanks, and I'm sure, the thanks of many.I'm sure you've got plenty of other opportunities at this point, but let me know if you want a job hunting Dragons. Probably not much of a challenge for the likes of you, but the offer stands!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:192
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Small ones, hurry with your alliance preparations! My patience with this land lacking in caves and prey grows dangerously thin. Not only must I sleep in a barn, these people do not even raise cattle. I must live off of fish! Fah!If you value my good temper, be quick!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:193
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:193
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Reaching Regna Island is no small challenge. One of my scouts has reported to me that Regnan boats lie thick on the sea. He also said he saw that the Regnans have a craft that can travel beneath the water. It is said they supply their Dagger Wound outpost with the craft. Perhaps you can use it to reach Regna. The pirates will either miss your passage or take you for one of their own."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:194
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:194
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know this is not the time to think of revenge, but I would pass onto you something I learned about my enemy, Charles Quixote. The Minotaur king, Masul, mentioned that Quixote keeps a sword of great power with him in his keep. It is called, \"Snake.\" Perhaps your acquiring of it would help the alliance cause?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:195
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:195
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My Dragon patrols have located two of the elemental gateways. One lies on the side of a large volcano southeast of the largest Dagger Wound Islands. The other is located in the center of the large lake in Ravage Roaming. I know not where they lead, but you will have to cross a lot of water to reach either."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:196
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:196
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An Erathian Dragon visited my cave shortly before you arrived there. He reported to me that a new type of Dragon, one seemingly made of crystalline rock, has been seen in Erathia. I'm not sure why I tell you this. Perhaps the giant crystal in the town square reminds me of the story. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:197
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:197
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Interesting that the Destroyer himself sends you to undo his works. I guess I am not surprised. The workings of the greater Powers are mysterious at best."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:198
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:198
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have done this land and Dragonkind a great service. For this, we owe you. Know that we will tolerate your presence in our caves, further, we will not hunt you as prey."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:199
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you know that our temple in Murmurwoods is the first in this land of Jadame? It is our mission to bring the Light to all corners of the world--even here. We were surprised to see that our enemies, the Necromancers' Guild had preceded our arrival with their own. But no matter, they will soon be dealt with.Say, don't you think this merchant house would make a fine Sun Temple? I will bring it up with Fellmoon after the crisis is over."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:200
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:200
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're off to Regna, you might want to look for the Mace of the Sun. When my brothers and I made the crossing from Erathia, we were attacked by the Regnan fleet. All but one of our ships escaped. Sadly, the lost ship was the one carrying the mission leader, Brother Howe. He had the weapon in his possession. I saw Brother Howe slain by the pirates, but perhaps they still have the mace."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:201
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:201
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How dare you insult me with your presence?\nYou have chosen the Path of the Light, and have forever renounced me as your teacher.\nGo now, and wallow in your weakness somewhere else."
msgstr "어떻게 감히 당신이 당신의 현재 모습을 모욕할 수 있단 말인가?  당신은 빛의 길을 선택했고, 나를 당신의 선생으로 영원히 포기했네.  지금 가서, 누군가에게 당신의 나약함을 호소해보게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:202
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:202
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your bravery has advanced our faith tremendously, Priests.\nIt's with pleasure that I can hereby promote all Priests to Priests of the Dark, and all honorary Priests to Honorary Priests of the Dark.\nThank you so much for your help!"
msgstr " 성직자, 당신의 용기는 우리의 신념을 완전히 발전시켰네.  나는 이로써 성직자를 어둠의 성직자로, 아너리성직자를 아너리어둠의 성직자로 승진시킴을 기뻐하고 있다네.  도와줘서 고맙네!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:203
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You know…I have a power stone that will activate the portal to the abandoned temple. And you have one that will allow us to reach the island where that portal is!If we joined forces, we could reach the temple with ease. What say you?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:204
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:204
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Looks like your party's all full up, so I can't travel with you now. But the offer still stands. If you need me, I'll be at the Adventurer's Inn."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:205
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:205
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Simon Templar, the knight, into your party?\nIf you would like Simon Templar to join you, click YES.\nIf you would like him to wait for you at the Adventurer's Inn, click NO."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:206
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:206
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have to have all the parts together and properly assembled for me to animate it, students!\nI can't animate incomplete golems."
msgstr "학생, 당신은 모든 부품들을 가지고 있어야 하고, 내가 그것을 부활시킬 수 있도록 적절히 조립해야만 하지!  완전하지 않은 골렘은 부활시킬 수 없다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:207
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very well. You have done as I have asked of you. Now I will return the favor. I will travel with you to meet your merchant guildmaster, and perhaps beyond if you will have me. There is little for me here.Shall we be off?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:208
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:208
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It seems that you're party is too full for me to join. I will therefore travel alone to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there when you have room. Until then, farewell."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:209
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:209
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Would you like Arius the Minotaur to join you?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:210
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:210
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will be happy to journey with you when your party is not so full. I will travel to the Adventurer's Inn. If you need me, I'll be there."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:211
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:211
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you have Rohani Oscleton the Dark Elf join you?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:212
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:212
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm glad you've decided to take me, but your party is too full. I guess I'll start my adventure by traveling to the Adventurer's Inn. See you there!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:213
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:213
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, I am ready to travel. Shall we go?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:214
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:214
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmmm. It seems your party is full. I will travel to the Adventure's Inn. You will find me there ready to join you when you have room. Good luck."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:215
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:215
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Ithilgore the Dragon into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:216
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:216
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though your party is full, I will still join your cause. I will travel to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there if you want me to travel with you."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:217
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:217
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Karanya Memoria the Necromancer into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:218
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:218
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot travel with you now; your party is too full. If you want me to journey with you, you will find me at the Adventurer's Inn."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:219
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:219
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you accept Maylander the Cleric as a follower?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:220
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:220
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm, I prefer to travel with a smaller party than you have. Tell you what…I'll travel to the Adventurer's Inn. If you want me I'll be there. 'Til then, farewell."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:221
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:221
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will always be in your debt for saving my father.\nIt would be an honor and a privilege if you allowed me to travel with you.'"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:222
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:222
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though I am honored that you would have me, I cannot join you for your party is full.\nYou can find me in the Adventurer's Inn if you ever wish my services."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:223
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:223
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Clan of Balthazar will always be in your debt for recovering the Axe of Balthazar and returning it to Masul.\nLong may Masul lead us!\nI would be honored if you would allow me to travel with you."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:224
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:224
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am honored that you would allow me to travel with you, however, I see that your group is full.\nI will travel to the Adventurer's Inn.\nYou can find me there if you wish me to join you in your travels."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:225
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:225
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that my herd is safe, I will gladly join you. I'm sure Herdmaster Masul will not object to me helping the saviors of my people. Shall we?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:226
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:226
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can see that your party is too large to include me in its ranks. Still, my thirst for adventure has been whetted by your offer. I will travel to Ravenshore and seek my fortune there. Perhaps you will find me at the Adventurer's Inn there. I will look for you there!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:227
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:227
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Jasp Thelbourne the Dark Elf into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:228
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:228
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, I'd be happy to go with you now, but your party is too full. But, I will make my services available to you. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Seek me there if you would have me."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:229
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:229
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Gethric Mercutura the Vampire into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:230
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:230
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, but your party is too full. But now, it is settled. It is a life of adventure I seek! I will travel to the Adventurer's Inn. If you will have me, I will be there."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:231
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:231
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Flamdring the Dragon into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:232
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:232
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join them? Yes? But no, their numbers are too great. But adventure I still seek. Well then, to the Adventurer's Inn I must go, for there gather those who would seek their fortunes."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:233
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:233
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you travel with Hevatia Deverbero the Necromancer?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:234
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:234
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your party is too full for me to join. I will go to the Adventure's Inn. You can take me into your group there if you have the room."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:235
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:235
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Verish the Cleric into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:236
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:236
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know I would serve the Light well by joining you, but your party is too full. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there if you have the room."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:237
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:237
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Nelix Uriel the Knight into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:238
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:238
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't go with you. Your party is too full. But you know? Things here are wrapping up and I have little to do. I'll travel to the Adventurer's Inn and seek my fortune there. Maybe we'll meet up there."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:239
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:239
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Sethrc Thistlebone the Troll into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:240
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:240
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm…you're party is too full, but still I wish to help you. I will go to the Adventure's Inn. If you need a strong clubber, you will find me there."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:241
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:241
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you care to travel with Rionel the Minotaur?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:242
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:242
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't go with you now. Your party is full. I will still make myself available to you. If you need me, I'll be at the Adventurer's Inn."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:243
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:243
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Adric Stellare the Dark Elf into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:244
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:244
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, I will gladly join you. Unfortunately, your party is too full. Tell you what. I'll go to the Adventurer's Inn. If you want to travel with me, you'll find me there."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:245
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:245
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take the Vampire Infaustus into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:246
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:246
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would go with you, but your party is too full. I prefer to travel with fewer people. I go now to the Adventurer's Inn. There I will find my companions."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:247
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:247
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you ask Brimstone the Dragon to join you?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:248
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:248
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, but your party is too full. Still, you are clearly the ones I seek. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Join with me there when you have room."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:249
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:249
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many our the Shadowspire Guild thanks for recovering the Lost Book of Khel! Perhaps I can join you in your travels to provide my own personal assistance?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:250
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:250
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would like to join you in your travels to provide my own personal assistance but I see that your group is full.\nYou can find me in the Adventurer's Inn if you need me."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:251
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:251
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It was very noble of you to seek a cure for the knight, Blazen Stormlance.\nI would like to join you in your quest! Will you have me?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:252
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:252
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I could join with you now, but your party is too full. I will wait for you in the Adventurer's Inn. Until then, good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:253
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:253
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Tempus the Knight into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:254
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:254
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot travel go with you. Your party is much too large for my preferences. I like to work with a smaller, more mobile group. Tell you what. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Join me there once you get rid of some of your dead weight."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:255
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:255
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will your travel with Thorne Understone the Troll?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:256
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:256
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great. Listen. I have some business I need to attend to before I can go with you. We'll meet at the Adventurer's Inn. I will join you there."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:257
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:257
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Ulbrecht the Minotaur into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:258
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:258
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would go with you now, but your party is too full. I will make preparations then travel to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there when you have room for me. Until then, good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:259
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:259
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks again for your help!\nMay I join you?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:260
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:260
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would like to join you in your adventures but your group is already full!\nI will await you in the Adventurer's Inn."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:261
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:261
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Artorius Veritas the Vampire into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:262
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:262
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't go with you, your party is too full. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Join me there."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:263
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:263
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take the Dragon, Duroth the Eternal into your party?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:264
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:264
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will join you, but not now. I have to see to some matters which will take me some days to deal with. After I'm done I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:265
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:265
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you agree to travel with Nathaniel Roberts the Necromancer?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:266
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:266
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fah! You are more a mob than an adventuring party. I'm looking for a smaller group. I will seek them at the Adventurer's Inn. If you want to journey with me…well, perhaps you'll find me there."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:267
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will gladly join you. My desire for revenge has been a thirst long in need of slaking. You have provided me with the cup. Let us go and fill it!Dyson Leland offers to join your party. Do you accept?"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:268
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your group is too full for me to join, but here is my plan…I will make my escape from the guild and meet you at the Adventurer's Inn. It may take me some time to get there, as I must travel with caution.Meet me there when you can. My revenge has waited for over a year. It can wait a few more weeks. Wish me luck!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:269
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:269
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will be forever in your debt.\nNot only did you rescue me from the lair of Zanthora, but you helped my daughter be promoted by Sir Charles Quixote.\nI would like to join you in your travels!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:270
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:270
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Unfortunately, there is not enough room in your group for me to join you now.\nI can be found in the Adventurer's Inn if you need me."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:271
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:271
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have to get the plans to him before he attacks Riverstride.\nIf you don't, they won't lead his forces into all the traps we've prepared for them.\nSo hurry up and deliver those plans!\nI'm counting on you!"
msgstr "당신은 그가 리버스트라이드를 공격하기 전에 그에게 그 계획을 전해주어야 합니다.  만약 그렇지 못하면, 그들은 우리가 준비해 놓은 덧으로 그들의 군대를 이끌고 오지 않을테니까요.  서둘러 그 계획을 전달해 주십시오!  나는 당신을 믿습니다!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:272
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:272
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You told the king the plans were fake?!?\n[The Queen puts her hand on her head, jaw agape] I have never seen such incompetence in all my life!\nAstounding!\nGet out of my sight!\nJust go!\n"
msgstr "당신은 그 왕에게 계획이 속임수라는 것을 말했습니까?!?  [여왕은 멍하게 그녀의 머리를 쥐어 짠다.]  내 인생에서 이 처럼 무능력한 일을 본적이 없어요!  꺄아악!  내 눈 앞에서 사라져!  가버려!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:273
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:273
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[The Queen raises her eyebrows with interest as you tell her how you infiltrated her fort, stole secret plans, and killed many of her guards while in the service of a foreign king] I wish I could truthfully say this is the most shocking treason I have ever witnessed, but unfortunately, it's not.\nNonetheless...Guards!\nOff with their heads!"
msgstr "[여왕은 당신이 어떻게 그녀의 요새를 공격하고 미밀계획을 훔쳐냈으며 그녀의 수비대를 죽였는지 말했을 때, 흥미있게 눈을 치켜뜬다.]  내가 본 반역 중 가장 충격적인 것이라는 걸 말할 수만 있다면.불행하게도 그럴 수가 없군.  수비대!  그들의 목을 메어라!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:274
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:274
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, time ran out for poor Loren.\nHe was executed for espionage by Avlee on schedule.\nDon't bother with the rescue.\nHe's gone."
msgstr "자, 불쌍한 로렌의 시간이 다 되었다.  그는 계획대로 스파이활동의 혐의로 처형되었다.  이제 구출도 소용없어.  그는 죽었으니까."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:275
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:275
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "King Parson is beyond the date when he could have used those false papers.\nDon't bother taking them to him--it doesn't matter anymore.\n"
msgstr "파슨 왕은 그가 거짓 계획을 이용할 수 있었을 때, 이미 기한을 넘겼어.  그에게 거짓 계획을 갖다 주지 않아도 되네. - 더 이상 소용없으니까."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:276
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:276
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome.\nI understand you've been appointed Lords of Harmondale by that idiot Markham.\nYou know, I WILL restore Avlee's rule over Harmondale--the only question is whether you are with me, or against me.\nIf you're with me, I will ensure that you retain your post.\nAgainst me, and I will have done with you once my armies occupy your lands.\n[King Parson smiles affably] So, of course you're with me!\nYou just need to prove it.\nLike a famous leader once said:\nTrust, but verify!\nWords to live by.\nWhat I want right now is the plans to Fort Riverstride.\nIt's a huge fort that stands between your lands and Erathia proper.\nYou can't miss the thing.\nSneak in there and get me those plans.\nIf you can do this, I will be in your debt.\nNot only that, there's a substantial gold reward as well.\nIf the plans are to be any use to me at all, though, I need them delivered to me within a month."
msgstr "환영하오.  나는 얼간이 마크햄에 의해 당신이 하몬데일의 군주로 임명된 것을 이해하네.  당신도 알다시피, 나는 애브리가 다시 하몬데일을 지배하도록 할 거야. - 문제는 당신이 내 곁에 있을지 나에게 등을 돌릴지라네.  만약 내 곁에 일을 것이라면, 당신의 지위를 계속 유지하도록 해주겠네.  적이 된다면, 나는 우선 당신의 나라를 차지할 것이네.\n\n[파슨 왕은 상냥하게 웃는다.]  물론 당신은 내 곁에 있겠지!  당신은 그것을 증명할 필요가 있지.  유명한 지도자가 한 말처럼 말이네. : 믿으라, 그러나 확인하라!  그 말이 진실인지.  지금 내가 원하는 것은 리버스트라이드 요새에 대한 계획이네.  그것은 당신의 나라와 에라시아 사이에 있는 거대한 요새지.  이것을 잊으면 안되네.  그 안에 몰래 들어가서 계획을 알아오게.  당신이 그렇게 한다면 고맙겠네.  그것 뿐 아니라, 기본적으로 골드를 보상으로 주겠네.  만약 내가 그 계획을 사용할 수 있다면, 그것이 한 달 안에 이루어져야 하네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:277
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:277
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[The King smiles broadly as you hand him the plans]\nThank you!\nThese will be VERY useful.\nMy factor will deposit 5,000 gold pieces in your bank account for services rendered.\nWhen we finally win this round against Erathia, I will not forget you."
msgstr "[당신이 그 계획을 왕에게 전해줄 때, 왕은 활짝 웃는다.]  고맙네!  정말 쓸모있을 거야.  나의 사무관이 보상으로 당신들의 은행계좌에 5,000골드를 입금해 주겠네.  우리가 에라시아를 정복한다면 당신을 잊을 수 없을 거야."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:278
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:278
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I really do need those plans soon.\nIf you take too long, I'll have to prepare my attack without the plans."
msgstr "나는 곧 필요한 조치를 취하네.  당신이 오래 걸리지 않는다면, 계획없이 공격준비를 하겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:279
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:279
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[The King smiles broadly as you hand him the false plans.\nSucker! ]\nThank you!\nThese will be VERY useful.\nWhen we finally win this round against Erathia, I will not forget you."
msgstr "[내가 가짜 계획서를 그에게 건네주었을 때, 그 왕은 활짝 웃는다.]  고맙네!  정말 쓸모있을 거야.  우리가 에라시아를 정복한다면 당신을 잊을 수 없을 거야."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:280
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:280
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What do you mean, these plans are false?\nSo you admit to plotting against me?\n[The King throws up his hands in disgust] Guards!\nTake these traitors to the courtyard and execute them!"
msgstr "무슨 뜻이지, 이 계획이 잘못된 것이라고?  그러면 당신은 나에 대해 역모를 꾸몄다는 것을 인정하는 것인가?  [왕은 화를 내며 당신의 손을 뿌리친다.]  수비대!  이 반역자를 앞마당에 끌고 나가 처형해!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:281
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:281
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The wily queen moves against me, eh?\n[The King frowns in thought, then brightens] I have an idea!\nI know someone who looks just like that spy she wants you to rescue.\nBring my man with you and deliver him to the Queen.\nShe's never met him, and won't know the difference.\nHis 'inside information' will encourage her to make mistakes.\n[The King takes a moment to summon the imposter]\nBe careful not to tip your hand.\nIt wouldn't do for her to discover our little plan.\n"
msgstr "약삭빠른 여왕이 내게 등을 돌렸다고?  [왕은 눈쌀을 찌푸리며, 밝은 표정으로]  좋은 생각이 났다!  나는 그녀가 구하기를 원하는 스파이처럼 보이는 사람을 알고 있지.  나의 부하와 당신을 보내서 그를 여왕에게 데려가라.  그녀는 그녀를 만나지 못했었고, 그 차이점을 알지 못하겠지.  그의 '내부 정보'는 그녀를 실수하도록 할거야.  왕은 그를 데려오도록 한다.]  들키지 않도록 조심하게.  그녀는 우리의 작은 계획을 알아 채지 못할 거야."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:282
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:282
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The imposter has infiltrated her military and diplomatic advisors' ranks, and will cause plenty of damage before he's discovered, I'm sure.\nThank you for your help! My factor will deposit 5000 gold into your account at the bank."
msgstr "그 첩자는 그녀의 군대와 외교 조언자들을 습경했고, 많은 피해를 입힐 것이다.  도와줘서 고맙네!  내 사무관이 당신의 은행계좌에 5,000골드를 입금시킬 거네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:283
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:283
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's important to get the imposter to the Queen before Mr. Steel's scheduled execution.\nAfter all, you can't rescue Mr. Steel if everyone knows I've executed him.\nAnd she'll become suspicious if I stay the execution.\nI've never stayed one before."
msgstr "스틸의 계획된 처형이 집행되기 전에 그 첩자가 여왕에게 갔다는 것이 중요하지.  결국, 모든사람이 내가 그를 처형했다는 것을 알게 된다면 당신은 그를 구할 수 없을 거야.  그리고 그녀는 내가 그를 처형했는지 궁금해 하겠지.  나는 전에 한 곳에 머무르지 않았지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:284
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:284
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You told Queen Catherine about the imposter?!? I can't believe my ears!\nWhy did you do it?\nWhy?\n[The King stands and points at the door] Get out!"
msgstr "당신이 캐서린 여왕에게 그 사기꾼 이야기를 했지!?! 난 내 귀를 믿을 수 없어! 왜 그랬어! [왕이 서서 문을 가르킨다] 나가!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:285
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:285
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[The king is silent while you detail your crimes against Avlee, then smiles and spreads his hands once you've finished] Well!\nI suppose that story speaks for itself, doesn't it?\nGuards!\nTake these traitors to the courtyard and execute them!"
msgstr "[왕은 당신이 애브리에게 저지를 죄를 이야기하는 동안 입을 열지 않았다. 그리고는 웃으면서 당신은 끝장났다는듯이손을 폈다. 글쎄! 난 사실은 자명하다고 생각해, 안그래? 수비병! 이 반역자를 안마당으로 끌고가 형을 집행하라!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:286
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:286
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The time where I could have used those plans is over.\nThanks for any efforts you may have put into finding them, but I no longer need the plans."
msgstr "내가 계략을 사용했었으면 했던 시간은 끝났다. 당신이 그들을 찾는데 들인 노력에는 감사하지만, 더 이상 계략은 필요하지 않아."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:287
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:287
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The execution date for Loren Steel has passed.\nDon't bother bringing the imposter to the Queen--she'll be too suspicious for our ruse to succeed.\nHe'll be leaving you now."
msgstr "로렌 스틸에 대한 형집행 날짜는 지나버렸다. 사기꾼은 여왕에게 데려가는걸 방해하지마 - 여왕은 성공할 우리의 계략에 대해서도 또한 의심할꺼야."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:288
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:288
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My loyal subjects!\nYou were the ones who took the Trumpet!\nGood work.\nWe thought it lost forever.\nOnce again, my purser will deposit gold in your account.\n5,000 gold, to be exact."
msgstr "내 충신여여! 당신은 트럼펫을 가진 사람들 중에 하나였네. 수고했네. 우리는 영원히 그것을 되찾지 못할 것이라고 생각했네. 나의 사무관이 당신의 은행 계좌에 5000 골드를 입금시킬 것이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:289
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:289
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, the Trumpet!\nYou captured it!\nWe weren't sure how things turned out when news of the human raid reached us.\nThank you again, my friends.\nMy factor will deposit 5,000 gold in your account for your services."
msgstr "아, 트럼펫! 당신이 트럼펫을 잡아습니다. 우리는 인간들의 습격 소식이 우리에게 전해졌을 때, 일이 어떻게 될지 알 수 없었습니다. 다시 한번 친구인 당신에게 감사드립니다. 나의 관리인이 당신의 봉사에 대한 댓가로 당신 계좌로 5000 골드를 입금할 것입니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:290
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:290
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If there is one piece of advice I could give you, it would be to fix your castle.\nI don't know how you're going to find the gold and workers to do it, as only wealthy nobles and kings can afford such large scale projects.\nI suppose it's the old chicken and egg question...you must appear noble to gain wealth and respect, but you must have wealth and respect in order to appear noble.\nIn any event, if you expect to be lords of Harmondale for more than a few months, you need to find a way to prove you're not just lucky peasants.\nYou must prove that you're fit to rule."
msgstr "내가 당신에게 한번이라도 충고할 수 있었다면, 성을 수리할 수 있었을텐데. 난 당신이 어떻게 금을 찾을지와 일꾼들이 그걸 어떻게 할지를 몰라요. 단지 부유한 귀족과 왕만이 그처럼 큰 규모의 프로젝트를 할 여유가 있으니까요. 난 그것이 오래된 닭과 달걀 문제라고 생각해요...당신은 부와 존경을 얻은듯 보여요. 하지만 당신은 부와 명성을 귀하게 보이도록 하는데 사용해야만 해요. 어떠한 사건속에서도, 몇달 이상을  하르몬달레의 군주가 되고자 한다면, 당신이 단지 운좋은 시골뜨기가 아니라는 것을 증명할 수 있는 길을 찾을 필요가 있습니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:291
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:291
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Once again, the Human kingdom of Erathia and the Elvish kingdom of Harmondale are fighting.\nAs the local Judge, it has fallen to me to patch up their differences and bring the two sides to the negotiating table.\nThe two sides are so evenly matched that either could prevail.\n[The judge leans closer to you, lowering his voice] And I'll tell you something else--I don't much care anymore who wins.\nThey are like children fighting over a toy.\nNeither really wants Harmondale--they just want to deny it to the other.\nSo, you're on your own.\nWhatever actions you take now in support of one side or another could really make a difference.\nJust remember that they couldn't possibly care less what happens to you or who rules in Harmondale.\nProtect yourselves and your people first.\nWe didn't have this conversation."
msgstr "다시 한번, 에라시아의 인간왕국과 하르몬달레의 엘비쉬 왕국이 싸우고 있습니다. 지역적인 판결에 따라, 그들의 견해차이를 조정하고 협상테이블로 양측을 데려오는 일에 제게 맡겨졌습니다. 양측이 공평하게 어울려 둘다 승리할 수 있었죠. [판결은 당신에게 달려 있습니다. 목소리를 깔면서] 그리고 내가 당신에게 다른 중요한 것을 말하지요 - 난 누가 더 이상 이기는 것에는 신경쓰지 않아요. 그들은 애들이 장난감을 놓고서 싸우는 꼴이죠. 둘다 실제로는 하르몬달레를 원하지 않았죠 - 그들은 단지 다른 한쪽을 부정하고 싶어하는거죠. 그래서 당신은 스스로의 힘으로 있는거죠. 당신이 지금 어느 한쪽의 지원 속에서 취하는 행동이 어떤 것이든지, 실제로는 달라지는거죠. 그들이 당신에게 일어나는 일과 누가 하르몬달레를 통치하는 가에 대해서 가능한 신경쓰지 않을 수 없다는 것만을 명심하세요. 먼저 당신 자신과 당신 사람들을 보호하세요. 우리는 이런 대화를 하지 않았습니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:292
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:292
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You were wise to return the Trumpet to me.\nNow I can use it to help shore up the weak side in this conflict and promote peace.\nThank you.\n"
msgstr "당신은 트럼펫을 내게 돌려줄만큼 현명했지요. 이제 나는 이런 투쟁속에서 약한 자들의 사기를 높이고 평화를 촉진하는 데에 도움이 되도록 트럼펫을 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:293
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:293
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A wise decision.\nYou won't regret this--believe me.\nI knew you were going to make this decision, and my bags are already packed and ready to go.\nAll you need to do now is get me to my new home, and I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr "현명한 결정. 당신은 이걸 후회하지 않을거야-나를 믿어. 난 당신이 이같은 결정을 할거라 알고 있었지. 그리고 내 가방은 이미 떠날 채비를 했어. 이제 당신이 할 일은 나를 새로운 집으로 데려다 주는 것이지. 그리고 난 남은 자들을 돌볼 것이다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:294
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:294
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your first order of business is to talk to Lord Ironfist and complete his 'mission.'\nOnce your ability and loyalty are proven, you will be allowed to help in more…interesting… ways."
msgstr "사업에서 당신의 첫 명령은 아이언피스트 주인에게 말해 그의 '임무'를 완성하는 것이지. 일단 당신의 능력과 충성이 증명되면, 당신은 더 많이 도울수 있게 되지....재미있는....방법들."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:295
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:295
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Each of the advisors to Lord Ironfist has a task for you, complete each one.\nTalk to Kastore, Dark Shade, and Maaximus for more information.\nThe completion of these tasks is vital for our future."
msgstr "아이언피스트 주인에게 각각의 고문들은 당신을 위한 임무를 가지고 있으며 각 하나씩을 완성한다. 카스토르, 다크 쉐이드 그리고 맥시무스에게 더 많은 정보를 물어보라. 이들 임무의 완료는 우리의 미래에 매우 중요하다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:296
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:296
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tolberti has a mission of great importance.\nEverything we've staked so far rests on its completion.\nPrepare well for his task or you will certainly fail."
msgstr "톨베르티에게는 아주 중요한 임무가 있다. 우리가 지금까지 말뚝을 박은 모든 것은 그 완성에 달려있다. 그 임무를 위해 잘 준비해라, 그렇지 않으면 분명히 실패할 것이다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:297
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:297
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Xenofex and the rest of the Kreegan must be put down; go to their 'hive' in the Land of the Giants and put a stop to Xenofex and his minions once and for all."
msgstr "크리간의 엑노팩스와 남은 자들은 분명히 저지되어야한다; 거인들의 땅에 있는 그들의 은신처에 가서 엑노팩스와 그의 추종자들을 이번만은 중지시켜라."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:298
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:298
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You will need to visit the craft that brought Kastore and his men to Erathia to continue.\nGo west of Avlee, and make sure to be properly outfitted."
msgstr "당신은 계속하기 위해 카스토어와 그의 사람을 에라시아로 데려갔던 명품을 찾아가 봐야 할 필요가 있네.  애브리의 서쪽으로 가서 잘 되어가고 있는지 확인하게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:299
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:299
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bring the Oscillation Overthruster back to Kastore with all possible speed!\nEvery moment you dally allows a chance for failure!"
msgstr "가능한 한 빨리 파동발생기를 카스토어에게 가져가게!  지체하면 실패할 거네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:300
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:300
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great!\nYou've done the right thing!\nThough the path of light can be hard to walk at times, the ultimate rewards are well worth it.\nI'm already prepared for the trip.\nAll you need to do now is get me to my new home, and I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr "훌륭해!  당신은 옳은 일을 했네.  비록 빛의 길을 가기가 어려운 일이지만, 그에 대한 보상이 따를 걸세.  나는 여행준비가 되었네.  지금 당신이 해야하는 일은 나를 나의 집으로 데려가는 것이지.  나는 여생을 편히 쉬면서 보낼 거야."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:301
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1275
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:301
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:370
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you seek to further your skills with the staff? Excellent! The staff can work offensively and defensively, and make you more difficult to hit. My teachings will raise you to Expert level, but first you must have a skill level of 4 with the staff and of course there is my small fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr "지팡이 쓰는 기술을 한 층 더 향상시키고 싶은가?  좋아!  지팡이란 공격과 방어에 다 쓰이니 방어력을 올려줄 수 있네.  내가 가르쳐서 순력자 수준으로 올려줄 수 있지만, 먼저 지팡이 기술이 4 레벨 이상되어야 하고, 물론 2000 골드의 수련료도 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:302
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1276
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:302
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:371
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You wish to continue on the path of mastery of the staff? If you prove an apt pupil and have already achieved an Expert skill level of 7 with the staff, I will gladly instruct you to Master level for 5000 gold.\nWith the skills I will teach you will have a chance to stun your opponent!"
msgstr "지팡이 기술로 고급에 까지 이르고 싶은가?  자네가 문하생이 될 자격이 있고 순력자 기술로 7 레벨 이상이라면, 수련료 5000 골드로 기꺼이 고급 수준으로 올려주겠네.  그 수준에 이르면 상대방을 주춤거리게('순간 마비'마법같은) 할 수도 있지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:303
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:303
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To achieve Grand Mastery of the staff, you must deal with me! Before I can instruct you, you must have reached a Master Skill level of 10 with the staff, and pay my price of 8000 gold.\nIf you meet my qualifications, I will teach you to wield the staff dealing out addition damage equal to the level of your skill."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:304
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1278
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:304
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:373
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So the sword is your weapon of choice, and you would like to have the skill to slay more effectively? Then I can help you!\nMy instruction will teach you to use your blade more quickly than before. If you have 2000 gold and have reached a skill level of 4 with the sword, I will instruct you to Expert level."
msgstr "그럼 검을 선택하였군. 그래서 기술을 향상시켜 더 효과적으로 검을 쓰고 싶다는 것이지?  그러면 내가 지도해 줄 수 있네!  내가 가르치면 전보다 더 빨리 검을 쓸 수 있을 거네.  검술이 4 레벨 이상이고 2000 골드의 수련료가 있다면, 자네를 중급 수준으로 올려주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:305
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1279
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:305
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:374
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bah!\nEven the strongest plate armor can be sliced like a melon by someone who can wield a sword with Mastery!\nWith an Expert sword level of 7 and 5000 gold this I can teach you!\n With the skills I teach, you can carry another weapon in your left hand, making you twice as deadly."
msgstr "푸!  가장 강한 철갑옷이라도 고급의 검술사라면 멜론을 자르듯이 베어낼 수 있지!  중급 검술로 7 레벨 이상이 되고 5000 골드의 수련료를 낸다면 고급 검술을 지도해주겠네!  그 수준에 이르면 검을 왼손에 쥐고 쓸 수 있으니, 2 번 공격할 수도 있지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:306
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1280
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:306
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:375
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Even the cheapest steel can save the life of a warrior who has achieved Grand Mastery of the sword. With Grand Mastery you will be more difficult to hit.\nIf you have reached a Master skill of 10 with the sword and can pay my fee of 8000, I will teach you all the techniques of a Grand Master Swordsman."
msgstr "검술사의 최고급라면 아주 하찮은 칼로도 목숨을 지켜낼 수 있네.  최고급의 수준에서는 방어력이 더 높아지네.  고급 검술로 10 레벨 이상이고 8000 골드의 수련료를 낼 수 있다면, 최고급 검술의 모든 기법을 지도해 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:307
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:307
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have a dagger and I bet I can kill you before you draw yours! Speed can kill and the dagger is the fastest weapon! With what I can teach you, you can carry another weapon in your off hand. Two are better than one. The Expert skills of the dagger can be yours if you have a dagger skill level of 4 and can pay my modest fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:308
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:308
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ha!\nThe fastest survive! As a Master of the dagger I have and will survive! My teachings can greatly increase your chance of causing critical damage! If you have an Expert skill level of 7 and 5000 gold I can lead you to Mastery!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:309
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:309
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The quickest dagger--the one that is never seen--is the ultimate weapon.\nYou can rapidly attack your foe before he has a chance to strike you once.\nWith Grand Mastery of the dagger, this can be yours.\nYou must have a Master skill level of 10 and 8000 gold to receive my instruction."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:310
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1284
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:310
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:379
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Speed kills, especially when that speed is driving an axe. With my instruction you can have this Expert ability. You will strike more quickly than before, demolishing your foes! You must first have a skill level of 4 with the axe and pay my price of 2000 gold."
msgstr "속도가 상대를 제압하는거야, 특히나 도끼를 쓰는데 속도가 붙는다면.  내게 배우면 도끼 기술의 중급이 될 수 있네.  그 수준에서는 더 빨리 칠 수 있을테고, 적들을 제압하게 될거네!  먼저 도끼 기술 4 레벨 이상이 되어야 하고 수련료는 2000 골드야."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:311
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:311
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of the axe and skilled hands can split an opponent's head like a pudding. With my instruction you can have this ability! You blows will cause more damage than before, devastating your opponents! But first you must have an Expert skill level of 7 with the axe and pay my price of 5000 gold."
msgstr "고급의 도끼와 그 능숙한 손놀림이라면 상대방의 머리를 푸딩처럼 짤라 버릴 수 있네.  내게 배우면 자네도 그 능력을 가질 수 있지!  전 보다 더 강력한 타격을 날리게 되고, 상대를 유린할 거야!  허나 먼저 숙련가 도끼 기술이 7 레벨 이상 되어야 하고 수련료로 5000 골드를 내야하네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:312
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:312
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As a Grand Master of the axe, your opponents' armor will mean nothing.\nThe effectiveness of their armor will be cut in half as you slice it from their carcasses! I can teach you this skill, but you first must have a Master skill level of 10 with the axe and pay me 8000 gold."
msgstr "도끼 기술의 최고급에겐 상대의 갑옷이나 방패는 의미가 없네.  그들의 방어구에 있던 방어력이 반으로 줄어들테고, 자넨 그들을 쓰러뜨린 후에 갑옷을 얇게 썰어 낼 수도 있네!  내가 자네에게 이 기술을 지도해 줄 수 있지만, 먼저 고급 도끼 기술이 10 레벨 이상되어야 하고 수련료 8000 골드를 내야하네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:313
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:313
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Spear expertise makes you one with your weapon.\nWith this skill you will cause more damage to your foes.\nI can raise you to an Expert level if your skill level is 4 and you have 2000 gold."
msgstr "창술을 중급 수준으로 높이면 창과 하나가 될 수 있네.  이 수준에서는 적에게 더 심한 타격을 입힐 수 있지.  창술 레벨이 4 이상이고 수련료 2000 골드를 내면, 내가 지도해 주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:314
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:314
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The spear is your weapon of choice? Would you like to learn to carry a shield or another weapon in your off hand to improve your combat ability?\nThis Master knowledge can be yours if you have an Expert skill level of 7 with the spear and 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:315
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1289
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:315
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:384
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you seek to further your skills with the spear? Excellent! The spear can work offensively and defensively, and make you more difficult to hit. My teachings will raise you to Grand Master, but first you must have a Master skill level of 10 with the spear and of course there is my small fee of 8000 gold."
msgstr "정말 창을 쓰는 기술수준을 한 증 더 높이고 싶은가?  훌륭하네!  창은 공격과 방어에 모두 쓰이지, 그래서 방어력을 더 올려줄  수 도 있네.  내가 최고급의 기술을 전수해 줄 수 있네만, 먼저 고급 창술로 레벨이 10 이상되어야 하고 또 당연히 수련료가 8000 골드 필요하지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:316
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1290
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:316
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:385
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Like to keep your enemy beyond arm's reach do you?\nThe bow is the best way to slay your enemy before he can harm you.\nWith my teachings you'll reach Expert status and be able to fire your bow more quickly, thus eliminating your enemy at range.\nI will teach you if your skill level with the bow is 4 and you pay the price of 2000 gold."
msgstr "적들을 멀리에 두고 다가오기 전에 공격하고 싶은가?  궁술은 적이 공격하기 전에 베어 버릴 수 있는 가장 좋은 방법이지.  내가 중급 수준으로 가르치면, 더 빨리 활을 쏴서 적을 없애버릴 수 있네.  먼저 궁술 레벨이 4 이상 되어야 하고 수련료 2000 골드를 내면 가르쳐 주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:317
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1291
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:317
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:386
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Think you are fast with the bow?\nThe speed you have now is nothing compared to what I can teach you.\nMy Master lessons can teach you to fire 2 arrows where Experts can only fire one.\nThis requires an Expert skill of 7 with the bow and the fee of 5000 gold."
msgstr "자신의 활 쏘는 솜씨가 빠르다고 생각하는가?  내가 가르치는 것에 비교한다면 자네의 그 속도는 아무것도 아닐세.  고급 기술을 내게 지도 받으면 중급이 한 번 쏘는 동안 2 발의 화살을 쏠 수 있네.  중급 궁술로 7 레벨 이상 되야 하고 5000 골드의 수련료가 필요하지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:318
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1292
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:318
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:387
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Speed with the bow can definitely be an advantage, but that speed combined with the knowledge of how to seriously injure your foe can be the difference between life and death.\nI will teach you Grand Mastery of the bow and you will increase the amount of damage that each shot does.\nYou must be a Master with a skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold for this instruction."
msgstr "빠르게 활 쏘는 것이 분명히 유리하지만, 적에게 더 심각한 타격을 주는 방법을 알게 된 후에 빠르게 활 쏘는 것과는 아주 큰 차이가 있네.  난 최고급의 궁술을 가르쳐서 자네가 활 쏘기 타격치를 높이도록 할 수 있네.  먼저 고급 궁술로 10 레벨 이상이 되어야 하고, 수련료로 8000 골드를 내야 하네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:319
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1293
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:319
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:388
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The mace is a subtle weapon.\nWhere blades and dagger slash the flesh, the mace can break bones and destroy organs without all the bloody mess. As an Expert with the mace you will inflict more damage, increasing combat effectiveness.\nIf you have achieved a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 I will instruct you."
msgstr "철퇴는 교묘한 무기지.  칼이나 단검은 살점을 베어버리지만, 철퇴는 핏덩이를 내지 않고 뼈를 부러뜨리고 내장을 파괴하지. 철퇴의 중급이 되면 타격치를 더 낼 수 있고, 효용을 높일 수 있네.  중급이 되려면 철퇴 기술의 레벨이 4 이상 되어야 하고 수련료 2000 골드를 내야하네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:320
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1294
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:320
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:389
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who needs subtlety when your opponent is unconscious?\nMastery of the mace will give you the chance to stun or even paralyze your enemy.\nFor 5000 gold and proof that you have reached an Expert skill level of 7, I will teach you Mastery of the mace."
msgstr "상최고급 의식불명일 때 교묘한 공격이 필요한가?  철퇴술의 고급이 되면 적을 멈칫하게('순간마비' 주문처럼) 할 수도 있고 아예 마비시킬 수도 있네.  철퇴술 중급으로 레벨이 7 이상이면, 5000 골드로 고급의 철퇴술을 전수해 주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:321
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:321
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A greater chance to subdue your foes means a smaller chance you will be hurt yourself.\nGrand Mastery of the mace will increase your chances of stunning or even paralyzing your foes.\nIf you have a Master skill level of 10 and can pay me 8000 gold, I will instruct you."
msgstr "적을 제압해서 움직이지 못하게 할 수 있으니 공격도 덜 받게 될 것이네.  철퇴술의 최고급은 적을 마비시키거나 멈칫하게 만들 확률이 높다네.  철퇴술 고급으로 레벨이 10 이상이라면 8000 골드를 내게. 내가 최고급의 철퇴술을 전수해 주지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:322
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:322
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, now that things seem to be settled with our little war with the Temple of the Sun. Sandro has said that guild members may turn their attention to other matters. Since arriving in Jadame, I have seen little of it save for the lands of Shadowspire. Say...perhaps you could use my services!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:323
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:323
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I could join with you. Sadly, our war with the Temple of the Sun takes up all of our time. The guild cannot spare me now."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:324
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:324
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes! I would love to join with you. Now that our holy war against the foul Necromancers' Guild seems to be going well, I find I have little to do around here. I will go with you if you will take me."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:325
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:325
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The shield can be your friend.\nIt keeps those who wish you dead from striking at you.\nWith the Expert skill in shield I can teach you, you will eliminate the penalty to your weapon's recovery for carrying a shield.\nThis skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 with the shield."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:326
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1300
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:326
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:395
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of the shield makes its defensive bonus doubly effective, making you that much harder to hit!\nI will teach you Mastery of the shield if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr "방패술의 고급이라면 방패의 방어력을 2 배로 올려서 전체 방어력을 보다 높일 수 있지.  먼저 방패술 중급으로 7 레벨 이상이 되어야 하고, 3000 골드의 수련료를 낸다면 내가 고급의 방패술을 전수해 주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:327
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1301
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:327
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:396
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Under my Grand Master tutelage, you will learn to make the shield the ultimate defense.\nNot only will it protect you in melee but will also give you the benefits of the Shield spell.\nThis skill can be yours if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 with the shield and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr "나의 밑에서 최고급의 기술을 전수 받는다면, 방패의 방어력을 최대로 높일 수 있지.  혼전, 접근전에서 뿐만 아니라 '방어막' 주문처럼 원거리 공격도 막을 수 있지.  먼저 방패술 고급으로 레벨이 10 이상 되어야 하고, 수련료로 7000 골드를 내면되네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:328
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1302
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:328
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:397
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Leather armor is the lightest protection around.\nIt keeps those who wish you dead from harming you.\nWith the Expert skill in leather armor, you will eliminate the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor.\nThis skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 in leather."
msgstr "가죽 갑옷은 가장 가벼운 방어구라네.  적들의 공격으로부터 자네를 보호해 주지.  가죽 갑옷의 숙련가가 되면, 방어구의 무게로 인해 느려지는 일이 없을거네. 가죽 갑옷 기술의 레벨이 4 이상이고 수련료로 1000 골드를 내면 가르쳐 주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:329
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1303
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:398
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of leather armor makes its defensive bonus doubly effective, making you that much harder to hit!\nI will teach you Mastery of leather armor if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr "가죽 갑옷의 고급이 되면 기술의 효용이 2 배가 되고, 방어력이 2 배로 높아지네.  자네가 전문가 가죽 갑옷 기술로 레벨이 7 이상이고 3000 골드의 수련료를 내면 내가 가르쳐 주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:330
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1304
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:399
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Under my Grand Master tutelage, you will learn to make leather armor your ultimate defense.\nNot only will it protect you in melee but will also protect you from the elemental spells of Earth, Air, Fire and Water.\nThis skill can be yours if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 with leather armor and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr "나의 밑에서 최고급의 기술을 전수받으면, 가죽 갑옷이 방어력이 최고 수준에 이르지.  접근전에서 뿐만 아니라 물, 불, 땅, 공기의 원소 계열 마법의 공격에 대해서도 방어력이 증가하지.  고급의 가죽 갑옷 기술로 레벨이 10 이상이고 수련료로 7000 골드를 내면 전수해 주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:331
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1305
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:400
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Chain armor is more durable than leather and offers more protection.\nIt keeps those who wish you dead from harming you.\nWith the Expert skill in chain armor, you will cut the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor in half.\nThis skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 in chain."
msgstr "사슬 갑옷은 가죽 갑옷보다 튼튼하고 방어력도 좋다네.  적들의 공격으로 부터 자네를 보호해 주지.  사슬 갑옷 기술의 숙련가가 되면, 갑옷의 무게로 인한 속도 감소가 반으로 줄어든다네.  수련료는 1000 골드고, 먼저 사슬 갑옷 기술의 레벨이 4 이상이어야 하네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:332
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1306
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:332
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:401
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of chain armor eliminates the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor.\nI will teach you Mastery of chain armor if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr "사슬 갑옷 기술의 고급은 갑옷을 입어도 느려지지 않네.  사슬 갑옷 중급의 레벨이 7 이상이면 3000 골드로 고급의 기술을 배울 수 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:333
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1307
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:402
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Under my Grand Master tutelage, you will learn to make chain armor your ultimate defense.\nUnder my instruction you will learn to use chain to take less damage from the physical blows that hit you.\nThis skill can be yours if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 with chain armor and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr "나의 밑에서 최고급의 기술을 전수받으면, 사슬 갑옷의 방어력이 최고 수준에 이르지.  육체적인 타격에 의한 손상을 줄일 수 있게 되지.  사슬 갑옷 고급으로 기술 레벨이 10 이상이면 7000 골드의 수련료로 최고급이 될 수 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:334
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1308
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:403
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Plate armor is the ultimate protection; compared to it, leather and chain are nothing.\nWith the Expert skill in plate armor, you will cut the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor in half.\nThis skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 in plate."
msgstr "판금 갑옷은 최고의 방어구이네;  이 것에 비하면 사슬이나 가죽 갑옷은 아무것도 아니네.  판금갑옷의 중급이 되면 갑옷의 무게로 인한 느려짐을 반으로 줄일 수 있네.  수련료는 1000 골드네.  먼저 판금 갑옷 기술의 레벨이 4 이상 되어야  한다네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:335
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1309
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:335
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:404
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of plate armor cuts the amount of damage from physical attacks in half.\nI will teach you Mastery of plate armor if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr "판금 갑옷 기술의 고급은 육체인 타격에 의한 손상을 반으로 줄일 수 있네 .  판금 갑옷 중급의 레벨이 7 이상이면 3000 골드로 고급의 기술을 배울 수 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:336
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1310
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:405
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grand Mastery of plate armor eliminates the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor.\nI will teach you Grand Mastery of plate armor if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr "판금 갑옷 기술의 최고급은 갑옷을 입어도 느려지는 일이 없지.  판금 갑옷의 고급으로 기술 레벨이 10 이상이면 7000 골드로 최고급의 기술을 전수해 주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:337
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:337
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Expert Fire Magic you can learn all of the Expert spells for Fire.\nHigher level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nExpert Fire Magic can be yours if you have a skill level of 4 in Fire Magic and can pay the price of 1000 gold."
msgstr "불원소 마법의 중급이 되면 중급 수준의 불원소 마법주문을 배울 수 있네.  더 높은 수준의 주문은 보다 강력하며 일행에게 더 많은 도움을 줄 수 있네. 불원소 마법의 기술 레벨이 4 이상이고 수련료로 1000 골드를 낸다면 불원소 마법 중급으로 만들어 주겠네."

