#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1694
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh!\nThe Seal.\nHere, I'm supposed to give you this money.\nNow, go away before we're seen together!\nSomeone will get suspicious."
msgstr "오! 이 우표. 자, 여기있네. 나는 당신에게 이 돈을 주게 되어있지. 자 이제 어서 가게, 다른 사람들이 의심할지도 모르니 다른 사람들이 우리가 같이 있었다는 걸 모르게 해야하네! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1695
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't try to say I didn't pay you!\nYou got your gold!\n"
msgstr "내가 돈을 안 주었다고 말하지 말게! 당신은 분명히 골드를 받았네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1696
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My instructions are quite clear.\nI am to pay the person carrying the letter that bears the Seal.\nSince you don't have a letter with a Seal, you get no money!"
msgstr "내 소개를 간단하게 하지. 나는 바로 우표가 붙힌 편지를 가지고 오는 자에게 돈을 주는 사람이네. 만일 당신이 우표를 붙인 편지가 없으면 돈을 받을 수 없네!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1697
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just south of town is an old keep called Goblinwatch.\nIt was originally built to help keep the town safe from goblin raids, but times have been so peaceful recently that we haven't been taking care of it.\nYou can imagine our embarrassment when we realized that the very monsters we were guarding against have moved into the keep!\nThey also changed the lock on a very important door leading to the caves below the dungeon level.\nWe have a standing reward of 2000 gold pieces to the ones who can figure out the combination and tell us what it is."
msgstr "마을 남쪽의 오래된 곳을 고블린와치라고 부른다. 원래는 고블린들로부터 마을을 안전하게 보호할려고 세웠는데, 아무일도 일어나지 않으니 요즈음은 신경을 안 썼네. 당신은 우리가 적들을 막으려고 했던 곳으로 침입했을 때 얼마나 당황했는지 상상이 갈 걸세! 그들은 또 던전 지하 동굴로 가는 대단히 중요한 문의 열쇠도 바꾸었다네. 우리는 이제 그 열쇠의 콤비네이션이 무언지 알아내고 우리에게 알려주는 자에게 2000 골드의 현상금을 걸었네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1698
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How can you find the combination to that lock by standing around here?\nGet going!"
msgstr "여기서 이렇게 서성대기만 하면 어떻게 열쇠의 콤비네이션을 알아내겠어? 자 빨리 가자!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1699
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, thank you for taking care of that little detail for us.\nHere's your gold!\nFeel free to return to Goblinwatch any time to finish clearing out the rest of the monsters.\nWe can't pay you, but you can have anything you find there.\n"
msgstr "오, 우리를 위해 조그만 소식을 알려주어서 고맙네. 여기 그대의 골드가 있네! 고블린와치로 돌아가 남아 있는 괴물들을 처치하게. 보상은 못하나 여기서 발견한 모든 것을 가지게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1700
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You did such a fine job with the Goblinwatch assignment that we would like to employ you again.\nA cult has moved into an old abandoned temple a few day's journey west of here.\nTo pay for their blasphemous activities, they've been robbing travelers using the road that leads to Castle Ironfist.\nWe've appealed to the regent to do something about these horrible cultists, but he says all his forces are occupied in the west, or some such nonsense.\nWe want it gone now, so we're willing to pay you 5000 gold pieces to get rid of them and bring us back the Chime of Harmony as proof you've done the deed."
msgstr "당신이 고블린와치 건을 너무나 잘 처리해 주어서 다시 한번 당신을 고용하기로 했네. 이제 예배는 오래되고 버림받은 여기서 서쪽으로 며칠 걸리는 신전으로 옮겨갔네. 그들은 아이언피스트성으로 여행오는 모험자나 여행자들을 약탈질하고 있네. 우리는 리젠에게 이 일에 대한 조치를 취하라고 했으나, 말도 안되는 이유를 둘러대고 모든 신경을 서쪽에 쏟아붓고 있다고 하던군. 우리는 이제 그런 일이 없었으면 좋겠네. 그래서 우리는 당신들이 우리에게 보여주었던 것처럼 그 적들을 없애고 다시 평화로운 길을 만들어주면  5000 골드를 주기로 했네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1701
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Without the Chime of Harmony, I'm not authorized to pay the reward money.\n"
msgstr "평화로운 종소리가 울려퍼지지 않으면, 나는 보상금을 안 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1702
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work!\nHere's your gold!\nI can't thank you enough for ruining that temple.\nNow the road to Ironfist will be safe for travel again."
msgstr "잘 했네! 여기 돈이 있네! 그 신전을 파괴 시킨 걸 뭐라고 감사해야 할지 모르겠네. 이제 아이언피스트로 가는 길은 안전해 졌네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1703
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The road to Ironfist is much safer thanks to you.\nYou have our gratitude."
msgstr "아이언피스트로 가는 길이 훨씬 안전해졌네. 정말 고맙네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1704
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The proprietor of the Howling Moon is George Caniss.\nIt's a wonderful place.\nTell him I said hi!"
msgstr "황량한 달의 소유자는 조지 카니스이다. 아주 멋진 장소이지. 그에게 나의 안부를 전해주게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1705
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you so much for bringing me these letters! <Wilbur begins reading the letters> I’ve been so worried…I see… This is not good news…Oh, no.\nTraitors!\nTraitors and conspirators everywhere!\nI must organize an expedition at once! <Wilbur lowers his voice> I trust you will not speak to the prince about these letters– he is already too depressed and unhappy to hear more bad news.\nAnd now I must see to the organization of the expedition.\nHere is a bag of gold as a reward– you’ve earned it and my gratitude.\nNow, if only I could find someone to finish looking for Lord Kilburn…"
msgstr "이 편지들을 가져와 정말 고맙네! <윌버는 편지를 읽기 시작했다> 나도 많이 걱정했었는데…알았다…별로 좋은 내용은 아니군…오, 아니야. 배신자! 배신자와 음모자는 모든 곳에 있다!  나는 이제 원정대를 조직해야겠네! <윌버는 목소리를 낮추었다> 나는 당신이 왕자에게 이 편지 내용을 말하지 않은 것으로 믿겠네? 그는 이제 더 이상 나쁜 소식을 듣긴 힘들 것이네. 그리고 이제 원정대의 조직도를 봐야하네. 여기 보상에 대한 돈가방이 있네?정말 고맙네. 이제 나만이 로드 킬번을 찾는 것을 끝낼 수 있을꺼야…"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1706
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<Wilbur snaps his fingers> Say, you wouldn’t happen to be interested in taking care of a little detail for me, would you?\nLord Kilburn disappeared near Blackshire.\nFind out what you can and return to me with the information.\nIf it is true that he has been slain by devils, return his shield to me if at all possible.\nI will grant you my favor with the High Council, should you require it, and you can rest assured your compensation will be generous."
msgstr "<윌버는 손을 휘저었다> 말하게, 당신은 나를 위해 이 일을 좀 더 도와 줄 수 있겠지, 그렇지? 로드 킬번은 블랙샤이어 근처에서 사라졌다. 당신이 할 수 있는 일을 찾아보고 많은 정보를 가지고 나에게 다시 오게. 만일 정말 그가 악마의 노예가 됐다면 그의 방패를 가지고 돌아오게. 어떤 방법으로든. 나는 의회와 같히 보조해 주겠네, 필요할 걸세, 그리고 당신 동료들에게 관대한 보상을 약속하게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1707
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm.\nNo luck finding the shield yet, eh?\nWell, do keep looking, will you?\nIt really is important that someone accounts for his whereabouts."
msgstr "음. 아무도 방패를 찾지 못했지, 흥? 계속 찾아보겠나? 누가 어디 있는 지를 찾아 내는 건 절망 중요하네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1708
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If his shield was in my Castle, I think I’d be aware of it.\nPerhaps if you were to leave, you may have better luck finding it…"
msgstr "만일 그의 방패가 내 성에 있으면 내가 분명히 알았을 것이네. 만일 떠난다면 당신은 운 좋게 찾을 기회가 많을걸세."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1709
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah.\n‘Tis a sad day when so noble a Knight should fall to such foul monsters!\nYou have done a good thing, bringing his shield to me.\nI shall ensure that he and his men receive all the honors due them.\nI am in your debt, and you have my favor with the council.\nHere is your reward."
msgstr "오. ‘이 괴로운 날이여, 멋진 최고의 기사가 하잘것 없는 괴물 따위에게 쓰러지다니!  당신은 일을 잘 처리해 주었네, 그의 방패를 내게 가져오게. 나는 그와 그의 사람들에게 신의 축복이 함께 할것을 확신하네. 난 당신에게 신세 졌네. 그리고 의회도. 여기 약속한 보상금이 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1710
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, you have my vote on the High Council.\nI trust you implicitly.\nI've sent a messenger instructing Slicker Silvertongue to vote for you on my behalf.\nNow I'm quite busy, and must attend to other duties.\nI'm sure you can take care of any problems and miscommunications that may arise in this matter.\nYes.\nQuite right."
msgstr "자, 당신은 의회에서 투표권이 있네. 나는 절대적으로 그대들을 믿네. 나는 슬리커 실버톤그에게 심부름꾼를 보내 당신들을 위해 투표하라고 했네. 나는 지금 몹시 바쁘고, 다른 일을 봐야하네. 나는 당신들이 어떤 문제든지 해결하고 이 일로 골치 아픈일도 해결하리라고 믿네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1711
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot thank you enough for uncovering that horrible traitor and his crimes against the throne.\nI understand you are on a mission of some importance, so for Services Rendered to the Crown, it behooves me to offer you free use of the royal yacht for your travels.\nIt will take you as far as Hermit's Isle, if you need it to.\nOnce again, thank you!"
msgstr "더러운 배신자와 그의 왕좌에 대한 음모를 밝혀 준 것에 대해 뭐라고 감사해야할지 모르겠네. 당신이 오아관을 돌려주기 위한 중요한 임무를 수행 중이라는 것을 이해하네. 여행 중에 왕의 요트를 타게 해 주겠네. 그것을 타면, 은둔자의 섬까지 금방 데려다 줄 걸세. 만일 가겠다면. 다시한번 말하지만 고맙네!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1712
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the Foremost Paladin, and as such, I am the one charged with the promotion and keeping of the titles and responsibilities of paladinhood.\nThose paladins who wish to perform a quest for the official promotion to crusader must rescue a damsel in distress.\nThose of you who are not paladins will be awarded the title of honorary crusader, and all will be given a sizeable gold reward.\nReturn to me with said damsel and I will promote any paladins aiding in her rescue to the status of crusader."
msgstr "나는 제일의 무인이다. 내가 진급과 칭호을 결정하고  팰라딘후드를 책임지고 있다. 십자군 전쟁에 참가하는 여러 무인들은 괴로와하는 많은 소녀들을 구출해야 한다. 무인이 아닌 자들은 명예의 십자군으로 임명되어 많은 골드를 받을 것이다. 소녀들을 데리고 돌아와라. 그러면, 나는 그대들을 정식 무인으로 인정하겠다. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1713
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know there is a shortage of damsels in distress, but this quest is the traditional test.\nI really can’t bend the rules here.\nKeep looking– I’m sure you’ll find someone.\nIf it helps, I hear Melody Silver, daughter of the noble John Silver, is being held captive by ruffians on the Island of Mist."
msgstr "이미 나도 소수의 소녀들 밖에 없다는 것을 안다. 그러나 이것은 전통적인 시험이다. 룰을 임의로 바꿀 수 없다. 계속 찾아보게. 누군가를 찾을 걸 확신한다.  만일 그것이 도와준다면, 미스트섬의 잔인한 악당에게 같혀 있는 귀족 존 실버의 딸 멜로디 실버를 들을 걸세."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1714
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have heard stories of the daring rescue, and I am delighted that you have returned with Miss Silver.\nI shall arrange to have her returned to her family at once.\nExemplary work!\nI hereby officially promote all paladins to the status of crusader, and all non-paladins to honorary crusaders!"
msgstr "그녀를 구출했다는 소식을 들었네. 그리고 실버양과 같이 돌아왔다니 정말 기쁘다네. 어서 그녀가 가족의 품으로 가도록 해야겠네. 정말 잘 해주었네! 지금 그대들을 정식 십자군 일원으로 임명하고 무인이 아닌자들은 명예 십자군으로 임명하네!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1715
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, then!\nIt is a fine thing to be promoted to crusader, but even finer a thing to be promoted to hero.\nAs you may have guessed by now, the condition for hero status is to slay a dragon.\nI know this seems difficult, but tradition has its demands.\nWhat’s worse, you can’t slay just any dragon, but must slay a named dragon.\nYour task is to slay Longfang Witherhide and return with a claw or tooth as proof.\nFortunately, we know that Longfang lives in a cave in the mountains behind Castle Darkmoor.\nHe has slain at least twelve would-be heroes, so be careful!"
msgstr "좋다! 십자군이 된건 좋은 일이지. 그러나 영웅으로 추앙된다면 더 좋겠지. 아마 대충 짐작했겠지만, 영웅이 되는 조건은 용을 죽이면 되네. 무척 힘들다는 것을 아네. 그러나 전통이라네. 좋진 않지만, 아무 드라곤이나 죽여서 안되네. 널리 알려진 드라곤이여만 하네. 당신의 임무는 론팽이라는 위더하이드에 있는 드라곤을 죽여 증거로 그의 이빨이나 송곳니를 가지고 돌아오게. 다행히도, 우리는 롱팽이 다크모아산 뒤에 있는 동굴에 살고 있다는 것을 알고 있다네. 그 용은 영웅이 될 사람을 12 명 정도 죽였네. 그러니 조심하게!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1716
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is no use returning to me to talk about your quest.\nI cannot change the rules or your quest.\nLongfang awaits your avenging sword.\nNow get to it!"
msgstr "모험에 대해 얘기하려면 나에게 돌아올 필요가 없네. 나는 이 모험의 룰을 바꿀 수가 없다네. 롱팽은 당신의 날카로운 검을 기다리고 있다네.이제 가게!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1717
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well done!\nOne less horrible monster in the world is a good thing.\nI hereby officially promote all crusaders to heroes, and all honorary crusaders to the status of honorary hero! May you long continue to live up to the title!"
msgstr "잘 했네! 강한 적이 하나 줄어든 건 세상을 위해 좋은 일이지. 난 여기서 공식적으로 모든 십자군들을 영웅으로 임명하겠네. 그리고 명예 십자군에서 명예 영웅으로! 오랫 동안 그 칭호를 가지고 열심히 세상을 위해 힘쓰기를 바란다!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1718
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is always good to speak with heroes of the realm!\nCome back in some less troubled time and we'll swap tales of honor and courage by the fire!"
msgstr "왕국의 영웅과 얘기하는 건 항상 좋은 일이지! 문제가 없을때 돌아오게. 그러면 우리가 불의 용기와 영웅의 이야기를 하겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1719
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The palace is deadly dull, and everyone tells me what to do.\nBeing royalty isn’t really worth much and no one will let me go outside the walls while my father is gone.\nI haven’t left the castle for months!\nAnyway, you people look pretty important.\nWhat if you helped me sneak out and stay with you for a couple of days?\nI can’t give you much in return yet, but I’ll owe you a favor.\nSomeday I’ll be able to repay you.\nI am the prince, after all!\nI’ll go out the secret door and meet you outside."
msgstr "이 장소는 죽은 듯이 침체되어 있고 모두들 나에게 어떻게 하라고 말한다. 왕족이 되는건 그렇게 가치있는 것도 아니고 아버지가 안 계신 동안 아무도 밖으로 못나가게 한다. 난 몇달 동안 성 밖으로 나가보질 못했다! 어쨌든 당신들은 꽤 중요한 느낌이 든다. 만일 당신들이 나를 빼줘서 같이 며칠 있으면 어떨까? 내가 해줄 수 있는 건 없지만 난 빚을 졌네. 언젠가는 내가 갚을 수 있겠지. 난 왕자니까. 내가 비밀문으로 나가 당신을 밖에서 만나겠네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1720
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Let’s go see the circus!"
msgstr "자, 가서 서커스를 보자."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1721
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It seems that Prince Nicolai disappeared while you were resting."
msgstr "당신이 쉬고 있는 동안 니콜라이왕자가 사라진 것 같다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1722
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Um.\nHi. <smiling weakly> Would you believe I got lost and these nice people were taking me home?\nNo?\nI guess I wouldn’t either.\nI suppose it’s time we got back to the castle, then."
msgstr "음. 반갑네. <힘없이 웃으며> 내가 길을 잃어버려서 이 사람들이 집까지 데려다 주었다면 믿겠나? 아니라고? 하긴, 나 역시도 믿지 못할테니까. 이제 성으로 돌아갈 시간인 것 같군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1723
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We should go back to Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "우리는 아이언피스트성으로 돌아가야 할 것 같다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1724
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<Nicolai speaks to you> Well, thanks for sneaking me out of the castle.\nSorry about the circus thing– I hope I wasn’t too much trouble to find.\nI’ll go in myself so no one will see that it was you who kidnapped me.\nThanks again, and goodbye.\nI’ll remember this, and I owe you a favor! "
msgstr "<니콜라이가 말한다.> 자, 나를 성 밖으로 빼주어서 고맙네. 서커스 건에 관해서는 미안하네.- 날 찾는데 별 어려움이 없었길 바라겠네. 난 혼자 들어가서 아무도 당신들하고 같이 있다는 것을 모르게 해야겠네. 고맙네. 그리고 잘 가게. 난 기억할거고, 큰 빚을 졌네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1725
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for bringing me home.\nI owe you a favor!"
msgstr "나를 데려다 주어서 고맙네. 내가 빚을 졌군!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1726
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone says that my Uncle Archibald wasn’t a very nice person, and that he almost usurped the throne from my father, but we defeated him.\nFather had Tanir turn him to stone and then locked him in the library.\nNobody’s been in there for years. "
msgstr "모두들 내 삼촌 아치발드는 별로 좋은 사람이 아니었다는 군. 그리고 거의 아버지의 왕좌를 뺐을 뻔 했었는데 우리가 막아냈다는 군. 아버지는그를 돌로 만들어 아무도 몇년동안 간적이 없는 도서관에 가두어 놨다는군."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1727
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You want to free Archibald?!\nIf the Oracle told you to do it, I guess we should, but he’ll be trouble once he’s loose, that’s for sure.\nI know where the bell is that turned him to stone, but I can’t open the family vault that it’s in without the Third Eye.\nIt’s one of three gems you need to put into the door of the vault in order to open it.\nI’ve got two of them– one in my father’s crown and one in his scepter, but my father hid the third one, and he didn’t tell me where it is.\nIf you could find it, I could open the vault and get the bell."
msgstr "아치발드를 해방시키고 싶다고?! 만일 오라클이 승락했으면 내 생각에도 그렇게 하는 게 날것 같네. 그러나 그를 놓치면 문제가 될 걸세. 정말로. 내가 그를 돌로 만든 벨이 어디 있는지 알고 있네. 그러나 난 가족의 문을 열 수 없네. 그것은 제 3의 눈을 제외하고 있거든. 그것은 3개의 보석 중에 하나를 문짝에 놓아야 하네. 난 2개의 있는 곳을 알고 있고-하나는 아버지 왕관에 있고 하나는 그의 왕위에 있는데 세번째 것은 감추어 놓았네.  그리고 어디있는지 얘길 안 해 주었지. 만일 찾을 수 있다면 난 벨을 갖기 위해 문을 열 수 있을꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1728
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Without the Third Eye, I can’t get into the vault to get you the bell that will release Archibald.\nHe must have hidden it near the castle, because he used to just go right outside and fetch it whenever he needed to open the vault."
msgstr "제 3의 눈 없이는 난 문을 못 여네. 분명히 성 근처 어딘가에 숨겨놨을 꺼야. 왜냐면 아버지는 항상 밖으로 나가 가져왔기 때문이지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1729
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You found the Third Eye!\nAll right, wait here– the bell should be in the vault.\n<Nicolai runs out of the throne room, returning a short while later> Ok, here it is! "
msgstr "제 3의 눈을 찾았군! 좋다, 여기서 기다려-벨은 분명히 방 안에 있을꺼야. <니콜라이는 방을 뛰쳐나갔다. 잠시 후 다시 돌아와> 그래, 여기 있다! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1730
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hope you know what you're doing.\nEveryone says my uncle is quite treacherous."
msgstr "당신이 지금 무슨 행동을 하는지 알았으면 하네. 모두들 내 삼촌은 불성실 하다고 하지."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1731
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "missing text 38"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1732
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now wait just a minute Tanir, and I’ll make it worth your while to let me…Oh. <Archibald is silent for a long while> I guess I have you people to thank for releasing me from my prison of stone.\nThank you!\nYou say you need a spell that I've created?\n<reaching to the shelves and removing a library scroll> Well, as a reward, I’ll give you the Ritual of the Void.\nUse it in good health.\nNow, I’m sure you’re very busy, as am I…<Archibald waves his arms and fades away>"
msgstr "이제 조금만 기다리게. 내가 좀 오... <아치발드는 깊게 생각하다> 나를 돌의 감옥에서 구출해 주어 고맙네! 당신은 나의 마법이 필요하다고? <선반에 다가가 스크롤을 움직인다.> 자, 그럼 여기 보상으로 지식의 공간을 주겠네 체력이 좋을 때만 사용하게. 이제 내 생각에는 당신도 나처럼 바쁠 것 같군…<알치발드는 팔을 흔들더니 사라졌다.>"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1733
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for rescuing me from the clutches of those ruffians!\nOh, I wish there was some way for me to reward you!"
msgstr "나를 저 악당 소굴에서 구해주어서 고맙네. 오, 내가 어떻게든 보상할 길이 있었으면 좋겠군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1734
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mine is the traditional duty to oversee the, um, less than upright business in the Kingdom.\nMy House has done this for centuries under the philosophy that such business will always exist and is better watched and regulated than not.\nRecently, a man styling himself the 'Prince of Thieves' has begun to usurp my authority in Free Haven.\nNot only does he challenge my authority, he cooperates with that loathsome new cult that’s sprung up recently…what’s it called?\nMoo, or Yak, or Bark…no…whatever.\nSome sort of animal sound.\nAnyway, my sources tell me that this cult plots to overthrow the King and assume power in Enroth.\nThis is a bad business, and needs to be stopped.\nYou can start by arresting the Prince of Thieves and returning him to me in chains.\nI will, of course, reward you richly.\n"
msgstr "광산은 전통의 의무, 음, 왕국 안의 고급 직업보단 못하지만. 우리 집안은 이런 사업은 항상 존재한다는 생각 아래 몇세기 동안 해 왔고  안하는 것보다는 통제하는게 좋다고 보네. 요즘에 도적의 왕자라는 자가 프리 헤븐에서 나의 권력을 뺐을 려고 하네. 그 사람 혼자뿐만이 아니네. 그는 이상한 종교를 믿는 자들과 결탁해서 뭐라고 하더라... 무, 야, 바아.. 아무렇든, 무슨 동물 소리 같은데와 같히 덤비네. 어쨌든 내 부하 얘기로는 이 집단이 왕을 뒤집어 엎고 엔로스의 힘을 장악하려고 한다더군. 그건 잘못 된 거네. 멈추게 할 필요가 있지. 당신은 먼저 도적의 왕자를 잡아 묶은 채로 내게 데리고 오게. 물론 보상은 두둑히 하겠네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1735
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "missing text 42"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1736
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have no information on his whereabouts, so it will do you no good to talk to me about it.\nTry going to Free Haven and asking around.\nHe must have a hideout somewhere in or near that town.\n<Smiling> if you find where he’s living, be sure to check under the bed and in the closet– you’ll probably find him hiding under a pile of clothes."
msgstr "난 그가 어디 있는지 아무런 정보가 없네. 프리 헤븐에 가서 물어 보게나. 그는 분명히 마을 근처에 숨어 있을 꺼네. <웃으며> 만일 그가 어디있는지 알아내면 확실히 그의 침대 밑이나 장롱을 뒤져보게. 분명히 그는 옷더미에 묻힌 채로 발견될 걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1737
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah!\nMy friends, you have returned with the package!\nWell done!\nHere is your reward money.\nYou have my full support at the council. <looking at the Prince> Welcome to my humble home, mighty Prince.\nI have a room prepared just for you.\nGuards!\nTake him away."
msgstr "오! 나의 친구여, 패키지와 함께 돌아왔군! 잘 했네! 여기 보상금이네. 이제 의회에서 내가 완벽히 협조 하겠네.  <왕자를 보며> 나의 초라한 집에 온 걸 환영하네, 위대한 왕자. 나는 당신을 위해 방을 준비해 놓았지. 경비병! 이분을 모시게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1738
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your work in capturing the Prince of Thieves has been quite beneficial to me.\nYou have my full support on the High Council."
msgstr "당신이 도적의 왕자를 잡아온 건 내게 큰 도움이 됐네. 앞으로 의회에서 난 무조건 당신편이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1739
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In addition to my duties as overseer of unlicensed business, I am the High Priest of Enroth.\nIt is my job to promote clerics to priests, and if warranted, priests to priests of light.\nRight now, the rolls are full of priests, and I am unable to promote new ones without creating new positions.\nTo do so would be highly irregular, but if someone were to perform an extraordinary service for the kingdom, the promotion would be acceptable.\n<Rubbing his temples> Come to think of it, there is a service I need.\nA temple in Free Haven was destroyed by fire a few months ago.\nIf you could get it rebuilt, I would have a reason to promote any clerics among you to priest status.\nSince I really want this job done, I am even willing to promote non-priests to an honorary priest status, and I will pay you well for your service.\nYou’ll need to hire a stonecutter and a carpenter and show them the temple you want them to work on."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1740
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The temple I asked you to rebuild still stands in ruins.\nThe people are deprived of their rightful religious solace, and you return to me empty-handed.\nLeave here and complete your mission!\n"
msgstr "내가 다시 지으라고 한 신전은 아직도 파괴된 채로 있네. 사람들은 아직도 희망을 잃고 당신은 아무성과 없이 돌아왔네. 빨리 가서 임무를 마치게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1741
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent work!\nThe temple has been rebuilt and the affront to the gods eased.\nFor this service, I am happy to promote all clerics to priests, and I grant honorary priest status to all non-clerics.\nCongratulations! "
msgstr "정말 잘 했네! 신전은 다시 만들어지고 사람들은 희망을 되찾았네. 나는 이제 당신들을 진급시켜 주겠네. 축하하네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1742
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It seems a bit quick to promote anyone to high priests, given that the promotion to priest has been so recent.\nWhy, many wait their entire lives to receive such a promotion, only to be granted it posthumously.\nHowever, an extraordinary service could possibly accelerate that promotion to, well, right now for instance… and I do have such a service in mind.\nThe heretical monks that live on the islands east of Free Haven have stolen our sacred chalice.\nRetrieve it from the monks and put it in the temple you rebuilt.\nThen return to me."
msgstr "누군가를 최고 교주로 임명하는 것은 너무 이른 것 같다. 많은 사람들이 승진하기 위해 인생을 산다고도 하지. 어찌됐든 진정하게 신을 모시는 자만이 진급 할 수 있지. 지금 같은 경우에는 난 진급 시킬 수 있을 것 같네. 프리 헤븐 동쪽의 섬에 사는 이교도의 승려가 우리의 신성한 성배를 훔쳐 갔다. 그걸 승려에게 뺐어 오고 새로 만든 신전에다 다시 갇다 놓게.  그리고 내게 돌아오게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1743
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The monks still have the chalice, and our temple is still without it.\nWhy do you delay?"
msgstr "아직 승려가 성배를 가지고 있네, 왜 늦장부리지?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1744
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see that you have recovered the chalice!\nGood work, but you still need to ensconce it in the temple.\nTake it there at once and return to me for your promotion!"
msgstr "이제 성배를 회복시킨 걸 확인했네. 잘 했네. 이젠 신전에다 안치만 하면 되지. 잘 갖다놓고 내게 돌아오게나. 진급시켜 줄테니! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1745
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are successful!\nIt looks like I will have to keep my promise and make more irregular, early promotions.\nI do so with pleasure.\nI hereby promote all priests to high priests, and all honorary priests to honorary high priests."
msgstr "성공했군! 이제 내가 약속 지킬 일만 남았네. 진급 말일세. 정말 나도 기쁘네. 난 여기서 당신과 친구들을 최고 주교와 명예 최고 주교로 임명하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1746
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though your rise to priest of light status was almost unseemly quick, I have never seen finer priests of light in all my years.\nI am grateful for all you've done for myself and for Enroth."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1747
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This is %s, the month of %s.\nJourney to the Shrine of %s and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr "%s. 이 달: %s.  성당으로 가 기도를 하면 %s의 보상금이 있다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1748
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must wait until the new month to undergo a pilgrimage."
msgstr "당신은 이제 새 달의 순례를 경험할 때까지 기다려야 한다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1749
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "performed daring deeds"
msgstr "사랑하는 사람의 행동을 이해하다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1750
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What have you lost?"
msgstr "뭘 잊어버렸지?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1754
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I sometimes have the worst trouble trying to remember things I’ve learned.\nI’m not sure why this is, but I’ve discovered a way around the problem.\nI am going to create a mirror that will allow me to look back in time, so that I can remember what it is I’ve forgotten.\nTo do this, I need the Hourglass of Time, but my duties and research prevent me from searching for the hourglass on my own.\nThe hourglass is said to be in a dark cavern up near area… <pauses a moment>\nNo, that was the Spear of Darkness…\nwhere is the hourglass?\n<pauses again>\nI should be able to remember this.\n<snaps his fingers>\nOf course!\nIt’s buried in an old fort to the south of here.\nI can offer you my support in the council if you will help me in creating my mirror."
msgstr "가끔 내가 배운 마법을 사용하려 할때 기억을 못 해 최악의 상태까지 가는 경우도 있네.  나도 왜 그런지는 모르네, 그러나 문제를 해결할 방법을 찾아냈지. 난 과거를 볼 수 있는 거울을 만들 생각이야. 그러면 내가 뭘 잊고 있는지 알 수 있잖아. 그런데 이 일을 진행하기 위해 난 모래시계의 시간이 필요하네. 그런데 나의 할 일들과 돌보아야 할 것들 때문에 모래시계을 찾으러 갈 시간이 없네. 아마 모래시계는 아마 그 곳... 어두운 동굴.. <잠시 쉬었다가> 아니야. 그건 어둠의 창이었어..... 모래시계가 어디있더라?   <다시 쉬었다가> 난 이걸 기억했는데. <손가랑을 튕기며> 그래! 여기서 남쪽의 오래된 성채에 있어. 이 일을 도와 준다면 난 의회에서 당신 편이 기꺼이 되주겠네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1755
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you forget where the way out is?\nI sometimes do.\nI think it’s the large doors behind you.\nOr is that the kitchen?\nIn any case, I’m sure the hourglass isn’t here, I would have found it by now if it was."
msgstr "나가는 길을 까먹었나? 나도 가끔 그래. 아마 당신 뒤에 있는 큰 문일꺼야. 아니 주방이던가? 어쨌든 모래시계는 여기 없네. 있었다면 내가 찾았을 테니.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1756
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I’m still looking for the mirror. <pauses> I mean Hourglass… I keep getting those mixed up.\nDid you try the dark cavern– no wait, it was the old fort south of here.\nI always seem to mix those up."
msgstr "난 여전히 거울을 찾고 있네. <쉬었다가> 아니 모래시계…가끔 이렇게 혼란스럽다니까. 어디 어둠의 동굴은 가봤나-아니야. 남쪽에 있는 오래된 성채지. 요샌 더 혼동스러운 것 같아.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1757
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now all I have to do is remember how to create the mirror.\nI wrote down all the important parts so I wouldn’t forget how to do it.\n<stops> Where did I put those notes?\n<ponders for a minute> I must have left them somewhere obvious, maybe in the laboratory.\nAnyway, your part in this is done, and again I thank you.\nYou will have my complete support in the council for this.\nWhat were your names again? "
msgstr "이제 내가 할일은 거울을 만드는 법을 기억해 내는 거지.  난 중요한 부분을 다 노트에 써 놨지. 내가 또 까먹지 않게.  <멈추고> 그런데 내가 노트를 어디다 놓았더라?  <잠시 생각하다> 아마 난 내가 잘 가는 곳에 놔 두었을 꺼야. 어쩌면 연구실일꺼야. 어쨌든 당신은 할 일을 했네. 정말 고맙네. 당신은 이제 의회에서 내가 전폭적으로 지원해 주겠네. 그런데 당신 이름이 뭐라고 했지? "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1758
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The hourglass wasn’t there?\nOh, that’s right!\nI knew I forgot something!\nThe key is in there!\nYou use the key to open the Forge of… <pauses>\nWell, I can’t remember whose forge it is, but that is the resting place of the Hourglass of Time...I think.\nIt can’t hurt to look there, especially now that you’ve found the key.\n<pauses>\nAt least I THINK that’s what the key opens.\nAnyway, that forge or laboratory or whatever it is can be found on the islands north of New Sorpigal.\nGood Luck!"
msgstr "모래시계가 없다고? 오, 그래 맞어. 내가 이걸 까먹었군! 키가 그곳에 있네! 당신은 그 키를 사용해 대장간...  <�l췄다가> 우. 주구 대장간인지 까먹었네. 그러나 아마 모래시계의 시간이 쉬고 있는 곳일걸세.  당신은 키를 찾았으니 그 곳에 가도 문제가 없을꺼네.  <쉬었다가> 내 생각에는 그게 바로 키가 열리는 거네. 아쨌든 대장간이든, 연구실이든, 어디든 간에 뉴 소피갈의 북쪽섬에서 발견될 수 있을꺼네. 행운을 비네! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1759
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks again for getting the hourglass for me!\nIf only I could remember where I put it.\n<sighs>\nYou have my support in the council for as long as you need it."
msgstr "내게 모래시계를 가져다 주어 고맙네! 내가 어디다 놓았는지 까먹지만 않는다면.  <한숨 쉬고>  이제 의회에선 내가 도움을 주겠네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1760
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the magus in charge of training and promoting sorcerers.\nThough powerful, sorcerer is not the pinnacle of the elemental magician.\nWizards take the knowledge and ability of a sorcerer, and hone those abilities to a sharper level.\nThey have greater magical potential than the sorcerer, and demand greater respect.\nThe way to earn this training, however, is not easy.\nFind the Fountain of Magic, drink from its waters, and return here.\nIf you are able to do this, I will train you in the ways of the wizard."
msgstr "난 마구스, 마도사들을 교육시키고 진급시키는 일을 하고 있지. 강하지, 원소 마법만 쓰는게 아니니까. 마법사들이 마도사들에게서 지식을 얻어가지. 그리고 실력을 쌓으면 마도사보다 훨씬 나아지지, 물론 존경도 받고. 이 트레이닝을 받는 건 쉬운 일이 아니네. 마법의 샘을 찾게. 물을 마시고 내게 돌아오게. 만일 성공한다면 나는 당신을 마법사로 만들어 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1761
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the magus responsible for\nthe promotion of sorcerers.\nThough none of you are sorcerers, I’m a fair man.\nIf you are able to locate the Fountain of Magic, I’ll grant you honorary wizard status.\nYou won’t receive any benefits of the wizards’ training, but you will gain more respect in the eyes of sorcerers and wizards.\n"
msgstr "난 마구스, 마도사들을 진급시키는 일을 하지. 나는 정직하네. 그리고 당신들 중 마도사는 한 명도 없군. 만일 당신들이 마법의 샘을 찾을 수 있다면 그대를 명예 마법사로 임명해 주겠네. 마법 트레이닝과는 상관이 없지만, 당신은 마도사나 마법사에게 많은 존경을 받을 걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1762
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don’t ask me for hints, I’ve already forgotten where the Fountain is.\nI know this isn’t an easy task, but if it were not difficult, every sorcerer would already BE a wizard."
msgstr "내게 힌트를 묻지 말게. 난 마법의 샘이 어디있는지 까먹었네. 쉬운 일이 아닌 걸 아네, 그러나 만일 어렵지 않았다면 모든 마도사들이 다 마법사가 됐겠지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1763
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have done well in finding the Fountain.\nIt’s location and powers are a secret, do not spread its location around.\nNow, let me show you the secrets of the wizard."
msgstr "샘을 잘 찾았네. 장소와 힘은 비밀이네. 아무에게도 말하지 말게. 이젠 내가 마법사의 비밀을 가르쳐 주지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1764
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your training does not end with what you have learned as a wizard, one final step remains.\nMaster wizard status completes your mastery of elemental magic.\nBuilding on your wizard training, master wizards have vast magical ability– the most efficient and skilled use of magic anywhere.\nEarning this training requires a powerful artifact, owned by the powerful Arch Mage Drael-.. no, it was Frundir-… no, that’s not right either.\nActually, I can’t seem to remember what the artifact was or who owned it.\nI'd remember it if I saw it, though.\nI know it can be found in Corlagon’s Estate near the Mire of the Damned.\nSearch for it there and return it; I must have it to train you to become a master wizard."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1765
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I’m sorry, but I still haven’t remembered exactly what it is you need.\nI know you need to search Corlagon’s Estate.\n "
msgstr "미안하네, 난 당신이 무엇이 필요했던지를 까먹었네. 그러나 콜라곤의 토지를 뒤져봐야한다는 건 아네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1766
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great news!\nI remember what you need to find!\nThe Crystal of Terrax!\nOh, you seem to have found it already.\nWell, perfect!\nI can train you to master wizards, then.\nThe first arch mage, Terrax, used this Crystal to master the elements.\nFire, earth, water, and air all formed together to make it, and from analyzing it he learned a great deal about elemental magic.\nIn addition, its effect on light led him to his discoveries of light and dark magic.\nSince that time, the study of this crystal has guided every new master wizard.\nLet me show you the secrets of the crystal. "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1767
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don’t have much time to talk right now– I have a lot to do.\nI’m in the process of organizing a few campaigns to attack the devils along the western coast.\nYou must realize, as I do, that nothing in all of Enroth poses as much of a threat to our safety as they do.\nI only wish the other Lords would assist me by contributing supplies and troops, or just helping in the planning of these attacks.\nThey spend more time bickering amongst themselves over borders and laws and trade than in helping me deal with the REAL threat.\nThe devils have an advance post in Kriegspire near the Sentinels.\nFrom here, they are able to base small raids and gather intelligence on our forces.\nI need you to sneak in and attack it, find what information you can on the location of any devil strongholds and patrol patterns, and destroy the place.\nDo not let any of the devils escape!\nSurprise and secrecy are our greatest weapons."
msgstr "당신은 지금 얘기 할 시간이 별로 없네.- 난 할일이 많다네. 나는 서쪽에 있는 악마들을 공격하기 위해 조직을 짜고 있지. 내가 하는 것처럼 당신도 해야하네. 엔로스의 아무것도 그들처럼 위협적이지 않네. 난 단지 다른 군주들이 나에게 물자 등을 공급하거나 공격하는데 계획을 같이 짜면 하는게 바램이네. 그들은 서로간의 이기만을 따지는데 급급하다네, 진짜 위협을 제쳐 놓고. 악마들은 크레이그스파이어 주변에 있는 센티넬스라는 곳에 자리 잡고 있네.  그들은 지능적으로 게릴라식으로 우리를 습격하고 있네. 난 당신이 숨어들어가 공격하고 악마 두목이 있는 장소와 순찰 패턴에 대한 정보와 그 장소를 파괴시키길 바라겠네.  한 마리의 악마도 도망치면 안되네! 놀라움과 비밀엄수는 우리의 위대한 무기이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1768
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Still here?\nThe demons are to the west, near the coast, not in my throne room!\nOr are you THAT lost?\nYou have the information you need to complete this mission, all you need now is to go out and do it."
msgstr "아직도 여��나? 악마들은 서쪽, 해안 주변에 있네. 나의 왕실 말고! 뭐, 길을 읽어버렸나? 당신은 이미 모든 정보를 가지고 있네. 이젠 어서 가 임무를 완수하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1769
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you fail in your mission?\nYou didn’t allow the demons to escape, did you?\nThat post MUST be destroyed for any large attack against them to be successful.\nAs long as that post exists, your mission still stands. "
msgstr "임무를 실패했나? 한 마리의 악마도 못 도망가게 했지? 그들의 전초부대는 꼭 멸망시켜야 하네. 만일 아직 남아있으면 임무는 완수한게 아니네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1770
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good job!\nWith the information you’ve brought back, we now have the intelligence we need to stage an attack on the devils, and with that post out of the way, we can hit them when they won’t expect it. I give you my full support in the council– hopefully the council will actually DO something for once."
msgstr "잘 했네! 당신이 가지고 온 정보로 이젠 우린 효율적인 공격을 할 수 있네. 이제 나는 의회에서 당신을 전폭적으로 지지하겠네.  의회가 한번에 통일된 의견을 말하면 좋겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1771
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:80
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent work in dispatching those devils!\nAgain, you have my thanks.\nMy support in the council is yours, at least until the threat of the devils is past.\nHopefully you can spur the council into action.\nBy the way, the information that you brought back has confirmed our suspicion about the enemy base.\nIt is definitely near the town of Sweet Water in Paradise Valley."
msgstr "악마들을 정말 잘 처리했네! 정말 고맙네. 의회에서 확실히 보답하지. 의회에서 힘을 내길 바라겠네. 당신이 가지고 온 정보는 정말 유용하게 쓰였네. 그들은 천상의 계곡의 스위트워터 타운 근처에 있다는 군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1772
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:81
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the Armsmaster in charge of the promotion of all knights in Enroth.\nWorthy knights can be promoted to cavaliers.\nCavaliers embody the spirit of action and the power of purpose.\nBehind their courageous example, armies charge into battle and enemies flee in terror. However, to become a cavalier, you need to be nominated by a person of authority.\nIf you could get the nomination of a cavalier, that would be good enough for me.\n "
msgstr "나는 엔로스의 모든 기사들의 승진을 맡고 있는 무기 마스터이네. 능력있는 기사들은 카발리어로 승진할 수 있지. 카발리어는 정신적인 힘과 육체적인 힘을 통합한 거지. 그들의 용기는 전쟁에 참가하면 적들은 공포로 도망할 정도라네. 카발리어가 되기 위해서는 개인의 권위를 지명해야하네. 만일 카발리어를 지명할 수 있다면 그건 나에게 아주 좋은 일이지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1773
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:82
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the Armsmaster in charge of the promotion of knights.\nUnfortunately, none of you are knights, and therefore the skills I would teach you would be worthless.\nHowever, if you so desire, you can attempt the task of a would-be cavalier.\nSeek the nomination of a person of authority, a cavalier, for example, and return to me."
msgstr "나는 엔로스의 모든 기사들의 승진을 맏고있는 무기 마스터이네. 불행하게도 당신들 중에는 기사가 없군. 그래서 인데 내가 정말 쓸만한 기술들을 알려주겠네. 어찌됐든 정말 원한다면 카발리어가 될 수 있는 임무를 수행할 수 있네. 개인의 권위를 찾고, 카발리어 예를 들어.그리고 내게 돌아오게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1774
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:83
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well there, you’re looking for a nomination to become cavaliers?\nI was once a valiant knight in my day.\nI fought with Roland in the Succession wars, though now I’m too old to do much good on the battlefield.\nIt’s good to see Osric keeping the traditions of the knights alive.\nTell him that I proudly nominate you to become cavaliers, and if he gives you any trouble tell him to come see me himself."
msgstr "당신은 카발리어가 되기위해 추천받기를 원하나? 난 한때 용감한 기사였지. 난 롤랜드왕과 왕위계승 전쟁에 있었지. 그러나 지금은 전쟁에 나서긴 너무 늙었네.  오스릭이 전통적인 기사들을 보유하는 것을 보는건 좋은 일이네. 그에게 말하게. 내가 당신을 추천했다고. 그리고 그가 뭐라고 하면 그보고 나에게 직접오라고 하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1775
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:84
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nI know you’ll make fine cavaliers.\nI only wish I had my youth again to serve with Osric in a campaign against the devils."
msgstr "축하하네! 난 당신이 멋진 카발리어가 될 줄 알았네. 난 제자들이 오스릭을 도와 악마들을 물리쳤으면 좋겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1776
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:85
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Come now!\nA person of your fame and stature should have no problem being nominated.\nDon’t tell me your fame is contrived– are you sure you deserve to be as famous as you are?\n<laughs>\nI’m jesting, calm down.\nSeriously, I'd suggest looking in Free Haven or the village of Rockham.\nI've heard a few cavaliers frequent the taverns there."
msgstr "이리오게! 당신은 추천받기에 충분해. 꾸며진 명성이라고 말하지 말게. - 당신이 유명하게 될 거라고 확신하나?  <웃으며> 난 농담하는 거네. 화풀게. 진짜로, 난 프리 헤븐이나 록햄 빌라지를 찾아보길 원하네. 내가 듣기로는 몇 카발리어는 그 곳 술집에 빈번하게 나타난다더군. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1777
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:86
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nThe nomination may not seem important, but we have a tradition that must be followed for this promotion.\nAs a cavalier, you need to understand that the traditions and values of the people need to be defended.\nI gladly promote you to the rank of cavalier!"
msgstr "축하하네! 추천받은 건 그리 중요한게 아니네. 그러나 전통을 따르는게 전통이네.  카발리어로서 당신은 전통과 약한 사람들을 방어해주어야 하네. 난 기쁘게 당신을 카발리어로 임명하겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1778
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:87
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, worthy cavaliers, the final step in your training is to become a champion.\nA cavalier is a brave and noble warrior, but a champion is a power to behold.\nNo force can stand between the champion and victory.\nEntire campaigns are decided on the bravery, decisiveness, and powerful example of the champion.\nThe task to complete this promotion, however, is difficult.\nYou must defeat a powerful enemy to prove your ability and determination.\nThe only enemy worthy of this task is a man known only as the Warlord, a dangerous and powerful warrior.\nHe commands a legion of evil knights, normally based to the northeast of\nIcewind Pass.\nDefeat him, bring back proof of your victory, and your promotion to champion is assured."
msgstr "오. 능력있는 카발리어들, 이제 트레이닝의 마지막은 챔피언이 되는 것이네. 카발리어는 용감하고 기품있는 전사이네, 챔피언은 최고이지. 어떤 것도 챔피언의 승리를 막을 수 없네. 모든 전쟁은 용기와 판단력 그리고 챔피언의 힘과 경험에 의해 결정되지. 이 임무를 끝내기는 상당히 어려울꺼네. 당신은 실력을 증명하기 위해 강한 적들을 쓰러뜨려야 하네. 아무나 안되고 위험하고 강한 장군을 쓰러뜨려야 하네. 그는 악마 기사들을 이끌고 아이스윈드 북동쪽에 위치하고 있네. 그를 처치하게. 당신의 승리의 증거를 가지고 오게. 그러면 챔피언으로 임명받을 걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1779
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:88
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You’re not scared of the Warlord, are you?\nHis terror needs to be put to an end.\nYou can’t become champion hiding underneath your bed or standing around looking at the walls– you need to go out and DO it!"
msgstr "당신은 장군을 무서워하지 않지, 안 그런가? 그의 악한 행동은 이제 끝나야 하네. 그렇게 숨어있으면 챔피언이 될 수 없네. 나가서 싸우게! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1780
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:89
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good job!\nExcellent!\nI wasn’t sure you’d make it back alive.\nKergmond had more potential than I realized, but you’re certainly more than a match for an army of Kergmonds.\nYou’ve proven yourselves worthy of the rank of champion. You must not be afraid to take up arms to defend what is right.\nMay your enemies fear your approach and your allies rally behind your courage. And now, I promote you to the rank of champion! "
msgstr "잘 했네! 좋네! 난 당신이 살아 돌아 올 지는 불확실 했네. 컬그몬드는 내가 생각했던 것보다 강했었네. 그러나 당신은 더 강했고. 당신은 챔피언 될 만한 충분한 자격을 증명했네. 당신은 이제 정의를 위해 물러서지 말아야 하네. 적들은 이제 당신의 용기에 넋을 잃을 걸세. 그리고 이제 나는 당신을 챔피언으로 임명하겠네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1781
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Memory Crystal Alpha – Hermit’s Isle.Memory Crystal Beta – Alamos.Memory Crystal Delta – Darkmoor.Memory Crystal Epsilon – Kriegspire."
msgstr "메모리 크리스탈 알파 ? 헐밋의 섬.\n메모리 크리스탈 베타 ? 크레이그스파이어.\n메모리 크리스탈 델타 ? 다크무어.\n메모리 크리스탈 엡실론-알라모스."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1782
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:91
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Place the memory Crystals into the modules above.\nAll four Crystals are necessary to activate the Oracle."
msgstr "메모리 크리스탈을 위의 제단에 놓게. 4개의 크리스탈은 다 오라클을 움직이는데 중요하다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1783
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am Melian, Guardian of Enroth.\nThank you for replacing my memory modules.\nArchibald took them from here when I refused to give him any help in his battle for succession.\nYour timing is impeccable.\nThe Kreegan have invaded our world, and you must try and stop them.\nUnfortunately, Archibald’s attempts at extracting information from me have damaged me enough that I cannot help you directly now.\nInstead, I can only give you advice.While most of the Kreegan can be slain with ordinary weapons and spells, the elite guards and upper echelon breeders have tougher skin and natural defenses that protect them from anything but very powerful weapons.\nIn the planetary control center beneath me are the weapons and armor you will need to survive battle with the enemy.\nMy orders, however, will only permit passage to someone with a Control Cube.\nMy instruments tell me that the only Control Cube left in Enroth can be found somewhere underground in Dragonsand.\n"
msgstr "난 멜리안, 엔로스의 가디언이지. 나의 메모리 모듈을 되돌려놔서 고맙네. 내가 그의 왕위계승 전쟁 돕기를 거부 했을 때, 알치발드가 모두 가져 갔었었네. 당신의 타이밍은 완벽했었네. 지금 크리간은 우리 세계를 망쳐놓고 있네, 당신은 그걸 멈춰야 하고. 불행하게도 알취발드가 내게 대미지를 입혀 난 지금 당신들을 도울 수 없네. 난 단지 조언만 할 수 있네. \n왠만한 크리간 보통 무기로도 죽일 수 있으나 엘리트 가드나 상위계급들은 강하기 때문에 역시 강한 무기로만 죽여야 하네. 내 바로 아래 있는 컨트롤 센터에는 당신이 그들과의 전쟁에서 살아남을 수 있는 강한 무기와 갑옷들을 가질 수 있네. 그 곳에는 컨트롤 큐브를 가진 자만이 들어갈 수 있고 내 기억으로는 아마 드라곤 샌드의 지하 세계 어느 곳에 있을 걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1784
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:93
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You now have access to the Control Center.\nSimply ask to be transported and I will oblige.\nOne warning however– the guardians of the Control Center are no longer under my control, so please exercise caution while visiting the Center."
msgstr "당신은 이제 컨트롤 센터에 들어왔다. 그냥 간단하게 이동하고 싶으면 말하게. 내가 해 줄 테니.  경고할 것은 컨트롤 센터의 가디언은 더 이상 내 지배에 있지 않네. 항상 신경써서 행동하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1785
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:94
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As I said, the Kreegan are resistant to most of the weapons available in Enroth, but not all.\nTo rid the world of them, you will need to find where their vessel crashed and destroy the main reactor.\nThe only problem is that the resulting explosions from the reactor will destroy this planet.\nYou will need a powerful spell to prevent the explosion from damaging the planet, but no spell like that exists in the world today.\nThe only person I can think of that would know of such a spell is Archibald, but he is in no condition to teach you.\nTo make matters worse, the reactor cannot be harmed by normal weapons or spells– you will need the ancient weapons in the Control Center to destroy the reactor."
msgstr "내가 말했듯이 크리간은 웬만한 무기에는 방어력이 있네. 그러나 전부는 아니지. 그를 제거할려면 당신은 그들의 배가 부서진 곳을 찾아가 원자로를 파괴해야하네. 그러나 정말 문제가 되는 것은 원자로가 터지면 이 별, 이 세계도 파괴 될 지도 모른다는 거지. 당신은 그런 폭발에서 이 별을 보호하기 위해 거는 엄청나게 강한 마법이 필요하다네. 그러나 그 정도로 강한 마법은 존재하지 않네. 내가 아는 한 그런 마법에 가장 근접한 사람은 알치발드뿐이네. 그러나 그는 가르쳐주질 않을 걸세. 상황을 좋게 진행하기 위해서는 컨트롤 센터에 있는 고대의 무기 뿐이네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1786
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:95
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though my memory has been damaged by Archibald, I can still remember the danger that our ancient enemy, the Kreegan, pose to our world.\nThe Kreegan first appeared roughly 1500 years ago, attacking outlying colonies and stealing their resources.\nIt was thought at the time they simply needed certain minerals, and could be reasoned with, but this was not the case.\nTheir life cycle forces them to breed until the world cannot support their numbers, then they send ships off to other worlds to renew the cycle.\nTheir attacks against the empire of the Ancients disrupted the network of shipping and communications that held us all together, causing the Silence that marks the first year of our modern calendar.\nWithout support from the homeworlds, our fledgling technology failed, bringing us to this sorry state.\nI would help rebuild our technology, but I seem to have become a religious figure in the minds of many people, and very few visit me or understand what I have to offer.\nPerhaps this Kreegan crisis we face will bring people to their senses--as long as we survive it."
msgstr "내 기억이 알치발드에 의해 파손됐어도 나는 아주 위험한 고대의 적을 기억하고 있네. 크리간은 처음에 1500년전에 나타났네. 외진 곳들을 침략해 자기 것으로 만들었지. 그때는 그냥 미네랄이 필요해서 전쟁을 했지만 이번은 아니네. 그들의 라이프 서클은 이 혹성이 그들의 숫자를 지탱하지 못 할 때까지 계속됐네. 그리고 그들은 또다른 세계로 배를 보내 다시 시작하지. 그들은 고대 왕국을 공격해 쉬핑과 커뮤니케이션, 우리를 지탱하는 것들을 파괴 시키지. 그리고 모든 것을 조용하게 만들어버리지. 우리들이 단합하지 않으면 우리의 모든 과학등 그런 것들은 사라져 버리지. 난 다시 과학 등을 만드는 걸 도울 순 있으나 많은 사람들의 도움이 필요하네. 그러나 소수의 사람만 나를 방문하고 이 사정을 이해하네. 어쩌면 우리가 살아있는 동안 크리간 같은 것은 계속 나올지도 모르지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1787
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:96
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I happen to know that you are amongst a short list of adventurers looking to receive favor from the High Council.\nWhat you want it for I don’t know, nor do I care.\nI’ll be blunt:\nI love money, and I want more.\nMuch more.\nI have a plan to fix the price of shipping in my favor for a time and I need competent agents to carry it out.\nPerform this task well and I will give you my support, not to mention a lot of money.\nHere is the plan:\nEach of the nine shipping companies in the Kingdom must be convinced to charge at least 48 gold per pound per mile of material they transport.\nThey are all in competition and they know it, so none will want to make a move before the others.\nI don’t care how you convince them– just get the job done and report back to me."
msgstr "난 당신이 의회의 도움을 얻기 위해 여행을 한다는 것을 알았네. 뭘 원하는지, 또한 왜 그런지도 관심이 없네. 나는 무디네: 난 돈을 사랑하네, 그리고 항상 더 원하지. 난 선적 가격을 고치려고 하고 나는 그런 것을 해줄 에이전트가 필요하네. 이번 임무를 잘 해주면 난 앞으로 도움을 주겠네. 돈이 아닌. 여기 계획이 있네: 왕국에 있는 9개의 해운회사는 파운드 마일당 모든 물건에 대해 최소한 48골드를 받아야 하네. 그들은 모두 경쟁상태에 있고 아무도 섣불리 그렇게 하지는 않을 걸세. 방법은 상관없으니 어떻게든 해서 관철시키고 나에게 돌아오게.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1788
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:97
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not all of the companies have agreed to raise their prices!\nWhy do you return only to report incompetence?\nThere are large profits I could be reaping if you had done your job and convinced these idiots to raise their prices!\nMUST I DO THIS MYSELF?\nShould I send someone else?\nWhy do I surround myself with MORONS?!\nSo far I have lost a lot of gold because you haven’t finished your job!\nI’ll deduct these losses from your final payment, you can be sure of that!"
msgstr "어떤 회사도 가격을 올리질 않았네! 왜 내게 돌아왔지? 만일 그들을 납득시켰으면 난 많은 돈을 벌 수 있는데 말이다! 내가 꼭 해야 겠나? 아니면 다른 사람을 보낼까? 왜 내 주위엔 바보들만 있지? 난 지금까지 많은 골드를 잃었네. 당신이 일을 끝내지 않았기 때문에 ! 난 마지막 계산 때 이걸 꼭 감할꺼네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1789
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:98
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "At last!\nThought you would never finish.\nMaybe you’re good for something after all.\nYou have won my support in the council, and of course, your payment. "
msgstr "드디어! 절대 못 끝낼줄 알았는데. 생각보다 잘 하는군. 이젠 내가 의회에서 당신을 밀어주겠네. 그리고 여기 보상금도 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1790
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:99
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're concerned about the suffering of the peasants over my price increase, don't be.\nI did it all for a good cause.\nI needed to raise money for granaries to store the excess grain we are harvesting this year.\nThe shipping prices are back down, and the availability of cheap, high quality grain more than makes up for it.\nThere!\nI'm not so horrible, am I?"
msgstr "만일 당신이 소작인들에 대한 나의 가격 올림을 방해하려 한다면 하지말게. 난 다 좋은 뜻으로 했으니. 내가 올린 이유는 올해 거둬 들인 곳식으로 인해 창고료를 내야하기 때문이지.  해상운송료는 비싸고 서비스는 형편없네. 높은 품질의 곡식 만이 메꿀수 있지. 그거야. 내가 심하다고 생각하나?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1791
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:100
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although it may be hard to believe, I happen to be one of the top druids in the land.\nAs such I am empowered to promote druids to great and arch druid status, provided they prove themselves worthy.\nTo be promoted to great druid status, you must perform the Ceremony of the Sun.\nPray at the center of the Circle of Stone during any equinox or solstice– March 20th, June 21st, September 23rd, or December 21st.\nIf you are there at that time, I will contact you magically and lead you through the Ceremony, thus promoting you to great druid.\nThose among you who are not druids will be granted honorary great druid status, and I am sure the experience will be worthwhile."
msgstr "어쩌면 믿기 어려울지도 모르지만, 난 한때 이 땅 최고의 드루이드였네. 난 드루이드들을 위대한 드루이드와 최고의 드루이드로 진급시킬수 있고 그들은 그 자신들이 증명을 하지. 위대한 드루이드로 승진하기 위해서는 태양의 의식을 실행해야 하네. 주야평분시나 지일최고점 때 센터의 원 중앙에서 기도를 하게. - 3월 20일, 6월 21일, 9월 23일, 12월 21일. 만일 그 때가 있으면 내가 마법적으로 연락해 의식을 이끌어 주겠네. 드루이들이 아닌자들은 명예 드루이드로 진급시켜주고 좋은 경험이 될걸세.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1792
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:101
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must pray at the center of the Circle of Stone during an equinox or solstice to complete the Ceremony of the Sun and be promoted to great druid.\nThere is nothing I can do for you to be promoted until then."
msgstr "태양의 의식을 끝내고 위대한 드루이드로 진급하기 위해서는 돌의 원 중앙에서 쥬야평분시나 지일최고점때 기도해야 하네. 그  전에는 난 아무것도 해 줄 수 없네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1793
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:102
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<Loretta Fleise contacts you via a telepathy spell> Welcome to the Ceremony of the Sun.\nStand ye in the circle of life and face the north while no shadows stretch before thee.\nMeditate upon this truth:\n“Money is everything.\nI have no truer a friend than money…” <grinning> Just kidding.\nNow, close your eyes, and meditate as you stand at the center of the world and time for just this one, sublime moment… <long, silent pause>\nOpen your eyes.\nI hereby promote all druids to great druids and all non-druids to honorary druids. <Loretta fades away> "
msgstr "<로레타 플레이스가 텔레파시 마법으로 연락을 했다> 태양의 의식에 온 걸 환영합니다. 라이프의 원에 서 있고 그림자가 없는 북쪽을 향하세요. 이 사실을 기도하세요: \" 돈이 최고다. 난 돈보다 친한 친구는 없다...\"   <웃으며> 농담이고, 이젠 눈을 감으세요, 이 시간을 위해 당신은 세상 중심에 있다고 생각하세요. 이 순간을 숭고하게.... <길고 조용한 침묵이.> 눈을 뜨세요. 난 여기서 모든 드루이드들을 위대한 드루이드로 드루이드가 이닌 자들은 명예 드루이드로 임명합니다.   <로레타는 사라졌다.> "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1794
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:103
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, you believe you are deserving of the title of arch druid.\nYou must complete the Ceremony of the Moon to achieve arch druid status.\nThis used to be rather easy before the factional split amongst the last generation of druids, but now you must fight your way to the sacred altar.\nIt is in the Temple of the Moon, currently controlled by the evil heretic Cedric Druthers.\nThere is no way they will just let you complete the ceremony peacefully, so you will probably have to fight your way in.\nLike the Ceremony of the Sun, the Ceremony of the Moon must be performed at a certain place and time.\nPray at the Altar of the Moon in the Temple of the Moon at midnight during any full moon.\nIf you are there at that time, I will contact you magically and lead you through the Ceremony."
msgstr "당신은 최고의 드루이드가 될 수 있다고 생각하는군. 그러기 위해서는 달의 의식을 통과해야하네. 이 일은 원래는 쉬웠으나 이제는 신성한 제단을 위해 싸워야 하네. 그것은 달의 신전에 있고 악한 드루이들이 컨트롤 하고 있네. 그냥 편하게 끝낼 방법은 없네. 아마도 전투를 치루어야 할걸세. 태양의 의식과 똑같이 하면되네. 새벽에 보름달 일때 달의 제단에서 기도를 하게. 만일 그 곳에 도착하면 내가 인도해 줄 걸세.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1795
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:104
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<Loretta Fleise contacts you via a telepathy spell> Welcome to the Ceremony of the Moon.\nStand ye before the altar of the Moon facing south.\nClose your eyes and meditate upon the Circle of Seasons and the Wheel of Life.\n<long, silent pause>\nOpen your eyes, my friends.\nI hereby promote all great druids to arch druids, and all honorary great druids to honorary arch druids.\n<Loretta fades away> "
msgstr "<로레타 플레이스가 텔레파시 마법으로 연락을 했다> 달의 의식에 온걸 환영합니다. 달의 제단에 서 있고 남쪽을 향하세요. 눈을 감고 계절의 순환과 인생의 변화를 생각하세요.   <길고 조용한 침묵이> 눈을 뜨세요. 내 친구여, 난 여기서 당신을 위대한 드루이드들에서 최고의 드루이드들로 임명합니다. 모든 명예 드루이드들은 최고의 며예 드루이드로 임명함니다.  <로레타는 사라졌다> "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1796
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:105
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must be standing before the altar of the Moon at midnight on any full moon to complete the Ceremony of the Moon and be promoted to arch druid.\nThere is nothing I can do for you to be promoted until then."
msgstr "달의 의식을 끝내기 위해선 보름달이 뜨기전에 새벽에 달의 제단의 중앙에 서 있어야하네. 그 전에 내가 해 줄 수 있는 건 아무 것도 없네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1797
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:106
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The earth is wounded in the west.\nI can feel it, my fellow druids, and if you put your hand to the ground and listen with your heart, you'll feel it, too.\nI am bound here with my responsibilities, but I urge you to investigate the source of this pain.\nI am sure the wound and the Night of Shooting Stars are related.\n"
msgstr "이 별의 서쪽은 상처를 입었네. 난 느낄 수 있네. 당신도 땅에 손을 대고 가슴으로 들어보게. 그럼 느낄 수 있네. 난 책임을 지고 수사에 착수할꺼네. 아마 이 상처는 슈팅스타의 밤과 관련이 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1798
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:107
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I grow tired of winter.\nIn my lands, winter seems to last year round.\nAs a matter of fact, for the last few years, summer didn’t arrive at all.\nI have come to believe that something is wrong with the weather, and I want something done about it.\nI know your reputation, and I hear you can do anything.\nI have a deal for you.\nEnd the winter in my land and I will give you my support in the High Council when it comes time for you to ask for it.\nIf it's any help at all, I hear there is hermit on a mountaintop somewhere west of here who has studied the weather in detail."
msgstr "난 겨울에 자랐네. 내 땅은 겨울만이 존재하는것 같지. 최근 몇년동안 여름은 오질 않았네. 나는 날씨와 무슨 문제가 있는것 같고 무언가를 해야할것 같다고 느꼈네.  난 당신에 대해 얘기를 듣고 당신은 뭐든지 다 할 수 있다고 들었네. 만일 당신이 겨울을 멈추게 해준다면 난 의회에서 당신을 협조하겠네. 도움이 되는 것이라면 여기 서쪽어딘가 산 꼭대기에 날씨에 잘 알고있는 은둔자가 있다고 하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1799
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:108
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you think you could hurry this miracle thing along?\nThe snow on the ground is building up, and we are going to have to start putting buildings on stilts!"
msgstr "당신 혼자서 기적을 일으킬 수 있을 것 같나? 눈은 계섯 갛이고 이젠 눈위에다 건물을 지어야 할 정도네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1800
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:109
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I was looking out my window when the weather broke and the snow vanished!\nA miracle!\nA genuine miracle!\nYou have done my people and me a great service.\n<Slapping his chest> Count Erik Von Stromgard as your friend forever!\n"
msgstr "난 창문 밖을 보고 있는데 날씨가 변하고 눈이 사라졌다네! 기적이야! 대단한 기적이야! 당신은 정말 대단한 일을 해주었네. <상자를 쳐다보며>  에릭 본 스트롬가드는 이제 영원히 당신의 친구이네!   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1801
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:110
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For your services, I grant you my favor in the High Council!\nLong may you live, O enemies of Winter!"
msgstr "나는 이제 의회에서 당신 편을 들겠네! 겨울의 적이여!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1802
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "20 years ago, I won the annual archery competition held at Castle Ironfist, and I have held the championship ever since.\nThis gives me the right to promote archers to the title of warrior mage and master archer as I see fit.\nI’ll grant the title of warrior mage to all the archers amongst you if you do me a little favor. I need the key to the old Dragon Towers set up near every major settlement in Enroth to shoot down flying creatures.\nI think that they can be set to shoot down only monsters, instead of shooting anything flying through the air. Since this is something of a pet project, I will reward honorary warrior mage status to the rest of you.\nThe key is in my old keep near the southern entrance to my lands.\nI had to leave it there when the ogres and their companions took it from me a few years ago.\nReturn with that key and be rewarded.\nAnd I won’t be crying in my beer if you kill a lot of those monsters while you’re at it.\nThey took my keep!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1803
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:112
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No key—No reward.\nOur deal is simple and straightforward.\nFetch the key from my old keep and return once you have it.\n"
msgstr "키가 없군.-보상도 없네. 우리 거래는 간단하고 이해하기 쉽잖아. 나의 오래된 창고에서 키를 빼 나에게 가지고 오기만 하면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1804
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very good!\nYou got the key, and hopefully slew a large number of those loathsome beasts.\nI hereby promote all archers to the status of warrior mage, and all non-archers to honorary warrior mage."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1805
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The reason I wanted the key was to open the Dragon Towers and make the adjustments to prevent them from shooting flyers indiscriminately.\nThere is a way to adjust the towers to shoot at only large objects, and I want all of them adjusted for the good of the Kingdom.\nMagic is becoming more common, as are stories of young Sorcerers getting shot from the sky because they didn’t know the function of the towers.\nYou have the key.\nIf you adjust all of the towers to shoot at only large objects, I will promote all warrior mages amongst you to master archers and promote any honorary warrior mages to honorary master archers."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1806
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:115
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm.\nNot all of the towers have been reset.\nThey are easy to find, if a bit long in getting to.\nThe easiest is in Whitecap to the west of us."
msgstr "음. 모든 타워가 다 정리되진 않았군. 그 곳들은 찾기가 쉽네. 크니까. 제일 쉬운 것은 여기 서쪽으로 있는 화이트캡에 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1807
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:116
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You’ve had a measure of success in resetting the towers, I see, but the job isn’t done yet.\nThere are still towers unadjusted.\nFinish what you’ve started and return to me to receive your reward."
msgstr "당신은 타워를 정리하는 걸 성공적으로 끝냈군. 그러나 아직 임무는 끝난 게 아니네. 아직 많은 타워가 남아있네. 다 끝내고 내게 돌아오게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1808
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I knew my faith in you was well placed!\nYou have fixed a major problem in our kingdom, not to mention doing yourself a favor—It’s now safe to fly above towns.\nIt is my pleasure to promote all warrior mages to master archers, and all honorary warrior mages to honorary master archers.\n"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1809
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome, master archers!\nYou may warm yourself by my hearth any time!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1810
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:119
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I like it up here.\nIt’s as though I can watch the world turn from up high and all alone.\nSerene.\nUntouchable.\nAlmost…Prophetic.\nI can see the clouds churn and travel, break apart and mix together.\nI can predict the weather almost perfectly.\n<Smiling> Right now, I predict more snow."
msgstr "난 여기가 좋네. 난 여기서 세상이 변하는 걸 혼자서 볼 수 있거든. 고요한.  건들지 못하는. 거의 예언되는. 구름이 휘져어져 나누어지고 섞이는 걸 본다네. 난 날씨를 거의 완벽하게 맞출수 있다네. <웃으며> 지금은 눈을 예언하겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1811
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:120
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, Stromgard needs a miracle with the weather, eh?\nAll this time I thought he was the one responsible for making it snow continually.\nI can break the enchantment on the weather easily, and if you hurry back to him, I’m sure you can claim responsibility."
msgstr "그래서, 스트롬가드는 날씨의 기적이 필요하다고? 난 여태까지 그가 모든 책임을 지는 줄 알고 있었는데. 내가 가볍게 바꾸어주지. 그에게 빨리 돌아가게. 좋은 소식이 있을테니. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1812
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:121
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As grateful as I am for your company, I am, in fact, a hermit.\nI'm sure you have plenty of important things to do and don't need to be cluttering up my house any longer."
msgstr "당신을 돕게 되어 기쁘네. 난 은둔자이지. 난 당신이 중요한 일을 해야하기 때문에 여기 오래 있지는 않을 거라고 확신하네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1813
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:122
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well met, champions!\nPlease, don’t waste your valuable time or mine in times like this.\nUse your skills for the good of Enroth and leave me to my planning!\nWhen this battle is over, THEN we can share tales of valor and skill."
msgstr "잘 만났네. 챔피언! 부탁인데, 그대와 나의 황금시간을 이렇게 쓰진 말게. 당신의 기술을 이 땅을 위해 쓰고 내 계획을 망치진 말게. 이 전쟁이 끝나면 그때 만나 얘기하세.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1814
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:123
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello there!\nAre you here to tile the floors?\nOh!\nSorry, for a moment I forgot who you were!\nWelcome again, arch mages!\nPerhaps you can assist me in an experiment or two when you’re less busy?"
msgstr "반갑네! 여기 마루바닥 고치러 왔나? 오, 미인. 당신이 누군지 까먹었군. 진짜로 환영하네. 궁수마법사! 나중에 좀 바쁘지 않을 때는 나를 도와줄 수 있겠지?   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1815
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:124
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am only allowed to vote on the issues that Lord Temper specifically instructs me on.\nGarner his approval, and on his recommendation, I will vote in your favor."
msgstr "난  템퍼 군주의 허락 하에서만 투표할 수 있네. 난 당신에 대해 얘기를 들었고 그가 하라했으니, 당신을 표를 던지겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1816
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:125
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Osric has instructed me to vote for your cause.\nI give you my full support in his name."
msgstr "오스릭이 나보고 당신을 위해 투표하라더군. 닌 그의 이름으로 당신을 위해 투표하겠어.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1817
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:126
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lady Fleise could not possibly care less about your problems and I will therefore not even consider your request."
msgstr "플레이스 여사 는 당신 문지를 돌볼 틈이 없네. 그럼니 난 당신의 요구사항은 신경 쓰지도 않겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1818
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:127
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have my vote, in Loretta’s name, to visit the Oracle."
msgstr "오라클을 방문할, 로레타의 이름으로 된 표가 여기 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1819
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:128
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lord Stone has not authorized me to vote in your behalf.\nYou will need to take this matter up with him."
msgstr "스톤 군주은 나보고 당신을 뽑으라고는 안했네. 그러니 당신은 가서 그와 상의해 보게.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1820
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:129
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Anthony backs your request to visit the Oracle, and I give you my vote on his behalf."
msgstr "앤써니는 당신이 오라클을 만나는 걸 허락했네. 여기 그의 이름으로 내 표를 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1821
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:130
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot vote on matters that do not concern Lord Stromgard.\nUntil you have his backing, I cannot vote for you."
msgstr "난 스트롬가드 군주에게 아무 얘기도 못 들었네. 그가 말하지 않는 이상 난 당신을 뽑을 수 없네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1822
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:131
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I vote for you to visit the Oracle, as instructed by Eric von Stromgard himself."
msgstr "에릭 본 스트롬가드의 뜻으로 난 당신이 오라클을 방문할 수 있게 투표를 했네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1823
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:132
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Until I receive favorable word from Lord Newton on your request, I cannot give you my backing."
msgstr "뉴톤 군주가 뭐라고 하지 않는 이상, 난 당신을 위해 투표할 수 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1824
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:133
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Albert has given me permission to back your request to visit the Oracle. "
msgstr "알버트는 나에게 당신이 오라클을 방문해도 좋다고 허락하셨네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1825
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:134
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not adequately demonstrated your loyalty to my liege, Lord Humphrey, and I cannot give you my vote."
msgstr "당신은 나의 군주 험프리 군주에게 당신에 대해 잘 얘기하지 않은 것 같군. 그러니 난 당신을 위해 표를 줄 수 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1826
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:135
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As long as I am a member of this council, you will not be permitted to visit the Oracle.\nI am not convinced of your sincerity and will not grant your request."
msgstr "내가 이 의회의 멤버인 이상, 당신은 오라클을 볼 생각하질 말게. 난 당신이 어떻게 했든 신경 안쓰네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1827
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:136
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do not believe you have won!\nSoon the Iron Fist will lose its grip, and I will be your king!\nAnd you can be sure I won't forget you…"
msgstr "당신이 이겼다는 걸 믿지 않네, 곧 아이론피스트는 사라질꺼고 난 당신의 왕이 될꺼네! 명심하게, 난 당신을 잊어버리지 않을걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1828
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:137
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Curses!\nFoiled again!"
msgstr "저주다! 또 좌절됐군! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1829
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:138
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, If Loretta's got a new scheme, count me in!\nBut you better get all the other companies to sign up!"
msgstr "자, 만일 로레타가 새로운 계획이 있으면 니도 포함시켜주게! 그러나 꼭 다른 사람들도 포함시켜야 하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1833
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:142
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Pssst…Wanna buy membership in the Buccaneers' Lair?\nWe have two chapter houses in the kingdom, and we support our members by teaching them certain valuable skills.\nI'm sure you know what I mean.\nAll we want is 25 gold pieces, and our services are at your disposal."
msgstr " 부캐니어 래어의 멤버쉽을 사고 싶나? 우린 두개의 길드가 있지. 그리고 우리는 유용한 기술을 가르친다네. 단지 25 골드로.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1834
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:143
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hi.\nI'm the guild recruiter for Protection Services, a 'special' guild sanctioned by Lord Anthony Stone to sell protection to merchants, whether they want it or not.\nBut we aren't all thugs– we offer legitimate services and classes, too.\nMembership in the Protection Services Guild costs 50 gold, and entitles you to buy classes in any skill we teach."
msgstr "반갑네. 난 프로텍션 서비스 길드의 앤소니 스톤 군주가 허락한, 이 곳의 책임자네. 우리는 확실한 기술과 분류를 가지고 있지. 가입비는 50 골드라네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1835
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:144
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Smugglers' Guild doesn't just run contraband goods past customs inspectors– it offers schooling in all the skills a smuggler needs to excel in his chosen profession.\nAll our members get access to the finest teachers in the business.\nAll we ask is a one time guild membership fee of 50 gold pieces."
msgstr "스머글러 길드는 그냥 단지 불법거래만 지나치는게 아니네. 이곳은 밀수업자들이 필요한 모든 것을 가르치지. 모든 우리 멤버들은 좋은 비지니스맨이지. 가입하는데는 50 골드이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1836
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:145
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "HEY!\nThe Blades' End mercenary's guild wants YOU– provided you're willing to pay a small fee to join.\nFor 25 gold pieces, we'll give you access to teachers for many of the skills a good sword for hire needs to succeed.\n"
msgstr "이봐! 블래이드 엔즈 머세너리의 길드는 당신을 원하네. 참가하기위해서 조금만 투자히게. 25 골드만 내면 많은 검술을 배울 수가 있을꺼네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1837
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:146
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Duelists' Edge mercenary guild offers valuable teachings in all the skills that a warrior on the go needs to know.\nFor a one time fee of 50 gold, we'll give you access to not just one of our fine guild halls, but BOTH of them.\nRemember, ours is the only guild that teaches the valuable repair skill."
msgstr "듀리스트 에지 머세너리 길드는 전사들이 알아야 할 많은 기술들을 가르치지. 가입비는 50 골드, 또 다른 우리 길드에 가입되네. 잊지말게, 우리 길드만이 물건 고치는 기술을 가르친다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1838
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:147
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The only way to get someone to teach you how to properly wear plate armor, short of a four year stint in the Iron Army, is to join the Berserkers' Fury mercenary guild.\nWe teach many other skills as well, so our modest fee of 50 gold pieces to join for life is really cheap."
msgstr "판금 갑옷을 입는 법과 철 갑옷에서 절약하는 법은 버서커 퓨리 머세너리길드에 가입하면 되네. 우리는 다른 기술도 잘 가르치고 50 골드만 내면 평생 회원이 되네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1839
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:148
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you already have membership in the Guild of the Elements, I'm sure you've found that their 'fine library' doesn't measure up to your exacting standards.\nThat's why I urge you to pay your dues at the Guild of Air.\nSince we concentrate on air magic, you're more likely to find what you're looking for.\nAnd the price is low, too!\nJust 50 gold for a lifetime membership."
msgstr "당신이 만일 원소 길드의멤버라면 ,당신은 분명히 그들의 좋은 도서관이 당신에게 큰 도움이 된다는 걸 알고 있을 꺼네. 그래서 에어 길드에 가입하라는 거네. 우리는 에어 마법만 담당하고 당신이 원하는 걸 찾을 수 있을꺼네. 가격도 아주 싼 50골드라네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1840
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:149
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Membership in the Guild of Earth will give you access to our excellent library of earth spells.\nLike all the spell guilds, we have two guild houses, and membership in the one automatically enrolls you in the other.\nThe cost to join is but 50 gold pieces."
msgstr "대지 길드의 멤버쉽은 강하고 위대한 대지 마법을 사용가능케 해 주지. 다른 길드처럼. 우린 두개의 길드가 있는데 다른 한군데도 자동으로 멤버가 되지. 참가비용은 50 골드라네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1841
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:150
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You may have noticed all the monsters and hostile people running around the kingdom lately.\nDefending yourself can be tough with the simple spells the Guild of the Elements teaches to its members.\nWhat you need is fire power!\nThe Guild of Fire has the most destructive spells short of dark magic known to man.\n50 gold pieces gives you access to our excellent library."
msgstr "당신은 이미 많은 괴물들과 악한들이 늦게 거리를 돌아다니는 걸 봤을꺼네. 당신 자신을 방어하는 것은  원소 길드의 멤버로서는 부족하네. 필요한 것은 불의 힘이지. 50 골드에 블�l 길드에 가입하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1842
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:151
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Membership in the Guild of Water gives you the right to buy our spells of change and movement.\nIt's my job to recruit new members and collect membership dues from them.\nThe price is 50 gold, and that includes membership in both our initiate and adept guild halls."
msgstr "물의 길드 멤버가 되면 당신은 바뀌고 이동하는 우리의 마법을 살수 있네. 신입 회원을 이끌어 드리는 것이 내가 하는 일이네. 50 골드면 길드 홀을 사용할 수 있네.."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1843
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:152
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the guild recruiter for the Guild of Body.\nWe are aware that many people think the simple healing spells available at the Guild of the Self are adequate, but we assure you they're not.\nIf you join our guild, you'll have the opportunity to purchase much more effect Body magic spells.\nThe cost is 50 gold pieces."
msgstr "바디 길드의 신입담당이네. 많은 사람들이 우리가  셀프 길드가 하는 치료마법과 비슷한줄 알니만 그건 아니네. 만일 참가한다면 많은 바디 마법의 효과를 볼 수 있네. 가격은 50 골드네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1844
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:153
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The greatest mind magic spells cannot be found in the Guild of the Self– they can only be found at the Guild of the Mind.\nI am empowered to sell membership to the Guild of the Mind for 50 gold pieces.\nWe have two guild halls, and membership in either is one and the same."
msgstr "위대한 마인드 마법은  셀프 길드에서 발견할 수 없네. 그것들은 단지 마인드 길드에서만 얻을 수 있지. 난 멤버쉽을 50 골드에 팔고 있네. 우린 2개의 길드가 있고 같이 사용가능하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1845
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:154
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When death strikes, often the measures an individual takes to prevent financial loss to the grieving family are inadequate, resulting in devastating burial costs.\nThe best way to prevent these costs is to invest in a Raise Dead or Resurrection spell purchased by the friendly folks at the Guild of Spirit Magic.\nYes, members enjoy full access to our luxurious and well stocked libraries for a small one time charge of 50 gold.\nAct now and set your mind at ease!"
msgstr "죽음이 찾아 왔을 때 사람들은 어쩔 줄을 모르지. 가족들에게는 엄청난 장례비용이 들어가지. 그런 걸 없에기 위해서는 죽음에서 일어나는 마법이나 부활마법을 준비하면 되고 그런 것들은 스프릿 길드에서 팔고 있네. 멤버가 되면 다 알수 있고 단 50 골드만 받는다네. 지금 신청하게.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1846
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:155
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Light magic represents the most powerful magic a person can wield without cost to his soul.\nUnavailable anywhere else in the kingdom, we feel confident our price of 1000 gold pieces for guild membership is fair."
msgstr "라잇트 매직은 아주 강한 마법을 영혼의 힘을 닳지 않고 사용케 해주네. 왕국 안에 이런 곳은 없네. 1000 골드만 내면 멤버로 받아주지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1847
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:156
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know what you want– power.\nYou're tired of half-hearted spells that nick and cut your enemies but do no real damage.\nLet me introduce you to the Guild of Dark.\nOur spells are the strongest in the land, plain and simple.\nMembership in our guild costs but 1000 gold."
msgstr "난 당신이 원하는게 뭔지 아네. -힘이지. 당신은 이미 별로 소용없는 마법을 쓰는데 지쳤을꺼야. 내가 어둠의 길드를 소개하지. 우리의 마법은 가장 강하고 멤버쉽은 1000 골드라네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1850
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:159
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join Buccaneers' Lair for 25 gold"
msgstr "부캐니어 래어에 25 골드로 참가한다.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1851
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:160
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join Protection Services for 50 gold"
msgstr "프로텍션 서비스 에 50 골드로 참가한다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1852
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:161
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join Smugglers' Guild for 50 gold"
msgstr "스머글러 길드에 50 골드로 참가한다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1853
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:162
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join Blades' End for 25 gold"
msgstr "블래이드 앤드에 25 골드로 참가한다.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1854
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:163
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join Duelists' Edge for 50 gold"
msgstr "듀리스트 에지에 50 골드로 참가한다.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1855
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:164
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join Berserkers' Fury for 50 gold"
msgstr "버서커스 퓨리에 50 골드로 참가한다.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1866
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:175
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For your numerous crimes and evil deeds, you have been sentenced to one year in prison. "
msgstr "당신의 범죄와 악한 행동으로 인해 당신은 감옥에 1년 있어야 한다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1867
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:176
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Followers of Baa and a band of cutpurses have been raiding Mist from the islands to the north.\nThey come to Mist through a teleporter on the northwest of the island.\nI'll activate the teleporter so that you can get to their islands and get rid of them.\nI'm sure they have all the things they've stolen on those islands, and you can get back from their teleporter.\n "
msgstr "바의 추종자들은 미스트에서 섬 북쪽까지 자라잡고 있지. 그들은 미스트에서 섬 북서쪽까지 순간이동도 한다네. 내가 당신을 그 곳으로 순간 이동시켜주겠네. 그들을 없애기 위해. 그리고 그들의 텔레포트를 이용해 돌아오게나. 그 섬에는 많은 보물이 있을 걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1868
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:177
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You never found it."
msgstr "절대 못 찾는다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1869
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:178
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here is the %s you have misplaced.\nYou must be more careful in the future."
msgstr "여기 당신이 잘 못 놓은 %s가 있네. 앞으로는 꼭 조심하게.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1870
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:179
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Slicker Silvertongue refused my order?\nThis must be treason!\nStill, I've known him so long, and he's never disobeyed an order before…perhaps he is suffering from delusions.\nYes, that's it.\nHe's been spending so much time investigating that horrible Baa cult that it's affected his mind– I even found one of their cloaks in his room.\nPerhaps you can find a cure for him.\nThey must surely know what they've done to him!\nI would start at their headquarters east of Castle Kriegspire.\nHere, take the cloak– perhaps you can find some use for it."
msgstr "슬릭커 실버통이 내 명령을 무시했다고? 이건 반역이군! 난 그를 안지 오래 됐지만 그는 내게 한번도 반기를 든적 없는데.... 아마 그는 현혹됐을꺼야. 그래, 그는 바아를 수사하는 데 많은 시간을 보냈고 그 동안 그들이 그를 현혹했을꺼야.- 난 그의 방에서 그들의 망토도 찾아냈네. 아마 당신이 그를 치료하는 약을 구할 수 있을지도 모르지. 그들이 그를 어떻게 했는지 분명히 알아야 할 걸세. 난 성 크레이그스파이어동쪽에서부터 시작하고 싶네! 여기, 망토를 가져가게. 쓸데가 있을지 모르니. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1871
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:180
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, my!\nIt appears that Slicker Silvertongue really is a traitor!\nWho ever would have guessed it?\nYou've done a good thing, bringing this letter to me.\nTake it to High Council immediately so we can be rid of this wicked traitor for once and for all!"
msgstr "오, 이런! 이것은 슬릭커 실버통이 진짜 배신자라는 것을 나타내는 군. 누가 알았겠나? 이 편지를 정말 잘 갖고 왔네. 이걸 의회로 가지고 가 밝혀야 겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1872
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:181
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Please hurry in your quest to find Slicker Silvertongue's cure!\nI am sure the poor man must be suffering horribly under their dreadful mind control spell!"
msgstr "빨리 슬릭커 실버통의 구제법을 찾게. 그는 지금 무서움에 떨고 있네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1873
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:182
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to the Circus of the Sun!\nWe have a variety of games for your amusement.\nYou can take the prizes you win from the various games and trade them in here for either kegs of wine or golden pyramids.\nYou need at least 10 points to get a keg of wine, and 30 or more points will win you a golden pyramid.\nIn case you didn't know, each lodestone is worth 1 point, each harpy feather is worth 3 points, and each four leaf clover is worth 5 points.\n"
msgstr "태양의 서커스에 온 걸 환영하네! 우리는 많은 게임들을 가지고 있네. 게임마다 상품이 있고 그것을 따면 와인통이나 골든 피라미드로 바꿀 수 있네. 와인통에게는 10 포인트, 골드 피라미드는 30 포인트가 필요하다네. 그리고 각각의 로드스톤은 1 포인트의 가치가 있네. 각각의 하피 피더는 3 포인트의 가치가 있고, 네잎 클로버는 5 포인트라네.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1874
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:183
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Missing Text:\nCircus Main Tent Trade for Prize"
msgstr "Missing Text:  Circus Main Tent Trade for Prize"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1875
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:184
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm sorry, but you don't have 10 points yet.\nWhy don't you try a few more games?"
msgstr "미안하지만 당신은 10 포인트가 안되네. 더 게임을 해보게나.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1876
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:185
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nYou win a keg of wine!\nThere are no limits on the prizes here, so keep playing!"
msgstr "축하하네! 당신은 와인통을 얻었군! 여기에 리밋은 없으니 계속 해보게!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1877
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:186
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nYou win a golden pyramid!\nGood work– remember there are no limits on the prizes, so keep playing!"
msgstr "축하하네! 당신은 골든 피라미드를 얻었군! 잘 했네, 여기는 리밋이 없으니 계속 해 보게!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1878
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:187
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome!\nTo play my game, simply pay 50 gold and step right up to compete against me.\nDepending on how well you do you can win either a lodestone, a harpy feather, or a four leaf clover.\nIf you do poorly, you win nothing.\nYou can trade in your lodestones, feathers, and clovers in the main tent."
msgstr "환영하네! 내 게임을 하려면 50 골드를 내고 올라와 나랑 붙게. 얼마만큼 하느냐에 따라 로드스톤, 하피 피더, 네잎 클로바냐가 결정되지. 만일 못하면 아무 것도 얻는 게 없네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1879
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:188
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Too bad!\nYou came pretty close.\nFor 50 gold, I'll give you another chance."
msgstr "아깝네! 거의 다 됐는데, 50골드를 주면 또 한번의 기회가 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1880
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:189
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good job, I thought I had you there.\nYou win a lodestone!"
msgstr "잘 했네, 거기서 끝날 줄 알았는데. 당신은 로드스톤을 얻었네!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1881
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:190
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent work, you win a harpy feather!"
msgstr "대단하군, 당신은 하피 피더를 얻었네!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1882
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:191
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Incredible!\nAre you sure you didn't cheat?\nWell, a rule's a rule.\nHere's your prize– a four leaf clover!"
msgstr "믿을수 없군! 정말 속임수 안 �㎡�? 자, 여기 선물로 네잎 크로바가 있네!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1883
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:192
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As part of the effort to rebuild the Temple here in Free Haven, I'm collecting temple gongs.\nIf you have any gongs, I'll pay you 2000 gold for each of them."
msgstr "프리 헤븐의 신전을 다시 짓는 자로서 난 신전 징을 모으네. 만일 징을 갖고 있다면 내가 2000 골드에 사겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1884
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:193
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This one's a little dirty, but I suppose it will do.\nHere is the gold I promised you for it.\nThanks for your help!"
msgstr "이건 약간 더럽지만 어떻하겠나. 여기 내가 약속한 골드가 있네. 도와줘서 고맙네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1885
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:194
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm looking for bones to use in my rituals.\nI prefer bones from humans or humanoids, but I suppose I can make do with whatever you find.\nI'm willing to pay up to 1000 gold for bones that I can use."
msgstr "난 나의 의식에 쓸 뼈를 찾고 있네. 인간의 뼈나 비슷한 뼈여야만 하네. 난 그것에 1000 골드를 내겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1886
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:195
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm...\nA leg bone of a human?\nThis will do nicely.\nThis bone is certainly worth 1000 gold.\n"
msgstr "음... 인간의 다리뼈? 아주 멋지군. 이 뼈는 1000 골드의 가치가 있겠군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1887
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:196
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many people aren't able to visit the circus, so I'm collecting circus prizes to give away to those not able to visit it themselves.\nI'll buy lodestones for 5 gold each if you want to part with them."
msgstr "많은 사람들이 서커스를 구경 못 오지. 그래서 나는 서커스 비용을 오지 못하는 자들을 위해 받겠네. 난 로드 스톤을 5골씩 사겠네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1888
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:197
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you!\nYou're too generous– this will make a lovely gift.\nHere's the 5 gold I owe you."
msgstr "고맙네! 당신은 너무 친절하네-이건 멋진 선물이 될 걸세. 여기 내가 빚진 5골드.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1889
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:198
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My daughter wants to go to the circus, but we never have the time when the circus is near here.\nI'd love to give her a bunch of the pretty harpy feathers for her.\nI'll take any harpy feathers you have for 10 gold each."
msgstr "내 딸은 서커스 구경을 가고 싶어하지. 그러나 이근처에 서커스가 열렸을 때는 갈 시간이 없네. 내 딸을 위해 몇 개의 예쁜 하피 피더를 주고 싶네. 난 그걸 10 골드에 사겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1890
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:199
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks!\nDon't tell my daughter about this, I want to surprise her.\nHere's the 10 gold."
msgstr "고맙네! 내 딸에게 이것에 대해 얘기하지 말게, 난 그녀를 놀래주고 싶네. 여기 10골드가 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1891
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:200
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard that you can get really nifty things from Abdul's Desert Resort if you pay with golden pyramids.\nI'm hoping to go there one day, and I want to stock up on the pyramids now.\nI'll take any golden pyramids you have for 1000 gold."
msgstr "난 당신이 아불 사막 리조트에서 골든 피라미드를 구했다고 들었네. 나도 가서 사고 �럼�. 그러니 난 당신이 가지고 있는 것들을 1000 골드에 사겠네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1892
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:201
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome, adventurers!\nDid you have something for me?\nI'm a very busy man, you know.\n"
msgstr "환영하네! 모험자들이여! 나를 위해 뭔가가 있나? 난 매우 바쁜사람이네, 보시다시피.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1893
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:202
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can help you become an expert in the use of the staff as a weapon.\nAll you need is an intermediate skill in the staff (Rank 4) and 2000 gold."
msgstr "난 당신이 지팡이에 베테랑이 되는 걸 도와 줄 수 있네. 당신이 필요한 건 2000골드와 중간 지팡이(랭크4)의 실력이라네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1894
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not to brag, but I'm the best staff fighter in the land.\nI will teach any student who is already an expert with the staff and has a high degree of skill (Rank 7) for 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1895
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:204
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My teaching can improve your sword technique.\nYou must already be of intermediate skill (Rank 4) to benefit from my advice.\nI charge 2000 gold per student."
msgstr "난 당신의 검술을 올려줄 수 있네. 물론 중간의 기술 (랭크4)가 있어야 하고 2000 골드만 내면 되네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1896
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am amongst the finest swordsmen in the land.\nI will teach students who possess a high degree of skill (Rank 7) for 5000 gold. I won't waste my time with anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1897
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:206
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wanna learn a few tricks with the dagger?\nYou've come to the right place, my friend.\nI'll teach you if you already know a thing or two with a dagger (Rank 4), and of course can pay my fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr "단검 기술들을 배우고 싶나? 재대로 왔네. (랭크4)가 되야하고 2000 골드만 내게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1898
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The dagger is a quick and subtle weapon that needs more brains than brawn to use.\nIf you're already skilled enough (Rank 7), I can train you to master rank for 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1899
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:208
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Using an axe is trickier than you think.\nIf you've already had some practice with the axe (Rank 4), I'll be happy to show you the finer points of splitting skulls.\nMy fee is 2000 gold."
msgstr "도끼는 생각보다 강하네. 만일 당신이 이미 (랭크 4)의 실력이 있고 2000 골드만 낸다면 두개골을 작살내는 기술을 알려주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1900
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, you want to train your axe skill the dwarven way?\nMy tutorage will show you how to dramatically increase the damage you inflict with an axe. I require a high skill (Rank 7) and 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1901
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:210
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It takes practice to use a spear right.\nYou have to know how to keep your enemy from getting past the point, and what to do when he does.\nIf you have enough skill already (Rank 4), I can show you the right moves.\nAll I want is 2000 gold for my services."
msgstr "창은 쓸려면 연습을 해야하지. 당신은 적들의 포인트를 잘 알아야하네. 내가 그걸 가르쳐주지. 당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 2000 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1902
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A little practice with the spear keeps you from making deadly mistakes in battle, but a lot more practice will help you get the best results from your spear.\nI will teach you the secrets of the masters if you've already had a little practice (Rank 7).\nMy fee is 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1903
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:212
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning to use a bow quickly and accurately is a skill that can take a lifetime to master.\nI can start you down that road if you've already had some basic training (Rank 4) and 2000 gold in your purse.\nWhat do you say?"
msgstr "활을 빠르고 정확하게 쓰는 기술을 배우고 싶나? 마스터 정도의? 난 당신이 (랭크 4)의 기술이 있고 2000 골드만 주면 가르쳐 주겠네. 어떤가?  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1904
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many years ago, I discovered a technique for firing twice as many arrows as the conventionally trained archer can in the same amount of time. My teaching costs 5000 gold, and you must already be highly skilled (Rank 7) in the bow."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1905
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:214
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A lot of people think there isn't much finesse in using a mace or hammer, but they're wrong.\nBeating something to death with a mace is a lot like playing the drums.\nYou have to target the hard, bony parts of your enemy so your weapon will bounce back quickly, cocking itself for another strike.\nI can teach you this technique if you already have a little skill (Rank 4) for 2000 gold."
msgstr "많은 사람들은 철퇴나 해머가 좋지 않다고 하지. 그건 틀렸네. 가장 큰 대미지를 줄 수 있는걸. 내가 그런 기술들을 알려주겠네. 당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 2000 골드면 되네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1906
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A master of the mace can strike enemies senseless with a single blow.\nI've been practicing this technique for years and have it down to a science.\nIf you have the skill (Rank 7), I can teach you my technique for 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1907
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:216
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No weapon today can match the power of the weapons from the Time of Wonders.\nI'm not sure any of those ancient weapons exist anymore, but I can show you some tricks if you find one.\nReally!\nI'm not crazy!"
msgstr "어떤 무기도 오늘날 고대 시대와 비교할 수 없네. 아마 더 이상의 고대 무기는 존재하질 않을 걸세. 만일 찾을 수 있다면 내가 사용법을 가르쳐주지. 정말로! 난 미치지 않았다네!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1908
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:217
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Long ago I found an old weapon that fired sunlight and could kill almost anything I used it against.\nI killed so many dragons, it got to be routine.\nI could shoot them out of the sky like big, slow ducks.\nOne day, it just stopped working, and my career as a dragon slayer ended.\nIf you ever bring me one, I'll show you how to use it right for 5000 gold."
msgstr "오래 전에 난 모든 적들을 죽일 수 있는 오래된 무기를 발견했네. 난 많은 용들을 죽였고 그게 나의 일과였지. 난 하늘을 나는 것도 무슨 오리 죽이듯이 죽였네. 어느날 갑자기 사용할 수가 없더군, 나의 명성도 멈췄지. 만일 가져온다면 내가 5000골드에 사용법을 가르쳐 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1909
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:218
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Used correctly, a shield makes a big difference in a fight.\nYou have to defend yourself if you're going to have a chance of winning.\nI can give you a some advanced training if you've already practiced a little (Rank 4) and have 2000 gold to spend."
msgstr "제대로 사용한다면 방패는 전쟁서 큰 차이를 만들지. 만일 이기려면 제대로 쓸 줄 알아야 하네. 만일 당신이 (랭크 4) 고 2000 골드만 준다면 내가 기술들을 가르쳐 주지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1910
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's easy to use a shield, but hard to use it right.\nI can drastically improve your defense if you give me the chance.\nSince I only offer extremely advanced training, you have to be an expert student (Rank 7) before I can help you.\nAll I ask is 3000 gold for my fee."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1911
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:220
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can teach expert skill in leather armor for a modest fee of 1000 gold if you already have a little skill (Rank 4)."
msgstr "난 1000 골드만 주고 실력이 (랭크4 )라면 가죽갑옷의 베테랑 기술을 가르쳐 줄 수 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1912
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My teaching will bring you up to master ranking in leather armor for 3000 gold.\nMy students must already be highly skilled (Rank 7) in the use of leather armor for my teaching to be worth anything to them."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1913
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:222
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Using chain armor is a skill that must be developed like any other.\nIt's not like wearing a heavy coat, that's for sure!\nI can train a little expertise into you for 1000 gold, provided you already have some skill (Rank 4) with chain armor."
msgstr "체인 갑옷 쓰는 기술도 다른 기술처럼 꼭 배워야 하지. 무거운 코트를 입는 기분은 아닐걸세. 당신의 실력이 (랭크4)고 내게 1000 골드만 준다면 기술들을 가르쳐 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1914
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Chain armor is a weapon of war, there's no doubt of that, and I'm careful who I train in its use.\nI require my students to be well practiced (Rank 7) before I'll train them.\nMy fee is 3000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1915
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:224
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An expert with plate armor can wear it with elegance and style.\nI can instill this grace in my students if they already have a little skill (Rank 4) and 1000 gold for my fee."
msgstr "판금 갑옷의 베테랑은 갑옷을 멋있고 품위있게 입을 수 있지. 만일 당신이 (랭크4)의 기술이 있고 1000 골드만 있다면 내가 가르쳐 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1916
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One who is a master in the use of plate mail wears it as easily as he wears his own clothes.\nI'll only teach it to skilled people (Rank 7) for 3000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1917
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:226
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The secrets of the fire are deep indeed, and can only be taught to one well initiated in the art (Rank 4).\nI can bring your skill to expert level for 1000 gold."
msgstr "불의 비밀은 대단히 중요하지, 그리고 능력이 (랭크4)이상 되는 사람만 배울 수 있네. 1000 골드만 주면 가르쳐주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1918
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Long have I studied the mysteries of fire magic, and have finally come to master the skill.\nI can teach the highly skilled (Rank 7) some of the things I've learned for 4000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1919
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:228
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are ways to draw magical energy from the air to power your spells longer and more efficiently.\nIf you're practiced in the art of air magic (Rank 4), I can teach you for 1000 gold."
msgstr "공기에서 마법을 찾아 강하고 효과적으로 사용할 수 있다네. 만일 당신의 마법 능력이 (랭크 4)이고 1000 골드만 주면 가르쳐 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1920
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Air magic is the most subtle and quirky of the elemental magics you can study.\nBecause of the difficulty involved in learning this skill, I require a high proficiency (Rank 7).\nMy price is 4000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1921
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:230
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Water is the element of movement and change.\nWithout skill in water magic, it takes forever to get from one side of the kingdom to the other.\nI can improve your skill to expert status if you've already had a little practice (Rank 4).\nMy fee is 1000 gold."
msgstr "물은 항상 변하고 바뀌는 원소이네. 물의 마법없이는, 한쪽 왕궁에서 다른곳까지 수십년 걸릴꺼네. 난 당신이 랭크4정도가 되고 1000 골드만 낸다면 베테랑으로 만들어 줄 수 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1922
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A master of water magic with the Lloyd's Beacon spell can travel about the kingdom as much as he pleases.\nI teach the skill to the most advanced students (Rank 7) for 4000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1923
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:232
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you want to become an expert in earth magic, you've come to the right place.\nAll you need is a modest level of skill (Rank 4) and 1000 gold for my fee."
msgstr "대지 마법의 베테랑이 되고 싶다면 제대로 찾아왔네. 당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 1000 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1924
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can teach experts in earth magic to become masters of earth magic.\nYou must be very highly skilled (Rank 7) before I can help you, and my fee is 4000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1925
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:234
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Spirit magic is the magic you need to bring life from death.\nI can train you in this important skill if you've already had a little practice (Rank 4) and are willing to pay me 1000 gold."
msgstr "스피릿 마법은 죽음에서 생명을 가져올 때 필요하지.  난 당신이 랭크4정도가 되고 1000 골드만 낸다면 베테랑으로 만들어 줄 수 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1926
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The most advanced spells of spirit magic permit the practitioner to raise the dead back to life. The choice of bringing a soul back from its final resting place is a weighty one indeed, and I will only train those with sufficient skill (Rank 7) for 4000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1927
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:236
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can fine tune your skill in mind magic, bringing you up to the level of expert in this vital skill.\nYou must have had a little practice (Rank 4) and be willing to pay a fee of 1000 gold."
msgstr "난 당신의 마인드 마법능력을 베테랑 레벨로 만들어 줄 수 있네. 당신이 필요한 건랭크4의 기술과 1000 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1928
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will train any experts of mind magic sufficiently skilled (Rank 7) to master level for 4000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1929
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:238
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Body magic is the magic of healing and strengthening spells.\nI will train anyone who is interested up to expert level for 1000 gold.\nAll you need is a little prior practice (Rank 4) for me to help you."
msgstr "바디 마법은 체력을 회복시켜 주는 매직이지.  당신이 필요한 건 베테랑의 기술과 1000 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1930
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The mysteries of the body can be yours all for the low, low price of 4000 gold.\nOnly highly skilled (Rank 7) experts can benefit from my teachings."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1931
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can show you some of the secrets of light magic if you already have a little skill (Rank 4) to start with.\nMy fee is 1000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1932
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A master of light magic is amongst the most powerful spell casters in the world.\nI can improve nearly any expert to master status, but I do not do this lightly.\nI require a high skill (Rank 7) and 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1933
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah!\nA student of darkness, no doubt!\nIf you want schooling in dark magic, I can help you if you've already practiced a little (Rank 4).\nMy fee is 1000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1934
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can bring experts of dark magic up to master, provided they meet my standards.\nI only teach the genuinely dedicated– those of high skill (Rank 7).\nI make no exceptions, and charge only 5000 gold in the interests of spreading darkness throughout the world."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1935
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:244
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you've spent any time adventuring at all, you'll know how important it is to know what your equipment does and how much it's worth.\nI can improve your expertise with this skill if you already have a little identify skill to start with (Rank 4).\nMy price is 500 gold."
msgstr "만일 모험을 많이 한다면 당신의 장비가 얼마나 가치가 있고 어떻게 쓰이는지 알아야 하네. 난 그런 능력을 알려줄 수 있지. 당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 500 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1936
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You may already have found that while being an expert in identifying your treasure is good, it's not good enough.\nI change\nthat.\nI will teach experts to become masters for 2500 gold.\nAll you need is sufficient skill (Rank 7)."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1937
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:246
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will happily teach anyone with enough (Rank 4) merchant skill to become an expert merchant for 2000 gold.\nIt may seem expensive, but it's worth it!"
msgstr "난  상거래 기술을 베테랑 상인으로 기쁘게 가르칠걸세. 그만큼 가치가 있지.  당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 2000 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1938
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rare is the expert merchant, but rarer still is the master.\nI can finish your merchant's education for 4000 gold, provided you have the skill (Rank 7) and the charm (Personality 50)."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1939
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:248
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Any blacksmith shop can repair your equipment, but what do you do when something breaks while you're on the road?\nI can make you an expert at mending things that are broken.\nAll you need is a little repair skill (Rank 4) to start with, and the gold to pay me.\nMy fee is but 500 gold."
msgstr "어떤 대장장이도 당신의 망가진 무기를 고칠 수 있지. 그러나 만일 길 위에서 고장나면 어떻게 할 건가?  난 그런 고치는 기술을 베테랑으로 만들어 줄걸세.  당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 500 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1940
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I teach experts in repair skill to be masters in the repair skill.\nYou must have a high skill (Rank 7) and 2500 gold for my fee."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1941
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:250
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ja, you want to learn body building, right?\nThen you listen to me.\nI teach you right for 500 gold, if you have a little meat on your body (Rank 4) to start with."
msgstr "자, 바디 빌딩을 배우고 싶지, 안 그런가?  당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 500 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1942
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If ever I've seen such pathetic weaklings as you, for the life of me I cannot remember!\nStarving rats have more meat on their bones!\nFor a fee of 2500 gold, I'll beat you mercilessly until you become master body builders!\nYou must, however, already have spent time working out (Rank 7) and be tough enough to take my punishment (Endurance 50) before I'll have anything to do with you!"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1943
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:252
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The way to achieve strength in the material realm is to achieve strength in the spiritual realm.\nI can show you the way.\nFor a fee of 500 gold, I will help you attain expert skill in meditation if you have already had a little practice (Rank 4)."
msgstr "보통 재료의 영역을 정신적 영역으로 승화시키는 거지. 내가 가르칠 수 있다네.  당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 500 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1944
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who disturbs my meditation, as the pebble disturbs the stillness of the pond?\nAhh, seekers of the True Path.\nIf you have already traveled the path of meditation for some time (rank 7) necessary for my teaching, I can lead you to master status for 2500 gold.\n"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1945
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:254
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The watchful can sometimes see a trap just before it goes off.\nThe lucky and skillful can sometimes avoid damage altogether.\nI can teach you to recognize and avoid these traps provided you've already practiced a little (Rank 4) and have 500 gold for my fee.\n"
msgstr "신중하면 함정을 피할 수도 있지. 그러나 운과 실력이 함께 한다면 더할 나위 없지. 난 이런 함정을 피하는걸 가르친다네. 당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 500 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1946
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The lucky person with a well trained eye can often stay out of harm's way when a trap goes off unexpectedly.\nIf you've already had a lot of practice (Rank 7), I'll make you a master of the perception skill.\nMy fee is but 2500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1947
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:256
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Having trouble getting people to talk to you?\nThat's your reputation speaking!\nA little skill in diplomacy will lessen the impact of your past misdeeds.\nI can bring you up to expert diplomat if you've already practiced your diplomacy a little (Rank 4) and have 500 gold for my fee.\n"
msgstr "사람들과 얘기하는데 문제가 있나? 조그만 사교적 능력이 엄청 차이나게 하지. 내가 그런 능력을 베테랑으로 만들어 줄 수 있네. 당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 500 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1948
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:257
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Even a murderer is entitled to his day in court, and a good diplomat can turn a premeditated ambush into a case of desperate self defense.\nI specialize in training expert diplomats into master diplomats.\nYou must have had plenty of practice (Rank 7) and enough fame (200) for my teaching to be of help.\nMy fee is 2500 gold."
msgstr "살인자들도 좋은 정치적 능력이 있다면 법원에서 이길 수도 있지. 난 베테랑 디플로메이트를 마스터로 만들어 준다네. 랭크 7의 능력과 200 fame, 그리고 2500 골드만 있으면 되네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1949
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:258
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So much of the treasure of the land is in the hands of monsters and criminals, and they have been getting very clever with their traps.\nYou really need to know how to get past those traps and live to tell the tale.\nI can help.\nIf you already have a little skill (Rank 4), I can train you to expert rank for just 500 gold.\n"
msgstr "많은 보물들이 괴물이나 범죄자의 손에 있지. 그들은 많은 함정이 있는 곳에 영리하게 숨켜 놓았지. 난 그런걸 피하는 걸 가르친다네.  당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 500 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1950
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's one thing to kill a rich and powerful monster, but it's something else entirely to get past the traps it puts on its treasure chests.\nMy disarm training is the best in the kingdom.\nIf you're already an expert and have the skill (Rank 7), I can train you to master rank for 2500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1951
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:260
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must learn to learn well if you're to enjoy a long and fruitful life.\nIf you already understand what I'm talking about (Rank 4), I can take you a lot farther.\nMy teachings cost 2000 gold."
msgstr "당신은 행복하게 장소하고 싶다면 많이 배워야 하네. 내가 그런 것을 가르치지. 당신이 필요한 건 랭크4의 기술과 2000 골드면 되네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1952
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the teacher of teachers, the master of learning.\nI can bring your understanding of the world around you to new heights.\nI will only train those who have studied under my old students and have a thorough understanding of my precepts (Rank 7).\nIf you are smart enough (Intellect 50), I can bring you to master rank for 5000 gold.\n"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1956
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:265
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must first be an expert in the skill before you can become a master."
msgstr "마스터가 되기 전에 베테랑 기술을 알아야 하네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1960
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:269
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best staff teacher in the land, Jasper Rice, lives up near Silver Cove.\nYou'll want to talk to him if you wish to continue your training with the staff."
msgstr "최고의 지팡이 선생님은 실버 코브 근처에 살고 있는 자스퍼 라이스이지. 만일 지팡이를 잘 사용하고 싶다면 그와 얘기해 보게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1961
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:270
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Guy Hampton in Blackshire taught me everything I know about the sword.\nIf you're looking to master the blade, he's the one to train under."
msgstr "불략쉐어의 가이 햄톤은 내 검술을 다 가르쳐 주었지. 만일 검술의 마스터가 되고 싶다면 그를 찾게.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1962
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:271
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm only a novice when compared to someone like Jules Miles.\nHe lives near Castle Stone, and he can teach anyone how to improve their dagger skills."
msgstr "나를 줄레스 마일스와 비교한다면 난 초보자이네. 그는 스톤 근처에 살고 그는 아무에게나 단검 기술을 가르친다네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1963
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:272
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Avinril Smythers mastered the axe before most of us were even born, but he doesn't train humans.\nI'm sure if you could do something special for him, he might consider teaching a human how to really swing an axe.\nHe spends most of his time in the Haunt in the Mire of the Damned."
msgstr "아빈릴 스미서스는 우리가 태어나기도 전에 이미 도끼 마스터였네. 그러나 그는 사람은 가르치지 않는다네. 만일 그를 위해 뭔가 특별한 일을 해준다면 어쩌면 가르쳐 줄 지도 모르네. 그는 디멘드의 수렁 소굴에서 많은 시간을 보낸다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1964
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:273
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best spearman in Enroth, Burton Rutherford, lives in Darkmoor.\nI'm not sure why he picks such a remote place to call his home.\nMaybe he doesn't like being bothered with students?"
msgstr "엔로스 최고의 창을 다루는 남자, 벌튼 루더포드, 다크무어에 살고 있지. 왜 그렇게 먼 곳에 살고 있는지 나도 모르겠네, 이쩌면 방해받고 싶지 않아서 일까?    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1965
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:274
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As good as Lord Stromgard is with a bow, he won't accept students.\nTo master the bow, you need to talk to Desmond Weller in Kriegspire."
msgstr "스트롬가드 군주가는 활을 놓기 전까진 절대 제자를 안 받을 걸세. 활에 마스터가 되고 싶다면 크레이그스파이어에 있는 데스몬드 웰러를 찾아 가게나. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1966
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:275
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you want to master the mace, you need to speak to Errol Ostermann in Blackshire."
msgstr "만일 철퇴를 마스터하고 싶다면 블랙쉐어의 에롤 오스털만하고 얘기하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1967
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:276
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very few people even know that these weapons exist.\nThe only other person I've ever seen using an ancient weapon is Rexella, but she was last living in Paradise Valley– I'm not sure she's even there anymore."
msgstr "몇몇의 사람들만 이 무기가 대단하다는 걸 알지. 이 고대 무기를 쓴 자는 렉셀라뿐이네, 마지막으로 그녀가 있던 곳은 파라다이스 밸리 였네.- 지금도 있는 지는 모르겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1968
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:277
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No one can use a shield like Bronwyn Meck in Blackshire.\nThat's the person to talk to if you want to master the shield."
msgstr "아무도 방패를 블랙쉐어의 브로윈 멕처럼 사용할 수 없을 꺼네. 방패에 대해 마스터하고 싶다면 그하고 얘기하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1969
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:278
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Arlen Sailor runs the best school in the art of wearing leather armor.\nHe normally holds his classes near Castle Stone."
msgstr "알렌 세일러는 가죽갑옷을 입는 최고의 학교를 운영하지. 그는 보통 스톤부근에서 교실을 열지. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1970
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:279
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Darkmoor is the home of David Feather, the only person I know of that can teach you to master your skill in chain armor."
msgstr "다크무어는 대이비드 피더의 집이지, 체인 갑옷의 대가이고 그만이 당신에게 가르쳐 줄 수 있을꺼야.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1971
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:280
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Forrest Suthers, one of the head Paladins in Enroth, teaches how to master plate near Castle Temper."
msgstr "포레스트 수더스, 엔로스의 최고 팔라딘 중 하나, 그는 템퍼 근처에서 어떻게 마스터 플래이트를 하는지 가르치네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1972
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:281
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To master the fire skill you need to speak to Jezebel in Mist."
msgstr "불 다루는 능력의 마스터가 되고자 한다면 미스트의 제제벨과 얘기 해 보게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1973
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:282
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Caao Salem can show you even more tricks with air magic in Mist."
msgstr "미스트에 있는 카오 살렘이 에어 매직에 대해 많은 걸 알려 줄 걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1974
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:283
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To gain mastery of the water skill you need to train under Harper Collins in Mist."
msgstr "물 다루는 기술에 대해 도움을 얻으려면 미스트에 있는하퍼 콜린스밑에서 배우게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1975
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:284
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Revee Botania can train you to master the earth skill in Silver Cove."
msgstr "실버 코브에 있는 레비 보타니아는 당신을 대지 마법 기술의 마스터로 만들어 줄 수 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1976
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:285
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Spirit can be mastered with the help of Bishop Inquisitorio.\nHe lives right behind Castle Ironfist, you can't miss him."
msgstr "스피릿은 비숍 인퀴시티토리오만 있으면 마스터 할 수 있네. 그는 아이론 피스트 뒤에 산다네. 그를 놓치면 안되네 "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1977
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:286
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thane Roper can train you to master the mind skill in Silver Cove."
msgstr "실버 코브에 있는 테인 로퍼는 당신에게 마인드 능력을 마스터 시켜 줄 수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1978
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:287
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're looking to master body magic, you need to talk to Gilbert Hammer in Silver Cove."
msgstr " 만일 바디 마법을 마스터하길 원한다면, 실버 코브에 있는 길보트 해머를 만나보게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1979
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:288
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Light magic is a difficult skill to learn, and the Great Teacher, Ki Lo Nee, can only be found somewhere around Castle Alamos."
msgstr "빛의 마법은 배우기 어렵고, 유명한 선생 키로니는 알라모스 성에서만 볼 수가 있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1980
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:289
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Su Lang Manchu was my teacher in dark magic.\nHe maintains a small house in a village in Paradise Valley."
msgstr "수랑만추는 나의 암흑 마법의 선생이셨네. 파라다이스 벨리에 조그만 집을 짓고 사신다네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1981
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:290
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hans Gifford can show you even more neat tricks in identifying items in Free Haven."
msgstr "한스 지포드는 프리 헤븐에 있는 물건을 알아보는 휼륭한 기술을 알려 줄 수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1982
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:291
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The smoothest talking merchant I've ever seen is Will Ottoman in Silver Cove.\nIf you're looking to improve your merchant skill, he's the man to see."
msgstr "최고의 상인은  윌 오토만. 실버코브에 있지. 만일 거래 기술을 올리고 싶다면, 그를 찾아보게.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1983
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:292
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you think I'm good at repairing things, Ryan Treacle is the best around.\nI'm sure he can be convinced to assist you in mastering the skill.\nHe lives up near Castle Stone the last I heard."
msgstr "물건 고치는데 최고자를 찾는다면 라이언 트리클을 찾아보게. 그가 마스터 기술을 가르쳐 줄지 안 가르쳐 줄지는 모르네. 그는 스톤 성 근처에 산다고 들었네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1984
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:293
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jason Traveler will coach you in the finest points of body-building.\nHe works in Free Haven, if you can handle his rigorous training."
msgstr "제이슨 트라블러는  당신을 최고의 바디 빌더 변하게 해 줄걸세. 그는 프리 헤븐에 있지. 만일 당신이 그의 트레이닝을 견딜 수 있다면.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1985
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:294
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If mastering meditation is your goal, you'll need to see Norio Ariganaka in Mist."
msgstr "만일 치료학을 마스터하는게 당신의 목표라면 미스트의 노리오 아리간카를 만나게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1986
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:295
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Perception can be mastered with help from Macro Caligula in Darkmoor."
msgstr "지략은 다크무어의 마르코 칼리규라에 의해 마스터 할 수 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1987
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jacques Kohl is working with Lord Stromgard to develop experimental recipes.\nIf he has time, perhaps he can assist you as well in mastering the art of Alchemy."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1988
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:297
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The greatest trap disarmer, Gabe Lester, is currently teaching his craft near Castle Stone.\nHe's the person to talk to if you want to learn all the best tricks."
msgstr "함정술의 대가, 게이브 레스터, 그는 스톤성 주변에서 가리친다고 하네. 최고의 트릭을 배우자면 그를 찾아가게나. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1989
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:298
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "John Tuck can teach you to master the learning skill.\nI believe he's still living in Silver Cove."
msgstr "존 턱은 당신에게 마스터 능력을 가르칠 수 있네. 그는 여전히 실버 코브에 살고 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1990
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:299
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The King of the Dwarves, Snergle, usurped Rocklin for leadership of the dwarven clans.\nNow Rocklin is in exile somewhere and Snergle is in charge.\nMost dwarves don’t like Snergle and would like to see Rocklin back in power.\nUnfortunately, Snergle has claimed both Rocklin’s caverns and the largest dwarven Iron Mine.\nSnergle, fearing treachery near home, has removed me, the Dwarven Weaponmaster, from my position.\nWe need someone to get Snergle out of power by any means necessary.\nI’d even consider training you humans how to use an axe like a true dwarf if you’ll help us."
msgstr "드워프족의 왕 스너글, 락클린을 밀어내고 드워프의 리더가 되었지. 지금 락클린은 어디로 추방당하고 스너글이 리더를 하지. 대부분의 드워프들은 스너글을 안 좋아하고 락클린이 돌아오기만을 기다리지. 불행하게도, 스너글은 락클린의 동굴과 드워프의 큰 철광산까지 차지 했네. 스너글은 나를 위협해 나를 드워프 무기 마스터에서 강등시켰네. 우리는 스너글을 추방시켜야 하네. 난 당신이 도와준다면 당신을 진짜 드워프처럼 도끼를 사용하도록 훈련시키겠네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1991
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:300
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I need proof that Snergle has been defeated.\nI’m sorry, but I just can’t take your word for it.\nBring back some personal item of his, like his axe maybe."
msgstr "난 스너글을 처치했다는 증거가 필요하네. 미안하지만 그냥 믿을 순 없네. 그의 개인 아이템을 가져오게. 예를 들어 도끼 등.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1992
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:301
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, glorious day!\nWith Snergle’s passing, we can now search for Rocklin to put him back in power.\nEternal thanks to you for this, and dwarves everywhere owe you a debt of gratitude."
msgstr "오, 영광적인 날이야! 스너글이 사라졌으니 이제 락클린을 찾아 왕좌를 회복시켜야 겠네. 정말 고맙고 모든 드워프들은 당신에게 빚을 졌네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1993
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:302
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Mayor here in Mist is considering allowing the Fraternal Order of Silver to police the town in their battle against evil.\nI know the Silver Helm Persecution Squads have murdered innocents in their misguided crusade against ‘evil,’ but there are no living witnesses to their atrocities.\nI need you to storm their outpost to the south of here to find proof so that I can convince the mayor to ban them from Mist."
msgstr "미스트의 시장은 악마와의 전쟁 중에 은빛의 우애조합으로 마을을 순찰시키려고 하네. 나도 은 헬멧의 소대들이 가이드를 잘 못 해 죽었다는 것도 아네. 그러나 살아있는 증인은 없네. 난 당신이 남쪽에 있는 그들의 전초부대를 급습하고 증거를 가져오기를 바라네. 그래서 내가 시장에게 그들을 파문시킬 수 있도록. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1994
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:303
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Keep searching– the lives of the mayor and myself could very well be in your hands.\nWe can’t take action against them without proof."
msgstr "계속 찾아보게- 시장과 나의 생명은 당신에게 달려있네. 우린 증거없이는 아무 행동도 할 수 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1995
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:304
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just as I suspected!\nI’m surprised the Mayor was number three on their enemies list.\nI suppose he IS a tad incompetent, but he’s not a bad person.\nThanks again, please accept this gold and my gratitude as your reward."
msgstr "내가 의심한 대로네! 난 시장이 적들이 가지고 있는 리스트의 3번째라는 것에 대해 놀랐네. 그는 무능력한 감은 있지만 나쁜 사람은 아니네. 고맙네. 그리고 여기 보상금으로 골드를 받아주게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1996
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:305
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I think I might just allow the Fraternal Order of Silver to police the areas around Mist.\nMaybe they’d be able to hunt down all the evil people and leave this island a paradise."
msgstr "난 지금 그냥 은빛의 우애조합 보고 미스트를 순찰시킬까 하고 있었네. 어쩌면 그들이 악마들을 죽이고 이 도시를 평화스럽게 하지 않을까 하네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1997
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:306
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can’t believe those Silver Helms wanted to kill me!\nI’ve never done anything wrong in my life!\nWell, nothing more wrong than any other mayor at least.\nThank you again for stopping them."
msgstr "난 저 은빛 헬멧들이 나를 죽이려 했다는 걸 믿을수 없네! 난 살아오면 아무런 악한 짓도 하질 않았네. 아니, 다른 시장에 비하면 그렇다는 거지. 그들을 멈추게 해줘서 정말 고맙네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1998
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:307
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Could you do the Temple of Baa a favor?\nIt appears that my brethren left the old temple to the northwest of here in a little too much of a hurry, and a candelabra necessary for some of our rituals was left behind.\nNone of the Baa priests want to go back because they’re afraid of whatever curse has been placed on the temple.\nIf you were to bring back the candelabra to me, however, I could reward you in their place."
msgstr "바아 신전의 요청을 들어주겠나? 나의 동료들, 여기서 북서쪽에 있는 오래된 신전에 있는 자들이 급한 것 같네. 칸델라브라는 우리의 예배를 위해 필요하다네. 어떤 바아의 주교들도 그 곳에 가고 싶어하지 않네. 그들은 그 신전에 무슨 주문이 걸려있을 까봐 무서워서지. 만일 당신이 그 칸델라브라를 내게 가져다 준다면 난 보상을 해 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1999
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:308
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did the curse frighten you away as well?\nI can understand.\nBaa is patient, however.\nShould you work up the courage to find the candelabra, I’m still prepared to compensate you for it."
msgstr "주문이 너무 강했나? 이해하네. 바아는 인내심이 있네. 어쨌든 용기를 내 candelabra를 가지고 오게. 난 여전히 기다리고 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2000
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:309
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nBaa be praised!\nI see you were not frightened of the curse after all.\nHere is your reward and thank you again for your assistance."
msgstr "대단하네! 바아는 기도하네! 내가 보기에는 주문도 어쩌질 못했던 것 같군. 여기 보상금이 있고 도와줘서 정말 고맙네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2001
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:310
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who would have thought that the evil I sought to fight all across Enroth would be found so close to my own home?\nGerrard Blackames was once my second in command.\nNot long before he murdered me he began corresponding with the Temple of Baa, and they began to feed him targets for our Order.\nI ended up being one of the targets, and Gerrard took control of the Order.\nNow, the Silver Helms are as evil as the people they hunt.\nI’m certain the Temple of Baa is responsible for the corruption of our Order.\nAt the same time, Gerrard’s brother, Marcus the Sorcerer, has been supplying the Silver Helms with high quality equipment.\nThe last I heard, Marcus was assisting someone in a forge on an island to the southeast."
msgstr "누가 나랑 싸웠던 악마가 내 집 주변에 나타날 줄 알았겠나?  제라드 블랙메스는 옜날 나의 두번째 부하였네. 그가 날 죽이기 전에 그는 바아 신전과 연락을 했었네. 그들은 우리를 타겟으로 그를 조였지. 나는 타겟이 되서 죽었고  제라드가 명령권을 가졌네. 이젠 실버 헬멧은 악마들이 되었네. 내가 알기에는 바아 신전이 우리의 명령권을 지휘하는것 같네. 그때 제라드의 향제, 마도사 마르커스는 실버 헬멧에게 높은 품질의 물품을 제공했네. 마지막으로 내가 듣기에는 마르커스는 섬 남동쪽에서 어떤 은둔자를 돕는 다더군.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2002
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:311
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My niece, Melody, has been kidnapped from her home in Mist and locked in a Silver Helm outpost near there.\nShe’s one of the few people who know that I’ve been murdered.\nI’m sure Gerrard has her locked up for that reason, but I believe he wants to force her into marriage to eliminate any opposition to his leadership of the Fraternal Order of Silver."
msgstr "내 조카, 멜로디는 그녀의 집 미스트에서 납치됐고 그 곳 근처에 있는 은빛 헬멧 전초부대에 의해 납치되었네. 그녀는 내가 살해당했다는 걸 아는 몇 안되는 사람 중 하나네. 제라드는 분명 그런 이유로 그녀를 감금시켰을 꺼고 은빛의 우애조합을 잘 컨트롤 하기 위해 그녀랑 강제 결혼 하려는 것 같네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2003
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:312
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for saving my niece.\nBehind this wall is a secret area I’ve kept hidden from even Gerrard all these years.\nYou are welcome to take whatever you want; I’d prefer you have this than Gerrard."
msgstr "내 조카를 구해줘서 고맙네. 이 벽 뒤에는 숨겨진 장소가 나오네. 이 장소는 제라드도 모르네. 당신은 원하는 만큼 다 가져가게나; 당신을 위해 준비했으니. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2004
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:313
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gerrard has an ankh inscribed with his name given to him by the priests of Baa.\nI’m not sure exactly what the ankh is used for, but he may use it to identify himself as a friend of Baa."
msgstr "제라드는 바아의 주교로서 안크라는 이름을 받았네. 나도 그 안크가 뭐에 쓰이는지는 모르나 내 생각에는 바아 사람들끼리 서로를 증명하는 이름인것  같네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2005
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:314
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You want to defeat Snergle, do you?\nWell, he knows how he stands among most dwarves.\nHe’s holed up in Rocklin’s old caverns surrounded by a horde of his loyal dwarves.\nIf anything were to happen in there, he’d just immediately lock himself in his private room and let his followers handle it.\nYou’ll need a key to get into his room; there’s no way you’ll bash down a high quality dwarven door.\nI was a steward for Rocklin– I know that room well and I happen to still have a key to it hidden on me.\nFortunately for you, I’m in this cell because of Snergle, and there’s nothing I’d rather see than his reign put to a quick end.\nHere’s the key– think of it as payment for letting me out of this cell."
msgstr "스네글을 죽이고 싶나, 그런가? 그가 어떻게 드워프들을 다루는지 알고 있네. 그는 락클린을 그의 왕족 드워프들의 있는 오래된 동굴에 감금시켜놓았네. 만일 무슨 일이 생기면 그는 바로 그의 개인 방으로 들어갈 것이고 그의 추종자가 해결할 걸세. 당신은 그의 방으로 들어갈 키가 필요할 꺼네. 키외에는 들어갈 방법이 없네. 나는 락클린의 집사였고 아직도 나는 그 키를 가지고 있네. 다행히도, 나는 여기 감금되어 있지만 그의 죽음을 보는 것만이 목적이네. 여기 키가 있네. 나를 빼준 보상이라고 생각하게.    "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2006
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:315
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for releasing me.\nThe only thing keeping the Silver Helms from killing me was the fact I’m a priest.\nFrankly, I’m surprised they would show me any mercy at all.\nListen, I’ve heard some strange sounds coming from around here… I think there might be a hidden passage near here.\nIn any event, I should probably be leaving now; I don’t want to stay in this cell any longer."
msgstr "나를 구해줘서 고마워요. 은빛 헬멧이 나를 죽이지 않고 가두어둔 이유는 내가 주교라서 그래요. 나도 그들이 그런 자비를 베풀 줄은 몰랐어요. 그리고 난 이 근처에서 이상한 소리를 들었어요... 내 생각에는 숨겨진 장소가 있는것 같아요.  어떻게 됐든 난 가야해요. 여기 더 이상 있고 싶지 않으니까요."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2007
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:316
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Dragoons that have been plaguing the roads around here recently stole a harp of mine from one of my caravans.\nI’m not strong enough to get it back from them, but I’m willing to pay someone capable to do it for me.\nFind the harp and return it, and I’ll reward you."
msgstr "길을 매우고 있던 용기병들은  최근에 내 하프를 나의 무역상에게서 훔치고 있네. 난 그들에게서 되찾을 만큼 강하지가 않으니 대신 돈을 줄테니 날 위해 해주게. 찾아서 돌아오게. 그럼 보상금을 줄테니.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2008
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:317
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My harp is still lost, so the reward is still available for it.\nI know the Dragoons base their operations to the south of here near the coast.\nPlease bring back my harp."
msgstr "내 하프는 여전히 잃어 버렸고 보상금은 아직 존재하네. 난 용기병들이 여기 남쪽 해안에 자리잡고 있다는 걸 아네. 제발 가지고 와주게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2009
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:318
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My gratitude!\nMy wife loves this harp; I’m so glad you were able to recover it!\nHere, take this as a reward.\nI’ve heard rumors that the Dragoons were working with the Shadow Guild.\nIf that’s the case, I’m sure the Mayor of New Sorpigal would love to see proof of it.\nThank you again for your assistance."
msgstr "영광이여! 내 부인은 이 하프를 사랑한다네; 당신이 갖다 주어소 정말 고맙네. 소문에 의하면 용기병들은 그림자 길드를 위해 일한다는 군. 만일 그렇다면 뉴 소피갈의 시장은 그 증거를 보고 싶어할꺼야. 정말 도와줘서 고맙네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2010
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:319
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, this IS a musical instrument, but it’s not a harp.\nLet me explain the difference:\nYou brought back a flute.\nA flute is a pipe with holes in it.\nA harp has strings.\nDoes that help?\nI’m sure they still have the harp and I will reward you well for its return."
msgstr "자, 이게 음악 악기네. 그러나 하프는 아니지.  내가 틀린 점을 설명해 주지: 당신은 플룻을 가지고 온거야. 풀릇은 구멍이 있는 파이프고 하프는 줄이 있는 거네. 이제 이해가 가나? 그들이 분명히 아직 가지고 있을 꺼고 가지고 오면 보상금을 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2011
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:320
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have a few theories about the undead that I would very much like to prove.\nWhat I really need is the remains of an undead creature, preferably a powerful one.\nActually, what I really need is the remains of the FIRST lich, Ethric the Mad.\nI am a scholar, however, and don’t have the means to gain such a specimen.\nI do have some money saved up, and I’d be willing to pay you well for Ethric’s remains."
msgstr "난 언데드에 대한 몇 개의 학설을 가지고 있네. 내가 필요한 건 언데드의 장소이다. 그것도 강한. 진짜로는 첫번째 시체, 미친 에스릭이네. 난 학자고 , 어쨌든 에스릭을 데리고오면 돈을 주겠네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2012
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:321
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am well aware of the difficulty of the task, believe me.\nTake your time but at the least, do the job properly. "
msgstr "난 임무의 어려운 부분을 잘 아네. 나를 믿게. 시간을 좀 가지게, 그러나 일은 적당히 하게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2013
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:322
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work! Now I can conclude my research.\nIf I can learn how the Ritual of Endless Night works, perhaps I can find a way to reverse the process.\nHere is the reward I promised you. "
msgstr "좋네! 이제 난 나의 조사를 할 수 있게 됐어. 잘 했네! 만일 내가 어떻게 마지막 밤의 의식이 돌아가는 지 알면 어쩌면 난 반대로 가공시킬 수 있는 걸 알아낼지도 모르지. 여기 약속한 보상금이네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2014
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:323
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our town is periodically plagued by giant spiders.\nI’m pretty sure that if the spider queen were killed, the rest of the spiders would go away.\nCurrently, I’m offering a reward to the person that can kill the spider queen."
msgstr "우리 마을은 거대한 거미들로 꽉 찼네. 난 확신하는데 여왕거미를 죽이면 나머진 다 도망갈걸세. 그리고 여왕거미를 죽이는 자에게 보상금을 걸겠네 "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2015
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:324
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No one has returned with proof that they’ve killed the spider queen, so the reward is still available."
msgstr "아무도 증거를 가지고 돌아오지 않았네. 모두 여왕 거미에게 죽었네. 그래서 현상금은 아직 걸려있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2016
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:325
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What a gruesome trophy!\nThis heart proves you’ve defeated the wicked spider queen.\nHopefully now the spiders won’t plague New Sorpigal anymore.\nHere is the reward I promised."
msgstr "대단한 드로피야!  심장은 당신이 정말 여왕거미를 죽였다는걸 말해주네. 이제는 거미들이 뉴 소피갈에는 나타나지 않겠군. 여기 약속한 보상금이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2017
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:326
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Cedric Druthers and his Celestial Order have taken over the Monolith, an ancient place sacred to druids.\nTheir dark rituals are corrupting the Monolith and they need to be stopped– whatever altar they use as the center of their ceremonies needs to be defaced.\nDo this for us and we will compensate you for your time and services."
msgstr "세드릭 드루더스와 그의 거룩한 명령은 모노리스가 가져 갔네. 드루이들의 고대의 신성한 장소지. 그들의 어둠의 예배는 모노리스를 어지럽히고 이젠 멈춰야 하네. 그들이 예배 볼 때 쓰는 어떤 제단이든 파괴하고 그것때문에 들어간 시간 등은 우리가 보상하겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2018
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:327
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I’m glad to see you again, but the Celestial Order is still in the Monolith."
msgstr "다시 만나서 반갑네. 그러나 하늘의 명령는 아직 모노리스에 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2019
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:328
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for your help!\nPlease allow me to compensate you for your efforts.\nWe can rest more safely knowing that Cedric and his renegade druids are no longer polluting that sacred area. "
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙네! 내가 보상을 할 수 있게 해주게. 신성한 장소에 세드릭과 그의 악한 드루이드들이 없다는 걸 안 이상 우리는 편히 쉴 수 있게 됐네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2020
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:329
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am a collector of rare and exotic creatures, and I make a living by selling some of these creatures as pets.\nCurrently, cobras are in great demand, and I don’t have many cobras left to sell.\nTherefore, I’m willing to pay handsomely for any cobra eggs you might have.\nRemember, if you find any cobra eggs, I’ll give you the best prices."
msgstr "나는 신비하고 진귀한 생물들을 모은다네. 난 이건 생물들을 애완용으로 팔아 생계를 유지한다네. 보통 코브라는 대단히 좋지만 더 이상 많은 코브라가 없네. 그러니 당신이 코브라 알을 가지고 있으면 내가 사겠네. 잊지말게. 만일 알을 찾으면 내가 최고의 값을 쳐 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2021
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:330
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent specimen!\nI should be able to hatch this in no time and help my flagging business.\nHere is my payment for this wonderful egg.\nI’ll buy any more cobra eggs you have as long as they are in demand."
msgstr "대단히 잘 했네! 나의 사업에 정말 큰 도움이 되겠네. 여기 이 아름다은 알에 대한 값이네.  계속 가져오기만 한다면 난 다 사겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2022
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2023
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2024
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:331
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:332
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:333
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Removed Bat Guano Message"
msgstr "박쥐 구아노 메세지를 이동시키다."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2025
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:334
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Near here is a temple dedicated to the Order of the Fist.\nI once belonged to that order, but recently they uncovered a powerful evil crystal.\nThey hope to use the crystal as a bargaining chip to be accepted into the Temple of Baa.\nI don’t want to see the crystal fall into Baa’s hands– it must be destroyed.\nPlease infiltrate the temple and destroy the crystal."
msgstr "이 근처에 피스트에 헌납된 신전이 하나 있네. 나도 그 신전의 일원이었지만 그 신전은 최근에 악마 크리스탈을 폭로했네. 그들은 이 신전을 헌납해 바아 신전과 같이 지낼려고 하지. 난 그 크리스탈이 바아에게 넘어가는 걸 원치 않네. 그 신전에 침입해 그 크리스탈을 파괴시키게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2026
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:335
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must hurry and destroy the crystal before Baa claims it.\nI’m not sure how long it will take, so time is of the essence."
msgstr "당신은 서둘러 크리스탈을 파괴시켜야 하네. 바아가 가져가기 전에. 나도 얼마나 걸릴지 모르네. 시간이 없네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2027
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:336
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work!\nI’m glad you made it in time.\nI don’t like to think about what Baa would have done with that crystal.\nYou have done all of Enroth a great service."
msgstr "잘 했네! 당신이 시간을 맞추어서 다행이네. 바가 그 크리스탈을 가져 갔으면 어떻게 되었는지는 상상도 하기 싫군. 당신은 엔로스를 위해 정말 잘 해주었네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2028
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:337
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My husband, Emmanuel, went to Star Island a few weeks ago with a few friends hoping to find some treasure.\nI haven’t seen him since, and I’m worried about him.\nI don’t dare go to the island; it’s rumored to be the home of medusas!\nIf you could find him and bring him home, I would be very grateful."
msgstr "내 남편, 엠마누엘, 보물을 찾으려 친구들하고 스타 섬으로 떠났지요. 난 그때부터 그를 보지 못했고 이젠 걱정이 됩니다. 난 섬에 갈 수 없어요; 소문엔 메두사의 집이라더군! 그를 내게 데려다준다면 정말 고맙겠습니다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2029
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:338
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No luck?\nHe must be in grave danger if you did not find him.\nIf you do happen to find him, please bring him back here.\nI’ll be waiting for him."
msgstr "운이 없다고? 만일 그를 찾지 못하면 그는 큰 위험에 빠질걸세. 그를 찾는다면 제발 그를 내게 데리고 오게. 기다릴테니. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2030
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:339
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, thank you for bringing Emmanuel back to me!\nNothing in this world means as much to me as him!\nPlease take this as a reward.\nI know it’s not much, but you deserve it for bringing him back to me."
msgstr "오, 엠마누엘을 내게 데리고 와 정말 고맙습니다. 이 세상에서 그가 가장 중요해요! 많진 않지만 이 보상금을 꼭 받아주세요."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2031
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2032
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:340
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:341
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for turning me back to normal. I’d love to stay and chat, but I really should be getting out of here."
msgstr "나를 정상으로 돌려주어서 고맙네. 난 같이 얘기하고 싶은데 먼저 여길 빠져나가야 하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2033
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:342
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Could you help me get out of here?\nI need to get back to my wife in Blackshire."
msgstr "제발 내가 여기서 나가도록 도와주겠나? 나는 블랙쉐어에 있는 내 부인에게 돌아가야하네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2034
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:343
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An explorer friend of mine recently uncovered a powerful artifact, Mordred, in his travels.\nHe wanted to sell it to me, and shipped it here for me to decide if I wanted it.\nUnfortunately, raiders attacked the caravan it was on and stole the artifact.\nThey were last seen headed to an area west of Castle Temper; I’m sure they must have some sort of base there.\nIf you bring back Mordred for me, I’ll give you a cut of what I’m paying my friend for it."
msgstr "나의 여행친구, 모드레드는 그의 여행중에 최근 고대의 강한 무기를 밝혀냈네. 그는 내게 팔려고 했지만 습격받은 무역상들이 가지고 있다가 도둑맞았네. 마지막으로 본게 템퍼성의 서쪽이네; 그곳에 분명히 어떤 집단이 있을꺼네. 내게 모드레드를 가져다 준다면 충분히 보상을 하겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2035
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:344
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again.\nNo one has found Mordred yet, so our deal is still good.\nI’ll give you part of the selling price for the artifact if you return it."
msgstr "또 만났군, 아직 아무도 모드레드를 찾지 못했네. 아직 보상금이 살아있지.  보상금을 줄테니 찾아 가지고 와주게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2036
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:345
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So this is the legendary Mordred, eh?\nInteresting, I was expecting something much grander.\nI don’t think I want it, actually.\nWhy don’t you keep it, and I’ll deal with my friend on the cost."
msgstr "이게 바로 전설의 모드레드인가, 어? 흥미롭군, 난 좀 더 �C있을줄 알았는데. 난 별로 가질 맘이 없네. 당신이 가지게. 오, 보상금은 물론 여기있네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2037
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:346
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Members of the Shadow Guild have moved down south recently, and have been trying to exert their influence over merchants in the area.\nI refused them access to our town, so they kidnapped Sharry Carnegie, an old healer loved by the townspeople, in an attempt to ‘convince’ me to let them operate here.\nI can’t believe that their extortion has moved so far south, I thought I was safe from that down here.\nPlease rescue Sharry– I can offer you some money as a reward, and I’m sure the townsfolk would appreciate her return."
msgstr "그림자 길드의 멤버들이 남쪽으로 최근 다 옮겨 갔네. 그리고 그 곳 상권을 장악하려고 하지. 나는 그들이 우리 마을에 들어오지 못하게 했네. 그랬더니 그들은  쉐리 카네기를 납치했네, 사람들이 사랑하던 오래된 치료자를. 그리고 우리에게 협상을 하자더군.  그 먼 남쪽에서 여기까지 와 그럴 줄은 몰랐네. 제발 쉐리를 구해주고  보상금으로 돈을 주겠네. 마을사람들이 그 녀를 구해내면 대단히 고마워 할걸세.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2038
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:347
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you found Sharry yet?\nNo?\nI’m sure she’s wherever the Shadow Guild is hiding out.\nFind them and you’ll find her."
msgstr "쉐리를 아직 못 찾았나? 내가 알기론 그녀는 그림자 길드의 은신처에 있을꺼네. 그들을 찾게. 그럼 그녀도 찾을 수 있네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2039
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:348
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you so much for saving Sharry!\nI can’t tell you how much this means to both New Sorpigal and myself.\nYou have our gratitude forever."
msgstr "쉐리를 구해주어 정말 고맙네! 이게 우리 뉴 소피갈과 내게 얼마나 큰 일인지 설명할 수가 없네! 당신은 영원히 우리 마을 사람의 은인이네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2040
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:349
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Interesting.\nThe Dragoons were hired by the Shadow Guild.\nI’m certain Anthony Stone will want to hear about this.\nI’ll present this letter when I see him next. Thank you for this.\nI’m sure he will want to take action against the Shadow Guild now that we have some proof of their deeds."
msgstr "흥미롭군. 용기병들이 그림자 길드에 고용됐다니. 내가 생각하기엔 앤서니 스톤도 이 얘기를 듣고 싶어할 것 같군. 내가 다음 번에 그를 보면 이 편지를 전하지. 고맙네. 그는 분명히 그림자 길드에 대해 뭔가 조취를 취할꺼야. 이젠 증거도 있으니."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2041
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:350
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for rescuing me from these horrible ruffians!\nI’d like to go back home to New Sorpigal now."
msgstr "나를 저 나쁜 악당들에게서 구해주어서 고맙네. 난 이제 뉴 소피갈에 있는 집에 가고 싶네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2042
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:351
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh dear, can you help me?\nMy daughter Angela is missing!\nI think she may have wandered into the abandoned temple near town, and if she did she could be in terrible danger– who knows what kind of horrible things are lurking in that cursed place!\nPlease find her and bring her back to me."
msgstr "오 제발, 나를 도와줄 수 있나?  내 딸 안젤라가 사라졌네! 내 생각에 그녀는 버림받은 신전을 방황했던것  같네. 만일 그렇다면 그녀는 엄청난 위험에 빠져있을꺼야- 거기 무엇이 있는지 누가 알겠나! 제발 그녀를 찾아 내게 데려다 주게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2043
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:352
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You didn’t find poor Angela?\nSomething horrible must have happened to her!"
msgstr "바보 안젤라를 못 찾았다구? 무언가 대단히 안 좋은 일이 생긴 것 같군!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2044
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:353
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "She’s alive!\nThank you so much for finding Angela!\nIf I weren’t so happy to see her, she’d be in a lot of trouble.\nPlease take this as a reward for all you’ve done."
msgstr "그녀가 살아있네! 안젤라를 찾아 정말 고맙네! 그녀를 찾지 못했으면 그녀는 매우 위험했을꺼네. 여기 보상금을 받아주게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2045
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:354
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I think I'm lost…<sob>…I want to go home!"
msgstr "난 길을 읽어버린 것 같아 …<흐느끼며>… 난 집에 가고 싶어!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2046
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:355
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A good friend of mine, Sherell, went with a group of friends to the islands in Bootleg Bay to explore an old temple rumored to be there.\nHer friends returned and said she was captured by cannibals on the island and taken to some ancient temple.\nI’m sure she doesn’t have much time before they do something dreadful to her, please rescue her!"
msgstr "내 친한 친구 중의 하나 쉐렐은 그의 친구들과 소문 속에 있는 오래된 신전을 찾으러 부트레그 배이에 있는 섬으로 여행을 떠났네. 그녀 친구들은 돌아와서 하는 얘기가 그녀는 고대 신전의 카니발에게 붙잡혔다더군. 어서 빨리 그녀를 구해주게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2047
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:356
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh dear!\nYou haven’t found her yet?\nSurely she must have been sacrificed or eaten or something.\nPlease try to find her, or at least avenge her death."
msgstr "오 제발!  그녀를 못 찾았나? 그녀는 지금 엄청난 위험에 처해있을꺼네! 꼭 그녀를 찾아주게. 아니면 그녀의 복수라도.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2048
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:357
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wonderful!\nShe’s not dead after all!\nThank you for all your trouble.\nI hope you will accept this token of my gratitude."
msgstr "대단해! 그녀는 죽지 않았군! 당신의 도움에 정말 감사하네. 당신이 나의 진심어린 이 토큰을 받았으면 좋겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2049
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:358
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello!\nPlease, oh please, get me out of this temple.\nI don’t want to die!"
msgstr "이봐! 제발, 제발, 나를 이 신전에서 빼주게. 난 죽고싶지 않아! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2050
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:359
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our town is under a terrible curse, though most people don’t believe it.\nUnder a full moon, we all change into werewolves.\nAlthough none of us are truly evil, we don’t really know what sort of horrible things we do as werewolves.\nWe can’t approach our lord, Acton Spindler about the problem because he doesn’t realize that we are the werewolves.\nPlease find a way to turn us back to normal!"
msgstr "우리 마을은 지금 대단한 주문에 걸려있네. 아무도 믿진 않지만. 보름달 아래서는 우리는 늑대인간로 변한다네. 우리 중에 진짜 악마는 없고 우리도 변했을 때 뭘 하는지를 모른다네. 우리는 우리 군주에게도 말을 못하네. 액톤 스핀들러 군주도 믿질 않는다네. 우리를 정상으로 만들 방법을 찾아주게!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2051
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:360
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Is there no hope for us?\nPlease promise me you’ll keep searching for a way to reverse the curse and turn us back to normal people."
msgstr "우리에게 희망이 없나? 제발 우리를 보통으로 만들 방법을 찾는다고 약속해 주게. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2052
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:361
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you!\nWe can now sleep at night without worrying about what kinds of foul acts we will commit as monsters!\nIt’s a tragedy that our lord was a werewolf himself; he’ll be sorely missed.\nPlease accept this for your help, and for believing in us."
msgstr "고맙네! 이제 우리는 밤에도 우리가 어떻게 될런지 걱정 안하고 편히 잘 수 있게 됐네. 우리 군주가 늑대인간이였다는 건 끔찍한 일이였네; 그도 대단히 아플꺼야. 이 보상금을 받아주게. 그리고 믿어주어 고맙네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2053
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:362
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Blackshire has been plagued by werewolves lately.\nThese caves must be where the werewolves are coming from!\nHowever, I will need help destroying them.\nYou’re welcome to any of the treasure we find.\nI’m only concerned with destroying them once and for all!"
msgstr "블랙쉐어는 뒤늦게 늑대인간으로 꽉 찼네. 이 동굴에서 늑대인간이 나오는 것 같네! 어쨌든 난 저들을 죽이기 위해 도움이 필요하네. 우리가 찾은 어떤 보물도 가져도 좋네. 난 단지 저들을 죽이는 것 밖에 관심이 없으니까.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2054
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:363
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You see, I am a werewolf and soon you will be one too!"
msgstr "보다시피 난 늑대이고 곧 너도 이렇게 될꺼다.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2055
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:364
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I was a guest at Lord Spindler's manor when it was attacked by a band of werewolves that had tunneled in from the mountains.\nI fought my way back down the tunnels they had created hoping to escape.\nEventually, they cornered me and I was killed at this very spot. "
msgstr "난 스핀들러 군주의 장원의 손님이었네. 그가 산에서 내려온 늑대인간무리에게 공격당할때.  나도 터너에서 싸웠지만 그들은 나를 집중공격했고 나는 죽임을 당했네  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2056
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:365
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In my flight, I managed to hide the Pearl of Purity in these caverns.\nThe pearl will both protect you from the curse of the werewolves, and will also destroy the Altar of the Wolf if the pearl touches it.\nThat should free everyone afflicted by the curse these werewolves have caused.\nThe pearl is at the end of the cavern across from this one.\nPlease do me one favor, return the Pearl to Wilbur Humphrey.\nHe is the lord in charge of paladins and the pearl belongs with him."
msgstr "난 전쟁중에 나의 순수의 진주를 이 동굴에 감추기로 했었지. 그 진주는 저주와 늑대인간들로부터 지켜준다네. 늑대인간들은 만지기만 하면 다 저주가 풀려 원상복귀되지. 진주는 이 건너편 동굴 끝에 있다네. 부탁인데 그 진주를 윌버 험프리에게 가져다 주게. 그는 팔라딘의 우두머리고 그 진주는 그의 것이라네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2057
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2058
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:366
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:367
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The werewolf leader possesses the Pearl of Putrescence, the opposite of my Pearl of Purity.\nWith this pearl, he has been able to cause the curse.\nI was never able to kill him in my retreat.\nI will be able to rest in peace knowing that he has been defeated."
msgstr "늑대인간의 리더는 부패의 진주를 소유하고 있네, 나의 순수의 진주하고 반대인 것이지. 그 진주때문에 그는 저주를 걸 수 있네. 내가 은퇴할때는 그를 죽일 수 없었지만 그를 죽인다면 편하게 쉴 수 있겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2059
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:368
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for defeating the werewolf leader.\nI wish that I had been strong enough to stop this from happening.\nPlease accept my thanks for allowing my spirit to move on.\nI will take the pearl away so that it may no longer cause any harm to the people of Enroth."
msgstr "늑대인간의 리더를 죽여줘서 고맙네. 난 내가 힘이 쌨었으면 좋겠네, 이런 걸 막기위해서. 내 혼이 떠나기 전에 내 감사를 받아주게. 내가 이 진주를 가져가겠네. 더 이상 이런 일이 없도록…"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2060
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:369
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What’s this?\nYou have the Pearl of Purity?\nI thought Balthasar– oh, he’s dead is he?\nI’ll keep it for now, then, as per his last wishes.\nThank you on behalf of both him and me."
msgstr "이게 뭐지?  순수의 진주?  난 발사르가? 오, 그가 죽었군? 내가 보관하지, 그의 소원대로. 고맙네, 그와 내가 말하는 걸세. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2064
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:373
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not used."
msgstr "Not used."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2065
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:374
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You no goblin!\nYou leave!\nWe take castle to watch over humans!\nYou no more kill us!"
msgstr "너, 고블린이 아니군! 꺼져! 이 성은 인간들을 보기 위한거야!  어서 꺼져! "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2066
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:375
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work removing the goblins from this keep.\nWe have the situation mostly under control now, though your help is always appreciated."
msgstr "고블린을 이 성에서 �m아낸 건 잘 했네.이제 상황은 우리가 컨트롤 할 수 있다네. 당신의 도움이 컸네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2067
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:376
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again, my pupils!\nI'm afraid there is nothing more I can teach you– your experiences must guide you from this point on.\nI know nothing more than you do about the devils that destroyed Sweet Water, but I know who you need to ask.\nThe Oracle in Free Haven will know what to do to rid Enroth of the terrible devils.\nUnfortunately, you will need the approval of the six High Council members, each of which represents one of the lords of Enroth.\nYou must do whatever necessary to speak to the Oracle in Free Haven and rid Enroth of the devils."
msgstr "또 만났군, 나의 작은 인형! 이젠 더 이상 가르칠게 없네. 당신은 이제 나 만큼의 능력이 됐네. 나도 스윗 워터에 파괴시킨 적에 의해서는 당신보다 아는 건 없지만 누구에게 물어봐야 하는 지는 아네. 프리해븐의 오라클이 알려 줄 걸세. 그러나 불행하게도 오라클을 만날려면 의회의 6명에게 허락을 맏어야하네. 그들은 다 엔로스의 군주들이고 당신은 오라클을 만나기 위해 그들이 요구하는 걸 들어주어야 하네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2068
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:377
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As you may know, the last members of the Necromancers' Guild in Enroth fled to Castle Darkmoor after their defeat in the Succession War.\nWho knows what foul magics they're concocting while we wait around.\nI'm certain that the book containing the Ritual of Endless Night, known as the Book of Liches, has been moved into that castle.\nIf the book were to be destroyed, it would deal a severe blow to whatever evil plans they have.\nI've tried a few times to get to the book, but the castle is too well defended.\nIf you are able to destroy the book, come back to me and I'll reward you personally."
msgstr "당신도 알지 모르지만 네크로맨서 길드의 마지막 멤버는 왕위계승 전쟁에서 당한 다음 다크무어로 도망갔네. 그는 우리가 원하는 마법을 알고 있지. 내가 알기로는 마지막 밤의 의식에 관한 책의 전기판이 그 성으로 간 것도 알고 있을꺼네. 만일 그 책을 파괴한다면 악마들의 계획에도 차질을 줄 걸세. 나도 몇번 책을 가지려 했지만 그 성은 너무 단단해 뚫을 수가 없었네. 만일 그 책을 파괴한다면 내게 돌아오게. 내가 개인적으로 보상해줄테니.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2069
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:378
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's no rush in destroying the book.\nIf you manage it, come back and talk to me.\nI'm not sure it's even possible to get to the book and destroy it– there are far too many evil creatures in that castle."
msgstr "그렇게 서두를 건 없네. 잘 모르겠다면 내게 물어보게. 나도 책을 찾아 파괴할 수 있는지는 잘 모르겠네. 그 성 안에는 엄청많은 악마들이 우글대네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2070
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:379
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Incredible!\nI didn't expect you'd be able to do it.\nNow that the Book of Liches is gone, the Necromancers' Guild here in Enroth will slowly fade away.\nThis is all thanks to you!\nHere, take this as a reward and accept my gratitude as well."
msgstr "믿을 수 없군! 난 당신이 못 할 줄 알았는데. 이제 전기판은 사라졌고 네크로맨서 길드도 조용히 사라질걸세. 정말 고맙네. 여기 보상금을 받게. 정말 고맙네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2071
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:380
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I was once the court magician, long ago.\nThat all ended when Archibald… disrupted… things.\nArchibald had acquired some skill as a sorcerer and had knowledge of spells beyond that taught to magicians today, and therefore didn’t require my services.\nSince then, I’ve lived in this little shack, conducted my own research, and have grown old."
msgstr "난 아주 오랜 옛날에 법원 마법사였지. 아치발드가 없앴지만. 아치발드는 마도사의 기질과 요즘 가르치는 모든 마법을 알고 있지. 그래서 내 마법은 통하지 않았지. 그때부터 난 이 조그만 통나무 집에 살았네. 난 연구를 하며 나이를 먹었다네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2072
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:381
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I’ve discovered a way to reverse the effects of time and make myself young again.\nThis requires a complex magical ritual, which I’ve worked out.\nThe problem is that I need to place magical statuettes on various pedestals. The tiger statuette goes on the pedestal near Sweet Water, the bear statuette in Kriegspire, the eagle statuette in Dragonsand, the wolf statuette in the Mire of the Damned, and the dragon statuette in Bootleg Bay.\nThe distances are too far for me to travel in my old age, and in the meantime I need to prepare the ritual itself.\nThere is no way I can do all of this on my own; I need your help.\nThe statuettes are in the chest outside my house.\nPlace them on the pedestals and return to me.\nEven if the ritual is a failure, I'll pay you for your efforts."
msgstr "난 나를 젊게하고 시간을 되돌리는 방법을 발견했다네. 이 방법은 마법적 의식을 필요로 하지. 문제는 내가 마법적인 상을 여러 받침대에 놔야 한다는 거지. 호랑이 상은 스윗워터근처에, 곰 상은 크리그스파이어에 , 독수리 상은  드라곤 샌드에, 늑대 상은 마이어의 댐에, 그리고 용 상은  부트레그베이. 나이 먹은 내가 여행하기는 너무 먼 거리고 또 난 나름대로 의식을 준비해야 하니 나 혼자할 방법은 없네. 도움이 필요하네. 그 상들은 집 밖의 상자 안에 있네. 그 상들을 배치하고 내게 돌아오게. 만일 실패하더라도 내가 보상을 하지.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2073
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:382
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I was one of the mages studying at Kriegspire when the creatures there went completely out of control.\nIn my escape from the castle, I left a valuable item behind, a jeweled egg.\nThis egg is a family heirloom that goes back in my family as far as the Silence.\nI have tried a few times to get it back, but the creatures there are too powerful for me.\nI’d gladly trade a generous sum of money to get my egg back."
msgstr "난  크리그스파이어에서 생물들이 미쳤을 때 공부하던 마법사이지.  내가 성에서 탈출했을 때는 좋은 아이템들을 많이 놔두고 나왔지. 보석 알 같은것. 이 알은 헤이룸 것이었다 우리 가족 것이 였었는데 말이다. 몇번 가지러 갈려고 했으나 그 성의 생물들이 너무 강했었네. 만일 그걸 내게 갖다준다면 내가 보상을 하겠네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2074
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:383
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Kriegspire is the castle inside the volcano.\nWe mages were forced to raise the earth around the castle to try and prevent the creatures from overrunning the surrounding towns.\nNow they’re contained inside, and that’s where the egg is."
msgstr "크리그스파이어는 화산 안에 있는 성이네. 우리 마법사들은 성안에 어떤 방해물도 들어오지 못하게 해놨네. 이제 그들은 참고 있네. 그 곳에 바로 알이 있고.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2075
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:384
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for returning this egg to me; it’s the most precious thing I have."
msgstr "나에게 이 알을 돌려줘서 고맙네. 나에게는 가장 중요한 것이거든.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2076
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:385
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the Lord of Fire, an immortal earth spirit.\nMy power is drawn from below the earth.\nThe channels that I use have been blocked by doors warded with powerful magic in the north.\nI need you to unward the doors so that I may awaken again.\nThough the enchantments on them are powerful, amber will break the ward on the doors."
msgstr "난 불의 군주네, 불사의 대지, 스피릿. 내 힘은 지구 밑에서 나왔지. 내가 사용하던 채널이 북쪽의 깅한 마법걸린 문으로 막혀졌네. 난 당신이 이 문을 부셨으면 하네. 다시 내가 일어날수 있도록. 그들의 마법은 강하지만 호박이 부셔줄 걸세.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2077
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:386
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you get lost in the caverns, you may find assistance from my servants.\nIf you have a piece of amber, they will assume you are under my care and will teleport you back to me if you talk to them.\nIf you do not have any amber, they will drain with some of your life force as payment for teleporting you back up here.\nDon’t worry, they rarely kill anyone."
msgstr "만일 동굴에서 길을 읽어버린다면 나의 부하들에게서 도움을 얻게. 만일 호박조각을 보여준다면 그들은 당신을 나에게 순간 이동 시켜줄 걸세. 만일 호박이 없다면 당신 생명의 힘을 좀 뺐어갈 걸세. 걱정말게. 그들은 아무도 죽이지 않을 테니.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2078
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:387
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The doors became warded when a strange creature came to reside here.\nI am not familiar with this type of being, and I’ve seen many types in my long time here in Enroth.\nI do not know why it chose this place as its home, or why there is only one, but I would like to see it destroyed for the trouble it has caused me. "
msgstr "이상한 생물이 다가오면 문은 격퇴된다네. 난 이런 일에 익숙하지는 않지만 많이 봐 왔네. 내가 왜 이곳을 집으로 택했는지 모르겠지만 난 그게 내게 문제 생기게 하기 전에 부셔버리고 싶네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2079
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:388
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As patient as I am, I would like to see the channels I use to sustain me opened again.\nPlease do not fail."
msgstr "환자로서 난 나를 격려해 준 채널을 다시 보고 싶네. 제발 실패하지 말게.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2080
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:389
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for your assistance.\nI am grateful to you for returning my source of sustenance to me.\nI need to recharge what little power I have left now that I am able to again."
msgstr "나를 도와줘서 고맙네. 나의 생계수단을 돌려주어서 고맙네. 나는 힘을 회복해야겠고 지금은 없지만 다시 일어서겠네.   "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2081
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:390
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you again for assisting me, but right now I'm quite busy preparing everything I need to complete the ritual."
msgstr "나를 도와주어서 고맙네. 그러나 지금은 의식을 끝내기 위한 준비 때문에 조금 바쁘네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2082
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:391
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, Sir John was murdered and the Silver Helms were bought off by the Temple of Baa?\nThat explains a great deal.\nGood work on bringing this to me, but you’ll need to collect your reward from Anthony Stone."
msgstr "그러니까, 존 경은 살해됐고 은빛 헬멧은 바아 신전이 조종했다고? 그러면 얘기가 되는 군. 나에게 알려줘서 고맙네. 그러나 보상금은 앤서니 스톤에게 받게."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2083
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:392
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I should have known Baa was behind this, they seem to be behind everything.\nThank you for bringing this to me.\nIt answers the questions I had about the Fraternal Order of Silver."
msgstr "난 바아가 이 뒤에 있었다는 것을 알았어야 하네, 그들은 모든 일을 다 조종하는 것 같군. 나에게 알려주어서 고맙네. 그것은 내가 가지고 있던 은빛의 우애조합에 대한 답이 되는군."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2084
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:393
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So Baa was behind the corruption of the Silver Helms and the murder of Sir John Silver?\nWhat a tragedy for Sir John, rest his soul.\n<blink> Loretta told you to collect the reward from me?\nGreedy witch.\nHere, your services should not go unrewarded."
msgstr "그래서 바아가 은빛 헬멧을 조종하고 존 실버 경을 죽였다고? 존 경의 재난이군. 영혼이 편히 쉬길. <깜박이며> 로레타가 나에게 보상금을 받으라 했다고? 멋진 마녀로군. 여기있네. 보상금.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2085
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:394
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work!\nHave you ever thought about assisting me full-time?\nI could certainly use reliable help.\nI've managed to collect a variety of trinkets over the years, so please help yourself to a few of these in payment for your services.\nI need to clean up a few things here, but I think I'll head back to Castle Ironfist in a bit and see if there's an opening for a court magician."
msgstr "잘 했네. 정말 고맙네- 나를 계속 도와주는 건 어떻겠나? 나는 몇년동안 여러가지 장신구들을 모아왔네. 그러니 상자를 열어 보상금으로 원하는 만큼 가지게나. 난 몇가지 여기서 정리할게 있으나, 아마 아이론피스트로 갈걸세. 그리고 마법의 법원에 대해 생각할꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2086
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:395
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks!\nI can't wait to take this to Abdul's Desert Resort and see what I get!\nOh, here's the money I owe you."
msgstr "고맙네! 난 이 앞의 사막 리조트가 가져갈 때까지 기다릴 수 없네. 그리고 내가 뭘 받는지 보게! 오, 여기 내가 꾼돈 여기있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2087
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:396
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My favorite wine is the stuff they give you for winning at the circus.\nI'll pay 300 gold for any keg of wine from the circus that you can bring me."
msgstr "내가 좋아하는 와인은 서커스에 이겼을 때 받는 와인이라네. 난 그 와인을 가져오면 300 골드를 내겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2088
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:397
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My favorite!\nThanks for the wine!\nHere's 300 gold, it's well worth the price."
msgstr "음, 아주 좋군, 아주 좋은 와인이네! 여기 300 골드. 좋은 가격이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2089
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:398
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have an incredible teeth collection, but I'm always looking for more.\nIf you find a tooth I don't have in my collection, I'll pay you 500 gold for it."
msgstr "난 아주 멋진 이빨을 모아놨네. 그러나 난 항상 더 원하지. 만일 내가 없는 이빨을 가지고 있으면 500 골드에 사겠네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2090
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:399
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't believe I have a tooth like this one yet, here's 500 gold."
msgstr "난 이런 이빨은 없는줄 알았는데. 여기 500 골드가 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2091
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:400
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have been to the circus three times, and I can't win anything.\nAll I really want are the nifty four leaf clovers they use as prizes there.\nI'll pay 25 gold for any four leaf clover you bring me."
msgstr "난 서커스에 3번 갔으나 이긴 적이 없네. 난 정말 네잎 클로버를 갖고 싶고 만일 있다면 25 골드에 사겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2092
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:401
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm so tired of the Shadow Guild, but I don't have any substantial proof of their activities.\nI'd love to have something I could show to Anthony Stone proving the Shadow Guild is up to no good down here."
msgstr "난 그림자 길드 때문에 지쳤네, 그러나 그들에 대한 증거가 없네. 엔서니 스톤에게 그림자 길드에 대한 증거를 보여주었으면 좋겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2093
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:402
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One of the few remaining Paladin artifacts left is the Pearl of Purity.\nBalthasar was in possession of the pearl the last I heard.\nHe was visiting Lord Spindler in Blackshire, but I haven't heard anything from him in months."
msgstr "팔라딘들이 남겨놓은 인공물은 순수의 진주이네. 발사르가 마지막 주인이었다더군. 그가 블랙쉐어의 스핀들러 군주를 방문했다고 하나 난 이번 달엔 아무런 얘기도 듣지 못했네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2094
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:403
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will only speak to the Chosen Ones; those that bring the symbol of fire."
msgstr "난 불의 심벌을 가지고 오는 선택된 사람하고만 얘기하네."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2095
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:404
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Recently, the Fraternal Order of Silver has been disrupting my business and my caravans.\nI'm not sure why Sir John feels it necessary, but I'd like this to stop.\nIf you could convince him to leave me alone, I'm sure I could give you a portion of the money you would be saving me."
msgstr "최근에, 은빛의 우애조합는 나의 거래와 나의 무역상을 방해하네. 나는 왜 존 경이 이게 중요하다는지 모르겠네. 난 멈추고 싶네. 만일 당신이 그에게 말해 날 건드리지 않는다면 난 돈을 많이 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2096
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:405
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Fraternal Order of Silver has begun more direct attacks on my legitimate, underworld associates.\nI would appreciate it greatly if you could talk to Sir John and learn why he feels these actions are necessary."
msgstr "은빛의 우애조합은 합법적으로 나의 지하세계를 공격하네. 만일 당신이 존슨 경에게 왜 그러는지를 알아다 준다면 고맙겠네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2097
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:406
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hurray!\nThis is much easier and much less embarrasing than going to the circus and losing!\nHere's 25 gold!"
msgstr "빨리! 이건 서커스를 가서 노는 것보다 훨씬 쉽네. 여기 25 골드!  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2098
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:407
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard it's possible to find large chunks of amber in a series of caves north of Castle Ironfist.\nI never have the time to leave Free Haven, but I'd love to get my hands on some of that amber.\nI'll pay 500 gold for any piece of amber."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는 아이론피스트 북쪽의 동굴에서 엄청 큰 호박을 구할 수 있다고 하네. 난 프리 해븐을 떠날 수 없으니 당신이 해 주면 500골드를 주겠네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2099
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:408
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This will do nicely!\nThank you for the amber, here is the 500 gold I promised you."
msgstr "호박은 정말 고맙네. 여기 약속한 500 골드가 있네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2100
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:409
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have almost prepared the entire ritual– all that is left is to place the statuettes."
msgstr "나는 거의 예배준비를 끝냈네- 이제 남은 건 상을 어디다 놓을 것인가 이네. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2101
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:410
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work!\nI have my youth again, thanks to you– have you ever thought about assisting me full-time?\nI could certainly use reliable help.\nI've managed to collect a variety of trinkets over the years, so please help yourself to a few of these in the chest outside as payment for your services.\nI need to clean up a few things here, but I think I'll head back to Castle Ironfist and see if there's an opening for a court magician."
msgstr "잘 했네. 정말 고맙네- 나를 계속 도와주는 건 어떻겠나? 나는 몇 년 동안 여러가지 장신구들을 모아왔네. 그러니 상자를 열어 보상금으로 원하는 만큼 가지게나.  난 몇가지 여기서 정리할 게 있으나, 아마 아이론피스트로 갈 걸세. 그리고 마법의 법원에 대해 생각할꺼네.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:411
